  ('307267529217210233', '''Allo ''Allo!', 1984, 'Comedy, War & Politics', 'David Croft, Jeremy Lloyd', null, 'Gorden Kaye, Carmen Silvera, Vicki Michelle, Richard Marner, Kim Hartman, Guy Siner, Kirsten Cooke, Rose Hill', 'TV-PG', 'The misadventures of hapless cafe owner René Artois and his escapades with the Resistance in occupied France.', 'The misadventures of hapless cafe owner René Artois and his escapades with the Resistance in occupied France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m42lb4UxkpaFil4bw0bqqjlWCY4.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:2211'),
  ('1007580251061291576', '''Cause You''re My Boy', 2018, 'Drama', 'Min Akitasvara', null, 'Sattabut Laedeke, Thanatsaran Samthonglai, Phuwin Tangsakyuen, Trai Nimtawat, Thanawat Ratanakitpaisan, Chayapol Jutamas, Pinyadar Salinvarradar, Rutricha Phapakithi', null, 'Meet Mork, mischievous leader of the ‘Bear Gang’ and a high school senior hustling porn to his classmates. He’s the son of Muad Moo, the legendary barber outside an all-boys school near Pak Khlong Talad. One day, while cutting Tee’s hair, Muad Moo mishears the lottery results and bolts, leaving Mork stuck as Tee’s reluctant barber. A prank haircut sparks chaos at school, and after three weeks scrubbing bathrooms as punishment, Mork gets revenge by framing Tee with a gay porn film, accidentally drawing Bambi’s attention. To fix the mess, Mork and Tee pretend to be a couple, guided by Ching, a playful Grade 10 yaoi fan. With friends Aou, Ton, Mork’s little brother Morn, and Gord, they navigate pranks, unexpected feelings, and schemes while trying to revive the legendary Muad Moo Barbershop.', 'Meet Mork, mischievous leader of the ‘Bear Gang’ and a high school senior hustling porn to his classmates. He’s the son of Muad Moo, the legendary barber outside an all-boys school near Pak Khlong Talad. One day, while cutting Tee’s hair, Muad Moo mishears the lottery results and bolts, leaving Mork stuck as Tee’s reluctant barber. A prank haircut sparks chaos at school, and after three weeks scrubbing bathrooms as punishment, Mork gets revenge by framing Tee with a gay porn film, accidentally drawing Bambi’s attention. To fix the mess, Mork and Tee pretend to be a couple, guided by Ching, a playful Grade 10 yaoi fan. With friends Aou, Ton, Mork’s little brother Morn, and Gord, they navigate pranks, unexpected feelings, and schemes while trying to revive the legendary Muad Moo Barbershop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAhhbX2l0lgDnUqZBPF8RMvZWBB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80450'),
  ('696203921342918460', '‘Pedazo de acordeón’, un viaje a través de la historia del vallenato', 2019, null, null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1IyJnBviBi3xyCiTYlsaVKDtcYG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100001'),
  ('1012202032149886372', '''Til Death', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Josh Goldsmith, Cathy Yuspa', null, 'Brad Garrett, Joely Fisher', 'TV-14', 'A comedy about the triumphs and tribulations of marriage and friendship from very different perspectives. It''s about the funny – and sometimes annoying – things that happen between husbands, wives, parents, children, neighbors and friends day after day after day. The show focuses on Eddie and Joy Stark, a couple married for 23 years who live in Philadelphia, Pennsylvania.', 'A comedy about the triumphs and tribulations of marriage and friendship from very different perspectives. It''s about the funny – and sometimes annoying – things that happen between husbands, wives, parents, children, neighbors and friends day after day after day. The show focuses on Eddie and Joy Stark, a couple married for 23 years who live in Philadelphia, Pennsylvania.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/trOymv1SiVmMeWlCmV0EiOC6E6v.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1568'),
  ('480926521791137037', '''Til Jail Do Us Part', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'José Luis Acosta', null, 'Kate del Castillo, Roselyn Sánchez, Sylvia Sáenz, Jeirmarie Osorio, Anthony Alvarez, Xabiani Ponce de León, Jessica Lindsey, Jamila Hache', 'TV-MA', 'Ángela, Viri, Esme and Sofía hate each other. When their husbands wind up in jail for stealing millions from the biggest drug lord in Miami, the foursome ends up on the street at his mercy. As they adapt to their new lives, the wives must work together to survive.', 'Ángela, Viri, Esme and Sofía hate each other. When their husbands wind up in jail for stealing millions from the biggest drug lord in Miami, the foursome ends up on the street at his mercy. As they adapt to their new lives, the wives must work together to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zN2wCmK6oKKIuvqL1uelh6gQelG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203417'),
  ('84177131962088269', '"Deji" Meets Girl', 2021, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tatsuyuki Kobayashi, Kiyono Yasuno, Kenta Miyake, Ikuko Tani', 'TV-PG', 'Sixteen-year-old Maise Higa spends her summer days working part-time at her family''s hotel, with absolutely nothing interesting to do. That is, until she meets Ichirou Suzuki—a mysterious boy who is seemingly haunted by strange supernatural occurrences. Upon interacting with him, Maise unexpectedly enters a different reality, where hotel rooms can transform into the deep ocean and banyan trees can spawn indoors out of nowhere. Intrigued, Maise accompanies Ichirou in his quest to uncover the secrets behind the inexplicable enigmas surrounding him.', 'Sixteen-year-old Maise Higa spends her summer days working part-time at her family''s hotel, with absolutely nothing interesting to do. That is, until she meets Ichirou Suzuki—a mysterious boy who is seemingly haunted by strange supernatural occurrences. Upon interacting with him, Maise unexpectedly enters a different reality, where hotel rooms can transform into the deep ocean and banyan trees can spawn indoors out of nowhere. Intrigued, Maise accompanies Ichirou in his quest to uncover the secrets behind the inexplicable enigmas surrounding him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUelX1DqtgTDYvlsK3TzWcbn2Hb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130112'),
  ('578074293199093914', '«Lucky»', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Vladimir Shchegolkov', 'Vladimir Shchegolkov', 'Evgeny Tsyganov, Maksim Lagashkin, Svetlana Khodchenkova, Vladimir Menshov, Kirill Käro, Sergey Gazarov, Valentina Lyapina, Mikhail Politseymako', null, 'The series is about a former motorcycle racer, champion of a motorcycle track, who, having become an alcoholic, moonlights as a driver and tries to stop drinking and improve his life.', 'The series is about a former motorcycle racer, champion of a motorcycle track, who, having become an alcoholic, moonlights as a driver and tries to stop drinking and improve his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkVpXSleGCFm8Q2TKKTZl4AdMdx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137928'),
  ('1050675313940396974', '(Un)Well', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'This docuseries takes a deep dive into the lucrative wellness industry, which touts health and healing. But do the products live up to the promises?', 'This docuseries takes a deep dive into the lucrative wellness industry, which touts health and healing. But do the products live up to the promises?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bC1CSudFJCvDm679fRtqdVHlDc3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106530'),
  ('804224029016641986', '[C] The Money of Soul and Possibility Control', 2011, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Daisuke Hosomi, Haruka Tomatsu, Koki Uchiyama, Yui Makino, Yuji Mitsuya, Mayumi Asano, Takahiro Sakurai, Saori Goto', 'TV-14', 'Kimimaro works two jobs to make ends meet. He could go from pauper to prince in a parallel world called the Financial District—if he’ll invest his future as collateral in a dangerous game. Winning gets you more wealth, but losing could erase you from existence. When the destructive forces at play compel Kimimaro to confront the most powerful player, can he save the real world from total collapse?', 'Kimimaro works two jobs to make ends meet. He could go from pauper to prince in a parallel world called the Financial District—if he’ll invest his future as collateral in a dangerous game. Winning gets you more wealth, but losing could erase you from existence. When the destructive forces at play compel Kimimaro to confront the most powerful player, can he save the real world from total collapse?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYr2SAWynWi2N4mLCzmHkVici0w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39435'),
  ('1090402429717087216', '【OSHI NO KO】', 2023, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Takeo Otsuka, Yurie Igoma, Megumi Han, Rumi Okubo, Manaka Iwami, Kent Ito, Yumi Uchiyama', 'TV-14', 'A small-town doctor gets sucked into the ruthless world of show business when he crosses paths with a popular teen idol who holds a secret.', 'A small-town doctor gets sucked into the ruthless world of show business when he crosses paths with a popular teen idol who holds a secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFp74PFpz14AHrtlVPrLyrSng47.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203737'),
  ('144462072591388231', '@midnight with Chris Hardwick', 2013, 'Comedy, Talk', 'Jon Zimelis, Jason U. Nadler, Alex Blagg', null, 'Chris Hardwick', null, 'Chris Hardwick will lead three celebrity contestants down the ultimate internet wormhole. Culling from the darkest recesses of social media, they will compete to determine who has the funniest take on the day''s pop culture.', 'Chris Hardwick will lead three celebrity contestants down the ultimate internet wormhole. Culling from the darkest recesses of social media, they will compete to determine who has the funniest take on the day''s pop culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVvxhRtJzl8nom2rAFxg60QkaYo.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:61025'),
  ('472880906508569329', '#1 Happy Family USA', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Ramy Youssef, Pam Brady', 'Sabrina Mahfouz', 'Ramy Youssef, Alia Shawkat, Salma Hindy, Randa Jarrar, Mandy Moore, Chris Redd, Akaash Singh, Whitmer Thomas', 'TV-14', 'An exploration of the experiences of a Muslim-American family that must learn how to code-switch as they navigate the early 2000s: a time of fear, war, and the rapid expansion of the boy-band industrial complex.', 'An exploration of the experiences of a Muslim-American family that must learn how to code-switch as they navigate the early 2000s: a time of fear, war, and the rapid expansion of the boy-band industrial complex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1EzcDTGhbbvTS27iKK4ompIQjva.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218510'),
  ('761081618616047977', '#All of Them. Debanhi, a story of networks', 2025, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, null, null, 'A documentary that portrays solidarity networks in the search for truth and justice in cases of femicides. In addition, a criticism of the actions of the authorities, and the economic and patriarchal culture of Mexico.', 'A documentary that portrays solidarity networks in the search for truth and justice in cases of femicides. In addition, a criticism of the actions of the authorities, and the economic and patriarchal culture of Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibjA9dXB35d10aTMcIPTppPcpTJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:285880'),
