  ('1014388759256611758', '×××HOLiC', 2013, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Anne Watanabe, Shota Sometani, Karen Miyazaki, Naoto Takenaka, Masahiro Higashide, Yumi Adachi, Tsumugi Hatakeyama, Ririka Kawashima', null, 'Yūko Ichihara is the sexy owner of a strange store which offers to make any wishes come true for a price. Kimihiro Watanuki has a special type of blood that attracts spirits and ghosts. He goes into the shop owned by Yūko Ichihara and asks her to get rid of the spirits. Yūko offers to do so if he works part-time at the store.', 'Yūko Ichihara is the sexy owner of a strange store which offers to make any wishes come true for a price. Kimihiro Watanuki has a special type of blood that attracts spirits and ghosts. He goes into the shop owned by Yūko Ichihara and asks her to get rid of the spirits. Yūko offers to do so if he works part-time at the store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oO5H6jHNyIYAiPRaG5WgdyfeDjX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46290'),
  ('176262056093388863', '$#*! My Dad Says', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Patrick Schumacker, Justin Halpern, David Kohan', null, 'William Shatner, Jonathan Sadowski, Nicole Sullivan, Will Sasso', null, 'Ed Goodson, a forthright and opinionated dad, relishes expressing his unsolicited and often wildly politically incorrect observations to anyone within earshot. Nobody is immune from Ed''s rants, including his sons, Henry, a struggling writer-turned-unpaid blogger; and Vince, the meek half of his husband/wife real estate duo with domineering Kathleen. When Henry finds he can no longer afford to pay rent to his pretty roommate -- and secret admirer -- Sam, Ed reveals a soft spot and invites Henry to move in with him. Henry agrees, knowing that the verbal assault will not abate and now there will be no escape.', 'Ed Goodson, a forthright and opinionated dad, relishes expressing his unsolicited and often wildly politically incorrect observations to anyone within earshot. Nobody is immune from Ed''s rants, including his sons, Henry, a struggling writer-turned-unpaid blogger; and Vince, the meek half of his husband/wife real estate duo with domineering Kathleen. When Henry finds he can no longer afford to pay rent to his pretty roommate -- and secret admirer -- Sam, Ed reveals a soft spot and invites Henry to move in with him. Henry agrees, knowing that the verbal assault will not abate and now there will be no escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNaDgCmn16Bdy0EbU1gY6ZJpnhA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32843'),
  ('791678379154791239', '0.5 Man', 2023, 'Drama', 'Shuichi Okita', 'Shuichi Okita', 'Ryuhei Matsuda, Asami Usuda, Tamaki Shiratori, Kai Inowaki, Yuzu Aoki, Atsushi Shinohara, Katsumi Kiba, Nanase Nishino', null, 'Masaharu "Masaji" Tachibana was a brilliant programmer who got burnt out and suddenly stopped showing up to work. He now lives at home with his parents and spends his time sleeping and playing video games. He only ventures out of his room to visit the local convenience store for more energy drinks and snacks, until one day he learns that his parents have decided to build a "2.5 family" house with his sister and her family joining them. Masaji is forced to acclimate and with the change of environment begins to venture out of his room and his own head.', 'Masaharu "Masaji" Tachibana was a brilliant programmer who got burnt out and suddenly stopped showing up to work. He now lives at home with his parents and spends his time sleeping and playing video games. He only ventures out of his room to visit the local convenience store for more energy drinks and snacks, until one day he learns that his parents have decided to build a "2.5 family" house with his sister and her family joining them. Masaji is forced to acclimate and with the change of environment begins to venture out of his room and his own head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zv1D98hMWVI3xYLMS3JV9D8hEQQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222976'),
  ('1033465992214398286', '007: Road to a Million', 2023, 'Reality, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Brian Cox, Frances McNamee', null, 'Nine pairs of everyday people are unleashed on an epic global adventure through a series of Bond inspired challenges, for a shot at winning a life-changing £1,000,000 prize. The Controller, Brian Cox, is the mastermind behind the game, watching the pairs as they hunt for 10 questions he’s hidden around the world.', 'Nine pairs of everyday people are unleashed on an epic global adventure through a series of Bond inspired challenges, for a shot at winning a life-changing £1,000,000 prize. The Controller, Brian Cox, is the mastermind behind the game, watching the pairs as they hunt for 10 questions he’s hidden around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYV5iTnj2CNTQXrqe88D0tr3Y4x.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:234455'),
  ('241062966620551460', '009-1', 2006, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics, Drama', null, null, 'Yumiko Shaku, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Marina Inoue, Satsuki Yukino, Akeno Watanabe, Hochu Otsuka, Yoji Ueda', 'TV-MA', 'In an alternate world, the Cold War has continued to persist for 140 years. As a result, the world was divided into two factions: the West Block, and the East Block. As the Cold War drags on, the tension between the two factions, as well as the amount of nuclear weapons they have, rise. Mylene Hoffman is a female cyborg who is a spy for the West Block. Together with three other agents, Mylene partakes in various missions issued by her superiors.', 'In an alternate world, the Cold War has continued to persist for 140 years. As a result, the world was divided into two factions: the West Block, and the East Block. As the Cold War drags on, the tension between the two factions, as well as the amount of nuclear weapons they have, rise. Mylene Hoffman is a female cyborg who is a spy for the West Block. Together with three other agents, Mylene partakes in various missions issued by her superiors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1zbGhkKXmzZR8h5y7LQxiE8yW9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34835'),
  ('348485530901751972', '010: De Mensen Die Rotterdam Kleur Geven', 2025, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'John Buijsman, Sandy Dam, Marco Bovekerk', null, 'Rotterdam: city of ''no talking, just cleaning''. A city that is one of the largest in our country with almost 700,000 inhabitants. But who are these cleaners and who gives Rotterdam colour? In this four-part series we follow the ups and downs of the most striking and funny residents.', 'Rotterdam: city of ''no talking, just cleaning''. A city that is one of the largest in our country with almost 700,000 inhabitants. But who are these cleaners and who gives Rotterdam colour? In this four-part series we follow the ups and downs of the most striking and funny residents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jKc3ENH4Cpta0fhNPDr7HF2c8Bl.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:292306'),
  ('206986204482089953', '07-Ghost', 2009, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Show Hayami, Susumu Chiba, Junichi Suwabe, Mitsuki Saiga, Kouki Miyata, Hiroki Takahashi, Kazuya Nakai, Daisuke Kishio', 'TV-14', 'For over a thousand years, two great countries shared power in the world. One,the Barsburg Empire, was protected by the Eye of Raphael. The other, the Kingdom of Laggs, was protected by the Eye of Michael. Until a brutal war between them saw the Kingdom of Laggs destroyed... Ten years later, an amnesiac young orphan named Teito and his best friend Mikage are attending Barsburg Imperial Military Academy, dreaming of becoming officers. Teito is plagued by disturbing dreams of Laggs Castle just before the fall... Of a man who speaks to him of his “true mission,” and an enemy wielding a blood-drenched sword... But when Teito meets Staff Chief Ayanami, his memories begin to return. This is the enemy from his dream. The man lying in a pool of blood, giving him that warning, was his own father... And Teito himself is the prince of the destroyed Laggs Empire! Teito must leave the army to find his true mission, and the secret of his past.', 'For over a thousand years, two great countries shared power in the world. One,the Barsburg Empire, was protected by the Eye of Raphael. The other, the Kingdom of Laggs, was protected by the Eye of Michael. Until a brutal war between them saw the Kingdom of Laggs destroyed... Ten years later, an amnesiac young orphan named Teito and his best friend Mikage are attending Barsburg Imperial Military Academy, dreaming of becoming officers. Teito is plagued by disturbing dreams of Laggs Castle just before the fall... Of a man who speaks to him of his “true mission,” and an enemy wielding a blood-drenched sword... But when Teito meets Staff Chief Ayanami, his memories begin to return. This is the enemy from his dream. The man lying in a pool of blood, giving him that warning, was his own father... And Teito himself is the prince of the destroyed Laggs Empire! Teito must leave the army to find his true mission, and the secret of his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bplLInPnw3pxyI8ySfPi0VfjsCN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21855'),
  ('791070253622237316', '1 Litre of Tears', 2005, 'Drama, Family', 'Takao Kinoshita, Shosuke Murakami', null, 'Erika Sawajiri, Hiroko Yakushimaru, Ryo Nishikido, Riko Narumi, Yuma Sanada, Ai Miyoshi, Momosuke Mizutani, Ryô Hashizume', 'TV-G', '1 Rittoru no Namida is a Japanese television drama for Fuji Television about a girl who was diagnosed with an incurable degenerative disease at 15, but was able to continue her life until her death at the age of 25.', '1 Rittoru no Namida is a Japanese television drama for Fuji Television about a girl who was diagnosed with an incurable degenerative disease at 15, but was able to continue her life until her death at the age of 25.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHG3D2ZElSYU6ji2tJXQapewAT8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6484'),
  ('1098194438995303322', '1 Woman 1 Man', 2008, 'Comedy', null, 'Guy A. Lepage', 'Emre Karayel, Demet Evgar', null, 'An intimate, hilarious, touching and almost voyeur look at the everyday realities of married life and differences between men and women.', 'An intimate, hilarious, touching and almost voyeur look at the everyday realities of married life and differences between men and women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqGxI6FTUyTiorjHajbnUwnEtbO.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:68516'),
  ('642533734486288474', '10 Items or Less', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Nancy Hower, John Lehr', null, 'John Lehr, Jennifer Elise Cox, Kim Coles, Christopher Liam Moore, Bob Clendenin, Chris Payne Gilbert, Kirsten Gronfield, Greg Davis Jr.', 'TV-14', 'Leslie Pool returns to his native Ohio to run the Green & Grains grocery store he has just inherited from his father. Seeking to undermine Green & Grains is Leslie''s arch nemesis, Amy, who manages the Super Value Mart down the street. He has known her since high school, where she was the popular beauty queen and he, a nerd.', 'Leslie Pool returns to his native Ohio to run the Green & Grains grocery store he has just inherited from his father. Seeking to undermine Green & Grains is Leslie''s arch nemesis, Amy, who manages the Super Value Mart down the street. He has known her since high school, where she was the popular beauty queen and he, a nerd.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFmlAVf4Oow3agoZlhD8BH4tkyS.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:4892'),
  ('215861419540360857', '10 Things I Hate About You', 2009, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Lindsey Shaw, Meaghan Jette Martin, Nicholas Braun, Ethan Peck, Larry Miller, Chris Zylka, Dana Davis, Ally Maki', 'TV-14', 'Outspoken Kat Stratford couldn''t be less like her sister, super sweet, yet kinda conformist Bianca. The only things they seem to have in common are being new at school and their overprotective dad.', 'Outspoken Kat Stratford couldn''t be less like her sister, super sweet, yet kinda conformist Bianca. The only things they seem to have in common are being new at school and their overprotective dad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zpac63F4m3xzUDLIJiy8Hm3l1St.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:17507'),
  ('853098906315394879', '10 Thousand Steps', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Devin Özgür Çınar', 'Engin Günaydın, Devin Özgür Çınar', 'Engin Günaydın, Devin Özgür Çınar', null, 'Two ex-lovers Ezgi and Memet decide to take 10 thousand steps by walking together every day. Different things happen to them every day. But they still keep taking steps every day.', 'Two ex-lovers Ezgi and Memet decide to take 10 thousand steps by walking together every day. Different things happen to them every day. But they still keep taking steps every day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3qr2K8LjVCTIBoWOnkFd6bQqcM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:115597'),
  ('363255663591356004', '10 Years with Hayao Miyazaki', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Hayao Miyazaki, Goro Miyazaki, Toshio Suzuki, Hideaki Anno, Isao Takahata, Michiyo Yasuda', null, 'A chronicle of the creative process of the legendary Japanese filmmaker Hayao Miyazaki, a passionate artisan, a steadfast trailblazer, and a father butting heads with his son…', 'A chronicle of the creative process of the legendary Japanese filmmaker Hayao Miyazaki, a passionate artisan, a steadfast trailblazer, and a father butting heads with his son…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXQXiQwt8gd4wm1vyvDyyCN8xps.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89764'),
