  ('1143016713728809262', '24 Hours in A&E', 2011, 'Documentary, Drama, Reality', null, null, null, 'NR', 'A British medical documentary set in King''s College Hospital. 91 cameras filmed round the clock for 28 days, 24 hours a day in A&E it offers unprecedented access to one of Britain''s busiest A&E departments.', 'A British medical documentary set in King''s College Hospital. 91 cameras filmed round the clock for 28 days, 24 hours a day in A&E it offers unprecedented access to one of Britain''s busiest A&E departments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/beBB1ZnPOxG64dlTYKsEO8BwEGf.jpg', 35, 'tmdb:tv:39706'),
