  ('624447523788699773', '3 Seconds Later, He Turned into a Beast', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Shogo Yano, Riho Sugiyama, Yuya Hirose', null, 'Tsumugi is a female college student who carries trauma from an aggressive man in her past. She meets Kaname at a mixer she requested specifically for unaggressive "herbivore"-type men. She and Kaname hit it off, and Kaname resembles Tsumugi''s older brother a little bit, so she relaxes her guard around him. Kaname, however, feigns to be a "herbivore"-type man, but is in reality an aggressive "carnivore"-type man, and he can change his demeanor in an instant.', 'Tsumugi is a female college student who carries trauma from an aggressive man in her past. She meets Kaname at a mixer she requested specifically for unaggressive "herbivore"-type men. She and Kaname hit it off, and Kaname resembles Tsumugi''s older brother a little bit, so she relaxes her guard around him. Kaname, however, feigns to be a "herbivore"-type man, but is in reality an aggressive "carnivore"-type man, and he can change his demeanor in an instant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LnfZfpFEYsOP3THUz1uszExGyf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157879'),
  ('314974675268858994', '3 Will Be Free', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Tidakorn Pookaothong', null, 'Lapassalan Jiravechsoontornkul, Tawan Vihokratana, Way-ar Sangngern, Jennie Panhan, Chanagun Arpornsutina, Nuttawut Jenmana, Pumipat Paiboon, Suphakorn Sriphotong', null, 'Three people with different backgrounds go on the run from the mafia, finding love and connection amid danger and survival.', 'Three people with different backgrounds go on the run from the mafia, finding love and connection amid danger and survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oQyCKKGBXTLR01n49c9Wj8nsWi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88981'),
  ('171771336924275068', '3-2-1 Contact', 1980, null, null, null, null, 'NR', '3-2-1 Contact is an American science educational television show that aired on PBS from 1980 to 1988, and an adjoining children''s magazine. The show, a production of the Children''s Television Workshop, teaches scientific principles and their applications. Dr. Edward G. Atkins, who was responsible for much of the scientific content of the show, felt that the TV program wouldn''t replace a classroom but would open the viewers to ask questions about the scientific purpose of things.', '3-2-1 Contact is an American science educational television show that aired on PBS from 1980 to 1988, and an adjoining children''s magazine. The show, a production of the Children''s Television Workshop, teaches scientific principles and their applications. Dr. Edward G. Atkins, who was responsible for much of the scientific content of the show, felt that the TV program wouldn''t replace a classroom but would open the viewers to ask questions about the scientific purpose of things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAHFYMRSbMy2XKU6y59992dF4Fw.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:3131'),
  ('47492884726000568', '3%', 2016, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Pedro Aguilera', null, 'Bianca Comparato, Rodolfo Valente, Vaneza Oliveira, Rafael Lozano, Larissa Noel', 'TV-MA', 'In a future where the elite inhabit an island paradise far from the crowded slums, you get one chance to join the 3% saved from squalor.', 'In a future where the elite inhabit an island paradise far from the crowded slums, you get one chance to join the 3% saved from squalor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uLBJSLuAQ8UqLIKZVWG3uNEXwjt.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:68467'),
  ('117359176016892174', '30 Coins', 2020, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Álex de la Iglesia', null, 'Eduard Fernández, Megan Montaner, Miguel Ángel Silvestre, Macarena Gómez, Pepón Nieto, Manolo Solo, Cosimo Fusco, Manuel Tallafé', 'TV-MA', 'Father Vergara—an exorcist, boxer and ex-convict—lives in a remote village in Spain. Hoping to be lost and forgotten, Vergara’s demons catch up to him.', 'Father Vergara—an exorcist, boxer and ex-convict—lives in a remote village in Spain. Hoping to be lost and forgotten, Vergara’s demons catch up to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nueyd0FDfX9aUDD1UrxbjdjIvC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:89844'),
  ('1096053442764514811', '30 Days', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Morgan Spurlock', null, 'Morgan Spurlock', 'TV-MA', '30 Days is a reality television show on the FX cable network in the United States, created and hosted by Morgan Spurlock. In each episode, Spurlock, or some other person or group of people, spend 30 days immersing themselves in a particular lifestyle with which they are unfamiliar, while discussing related social issues. As in Spurlock''s film, Super Size Me, there are a number of rules unique to each situation which must be followed during each such experiment. At least one episode each season has featured Spurlock as the person spending the month in the particular lifestyle. Season one premiered on June 15, 2005, and its respective DVD set was released July 11, 2006. The second season premiered on July 26, 2006. Season 3 of 30 Days premiered on June 3, 2008. FX said on November 6 that it would not be renewing the series for a fourth season, effectively canceling the show. The show has recently been picked up for re-air by Planet Green, though no new episodes have been ordered. In the United Kingdom, the program is broadcast on More4 and Channel 4. In Australia, the program is broadcast on Network Ten and Lifestyle Channel. It currently airs in Canada on Independent Film Channel and Canal Vie. It also airs on FX in Latin America. In Norway it airs on TV 2. In Sweden it airs on TV4 and Kanal 9.', '30 Days is a reality television show on the FX cable network in the United States, created and hosted by Morgan Spurlock. In each episode, Spurlock, or some other person or group of people, spend 30 days immersing themselves in a particular lifestyle with which they are unfamiliar, while discussing related social issues. As in Spurlock''s film, Super Size Me, there are a number of rules unique to each situation which must be followed during each such experiment. At least one episode each season has featured Spurlock as the person spending the month in the particular lifestyle. Season one premiered on June 15, 2005, and its respective DVD set was released July 11, 2006. The second season premiered on July 26, 2006. Season 3 of 30 Days premiered on June 3, 2008. FX said on November 6 that it would not be renewing the series for a fourth season, effectively canceling the show. The show has recently been picked up for re-air by Planet Green, though no new episodes have been ordered. In the United Kingdom, the program is broadcast on More4 and Channel 4. In Australia, the program is broadcast on Network Ten and Lifestyle Channel. It currently airs in Canada on Independent Film Channel and Canal Vie. It also airs on FX in Latin America. In Norway it airs on TV 2. In Sweden it airs on TV4 and Kanal 9.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3l8cqGXqJ6sgBsDDIoXTsbHMexZ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1543'),
  ('726615413282274541', '30 Days of Night: Blood Trails', 2007, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', 'Ben Ketai, Steve Niles', null, 'Trip Hope, Marilyn Johnson, Geoff Stirling Jr., Andrew Laurich, T.J. Zale, Shawn G. Smith, Jeremy Lee Shranko, Brittney Kara', 'TV-MA', 'Set two days before the events of 30 Days of Night (2007), George is a young addict who makes a living seeking covert information for Judith, the weary but wise New Orleans vampire hunter.', 'Set two days before the events of 30 Days of Night (2007), George is a young addict who makes a living seeking covert information for Judith, the weary but wise New Orleans vampire hunter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2MRqKCwr96tyrr7EBVLmXDNLOU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14633'),
  ('666198625361243822', '30 Degrees in February', 2012, 'Drama', null, null, 'Kjell Wilhelmsen, Duangjai Hiransri, Lotta Tejle, Maria Lundqvist, Hanna Ardéhn, Viola Weidemann, Kjell Bergqvist, Thomas Chaanhing', null, 'Follow a group of Swedes who''ve left the snow and cold of Scandinavia for the warm, sandy beaches of Thailand in the dead of winter. Why? To embark on a life-changing adventure, a fresh start and a new life, of course.', 'Follow a group of Swedes who''ve left the snow and cold of Scandinavia for the warm, sandy beaches of Thailand in the dead of winter. Why? To embark on a life-changing adventure, a fresh start and a new life, of course.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEWUCfbe3xMjESyvxNO24Sw2ZoM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:43573'),
  ('351203985332042238', '30 for 30', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Bill Simmons, Connor Schell, John Dahl', null, null, 'TV-PG', '30 for 30 is the title for a series of documentary films airing on ESPN, its sister networks, and online highlighting interesting people and events in sports history. This currently includes four "volumes" of 30 episodes each, a 13-episode series under the ESPN Films Presents title in 2011–2012, and a series of 30 for 30 Shorts shown through the ESPN.com website. The series has also expanded to include Soccer Stories, which aired in advance of the 2014 FIFA World Cup, and audio podcasts. This entry refers to the main Volumes of the series presented by ESPN', '30 for 30 is the title for a series of documentary films airing on ESPN, its sister networks, and online highlighting interesting people and events in sports history. This currently includes four "volumes" of 30 episodes each, a 13-episode series under the ESPN Films Presents title in 2011–2012, and a series of 30 for 30 Shorts shown through the ESPN.com website. The series has also expanded to include Soccer Stories, which aired in advance of the 2014 FIFA World Cup, and audio podcasts. This entry refers to the main Volumes of the series presented by ESPN', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1CdZEUcnVYypLOp8cfb7W9mSp2.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:31677'),
  ('883843430282454739', '30 minuts', 1984, null, null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oLu6gs1qglnM64fJJarYXXIDHIg.jpg', 41, 'tmdb:tv:250937'),
  ('118991752386452918', '30 Rock', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Tina Fey', null, 'Tina Fey, Alec Baldwin, Tracy Morgan, Jane Krakowski, Jack McBrayer, Scott Adsit, Judah Friedlander, Keith Powell', 'TV-14', 'Liz Lemon, the head writer for a late-night TV variety show in New York, tries to juggle all the egos around her while chasing her own dream.', 'Liz Lemon, the head writer for a late-night TV variety show in New York, tries to juggle all the egos around her while chasing her own dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYYQWACx7ttUzRwTNYuo6zveqpE.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:4608'),
  ('1090005088433994469', '3000 Leagues in Search of Mother', 1976, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Family', null, 'Kazuo Fukazawa', 'Yoshiko Matsuo, Kazuyuki Sogabe, Yukiko Nikaido, Kiyoshi Kawakubo, Akiko Tsuboi, Noriko Ohara, Mie Azuma, Ichiro Nagai', null, 'Italy is in a deep depression, so to support her family, Marco''s mother goes to Argentina to work as a domestic. But after she writes to her family that she is sick, her letters stop coming. So Marco decides to go to Argentina to look for her. He travels across Argentina to find her, meeting many wonderful people, and having many adventures during his journey.', 'Italy is in a deep depression, so to support her family, Marco''s mother goes to Argentina to work as a domestic. But after she writes to her family that she is sick, her letters stop coming. So Marco decides to go to Argentina to look for her. He travels across Argentina to find her, meeting many wonderful people, and having many adventures during his journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNyYHaHxOytT7DFbVhRrHpkqlst.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8962'),
  ('76559225215563119', '3000 Whys of Blue Cat', 1999, 'Kids, Animation', null, null, 'Ge Ping, Wenjun Yuan, 杜娟, 曾令, 殷姿, Fu Yilin, 章颖智, 吴智勇', null, '3000 Whys of Blue Cat is the first large-scale Chinese animated series in mainland China with an emphasis on science. The series is produced by "Beijing Sunchime Happy Culture Company". The show remains one of the longest running children''s cartoon series in the world. It is most commonly referred to as "Blue Cat". An English version was made for the first episode titled "The Adventures of the Blue Cat" and was made as a pilot for a series titled "Lucky''s Adventures" but due to lack of intrerests, the series was canceled. The show uses a combination of 2D animation and CGI.', '3000 Whys of Blue Cat is the first large-scale Chinese animated series in mainland China with an emphasis on science. The series is produced by "Beijing Sunchime Happy Culture Company". The show remains one of the longest running children''s cartoon series in the world. It is most commonly referred to as "Blue Cat". An English version was made for the first episode titled "The Adventures of the Blue Cat" and was made as a pilot for a series titled "Lucky''s Adventures" but due to lack of intrerests, the series was canceled. The show uses a combination of 2D animation and CGI.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vCRRb67Dv1G5sYGaIUnoVkTjNlw.jpg', 26, 'tmdb:tv:5811'),
  ('993933130830343900', '31 Minutes', 2003, 'Comedy, Kids, Family', 'Álvaro Díaz González, Pedro Peirano', 'Pedro Peirano, Daniel Castro, Patricio Díaz', 'Pedro Peirano, Álvaro Díaz González, Daniel Castro, Rodrigo Salinas, Jani Dueñas, Guillermo Silva, Felipe Godoy, Héctor Velozo', 'NR', 'Chilean television show which takes the form of a mock news broadcast, and is fronted by puppets who present various items.', 'Chilean television show which takes the form of a mock news broadcast, and is fronted by puppets who present various items.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rI0hXEJFcgRaigCWGEuqEXQvOjY.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:43'),
  ('689583548253605466', '365 Days to the Wedding', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kentaro Kumagai, Saori Hayami, Ami Koshimizu, Fukushi Ochiai, Kana Asumi, Haruki Ishiya, Kentaro Tone, Jouji Nakata', null, 'Takuya and Rika work at the same travel agency in Tokyo and are both happily introverted and single. But their company is opening a new branch in Alaska next year, and employees without a spouse will be recruited to work there. Desperate to avoid the move, and though they’ve hardly spoken before, they decide to fake an engagement. Can these quiet coworkers become a convincing couple?', 'Takuya and Rika work at the same travel agency in Tokyo and are both happily introverted and single. But their company is opening a new branch in Alaska next year, and employees without a spouse will be recruited to work there. Desperate to avoid the move, and though they’ve hardly spoken before, they decide to fake an engagement. Can these quiet coworkers become a convincing couple?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMVkOrMaWEkHZLdPksKGcdi6hJg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230189'),
  ('63183346098857789', '365: Repeat the Year', 2020, 'Mystery, Drama', null, 'Lee Seo-youn, Lee Soo-kyung', 'Lee Jun-hyuk, Nam Ji-hyun, Kim Ji-soo, Yang Dong-geun, Lee Shi-a, Yun Ju-sang, Im Ha-ryong, Jung Moon-sung', null, 'A story where ten people get the chance to go back in time by one year, but unexpectedly mysterious situations start to arise when their fates are changed and twisted in the process. Ji Hyung Joo is a detective in the violent crimes division. He used to be part of the traffic police but was promoted when he arrested a wanted criminal. It''s been seven years since the change, and he''s a talented individual who always knows how to relax. Though he is happy at first to have the chance to go back in time by one year and "reset" his life, he begins to search for the truth when a series of mysterious events befall on the group of people he goes back in time with. Based on the Japanese novel, "Repeat"', 'A story where ten people get the chance to go back in time by one year, but unexpectedly mysterious situations start to arise when their fates are changed and twisted in the process. Ji Hyung Joo is a detective in the violent crimes division. He used to be part of the traffic police but was promoted when he arrested a wanted criminal. It''s been seven years since the change, and he''s a talented individual who always knows how to relax. Though he is happy at first to have the chance to go back in time by one year and "reset" his life, he begins to search for the truth when a series of mysterious events befall on the group of people he goes back in time with. Based on the Japanese novel, "Repeat"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1LyWBjxVv0hns4w8NekwWA7Mll.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99479'),
  ('847040635669790695', '37 Days', 2014, 'Drama', null, 'Mark Hayhurst', 'Bernhard Schütz, Mark Lewis Jones, Nicholas Asbury, Urs Remond, Oliver Ford Davies, Ian Beattie, Rainer Sellien, Ian McDiarmid', 'NR', 'This three-part political thriller follows the catastrophic chain of events leading up to World War I from the assassination of Archduke Franz Ferdinand on 28 June 1914 to Britain''s declaration of war on Germany 37 days later. This tense and gripping miniseries set among the corridors of power in Whitehall and Berlin tracks the unfolding crisis through the eyes of leading politicians and civil servants struggling to prevent the world''s first global war. 37 Days unlocks the mystery of the war s origins, overturning assumptions about its inevitability, demonstrating that World War One was neither a chance happening nor was it a foregone conclusion.', 'This three-part political thriller follows the catastrophic chain of events leading up to World War I from the assassination of Archduke Franz Ferdinand on 28 June 1914 to Britain''s declaration of war on Germany 37 days later. This tense and gripping miniseries set among the corridors of power in Whitehall and Berlin tracks the unfolding crisis through the eyes of leading politicians and civil servants struggling to prevent the world''s first global war. 37 Days unlocks the mystery of the war s origins, overturning assumptions about its inevitability, demonstrating that World War One was neither a chance happening nor was it a foregone conclusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqDzrXyRvm0mCMzYizRDhuAxkMF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64669'),
  ('171631117631012310', '37 secondes', 2025, 'Drama', 'Anne Landois, Sophie Kovess-Brun', null, 'Nina Meurisse, Jonathan Turnbull, Eric Pucheu, Anna Cervinka, Pauline Briand, Mathieu Demy, Jonas Bloquet, Antonia Buresi', null, 'On January 15, 2004, the Bugaled Breizh, a Breton trawler, sinks off the English coast, killing its 5 sailors. Marie, sister-in-law of one, links the sinking to NATO military exercises. and risks everything to uncover the truth.', 'On January 15, 2004, the Bugaled Breizh, a Breton trawler, sinks off the English coast, killing its 5 sailors. Marie, sister-in-law of one, links the sinking to NATO military exercises. and risks everything to uncover the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ufkrEzB5ndN2zNDxwfvDlF6Ahh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:237811'),
  ('358311537134543323', '39 i pół', 2008, 'Comedy', null, 'Doman Nowakowski', 'Tomasz Karolak, Daria Widawska, Krzysztof Stelmaszyk, Alan Andersz, Sonia Bohosiewicz, Dorota Deląg, Magdalena Zawadzka, Leonard Pietraszak', null, '39 i pół is a Polish comedy-drama television series that appeared on TVN for three seasons from March 4, 2008 through December 1, 2009. The series tells the story about Darek, a man just before his 40th birthday who wants go back to his wife and teenage son.', '39 i pół is a Polish comedy-drama television series that appeared on TVN for three seasons from March 4, 2008 through December 1, 2009. The series tells the story about Darek, a man just before his 40th birthday who wants go back to his wife and teenage son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wB1JMvtDUstgHte4EnGK5998dzP.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:40066'),
  ('511943313813253374', '3Below: Tales of Arcadia', 2018, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Guillermo del Toro', null, 'Tatiana Maslany, Frank Welker, Cheryl Hines, Glenn Close, Diego Luna, Nick Offerman, Nick Frost, Cole Sand', 'TV-Y7', 'After crash-landing on Earth, two royal teen aliens on the run struggle to blend in with humans as they evade intergalactic bounty hunters.', 'After crash-landing on Earth, two royal teen aliens on the run struggle to blend in with humans as they evade intergalactic bounty hunters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWoplw8QJhSGDnhyYCrs9OugdTj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:84154'),
  ('156200017995940048', '3rd Rock from the Sun', 1996, 'Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', 'Terry Turner, Bonnie Turner', null, 'John Lithgow, Kristen Johnston, Jane Curtin, Joseph Gordon-Levitt, French Stewart, Simbi Khali, Wayne Knight, Elmarie Wendel', 'TV-PG', 'The high commander of an alien expedition lands on Earth -- what he considers to be the least-important planet -- in human form as Dick Solomon. Along for the ride are his alien compatriots Harry, Sally and Tommy -- who is the eldest of the group but is now angrily trapped in a teen''s body.', 'The high commander of an alien expedition lands on Earth -- what he considers to be the least-important planet -- in human form as Dick Solomon. Along for the ride are his alien compatriots Harry, Sally and Tommy -- who is the eldest of the group but is now angrily trapped in a teen''s body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUB4lZghNnwQywKqgjIfJsyBqI2.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:155'),
  ('409842090765110028', '3x Manon', 2014, 'Drama', 'Jean-Xavier de Lestrade, Antoine Lacomblez', 'Antoine Lacomblez, Jean-Xavier de Lestrade', 'Alba Gaïa Bellugi, Marina Foïs, Théo Cholbi, Déborah François', null, 'After going before the judge for the third time, 15-year old Manon is placed in a reform centre for six months. Challenged by her own uncontrollable temper, and the bureaucracy of the institution, will this be Manon’s last chance at redemption?', 'After going before the judge for the third time, 15-year old Manon is placed in a reform centre for six months. Challenged by her own uncontrollable temper, and the bureaucracy of the institution, will this be Manon’s last chance at redemption?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXiH5RQYvoQwEh6SuV8rPPiJmeg.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67666'),
  ('229898115843091186', '3x3 Eyes', 1991, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Megumi Hayashibara, Koji Tsujitani', null, 'The story of a young man named Yakumo Fuuji, who through a strange series of events becomes the immortal slave of the last of a race of 3 Eyed immortals. The immortal absorbs his soul to save his life, making him immortal in the process. Now, he begins a journey with the female immortal in an attempt to find a way of becoming human. Of course, there are many complications along the way, not the least of which being that the immortal is a female with a split personality, one achingly cute and the other being no-nonsense destructive power, and the romances that develop between.', 'The story of a young man named Yakumo Fuuji, who through a strange series of events becomes the immortal slave of the last of a race of 3 Eyed immortals. The immortal absorbs his soul to save his life, making him immortal in the process. Now, he begins a journey with the female immortal in an attempt to find a way of becoming human. Of course, there are many complications along the way, not the least of which being that the immortal is a female with a split personality, one achingly cute and the other being no-nonsense destructive power, and the romances that develop between.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVetO3otqpgDlSPtxITKGON5k85.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62913'),
  ('137246458761843095', '4 Alternative Street', 1986, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Roman Wilhelmi, Bożena Dykiel, Jerzy Bończak, Stanisława Celińska, Zofia Czerwińska, Witold Pyrkosz, Wiesław Gołas, Kazimierz Kaczor', null, '4 Alternative Street was a Polish comedy TV show that was finished in 1983 and aired in 1986 due to censorship. Many famous Polish actors appeared in the series. The filming location used in the mini series was a residential complex which is still in existence at 3 Grzegorzewska Street in Warsaw, Poland. The series was a satire to the communist rule in Poland, spoken in a way that it passed through communist censorship office.', '4 Alternative Street was a Polish comedy TV show that was finished in 1983 and aired in 1986 due to censorship. Many famous Polish actors appeared in the series. The filming location used in the mini series was a residential complex which is still in existence at 3 Grzegorzewska Street in Warsaw, Poland. The series was a satire to the communist rule in Poland, spoken in a way that it passed through communist censorship office.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6adqIl17HKePBQSux12XldlqDDL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43250'),
  ('493440910418030176', '4 Blocks', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Hanno Hackfort, Bob Konrad, Richard Kropf', null, 'Kida Khodr Ramadan, Massiv, Almila Bağrıaçık, Oliver Masucci, Emilio Sakraya, Nik Xhelilaj, Brian Flaccus, Cem-Ali Gültekin', null, 'Based in Neukölln, Berlin Toni manages the daily business of dealing with the Arabic gangs and ends up wanting to leave his old life behind for his family, but as expected, its never that simple.', 'Based in Neukölln, Berlin Toni manages the daily business of dealing with the Arabic gangs and ends up wanting to leave his old life behind for his family, but as expected, its never that simple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVObyxtNxuPbG5czuKvm7pW56EV.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:71641'),
