  ('118279608263560122', '72 Dangerous Animals: Latin America', 2017, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Bob Brisbane', null, 'Powerful cats, indestructible arachnids and flesh-melting pit vipers are just the beginning in this series about Latin America''s deadliest creatures.', 'Powerful cats, indestructible arachnids and flesh-melting pit vipers are just the beginning in this series about Latin America''s deadliest creatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xL1pkGfR2NzJhj7NJS6ZZMGARBx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76453'),
  ('1081247135568670000', '72 Dangerous Places to Live', 2016, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Mitch Ryan', 'TV-MA', 'Get up close and personal with avalanches, fiery volcanoes and other natural cataclysms, and learn why some choose to live in their destructive paths.', 'Get up close and personal with avalanches, fiery volcanoes and other natural cataclysms, and learn why some choose to live in their destructive paths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dH9jZ2HWpkPDIXEKk5gMptWnkw0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70169'),
  ('662102936684970803', '77 Sunset Strip', 1958, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Roy Huggins', null, 'Efrem Zimbalist Jr., Edd Byrnes, Roger Smith, Jacqueline Beer, Louis Quinn', 'TV-PG', 'Stu Bailey and Jeff Spencer are the wisecracking, womanizing private-detective heroes of this Warner Brothers drama. They work out of an office located at 77 Sunset Strip in Los Angeles, California, right next door to a snazzy restaurant where Kookie works as a valet. The finger-snapping, slang-talking Kookie occasionally helps Stu and Jeff with their cases, and eventually becomes a full-fledged member of the detective agency. Rex Randolph and J.R. Hale also join the firm, and Suzanne is their leggy secretary.', 'Stu Bailey and Jeff Spencer are the wisecracking, womanizing private-detective heroes of this Warner Brothers drama. They work out of an office located at 77 Sunset Strip in Los Angeles, California, right next door to a snazzy restaurant where Kookie works as a valet. The finger-snapping, slang-talking Kookie occasionally helps Stu and Jeff with their cases, and eventually becomes a full-fledged member of the detective agency. Rex Randolph and J.R. Hale also join the firm, and Suzanne is their leggy secretary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3E533YY70yC3upv49XkeDcvd5z0.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:925'),
  ('261025536192437339', '7de Laan', 2000, 'Soap', 'Danie Odendaal', null, null, null, '7de Laan is an extraordinary microcosm where good and bad, evil and wholesome characters find themselves forming part of a wholesome community where no matter what – everyone counts and everyone cares…', '7de Laan is an extraordinary microcosm where good and bad, evil and wholesome characters find themselves forming part of a wholesome community where no matter what – everyone counts and everyone cares…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQcC4Kcx0ZEXxmj0gUrfkFR14LU.jpg', 24, 'tmdb:tv:17887'),
  ('320673255025064733', '7SEEDS', 2019, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nao Toyama, Jun Fukuyama, Katsuyuki Konishi, Kana Asumi, Kazuhiko Inoue, Akira Ishida, Yoko Hikasa, Hirofumi Nojima', 'TV-MA', 'Shy Natsu awakens as part of a group chosen to ensure the survival of humanity. Together, they have to survive on a changed Earth.', 'Shy Natsu awakens as part of a group chosen to ensure the survival of humanity. Together, they have to survive on a changed Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eeGRd3ENc9vetozwDDMhl9S7l3G.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85940'),
  ('197673995840526436', '7th Grade Civil Servant', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', null, 'Chun Sung-il', 'Choi Kang-hee, Joo Won, Ahn Nae-sang, Hwang Chan-sung, Byun Seung-yoon, Choi Jong-hwan, Dokgo Young-jae, Lee El', null, 'Love and espionage collide in this drama of the National Intelligence Service’s rookie agents. Han Gil Ro realizes his dream of becoming an international man of mystery, after a childhood spent pouring over James Bond films. Kim Seo Won spices things up as a goofy, yet determined agent, but it''s not all 007 glamor. Both Gil Ro and Seo Won must learn what it takes to uphold their sworn duty, even at the sacrifice of their happiness - and lives.', 'Love and espionage collide in this drama of the National Intelligence Service’s rookie agents. Han Gil Ro realizes his dream of becoming an international man of mystery, after a childhood spent pouring over James Bond films. Kim Seo Won spices things up as a goofy, yet determined agent, but it''s not all 007 glamor. Both Gil Ro and Seo Won must learn what it takes to uphold their sworn duty, even at the sacrifice of their happiness - and lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icXFTKLdfjOh8y6T1soyEjXV4T5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46592'),
  ('364755582666024377', '7th Heaven', 1996, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Brenda Hampton', null, 'Stephen Collins, Catherine Hicks, Beverley Mitchell, George Stults, Nikolas Brino, Lorenzo Brino', 'TV-G', 'Reverend Eric Camden and his wife Annie have always had their hands full caring for seven children, not to mention the friends, sweethearts and spouses that continually come and go in the Camden household.', 'Reverend Eric Camden and his wife Annie have always had their hands full caring for seven children, not to mention the friends, sweethearts and spouses that continually come and go in the Camden household.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGmY2VP6mzAM6s8HkRVc1qzpK83.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:4550'),
  ('74002494033563452', '7th Time Loop: The Villainess Enjoys a Carefree Life Married to Her Worst Enemy!', 2024, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ikumi Hasegawa, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Shinnosuke Tachibana, Katsumi Fukuhara, Daisuke Ono, Shunichi Toki, Mariya Ise', 'TV-14', 'Rishe, the duke’s daughter, is no stranger to reincarnation—it’s her seventh life, after all. Each life restarts at her broken engagement. Having been a merchant, a maid, and a knight, she now desires leisure. But her world changes when a prince, who killed her in a past life, proposes! To prevent war and live to a ripe old age, she begins her seventh life as the bride of an enemy nation’s prince.', 'Rishe, the duke’s daughter, is no stranger to reincarnation—it’s her seventh life, after all. Each life restarts at her broken engagement. Having been a merchant, a maid, and a knight, she now desires leisure. But her world changes when a prince, who killed her in a past life, proposes! To prevent war and live to a ripe old age, she begins her seventh life as the bride of an enemy nation’s prince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5k7bkqolsaJVCj321gLkuikk2Ax.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:232926'),
  ('829352307988564884', '8 Days', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Rafael Parente, Peter Kocyla, Benjamin Seiler', null, 'Christiane Paul, Mark Waschke, Lena Klenke, Luisa-Céline Gaffron, Fabian Hinrichs, Nora Waldstätten, Devid Striesow, Murathan Muslu', null, 'With a huge asteroid rushing towards Europe, there are only eight days left till impact. In the face of the apocalypse everything changes; laws and rules are abandoned. Who can save themself, what is really important now?', 'With a huge asteroid rushing towards Europe, there are only eight days left till impact. In the face of the apocalypse everything changes; laws and rules are abandoned. Who can save themself, what is really important now?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bi6APA890lIOY50QfPtFttOULs6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82807'),
  ('554893240350922090', '8 Out of 10 Cats', 2005, 'Talk', null, null, 'Jimmy Carr, Rob Beckett, Katherine Ryan', null, 'A weekly, topical panel show based around a huge series of opinion poll surveys carried out around Britain.', 'A weekly, topical panel show based around a huge series of opinion poll surveys carried out around Britain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1v9PXvumKXZT9AKzNjqdAADNPKS.jpg', 23, 'tmdb:tv:4020'),
  ('232049910216793850', '8 Out of 10 Cats Does Countdown', 2013, 'Comedy, Reality, Talk', null, null, 'Jimmy Carr, Jon Richardson, Rob Beckett, Rachel Riley, Susie Dent, Robert Deaton', null, 'Jimmy Carr hosts proceedings as the 8 Out of 10 Cats crew take over the words and numbers quiz.', 'Jimmy Carr hosts proceedings as the 8 Out of 10 Cats crew take over the words and numbers quiz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l4LGTlpRbGqgZURwzGXCZLHRr1k.jpg', 29, 'tmdb:tv:62974'),
  ('201173729168412238', '8 Simple Rules', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tracy Gamble', null, 'Katey Sagal, Kaley Cuoco, Amy Davidson, Martin Spanjers, James Garner, David Spade', 'TV-PG', 'Paul and Cate are raising their three children -- Bridget, Kerry and Rory -- which is no easy task. Oldest daughter Bridget is traversing the dating scene. Kerry is cute and smart, but she has a hard time getting in touch with her true feelings because of her lack of self-confidence. The youngest of the three children, and only boy, Rory is beginning to discover one of life''s greatest mysteries -- girls.', 'Paul and Cate are raising their three children -- Bridget, Kerry and Rory -- which is no easy task. Oldest daughter Bridget is traversing the dating scene. Kerry is cute and smart, but she has a hard time getting in touch with her true feelings because of her lack of self-confidence. The youngest of the three children, and only boy, Rory is beginning to discover one of life''s greatest mysteries -- girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81bJijYZedZ4TSm34rYmW9gEDvN.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:4241'),
  ('37832945106038159', '80''s', 2012, 'Comedy', null, 'Stanislav Tlyashev, Andrey Nikiforov, Evgenia Khripkova', 'Alexandr Yakin, Natalya Zemtsova, Aleksandr Polovtsev, Mariya Aronova, Dmitriy Belotserkovskiy, Roman Fomin, Anastasiya Balyakina, Anna Tsukanova-Kott', null, 'This story began back in 1986. Perestroika was already underway, but the Soviet Union had not yet collapsed. It was a time when there was no Internet, hypermarkets and even mobile phones, but they drank water from the tap, there were no traffic jams in Moscow, and the keys to the apartment were quietly left under the rug.', 'This story began back in 1986. Perestroika was already underway, but the Soviet Union had not yet collapsed. It was a time when there was no Internet, hypermarkets and even mobile phones, but they drank water from the tap, there were no traffic jams in Moscow, and the keys to the apartment were quietly left under the rug.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5CKCyhNhIsgrgo2IUidmLyVsZfb.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:62163'),
  ('534242545094842440', '800 Meters', 2022, 'Documentary', null, 'Ramón Campos, Elías León Siminiani', null, 'TV-MA', 'In 2017, Spain suffered two terrorist attacks perpetrated by young members of its community. How could this happen? This incisive series investigates.', 'In 2017, Spain suffered two terrorist attacks perpetrated by young members of its community. How could this happen? This incisive series investigates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1FMWoqv6LAQjRiLre5s1WZpKHY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158088'),
  ('313815947360248161', '800 Words', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Maxine Fleming, James Griffin', null, 'Erik Thomson, Melina Vidler, Benson Jack Anthony', null, 'A recently widowed father, quits his job as a popular 800 word columnist for a top selling Sydney newspaper. Over the internet he buys a house on an impulse in a remote New Zealand seaside town. He then has to break the news to his two teenage kids who just lost their mum, and now face an even more uncertain future. But the colourful and inquisitive locals ensure his dream of a fresh start does not go to plan.', 'A recently widowed father, quits his job as a popular 800 word columnist for a top selling Sydney newspaper. Over the internet he buys a house on an impulse in a remote New Zealand seaside town. He then has to break the news to his two teenage kids who just lost their mum, and now face an even more uncertain future. But the colourful and inquisitive locals ensure his dream of a fresh start does not go to plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1fqAY0rRBlbXZdMRSqJqNoRIAg.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:63839'),
  ('466389619361791394', '86 EIGHTY-SIX', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', null, null, 'Ikumi Hasegawa, Shoya Chiba, Natsumi Fujiwara, Seiichiro Yamashita, Saori Hayami, Sayumi Suzushiro', 'TV-MA', 'Called “Juggernaut,” these are the unmanned combat drones developed by the Republic of San Magnolia in answer to the attacks by the autonomous unmanned drones of the neighboring Empire of Giad, the “Legion”. But they’re only unmanned in name. In reality, they are piloted by the Eighty-sixers—those considered to be less than human and treated as mere tools. Determined to achieve his own mysterious ends, Shin, the captain of Spearhead Squadron, which is comprised of Eighty-sixers, continues to fight a hopeless war on a battlefield where only death awaits him.', 'Called “Juggernaut,” these are the unmanned combat drones developed by the Republic of San Magnolia in answer to the attacks by the autonomous unmanned drones of the neighboring Empire of Giad, the “Legion”. But they’re only unmanned in name. In reality, they are piloted by the Eighty-sixers—those considered to be less than human and treated as mere tools. Determined to achieve his own mysterious ends, Shin, the captain of Spearhead Squadron, which is comprised of Eighty-sixers, continues to fight a hopeless war on a battlefield where only death awaits him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96mUvRlJBYOMBdbn30wtoh7QrpY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100565'),
  ('1024562958614999410', '87th Precinct', 1961, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Ron Harper, Robert Lansing, Norman Fell, Gena Rowlands, Gregory Walcott', null, '87th Precinct is an American crime drama starring Robert Lansing, Gena Rowlands, and Ron Harper, which aired on NBC on Monday evenings during the 1961–1962 television season.', '87th Precinct is an American crime drama starring Robert Lansing, Gena Rowlands, and Ron Harper, which aired on NBC on Monday evenings during the 1961–1962 television season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cjjQVJdYwIDoRWsRjHemp6nbv0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7472'),
  ('605334221081900250', '9 End 2 Outs', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', null, 'Yeoh Gee-na', 'Soo Ae, Lee Jung-jin, Lee Tae-sung, Hwang Ji-hyeon, Lee Sang-woo, Cho Eun-ji, Kim Chang-sook, Yoona', null, '9 End 2 Outs is a heartfelt and hilarious romantic comedy with a twist. Hong Nan Hee and Byun Hyung Tae have been best friends for 30 years. They cook for each other, call each other daily, bicker like siblings, and support each other when things go wrong. But everything is about to change. On her 30th birthday, Nan Hee realizes that she needs to shake things up. Tired of living with her mother, she rents Hyung Tae''s house while he is on vacation, but complications arise and soon the two friends are living in the house together. As the old friends navigate new territory, they begin to discover things they never knew about each other—he''s neurotic, she snores—but more importantly, they begin to discover what their friends and family have always suspected—that, without realizing it, they''ve been the most important people to each other all along.', '9 End 2 Outs is a heartfelt and hilarious romantic comedy with a twist. Hong Nan Hee and Byun Hyung Tae have been best friends for 30 years. They cook for each other, call each other daily, bicker like siblings, and support each other when things go wrong. But everything is about to change. On her 30th birthday, Nan Hee realizes that she needs to shake things up. Tired of living with her mother, she rents Hyung Tae''s house while he is on vacation, but complications arise and soon the two friends are living in the house together. As the old friends navigate new territory, they begin to discover things they never knew about each other—he''s neurotic, she snores—but more importantly, they begin to discover what their friends and family have always suspected—that, without realizing it, they''ve been the most important people to each other all along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1ToG0tmD4M2DBn32oayRmFdWRl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38854'),
  ('537219365837856217', '9-1-1', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Ryan Murphy, Brad Falchuk, Tim Minear', null, 'Angela Bassett, Jennifer Love Hewitt, Oliver Stark, Aisha Hinds, Kenneth Choi, Ryan Guzman, Corinne Massiah, Elijah M. Cooper', 'TV-14', 'Explore the high-pressure experiences of police officers, paramedics and firefighters who are thrust into the most frightening, shocking and heart-stopping situations. These emergency responders must try to balance saving those who are at their most vulnerable with solving the problems in their own lives.', 'Explore the high-pressure experiences of police officers, paramedics and firefighters who are thrust into the most frightening, shocking and heart-stopping situations. These emergency responders must try to balance saving those who are at their most vulnerable with solving the problems in their own lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6njUqsd3By2mJsdZm1P0moPLzs3.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:75219'),
  ('121238318561340189', '9-1-1: Lone Star', 2020, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Brad Falchuk, Tim Minear, Ryan Murphy', 'Silas Savard, Matt Solik', 'Rob Lowe, Gina Torres, Ronen Rubinstein, Jim Parrack, Natacha Karam, Brian Michael Smith, Rafael L. Silva, Julian Works', 'TV-14', 'Nearly 20 years ago, Owen Strand was the lone survivor of his Manhattan firehouse on 9/11. In the wake of the attack, Owen had the unenviable task of rebuilding his station. After a similar tragedy happens to a firehouse in Austin, Owen, along with his troubled firefighter son, T.K., takes his progressive philosophies of life and firefighting down to Texas, where he helps them start anew. On the surface, Owen is all about big-city style and swagger, but underneath he struggles with a secret he hides from the world - one that could very well end his life.', 'Nearly 20 years ago, Owen Strand was the lone survivor of his Manhattan firehouse on 9/11. In the wake of the attack, Owen had the unenviable task of rebuilding his station. After a similar tragedy happens to a firehouse in Austin, Owen, along with his troubled firefighter son, T.K., takes his progressive philosophies of life and firefighting down to Texas, where he helps them start anew. On the surface, Owen is all about big-city style and swagger, but underneath he struggles with a secret he hides from the world - one that could very well end his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/BOTITv548LYGB4xRD3rHfbwkqm.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:89393'),
  ('406901052892341341', '9-1-1: Nashville', 2025, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Ryan Murphy, Tim Minear, Rashad Raisani', null, 'Chris O''Donnell, Jessica Capshaw, Kimberly Williams-Paisley, LeAnn Rimes, Michael Provost, Juani Feliz, Hailey Kilgore, Hunter McVey', 'TV-14', 'Follow heroic first responders, as well as their family saga of power and glamour, in one of America''s most diverse and dynamic cities: Nashville, Tennessee.', 'Follow heroic first responders, as well as their family saga of power and glamour, in one of America''s most diverse and dynamic cities: Nashville, Tennessee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Dl0LysUOEWOhitzAfrKFkBeefu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:284838'),
  ('94203149669202582', '9-nine- Ruler''s Crown', 2025, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', null, null, 'Atsushi Abe, Misato Fukuen, Atsumi Tanezaki, Yuri Yamaoka, Akane Fujita, Kazutomi Yamamoto, Satomi Arai, Hana Takeda', null, '9-nine is a tale of the town of Shiromitsugawa, host to mysterious Artifacts and the superpowers they bestow on their Users. A tale of growing trust and budding romance between the protagonist and the heroine, and also a murder mystery where they hunt down the culprit behind a series of supernatural murders.', '9-nine is a tale of the town of Shiromitsugawa, host to mysterious Artifacts and the superpowers they bestow on their Users. A tale of growing trust and budding romance between the protagonist and the heroine, and also a murder mystery where they hunt down the culprit behind a series of supernatural murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mM2XpYKaFIAcTkGng6byHv2I5OI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:270931'),
  ('588628410479998768', '9/11: One Day in America', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Joseph Pfeifer, Jason Thomas, Ron DiFrancesco, William Toti', 'TV-MA', 'In official collaboration with the 9/11 Memorial & Museum, this documentary series takes viewers through harrowing moments of the historic morning of September 11, 2001.', 'In official collaboration with the 9/11 Memorial & Museum, this documentary series takes viewers through harrowing moments of the historic morning of September 11, 2001.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJUnyjaSscsZLbSKhRp0vh6Fl24.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126422'),
  ('371337868813397646', '90 Day Fiancé', 2014, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Getting through customs is just the beginning. With just 90 days to wed on a fiancé visa, follow international couples as they attempt to overcome cultural barriers and family drama while in search of true love that knows no borders.', 'Getting through customs is just the beginning. With just 90 days to wed on a fiancé visa, follow international couples as they attempt to overcome cultural barriers and family drama while in search of true love that knows no borders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJVDf4ZysdxhoREQIHlOM4phRNp.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:61575'),
  ('366288217444693170', '90 Day Fiancé: Before the 90 Days', 2017, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Follow couples who have an existing relationship online, but haven''t met in person. We''ll experience their journey as they travel to the other''s foreign country for the first time in an attempt to establish an in-person relationship and start the K-1 visa process.', 'Follow couples who have an existing relationship online, but haven''t met in person. We''ll experience their journey as they travel to the other''s foreign country for the first time in an attempt to establish an in-person relationship and start the K-1 visa process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/miG0k1MGyLovjKETzhqbKs9kIdt.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:73319'),
  ('594880816234631645', '90 Day Fiancé: Happily Ever After?', 2016, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Life after the 90 Days continues as the couples look back on their 90-day journey and realize their lives as newlyweds have not gotten easier.', 'Life after the 90 Days continues as the couples look back on their 90-day journey and realize their lives as newlyweds have not gotten easier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvnKFszSDrB1zMf7R8DSPY2VRPV.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:67757'),
  ('484522890147406893', '90 Day Fiancé: Pillow Talk', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Robert Springs, Veronica Rodriguez, Anny Francisco, Tim Malcolm, David Toborowsky, Annie Suwan, Alexei Brovarnik, Kenneth Niedermeier', 'TV-14', 'Previous cast members of 90 Day Fiancé and its spin-off shows react to new episodes of these shows.', 'Previous cast members of 90 Day Fiancé and its spin-off shows react to new episodes of these shows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtBcg0qCekbSvPHCGtsDQEKOq8z.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:94009'),
  ('1088468128830367513', '90 Day Fiancé: The Other Way', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Americans move to a foreign country all in the name of love. Will uprooting their lives in the United States pay off, or will they be packing up and moving back to America brokenhearted?', 'Americans move to a foreign country all in the name of love. Will uprooting their lives in the United States pay off, or will they be packing up and moving back to America brokenhearted?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jw4KDjNmpBnMd7fEjbz9qTUmKJS.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:90046'),
  ('683219428850620704', '90 Day: The Single Life', 2021, 'Reality, Drama', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Six singles from the various 90 Day Fiancé series give dating another shot. Letting go of their past proves difficult as they have to go through first dates and falling in love all over again. The singles seek out the help of dating coaches, events, apps, friends and family.', 'Six singles from the various 90 Day Fiancé series give dating another shot. Letting go of their past proves difficult as they have to go through first dates and falling in love all over again. The singles seek out the help of dating coaches, events, apps, friends and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rjfFbzDTGxwFszGAb3wEGkVgq3W.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:118422'),
  ('1000776150053304837', '90 Day: The Single Life Between the Sheets', 2026, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Go beyond the drama in this unfiltered after-show to "90 Day: The Single Life," where cast members serve up juicy extras, spill behind-the-scenes drama and share unfiltered reactions to each episode.', 'Go beyond the drama in this unfiltered after-show to "90 Day: The Single Life," where cast members serve up juicy extras, spill behind-the-scenes drama and share unfiltered reactions to each episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cDGt1rFFSOreCYjfajJgs8by7j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:315139'),
  ('1023046546365785407', '900 Days Without Anabel', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Anabel Segura''s abduction held Spain in suspense for 900 days. This docuseries explores the case through never-before-heard recordings of the kidnappers.', 'Anabel Segura''s abduction held Spain in suspense for 900 days. This docuseries explores the case through never-before-heard recordings of the kidnappers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQEfSeIf2459lEoLmXkgjlRyI22.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274905'),
  ('608690174868301648', '90210', 2008, 'Drama', 'Rob Thomas, Gabe Sachs, Jeff Judah', null, 'Shenae Grimes-Beech, Tristan Mack Wilds, AnnaLynne McCord, Jessica Stroup, Michael Steger, Jessica Lowndes, Matt Lanter, Cassandra Church', 'TV-14', '90210 revolves around several students at the fictional West Beverly Hills High School, including new Beverly Hills residents Annie Wilson and Dixon Wilson. Their father, Harry Wilson, has returned from Kansas to his Beverly Hills childhood home with his family to care for his mother, former television and theater actress Tabitha Wilson, who has a drinking problem and clashes with his wife Debbie Wilson. Annie and Dixon struggle to adjust to their new lives while making friends and yet adhering to their parents'' wishes.', '90210 revolves around several students at the fictional West Beverly Hills High School, including new Beverly Hills residents Annie Wilson and Dixon Wilson. Their father, Harry Wilson, has returned from Kansas to his Beverly Hills childhood home with his family to care for his mother, former television and theater actress Tabitha Wilson, who has a drinking problem and clashes with his wife Debbie Wilson. Annie and Dixon struggle to adjust to their new lives while making friends and yet adhering to their parents'' wishes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6uy8Le8X8qqvc5X7pSFn3BJA69M.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:5917'),
  ('407395082119080233', '91 Days', 2016, 'Animation, Crime, Drama', 'Taku Kishimoto', null, 'Takashi Kondo, Takuya Eguchi, Takahiro Sakurai, Soma Saito, Kenjiro Tsuda, Koutaro Nishiyama, Yuichi Nakamura, Daisuke Ono', 'TV-MA', 'During Prohibition, the law is powerless and the mob rules Lawless, a town that thrives on the black market sale of illicitly brewed liquor. Avilio returns to town after a time away, following a lead on the murder of his family.', 'During Prohibition, the law is powerless and the mob rules Lawless, a town that thrives on the black market sale of illicitly brewed liquor. Avilio returns to town after a time away, following a lead on the murder of his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPn42jFjw0ia1o5oL3SsTsEKgFP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67043'),
  ('1007554082668743853', '99', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Alex Ferguson, David Beckham, Paul Scholes, Andy Cole, Gary Neville, Phil Neville, Peter Schmeichel, Teddy Sheringham', null, '1999 was a year of groundbreaking success for England’s biggest and most powerful football club, Manchester United. Despite dominating domestic football during the 90s, manager Alex Ferguson was yet to restore Manchester United’s European glory when in 1999, glory arrived in an unprecedented fashion.', '1999 was a year of groundbreaking success for England’s biggest and most powerful football club, Manchester United. Despite dominating domestic football during the 90s, manager Alex Ferguson was yet to restore Manchester United’s European glory when in 1999, glory arrived in an unprecedented fashion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDkzFvNP8H8HM163nFmitPx0s53.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:251559'),
  ('915564453158825044', '99 Days with the Superstar', 2011, 'Romance', 'Masahiro Kunimoto, Tomomi Ookubo', null, 'Kim Tae-hee, Hidetoshi Nishijima, Kuranosuke Sasaki, Jun Kaname, Hitomi Miyauchi, Ok Taec-yeon', null, 'She''s an attractive superstar that everyone feels very far away from, yet she has a secret buried deep in her heart. One day, a normal man becomes her bodyguard. They go every where together knowing that they cannot be in love with each other. The man will be her bodyguard for 99 days. Kohei Namiki who works at a security company is a single man approaching his 40''s. Although he is passionate about astrology, he cannot follow through on his dreams to work in an observatory due to his family and economic difficulties. The superstar actress from South Korea, Han Yoo Na arrives in Japan to star in a drama series. Yoo Na and Kohei''s unexpected encounter of becoming master and servant slowly develops into an interesting relationship.', 'She''s an attractive superstar that everyone feels very far away from, yet she has a secret buried deep in her heart. One day, a normal man becomes her bodyguard. They go every where together knowing that they cannot be in love with each other. The man will be her bodyguard for 99 days. Kohei Namiki who works at a security company is a single man approaching his 40''s. Although he is passionate about astrology, he cannot follow through on his dreams to work in an observatory due to his family and economic difficulties. The superstar actress from South Korea, Han Yoo Na arrives in Japan to star in a drama series. Yoo Na and Kohei''s unexpected encounter of becoming master and servant slowly develops into an interesting relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/W6dNhpMqCjMHkG16yH7wPxpRhj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40448'),
  ('753363756337414387', '99.9 Criminal Lawyer', 2016, 'Crime', null, null, 'Jun Matsumoto, Teruyuki Kagawa, Fumino Kimura, Jin Katagiri, Yukino Kishii, Shori Sato, Ittoku Kishibe, Magi', null, 'Hiroto Miyama is an unconventional young lawyer who dances to his own tune and gets a little obsessive. For one thing, he’s only interested in criminal cases, and he will never give up in his pursuit of the truth even if offers only a 0.1% chance of being discovered. Japan’s 99.9% criminal case conviction rate leads the world, attesting to a “highly reliable” judicial system. In other words, once a crime suspect is indicted, prosecutor arguments tend to be accepted hook, line and sinker. In the face of those 99.9% odds, there’s no money in being a defense lawyer specializing in criminal cases, but for Miyama, that’s where the interest and kernels of truth lie. From unexpected places, the mold-breaking Miyama stakes his reputation on a prayer of a chance as he clashes with hotshot lawyers who’ll go to any lengths to win in this gloriously fun, legal mystery.', 'Hiroto Miyama is an unconventional young lawyer who dances to his own tune and gets a little obsessive. For one thing, he’s only interested in criminal cases, and he will never give up in his pursuit of the truth even if offers only a 0.1% chance of being discovered. Japan’s 99.9% criminal case conviction rate leads the world, attesting to a “highly reliable” judicial system. In other words, once a crime suspect is indicted, prosecutor arguments tend to be accepted hook, line and sinker. In the face of those 99.9% odds, there’s no money in being a defense lawyer specializing in criminal cases, but for Miyama, that’s where the interest and kernels of truth lie. From unexpected places, the mold-breaking Miyama stakes his reputation on a prayer of a chance as he clashes with hotshot lawyers who’ll go to any lengths to win in this gloriously fun, legal mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3PI2CgSdFeiNtqsBE0Gqe0Viahc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66584'),
  ('906382751877041041', '9JKL', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Dana Klein, Mark Feuerstein', null, 'Mark Feuerstein, David Walton, Elliott Gould, Linda Lavin, Liza Lapira, Albert Tsai, Matt Murray', 'TV-PG', 'A time in Mark Feuerstein''s adult life when he lived in apartment 9K in the building he grew up in, sandwiched between his parents'' apartment, 9J; and his brother, sister-in-law and their baby''s apartment, 9L and his attempts to set boundaries with his intrusive but well-meaning family.', 'A time in Mark Feuerstein''s adult life when he lived in apartment 9K in the building he grew up in, sandwiched between his parents'' apartment, 9J; and his brother, sister-in-law and their baby''s apartment, 9L and his attempts to set boundaries with his intrusive but well-meaning family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jFLTrrmTgZxLAqTza171eX2FZr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71717'),
