  ('941158276841467646', 'A Love to Kill', 2005, 'Drama', null, 'Lee Kyoung-hee', 'Rain, Shin Min-a, Kim Sa-rang, Lee Ki-woo, Kim Young-jae, Kang Rae-yeon, Park In-hwan, Yoo Hye-ri', null, 'A good-for-nothing K1 fighter begins working as a top celebrity''s private bodyguard, with the intent of seducing her and then leaving her to ruins, as an act of avenging his older brother who was left in a coma. Soon, he finds himself falling in love with her, their romance a tragedy in the making.', 'A good-for-nothing K1 fighter begins working as a top celebrity''s private bodyguard, with the intent of seducing her and then leaving her to ruins, as an act of avenging his older brother who was left in a coma. Soon, he finds himself falling in love with her, their romance a tragedy in the making.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjttqFsLkC3vEroAbqOZsFaYDdq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2619'),
  ('44863237071953344', 'A Love To Remember', 2014, 'Drama', 'Leonardo Abreu, Alberto Gómez', null, 'Héctor Soberón, Daniel Elbittar, Melissa Barrera, Cecilia Ponce, Aura Cristina Geithner, Rafael Sánchez Navarro, Gabriela Roel, Leticia Huijara', null, 'A rich and handsome architect is flying from Acapulco to Mexico City when his plane crashes. A beautiful, young girl finds him in the forest and decides to bring him home to look after him.', 'A rich and handsome architect is flying from Acapulco to Mexico City when his plane crashes. A beautiful, young girl finds him in the forest and decides to bring him home to look after him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCfJvkU4qKt3S1ssXD6xRtSCXrB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107159'),
  ('732680391649488711', 'A Man Called God', 2010, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Bong-Seong Park', null, 'Song Il-gook, Han Chae-young, Jeong Dong-hwan, Yoo In-young, Nam Da-reum, Choo Ja-hyun, Lee Bo-hee, Cho Jin-woong', null, 'Michael King vows to avenge his parents'' deaths. He believes that he can use his power as head of an underground drug kingpin to punish those who hurt him. However, his beliefs are shaken when he falls in love with a reporter named Jin Bo Bae.', 'Michael King vows to avenge his parents'' deaths. He believes that he can use his power as head of an underground drug kingpin to punish those who hurt him. However, his beliefs are shaken when he falls in love with a reporter named Jin Bo Bae.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xD7gEI967MDGGJLBwhPeel88BVF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38850'),
