  ('44004596062463635', 'A Moody Christmas', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Trent O''Donnell, Phil Lloyd', null, 'Ian Meadows, Patrick Brammall, Jane Harber, Danny Adcock, Robina Beard, Tina Bursill, Guy Edmonds, Darren Gilshenan', null, 'Focused on the lovable, yet seasonally dysfunctional Moody family, A Moody Christmas is set against the backdrop of the one occasion that can bring out the best (and the worst) in people … Christmas Day.', 'Focused on the lovable, yet seasonally dysfunctional Moody family, A Moody Christmas is set against the backdrop of the one occasion that can bring out the best (and the worst) in people … Christmas Day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSWNWUX1LTKittrghwTer4Q7nvn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46415'),
  ('391868273529529590', 'A Moonlight Nights Passing', 2026, 'Mystery', 'Rikako Akiyoshi', null, 'Haru, Kumiko Aso, Shuntaro Yanagi, Ryūto Sakuma, Kiyohiko Shibukawa, Naoki Tanaka', null, 'A transgender bar owner and a troubled housewife uncover buried regrets and get caught in a murder mystery in Osaka, where literature and intuition guide them toward the truth.', 'A transgender bar owner and a troubled housewife uncover buried regrets and get caught in a murder mystery in Osaka, where literature and intuition guide them toward the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6s7j5SGdcprXHfg7FqayaNih1hQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:314644'),
  ('87104258231592891', 'A Mother''s Love', 2019, 'Soap, Drama, Crime, Family', 'Manuela Dias', 'Manuela Dias, Roberto Vitorino, Mariana Mesquita', 'Regina Casé, Adriana Esteves, Taís Araújo, Murilo Benício, Irandhir Santos, Vladimir Brichta, Juliano Cazarré, Chay Suede', null, 'Lurdes is a mother of five who tirelessly seeks for Domenico, a child of hers who was sold by his own father 26 years ago; Thelma is an overprotective mother who finds out she has a terminal illness, and must race against time to make her dreams come true and prepare her son for a life without her presence; Vitória is a successful lawyer who sees the end of her marriage after countless failed attempts to have a baby and decides for adoption, but finds out she is pregnant during the process. In "A Mother''s Love", the lives of these women are intertwined while they recognize themselves in the unconditional love provided by motherhood.', 'Lurdes is a mother of five who tirelessly seeks for Domenico, a child of hers who was sold by his own father 26 years ago; Thelma is an overprotective mother who finds out she has a terminal illness, and must race against time to make her dreams come true and prepare her son for a life without her presence; Vitória is a successful lawyer who sees the end of her marriage after countless failed attempts to have a baby and decides for adoption, but finds out she is pregnant during the process. In "A Mother''s Love", the lives of these women are intertwined while they recognize themselves in the unconditional love provided by motherhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FGuE5rGu9OixjmDHuIaW2ld92F.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95885'),
  ('83782049309080717', 'A Mother''s Love', 2022, 'Drama, Soap', 'Yasemin Erkul Türkmenli, Ece Tahtalıoğlu Pertez', null, 'Erol Gedik, Selin Sezgin, Gece Işık Demirel, Cansın Mısırlı, Serdar Yıldırım, Dilara Büyükbayraktar, Faruk Pakiş, Kayra Zabcı', null, 'Zeynep is an innocent and beautiful girl who''s very fond of her mother. One day, her mother Cemre dies in an accident. No one can bring themselves to tell Zeynep that her mother is dead. Zeynep was born with a heart condition and she is not strong enough to bear the news. When she was dying, Zeynep''s mother is slandered so that Murat, who used to love her madly, now hates her deeply. Now that Asude, her grandmother has the perfect conditions to make Murat marry Melek, the woman she''d like to see as her daughter-in-law. The night that Zeynep finds out about her mother''s death, she also finds out that Murat is to marry Melek and she has an attack. When Zeynep''s heart is about to stop, a miracle happens. Zeynep comes across Nazli, who looks exactly like her mother.', 'Zeynep is an innocent and beautiful girl who''s very fond of her mother. One day, her mother Cemre dies in an accident. No one can bring themselves to tell Zeynep that her mother is dead. Zeynep was born with a heart condition and she is not strong enough to bear the news. When she was dying, Zeynep''s mother is slandered so that Murat, who used to love her madly, now hates her deeply. Now that Asude, her grandmother has the perfect conditions to make Murat marry Melek, the woman she''d like to see as her daughter-in-law. The night that Zeynep finds out about her mother''s death, she also finds out that Murat is to marry Melek and she has an attack. When Zeynep''s heart is about to stop, a miracle happens. Zeynep comes across Nazli, who looks exactly like her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pPjyZWvaLzu2MRllG64p6eyQyre.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:49608'),
  ('255579715884803985', 'A Mother''s Son', 2012, 'Crime, Drama', null, 'Chris Lang', 'Hermione Norris, Martin Clunes, Paul McGann, Alexander Arnold, Nicola Walker, Annabelle Apsion, Antonia Clarke, Jake Davies', null, 'A mother suspects that her son could be the killer of a recently found dead girl, and becomes caught in a torturous dilemma of whether to denounce him, or protect him and hide the act.', 'A mother suspects that her son could be the killer of a recently found dead girl, and becomes caught in a torturous dilemma of whether to denounce him, or protect him and hide the act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spqETTrL69k6heBkBolmw5ZIAKN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61574'),
  ('1045824007660668497', 'A Murder at the End of the World', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Brit Marling, Zal Batmanglij', null, 'Emma Corrin, Brit Marling, Harris Dickinson, Alice Braga, Joan Chen, Raúl Esparza, Jermaine Fowler, Pegah Ferydoni', 'TV-MA', 'Gen Z amateur sleuth and tech-savvy hacker Darby Hart and eight other guests are invited by a reclusive billionaire to participate in a retreat at a remote location. When one of the other guests is found dead, Darby must use her skills to prove it was murder before the killer takes another life.', 'Gen Z amateur sleuth and tech-savvy hacker Darby Hart and eight other guests are invited by a reclusive billionaire to participate in a retreat at a remote location. When one of the other guests is found dead, Darby must use her skills to prove it was murder before the killer takes another life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mWCXJefbNU1E2XPJVM2vejMSZO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:134095'),
  ('136182710350682650', 'A Murderous Affair in Horizon Tower', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery', null, 'Yang Shen, Shu Qiao', 'Yang Zishan, Guo Tao, AngelaBaby, Lü Yulai, Zhang Bojia, Jiao Gang, Ni Hongjie, Liu Dan', 'NR', 'The mysterious death of coffee shop owner Zhong Meibao, known as the "Doll Murder Case," shakes the Horizon Tower. While initial suspects include those linked to her romantically, new evidence reveals dark secrets from her past, pulling her family into the unfolding mystery.', 'The mysterious death of coffee shop owner Zhong Meibao, known as the "Doll Murder Case," shakes the Horizon Tower. While initial suspects include those linked to her romantically, new evidence reveals dark secrets from her past, pulling her family into the unfolding mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/divNuMfcVFOnZuLXxYQWsoArOXL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107723'),
  ('1071673163945040588', 'A Nagy Duett', 2011, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyQFl4zVlCDro3U06xxhgARBlhU.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:289232'),
  ('816440575978245146', 'A Nearly Normal Family', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', null, 'Anna Platt, Hans Jörnlind', 'Alexandra Karlsson Tyrefors, Lo Kauppi, Björn Bengtsson, Christian Fandango Sundgren, Melisa Ferhatovic, Håkan Bengtsson, Vera Olin, Cedomir Glisovic', 'TV-MA', 'The world of a seemingly perfect family shatters when a shocking murder proves that they''re willing to make desperate moves to protect one another.', 'The world of a seemingly perfect family shatters when a shocking murder proves that they''re willing to make desperate moves to protect one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXQZaoKFYXkSTRBXeerj4MJ5eXQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235571'),
