  ('502484915997632245', 'A Piece of Your Mind', 2020, 'Drama', 'Lee Suk-yeon', 'Lee Suk-yeon', 'Jung Hae-in, Chae Soo-bin, Lee Ha-na, Kim Sung-kyu, Woo Ji-hyun, Lee Sang-hee, Park Ju-hyun, Kang Bong-sung', null, 'Moon Ha-won is an AI programmer and he is the founder of AH Company. He is a consistent person with a good heart. Meanwhile, Han Seo-woo works as a classical music recording engineer. Her life is unstable without a family or house, but she is a positive person.', 'Moon Ha-won is an AI programmer and he is the founder of AH Company. He is a consistent person with a good heart. Meanwhile, Han Seo-woo works as a classical music recording engineer. Her life is unstable without a family or house, but she is a positive person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u25Bd08J1kdsLXdHymXkFJsseV7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99112'),
  ('224271558753793093', 'A Place Further than the Universe', 2018, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Inori Minase, Kana Hanazawa, Yuka Iguchi, Saori Hayami', null, 'Scenery that we have never seen. Sounds that we have never heard. Scent that we have never smelled. Food that we have never tasted. And the surge of emotion that we have never experienced. This is the expedition of recollecting the pieces torn apart and sensation left alone. When we reach that place, what will we think? Howling, 40 degree angle. Raging, 50 degree angle. Shouting, 60 degree angle. A wilderness beyond the heavy sea. The furthest south, far from civilization. At the top of the Earth. We will find lights through the girls'' eyes to live tomorrow.', 'Scenery that we have never seen. Sounds that we have never heard. Scent that we have never smelled. Food that we have never tasted. And the surge of emotion that we have never experienced. This is the expedition of recollecting the pieces torn apart and sensation left alone. When we reach that place, what will we think? Howling, 40 degree angle. Raging, 50 degree angle. Shouting, 60 degree angle. A wilderness beyond the heavy sea. The furthest south, far from civilization. At the top of the Earth. We will find lights through the girls'' eyes to live tomorrow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7FxjyLe7co1U8xLYYkpLbXfkTh1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76059'),
  ('836948023610129849', 'A Place to Call Home', 2013, 'Drama, Soap', 'Bevan Lee', null, 'Marta Dusseldorp, Noni Hazlehurst, Brett Climo, Craig Hall, David Berry, Arianwen Parkes-Lockwood, Abby Earl, Sara Wiseman', 'TV-PG', 'A mysterious woman is perched between the harsh legacy of World War II and the hope of a new life in Australia. A sweeping romantic drama set in 1950s rural Australia following the lives of the Blighs, a wealthy and complicated pastoralist family, who lives in Inverness, NSW.', 'A mysterious woman is perched between the harsh legacy of World War II and the hope of a new life in Australia. A sweeping romantic drama set in 1950s rural Australia following the lives of the Blighs, a wealthy and complicated pastoralist family, who lives in Inverness, NSW.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctjoNliuHbsRK3asfSjP7z8qhum.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:47335'),
  ('1150045201553967673', 'A Playthrough of a Certain Dude''s VRMMO Life', 2023, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kaito Ishikawa, Daisuke Namikawa, Reina Ueda, Tasuku Hatanaka, Miho Okasaki, Shiori Izawa', 'TV-14', 'Taichi Tanaka is just an ordinary 38-year-old who enjoys video games. He starts a new virtual reality multiplayer game called One More Free Life Online, naming his character Earth. Unlike his fellow players, he decides to master the most menial of skills in the game. He cooks the finest meals, overbrews complicated potions, and hunts monsters with handmade weapons. His fantasy life begins!', 'Taichi Tanaka is just an ordinary 38-year-old who enjoys video games. He starts a new virtual reality multiplayer game called One More Free Life Online, naming his character Earth. Unlike his fellow players, he decides to master the most menial of skills in the game. He cooks the finest meals, overbrews complicated potions, and hunts monsters with handmade weapons. His fantasy life begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7bI6JkJ1VhlxgqEZpaWMLlEJ5Q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229610'),
  ('572714100878385183', 'A Poem A Day', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Lee Yu-bi, Lee Jun-hyuk, Jang Dong-yoon, Shin Jae-ha, Lee Chae-young, Kim Jae-beom, Defconn, Park Sun-ho', null, 'Story follows a group of physical therapists, nurses, radiological technologists and trainees. Ye Jae-Wook works as a physical therapist and also teaches in the same field. He begins to work as a team leader at a hospital. Woo Bo-Young has been working as a physical therapist for 3 years. She wanted to become a poet, but due to her poor family background she studied to become a physical therapist. Shin Min-Ho is a trainee, but he isn''t interested in physical therapy. His grades weren''t good enough for medical school and his parents, who are both doctors, made him study physical therapy.', 'Story follows a group of physical therapists, nurses, radiological technologists and trainees. Ye Jae-Wook works as a physical therapist and also teaches in the same field. He begins to work as a team leader at a hospital. Woo Bo-Young has been working as a physical therapist for 3 years. She wanted to become a poet, but due to her poor family background she studied to become a physical therapist. Shin Min-Ho is a trainee, but he isn''t interested in physical therapy. His grades weren''t good enough for medical school and his parents, who are both doctors, made him study physical therapy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogYCFZ0qTHbRGPYauOIVVOSPurj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78060'),
  ('1065076370857180783', 'A Polish Family', 2011, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Tomasz Karolak, Małgorzata Kożuchowska, Maciej Musiał, Adam Zdrójkowski, Mateusz Pawłowski, Jacek Braciak, Agata Kulesza, Julia Wieniawa', null, 'Ludwik and Natalia Boski navigate the chaos of raising three children while also managing their busy careers.', 'Ludwik and Natalia Boski navigate the chaos of raising three children while also managing their busy careers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mlDzytURLa1AOSxjgLsyf88Vq3J.jpg', 18, 'tmdb:tv:48175'),
  ('280421529360772174', 'A Predator in a Skirt', 2017, 'Animation', null, null, 'Miho Hayashi, Shiori Satsuki, Koudai Sakai, Yuri Katou', null, 'The story begins when the reserved Shizuka attends a local mixer party but has trouble adjusting to the atmosphere. A beautiful older female college student named Ryou starts talking to her, and the pair hit it off. Shizuka goes to spend the night at Ryou''s place. However, Ryou unexpectedly kisses Shizuka and pushes her down. Shizuka thinks the beautiful woman is a lesbian but soon discovers that Ryou is actually a man dressed as a woman.', 'The story begins when the reserved Shizuka attends a local mixer party but has trouble adjusting to the atmosphere. A beautiful older female college student named Ryou starts talking to her, and the pair hit it off. Shizuka goes to spend the night at Ryou''s place. However, Ryou unexpectedly kisses Shizuka and pushes her down. Shizuka thinks the beautiful woman is a lesbian but soon discovers that Ryou is actually a man dressed as a woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5o2TArFnXPzBvLdH97AOnJCfwW0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72520'),
  ('582160026639351147', 'A priori', 2025, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Benoît Masocco', null, 'Florent Manaudou', null, 'After graduating at the top of her class from the police academy, 27-year-old Iris joins a police station in the south of France. Upon arriving at this brigade of colorful police officers, she receives a less than warm welcome. Her in-depth knowledge of the law and her insistence on following the rules do not sit well with everyone, particularly Victor, 54, her designated partner, a lone wolf cop whose methods are considered outdated. Despite their differences in age and background, when Iris and Victor are assigned a case that seems almost closed in advance, by combining their talents, they discover that it is not a simple traffic accident but a premeditated crime. While their success brings the duo closer together, Victor quickly discovers that Iris is not just anyone''s daughter... What secret from the past threatens to resurface?', 'After graduating at the top of her class from the police academy, 27-year-old Iris joins a police station in the south of France. Upon arriving at this brigade of colorful police officers, she receives a less than warm welcome. Her in-depth knowledge of the law and her insistence on following the rules do not sit well with everyone, particularly Victor, 54, her designated partner, a lone wolf cop whose methods are considered outdated. Despite their differences in age and background, when Iris and Victor are assigned a case that seems almost closed in advance, by combining their talents, they discover that it is not a simple traffic accident but a premeditated crime. While their success brings the duo closer together, Victor quickly discovers that Iris is not just anyone''s daughter... What secret from the past threatens to resurface?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pItxtzVqeZjGbJAB1I9LMnHrofC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:258003'),
  ('231261859186980123', 'A Private Affair', 2022, 'Comedy, Mystery, Drama', 'Teresa Fernández-Valdés, Ramón Campos, Gema R. Neira', null, 'Jean Reno, Aura Garrido, Gorka Otxoa, Pablo Molinero, Álex García, Ángela Molina, Tito Valverde', null, 'Marina Quiroga, a daring upper-class girl with a detective''s soul, sets off to catch the serial killer that has been terrorizing her town with her faithful butler Hector''s help.', 'Marina Quiroga, a daring upper-class girl with a detective''s soul, sets off to catch the serial killer that has been terrorizing her town with her faithful butler Hector''s help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lmGRZEuIQtArmyGjt6Ay5Y74hk2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112321'),
  ('201173294940383169', 'A Professor', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Alessandro D''Alatri', null, 'Alessandro Gassmann, Claudia Pandolfi, Nicolas Maupas, Damiano Gavino, Christiane Filangieri, Francesca Cavallin, Paolo Conticini, Federica Cifola', null, 'Based on the Catalan format Merlí by Hector Lozano, produced by Veranda for TV3 Lagardère Studios Distribution. Dante Balestra is a philosophy teacher who, after many years away, returns to Rome to care for his son Simone. Charming and unconventional, the teacher takes a class at the Leonardo Da Vinci High School, where he applies his unconventional teaching methods and develops a very special relationship with his students, including Simone. But his approach quickly leads to his personal and professional lives becoming confused, and the return from the past of Anita, a former flame of his and now the mother of Manuel, the class "black sheep," makes things even more complicated.', 'Based on the Catalan format Merlí by Hector Lozano, produced by Veranda for TV3 Lagardère Studios Distribution. Dante Balestra is a philosophy teacher who, after many years away, returns to Rome to care for his son Simone. Charming and unconventional, the teacher takes a class at the Leonardo Da Vinci High School, where he applies his unconventional teaching methods and develops a very special relationship with his students, including Simone. But his approach quickly leads to his personal and professional lives becoming confused, and the return from the past of Anita, a former flame of his and now the mother of Manuel, the class "black sheep," makes things even more complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1Z60kHQ8NsryXtsrXfEysTAQs2.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:138395'),
  ('557435783485817525', 'A Prophet', 2026, 'Crime, Drama', 'Nicolas Peufaillit, Abdel Raouf Dafri', null, 'Mamadou Sidibé, Sami Bouajila, Ouassini Embarek, Matthieu Lucci, Nailia Harzoune, Foued Nabba, Moussa Maaskri, Salim Kéchiouche', null, 'Based on the Academy Award nominated film by EMILIA PÉREZ’s director Jacques Audiard, A PROPHET is a visceral, riveting crime drama about a young African immigrant''s rise to power in Marseille’s brutal underworld.', 'Based on the Academy Award nominated film by EMILIA PÉREZ’s director Jacques Audiard, A PROPHET is a visceral, riveting crime drama about a young African immigrant''s rise to power in Marseille’s brutal underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qupRQOXlxykkFXpXSmuduRqnemg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224006'),
  ('864062455676899421', 'A Protegida', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Patrícia Müller', 'Patrícia Müller', 'Matilde Reymão, Pedro Sousa, Diogo Morgado, Alexandra Lencastre, Paulo Pires, Maria do Céu Guerra, Fernanda Serrano, Catarina Nifo', null, 'In the heart of the Alentejo countryside, Mariana and José Diogo are two children whose backgrounds could not be more different: she is the fruit of a loving relationship; he''s an orphan. She has a safe haven in her family to run to when she gets hurt; he can only run to her.', 'In the heart of the Alentejo countryside, Mariana and José Diogo are two children whose backgrounds could not be more different: she is the fruit of a loving relationship; he''s an orphan. She has a safe haven in her family to run to when she gets hurt; he can only run to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUcK2iHLuYlAXbq3bEmWmQ93zlc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274186'),
  ('527479280434144236', 'A Próxima Vítima', 1995, 'Soap, Crime, Drama', 'Silvio de Abreu', 'Alcides Nogueira, Maria Adelaide Amaral, Silvio de Abreu', 'Tony Ramos, José Wilker, Susana Vieira, Lima Duarte, Glória Menezes, Aracy Balabanian, Gianfrancesco Guarnieri, Natália do Vale', null, 'A young law student starts to work as a detective, decided to uncover the identity behind a series of murders, as well as who is next.', 'A young law student starts to work as a detective, decided to uncover the identity behind a series of murders, as well as who is next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzjDrUCgErrWvjyiTTL6OUYysRA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46121'),
  ('846899379373804430', 'A Pup Named Scooby-Doo', 1988, 'Animation, Mystery, Comedy, Family, Kids', 'Tom Ruegger', null, 'Don Messick, Casey Kasem, Carl Steven, Kellie Martin, Christina Lange, Scott Menville, Lars Thiesgaard, Timm Mehrens', 'TV-G', 'The world''s favorite chicken-hearted canine, as a puppy? That''s right! And the old gang is back with him. Shaggy, Daphne, Velma, and Freddy are all here as gangly kids — goofing off, solving kid-size mysteries, and having run-ins with ghouls, ghosts, and goblins.', 'The world''s favorite chicken-hearted canine, as a puppy? That''s right! And the old gang is back with him. Shaggy, Daphne, Velma, and Freddy are all here as gangly kids — goofing off, solving kid-size mysteries, and having run-ins with ghouls, ghosts, and goblins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KLZCKbql421IIORH1GGQn1R5Qh.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:418'),
