  ('225678894539140939', 'Action Man', 1995, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, 'Bob Forward, Julie Fuller, Phil Harnage', 'Mark Griffin, Dale Wilson, David Hay, Garry Chalk, Iris Quinn, Joely Collins, Richard Cox, Rolf Leenders', null, 'Action Man is a member of an elite multinational task force named Action Force who fight against the terrorist Dr. X and his "Council of Doom".', 'Action Man is a member of an elite multinational task force named Action Force who fight against the terrorist Dr. X and his "Council of Doom".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Cp5mhe2lJG5zdfX7L7zvCmajtK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:41729'),
  ('1026817741462043700', 'Action Man: A.T.O.M.', 2005, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', 'Paul-Patrick Duval, Ariane Desrieux', null, 'Clancy Brown, Tom Kenny, Brian Donovan, Charlie Schlatter, James Arnold Taylor, Aldis Hodge, Kari Wahlgren, Bill Fagerbakke', 'NR', 'A.T.O.M. is a French animated television series, which chronicles the adventures of five teenagers, set in the fictional Landmark City. The Alpha Teens, which consist of Axel Manning, Catalina Leone, Crey Kingston, Zack Hawkes, and Ollie Sharker, test prototype vehicles and weapons for Lee Industries, and use these prototypes to combat criminals, particularly the sadistic Alexander Paine. In the United Kingdom, Australia and Latin America, the series is called Action Man A.T.O.M. and has its own comic book from Panini Comics.', 'A.T.O.M. is a French animated television series, which chronicles the adventures of five teenagers, set in the fictional Landmark City. The Alpha Teens, which consist of Axel Manning, Catalina Leone, Crey Kingston, Zack Hawkes, and Ollie Sharker, test prototype vehicles and weapons for Lee Industries, and use these prototypes to combat criminals, particularly the sadistic Alexander Paine. In the United Kingdom, Australia and Latin America, the series is called Action Man A.T.O.M. and has its own comic book from Panini Comics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6PQMghAFF9hQ6PXWCgvc3SAteD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1903'),
  ('134921874265037159', 'Action Pack', 2022, 'Animation, Family, Kids, Action & Adventure', 'William Harper', null, null, 'TV-Y', 'The heroic kids of the Action Academy take on the bad guys with their hearts, their wits and their superpowers, and bring out the best in them.', 'The heroic kids of the Action Academy take on the bad guys with their hearts, their wits and their superpowers, and bring out the best in them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuDysbuWHcg2Xt5a0JsqAxeGH1X.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:10779'),
  ('998202355001585623', 'Active Raid', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Crime', null, null, 'Takahiro Sakurai, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Ari Ozawa, Shizuka Ishigami, Ai Kakuma, Hikaru Midorikawa, Masayo Kurata, Natsuki Hanae', null, 'Set in a part of Tokyo that has descended into a quagmire, the story follows Unit 8 of the 5th Special Public Security Section''s 3rd Mobile Assault Division — popularly called "The Eighth" — who don powered armor "Willware" exoskeletons to counter the rise in crime. Assistant inspector Asami Kazari is assigned to The Eighth with the task of assessing the unit''s status and reporting it to her superiors. But her true goal is to rehabilitate this sloppy, haphazard, justice-less group.', 'Set in a part of Tokyo that has descended into a quagmire, the story follows Unit 8 of the 5th Special Public Security Section''s 3rd Mobile Assault Division — popularly called "The Eighth" — who don powered armor "Willware" exoskeletons to counter the rise in crime. Assistant inspector Asami Kazari is assigned to The Eighth with the task of assessing the unit''s status and reporting it to her superiors. But her true goal is to rehabilitate this sloppy, haphazard, justice-less group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5fpBFuTMtwLhPECXJ38c7XG07W.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65214'),
  ('613935781220931932', 'Actually, I Am...', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Natsuki Hanae, Yu Serizawa, Inori Minase, Reina Ueda, Aya Uchida, Mao Ichimichi, Emi Nitta, Daisuke Hirakawa', 'TV-14', 'Asahi Kuromine is a high school student who supposedly cannot keep a secret. One day he spots his crush Yoko Shiragami, unfurling a large pair of wings from her back. She explains to him that she is a vampire and is only able to attend a normal school on the condition that no one discover her true identity. Asahi swears to keep her secret but finds it hard to maintain seeing as how Yoko herself is an airhead and Asahi''s friend Mikan keeps bullying the two of them.', 'Asahi Kuromine is a high school student who supposedly cannot keep a secret. One day he spots his crush Yoko Shiragami, unfurling a large pair of wings from her back. She explains to him that she is a vampire and is only able to attend a normal school on the condition that no one discover her true identity. Asahi swears to keep her secret but finds it hard to maintain seeing as how Yoko herself is an airhead and Asahi''s friend Mikan keeps bullying the two of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8a3P39jVKwFBLTG4t6yMy1G11X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73093'),
  ('907748430269767608', 'Ad Vitam', 2018, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Thomas Cailley, Sébastien Mounier', 'Sébastien Mounier, Thomas Cailley', 'Yvan Attal, Garance Marillier, Niels Schneider, Rod Paradot, Hanna Schygulla, Anne Azoulay, Ariane Labed, Victor Assié', 'TV-MA', 'In a future where regeneration technology lets humans live indefinitely, a cop and a troubled young woman investigate a strange wave of youth suicides.', 'In a future where regeneration technology lets humans live indefinitely, a cop and a troubled young woman investigate a strange wave of youth suicides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmYzmu4Qzw0w0zat8esBU1us9T4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81951'),
  ('490033323496249042', 'Ada Twist, Scientist', 2021, 'Kids, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Chris Nee', null, 'Amanda Christine, Nicholas Crovetti', null, 'Pint-sized scientist Ada Twist and her two best friends are asking big questions — and working together to discover the truth about everything!', 'Pint-sized scientist Ada Twist and her two best friends are asking big questions — and working together to discover the truth about everything!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHoHuYdtCkQlj8UtqePjnvUZf80.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:129604'),
  ('501568720040796998', 'Adachi and Shimamura', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Akari Kito, Miku Ito, Manami Numakura, Reina Ueda, Iori Saeki', 'TV-14', 'Adachi spends her school days skipping class until she meets fellow delinquent Shimamura and the two become fast friends. Cutting class together deepens their friendship but soon unexpected emotions blossom. As awkwardness and confusion settle in, the two girls travel this sea of emotions without a paddle as they learn about each other’s feelings.', 'Adachi spends her school days skipping class until she meets fellow delinquent Shimamura and the two become fast friends. Cutting class together deepens their friendship but soon unexpected emotions blossom. As awkwardness and confusion settle in, the two girls travel this sea of emotions without a paddle as they learn about each other’s feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sh5yedKXpngurKN0Do4ltT3r0KK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94359'),
  ('101747607828028426', 'Adam Ruins Everything', 2015, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Adam Conover', null, 'Adam Conover, Emily Axford, River Butcher', 'TV-14', 'Host Adam Conover employs a combination of comedy, history and science to dispel widespread misconceptions about everything we take for granted.', 'Host Adam Conover employs a combination of comedy, history and science to dispel widespread misconceptions about everything we take for granted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1GafOvGp5QtzRRUMpJye2SrF1G5.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:64537'),
  ('279729431345740592', 'Adam zkt. Eva', 2014, 'Reality', 'Reinout Oerlemans', null, 'Marieke Elsinga', null, 'Adam zkt. Eva (Dutch for Adam seeks Eve) is a Dutch television dating show. The show''s gimmick is that the two candidates are naked, and an additional twist is that a second candidate (also naked) for the main character''s affections is introduced halfway through the program.', 'Adam zkt. Eva (Dutch for Adam seeks Eve) is a Dutch television dating show. The show''s gimmick is that the two candidates are naked, and an additional twist is that a second candidate (also naked) for the main character''s affections is introduced halfway through the program.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGaxMnVYETXiFAo7IGAaFs2mem8.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:61591'),
  ('940962113719784844', 'Adam-12', 1968, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jack Webb, Robert A. Cinader', null, 'Martin Milner, Kent McCord, William Boyett', 'TV-PG', 'Adam-12 is a television police drama that followed two police officers of the Los Angeles Police Department, Pete Malloy and Jim Reed, as they patrolled the streets of Los Angeles in their patrol unit, 1-Adam-12.', 'Adam-12 is a television police drama that followed two police officers of the Los Angeles Police Department, Pete Malloy and Jim Reed, as they patrolled the streets of Los Angeles in their patrol unit, 1-Adam-12.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXlPZz943xMbqfp2Ne1OvOWaPo.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:4660'),
  ('852238240070496069', 'Adam''s Sweet Agony', 2024, 'Animation', null, null, 'Hana Kuga, Shizuka Itoh, Mari Kirimura, Kaho Shibuya, Shinnosuke Tachibana, Harumichi Shito', 'TV-MA', 'This is the story of a boy, who became the lone Adam among four billion Eves. In a world where a pandemic has rendered all men impotent, high school student Itsuki is the exception who escaped it. In order to protect this secret, he transfers to a very special high school, which turns out to be composed of 90% girls! There, he encounters an upbeat and friendly senior, a sexually frustrated female teacher, a tomboyish school ''prince,'' and an heiress from a wealthy family. For Itsuki, who has his pick of any woman in the world, the question remains: which one will he choose?', 'This is the story of a boy, who became the lone Adam among four billion Eves. In a world where a pandemic has rendered all men impotent, high school student Itsuki is the exception who escaped it. In order to protect this secret, he transfers to a very special high school, which turns out to be composed of 90% girls! There, he encounters an upbeat and friendly senior, a sexually frustrated female teacher, a tomboyish school ''prince,'' and an heiress from a wealthy family. For Itsuki, who has his pick of any woman in the world, the question remains: which one will he choose?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1n1ZP0KHXUSvVxZG63x7aOzmO4M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241002'),
  ('935547425719554954', 'Adamas', 2022, 'Mystery, Drama', null, 'Choi Tae-gang', 'Ji Sung, Seo Ji-hye, Lee Soo-kyung, Heo Sung-tae, Oh Dae-hwan, Lee Kyung-young, Hwang Jeong-min, Choi Deok-moon', null, 'Twin brothers Woo-sin and Soo-hyun lose their father in a murder case. Twenty-two years later, the brothers seek to clear their father''s name.', 'Twin brothers Woo-sin and Soo-hyun lose their father in a murder case. Twenty-two years later, the brothers seek to clear their father''s name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhfZRo3krONzarJFot6WCw99uxH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205040'),
  ('1070845415324464808', 'Adanalı', 2008, 'Crime, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Tayfun Güneyer', null, 'Oktay Kaynarca, Mehmet Akif Alakurt, Ekin Türkmen, Cemal Hünal, Çağkan Çulha, Zeynep Özder, Umut Oğuz, Selim Erdoğan', null, 'Two men who used to be bosom friends have chosen to live in different worlds. Yavuz serves the Law as a police officer while Maraz Ali is the leader of Istanbul''s most formidable gang.', 'Two men who used to be bosom friends have chosen to live in different worlds. Yavuz serves the Law as a police officer while Maraz Ali is the leader of Istanbul''s most formidable gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48i4szV7zMAY4nASzXBv31Hw88J.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:50323'),
