  ('965390393259212468', 'Addicted', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Chai Jidan', 'Chai Jidan', 'Timmy Xu, Johnny Huang, Lin Fengsong, Chen Wen', 'TV-14', 'Two high school students become entangled in a wildly conflicting emotional relationship that erupts when they discover they are now step-brothers.', 'Two high school students become entangled in a wildly conflicting emotional relationship that erupts when they discover they are now step-brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSYj6g0be7enulAYqzxVV7MjfWR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65890'),
  ('739473194683126040', 'Addicted', 2018, 'Drama', null, null, 'Denis Shvedov, Lyubov Aksyonova, Polina Gagarina, Vitaliy Khaev, Grigory Chaban, Anatoli Zhuravlyov, Sofia Lebedeva, Sergey Lanbamin', null, 'Addicted is an ensemble drama set in New Home, a leading rehab centre run by a brilliant team of experts; psychologists, doctors and counsellors. Lead character Yana is a junkie. After getting herself into serious trouble she’s forced to choose between therapy or jail. Reluctantly she chooses rehab, where she meets Ilya, a newbie consultant therapist assigned to her case. Observing other patients helps Yana understand her situation better, re-discover her self-worth, and gradually recover her health and her life. As her treatment progresses, so does their friendship, presenting an ethical and moral dilemma for both.', 'Addicted is an ensemble drama set in New Home, a leading rehab centre run by a brilliant team of experts; psychologists, doctors and counsellors. Lead character Yana is a junkie. After getting herself into serious trouble she’s forced to choose between therapy or jail. Reluctantly she chooses rehab, where she meets Ilya, a newbie consultant therapist assigned to her case. Observing other patients helps Yana understand her situation better, re-discover her self-worth, and gradually recover her health and her life. As her treatment progresses, so does their friendship, presenting an ethical and moral dilemma for both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7b4PQ6TS7SzPQ1b7Hw3m72EyQf1.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:84157'),
  ('884226005826958690', 'Adhura', 2023, 'Mystery', 'Gauravv K. Chawla, Ananya Banerjee', 'Anand K Jain, Ananya Banerjee', 'Ishwak Singh, Rasika Dugal, Shrenik Arora, Poojan Chhabra, Arjun Deswal, Jaimini Pathak, Rahul Dev, K.C. Shankar', null, 'Strange events take place in the Nilgiri Valley School that seem to be connected to Vedant, a 10-year-old new student. When the batch of 2007 returns for its reunion, Adhiraj Jaisingh, an ex-student must face what he did fifteen years ago. But things take a horrifying turn when Vedant and Adhiraj''s paths collide. A dark secret begins to reveal itself threatening the lives of everyone on campus.', 'Strange events take place in the Nilgiri Valley School that seem to be connected to Vedant, a 10-year-old new student. When the batch of 2007 returns for its reunion, Adhiraj Jaisingh, an ex-student must face what he did fifteen years ago. But things take a horrifying turn when Vedant and Adhiraj''s paths collide. A dark secret begins to reveal itself threatening the lives of everyone on campus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNV51FI3v4jXHizIfbmjCQyU32h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201085'),
