  ('361630862366756730', 'Aesthetica of a Rogue Hero', 2012, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Yoko Hikasa, Kana Hanazawa, Kana Ueda, Takahiro Sakurai, Marina Inoue, Satoshi Hino, Ayana Taketatsu, Rina Sato', 'TV-MA', 'For 30 years, thousands have traveled to other worlds. The few that return keep the powers they had in those worlds. Akatsuki Ousawa returns from the world of Alayzard with the defeated Demon King''s daughter, Miu. Miu pretends to be Akatsuki''s sister to hide her true identity. They join Babel, a school for inter-dimensional travelers, and struggle against the student council to uncover the truth behind the school.', 'For 30 years, thousands have traveled to other worlds. The few that return keep the powers they had in those worlds. Akatsuki Ousawa returns from the world of Alayzard with the defeated Demon King''s daughter, Miu. Miu pretends to be Akatsuki''s sister to hide her true identity. They join Babel, a school for inter-dimensional travelers, and struggle against the student council to uncover the truth behind the school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65y1Z0CaMYT31IUPgZYYxMgpayz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62171'),
