  ('69382754338361338', 'Alex Haley''s Queen', 1993, 'Drama', 'Alex Haley', 'Alex Haley, David Stevens', 'Halle Berry, Ann-Margret, Jane Krakowski, Frances Conroy, Raven-Symoné, Tim Daly, Danny Glover, Paul Winfield', 'TV-14', 'Queen is the story about Easter, the illegitimate daughter of James Jackson, III and her lifelong affair with plantation owner Tim Daly, which would result in the birth of Queen. Queen''s story revolves around her early years as a slave who yearns to know who her father is, and her condition as a fair skin mixed race woman who spends her life trying to figure out where exactly she fits in.', 'Queen is the story about Easter, the illegitimate daughter of James Jackson, III and her lifelong affair with plantation owner Tim Daly, which would result in the birth of Queen. Queen''s story revolves around her early years as a slave who yearns to know who her father is, and her condition as a fair skin mixed race woman who spends her life trying to figure out where exactly she fits in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DgN1qsvKqrIaZj2DFfcmEWlpQZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19802'),
  ('737494381769417305', 'Alex Hugo', 2015, 'Crime, Drama', 'Franck Thilliez, Nicolas Tackian', null, 'Samuel Le Bihan, Mikaël Fitoussi, Fabien Baïardi', 'TV-14', 'Fed-up with his violent daily life, former Marseilles police officer Alex Hugo leaves the city and the violence he can no longer bear.', 'Fed-up with his violent daily life, former Marseilles police officer Alex Hugo leaves the city and the violence he can no longer bear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MdnyrdYJkLPcJNDize2rN1k3bt.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:67691'),
  ('159084101183342408', 'Alex Rider', 2020, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Guy Burt', null, 'Otto Farrant, Stephen Dillane, Vicky McClure, Brenock O''Connor, Ronkẹ Adékoluẹjo, Marli Siu, Thomas Levin, Jason Wong', 'TV-14', 'Alex Rider is an ordinary teenager enlisted to work on behalf of MI6, where he uses skills he didn''t know he had to become an extraordinary spy.', 'Alex Rider is an ordinary teenager enlisted to work on behalf of MI6, where he uses skills he didn''t know he had to become an extraordinary spy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7VkzkvA0XckUClWrlkt4fnmTrkL.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:99799'),
  ('894031352791621016', 'Alex, Inc.', 2018, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Zach Braff, Tiya Sircar, Hillary Anne Matthews, Michael Imperioli, Elisha Henig, Audyssie James, Horacio Abaroa', 'TV-PG', 'A brilliant radio journalist, husband, and father of two is about to do something crazy — quit his job and start his own company. He quickly discovers it’s going to be a lot harder than he thought.', 'A brilliant radio journalist, husband, and father of two is about to do something crazy — quit his job and start his own company. He quickly discovers it’s going to be a lot harder than he thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDrUGwYPV5qsE1ZxoQivOLOMWmv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71763'),
  ('486120765234239178', 'Alexa & Katie', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Heather Wordham', null, 'Paris Berelc, Isabel May, Tiffani-Amber Thiessen, Emery Kelly, Finn Carr, Eddie Shin, Jolie Jenkins', 'TV-G', 'Lifelong best friends Alexa and Katie are eagerly anticipating the start of their freshman year of high school. The pals confront a crisis that leaves them feeling like outsiders at a time when what seems to matter most is fitting in.', 'Lifelong best friends Alexa and Katie are eagerly anticipating the start of their freshman year of high school. The pals confront a crisis that leaves them feeling like outsiders at a time when what seems to matter most is fitting in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXNWQzzQ7yPSZMaWYA96NStN8DC.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:76874'),
  ('977074992213742319', 'Alexander: The Making of a God', 2024, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Tony Mitchell', 'Christopher Bell, Jane McLean', 'Mido Hamada, Buck Braithwaite, Agni Scott, Souad Faress, Dino Kelly, Kosha Engler, Salima Ikram, Waleed Elgadi', 'TV-MA', 'Expert interviews and gripping reenactments combine to reveal the extraordinary life of Alexander the Great and his burning desire to conquer the world.', 'Expert interviews and gripping reenactments combine to reveal the extraordinary life of Alexander the Great and his burning desire to conquer the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKUTpdyg0wGfIYplIAfkN6hDbRw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242392'),
  ('496578696187103481', 'Alexandra Ehle', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Elsa Marpeau', null, 'Julie Depardieu, Bernard Yerlès, Xavier Guelfi, Emilie Lehuraux', 'NR', 'Alexandra Ehle is a coroner at the Bordeaux forensic institute. Fanciful and free-thinking, she devotes herself completely to what she considers her mission: restoring to the dead their dignity and human appearance, and giving them justice.', 'Alexandra Ehle is a coroner at the Bordeaux forensic institute. Fanciful and free-thinking, she devotes herself completely to what she considers her mission: restoring to the dead their dignity and human appearance, and giving them justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/baOWwf1FAMX6VyCN5TjI1tCOEnV.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:78834'),
  ('863282976199287950', 'ALF', 1986, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Paul Fusco, Tom Patchett', null, 'Paul Fusco, Max Wright, Anne Schedeen, Andrea Elson, Benji Gregory', 'TV-G', 'A furry alien wiseguy comes to live with a terran family after crashing into their garage.', 'A furry alien wiseguy comes to live with a terran family after crashing into their garage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shRed7ZrCRjdIMEYNx2YBVFkkNu.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4658'),
  ('542094583124692238', 'ALF: The Animated Series', 1987, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Paul Fusco, Tom Patchett', null, 'Paul Fusco, Dan Hennessey, Noam Zylberman, Tabitha St. Germain', 'TV-Y', 'ALF: The Animated Series is an animated cartoon spin-off based on the live-action Sitcom series ALF. It premiered on September 26, 1987 and ran for 26 episodes. ALF Tales was a spinoff from the series that ran on the NBC television network on Saturdays from August 1988 to December 1989. The show had characters from that series play various characters from fairy tales. The fairy tale was usually altered for comedic effect in a manner relational to Fractured Fairy Tales.', 'ALF: The Animated Series is an animated cartoon spin-off based on the live-action Sitcom series ALF. It premiered on September 26, 1987 and ran for 26 episodes. ALF Tales was a spinoff from the series that ran on the NBC television network on Saturdays from August 1988 to December 1989. The show had characters from that series play various characters from fairy tales. The fairy tale was usually altered for comedic effect in a manner relational to Fractured Fairy Tales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2e8mwZuCOT2uaHi2Hi7adpmMCR.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11042'),
  ('227772753979437368', 'Alfred Hitchcock Presents', 1955, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Alfred Hitchcock', null, 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'TV-PG', 'A television anthology series hosted by Alfred Hitchcock featuring dramas, thrillers, and mysteries.', 'A television anthology series hosted by Alfred Hitchcock featuring dramas, thrillers, and mysteries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lmbBSG3jRVjxdovpdhOf2LF1voZ.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:5273'),
  ('1004613302462509400', 'Alfred J. Kwak', 1989, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Herman van Veen', null, 'Megumi Hayashibara, Shigeru Chiba, Kenichi Ogata, Yuko Kobayashi', null, 'Alfred J. Kwak lost his parents when he was just a duckling. Raised by a mole, the brave duck grows up to have lots of adventures around the world.', 'Alfred J. Kwak lost his parents when he was just a duckling. Raised by a mole, the brave duck grows up to have lots of adventures around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4IWoD4qBie9Nu13n0vtPmk3df67.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1887'),
  ('1012515565322892994', 'Alfredino - An italian story', 2021, 'Drama', 'Barbara Petronio, Francesco Balletta', null, 'Anna Foglietta, Francesco Acquaroli, Vinicio Marchioni, Luca Angeletti, Beniamino Marcone, Giacomo Ferrara, Valentina Romani, Daniele La Leggia', null, 'The fiction retraces the Vermicino incident, a famous crime story from 1981 in which a six-year-old boy, Alfredo Rampi, died three days after accidentally falling into an artesian well. The story had a notable impact on the press and on Italian public opinion.', 'The fiction retraces the Vermicino incident, a famous crime story from 1981 in which a six-year-old boy, Alfredo Rampi, died three days after accidentally falling into an artesian well. The story had a notable impact on the press and on Italian public opinion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDzi8k46fpIfmPxt6xOHj7MK5OD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126025'),
  ('821228777723986854', 'Algo habrán hecho', 2005, 'Documentary, Family, Drama', null, null, 'Rafael Ferro, Norberto Díaz, Leticia Brédice, Felipe Pigna, Roberto Carnaghi, Osvaldo Santoro, Martín Pavlovsky, Oscar Ferreiro', null, 'Algo habrán hecho is a documentary film for television that narrates the history of Argentina. It was created by the argentine historian Felipe Pigna, who acted as presenter. In the first two seasons Mario Pergolini was a co-presenter of it, but after giving up on all works on television his role in the documentary was taken by Juan Di Natale. Di Natale and Pergolini were by that time co-presenters of the talk show Caiga quien caiga. Di Natale pointed that he wasn''t meant to act as if he was Pergolini, but the script writers wrote instead the scripts based on his own personality. The first season, aired in 2005 on Canal 13, narrates the history of Argentina from the british invasions of the Río de la Plata to the fall of Juan Manuel de Rosas during the Battle of Caseros. The second season, aired in 2006 on Telefé, resumes the narration from that point and continues up to the suicide of Leandro N. Alem in 1896. The third one, aired in 2008 on Telefé, resumes as well from the end of previous season and ends with the meeting of Juan Domingo Perón and Eva Duarte at the Luna Park during a fund-raising to help after the San Juan earthquake.', 'Algo habrán hecho is a documentary film for television that narrates the history of Argentina. It was created by the argentine historian Felipe Pigna, who acted as presenter. In the first two seasons Mario Pergolini was a co-presenter of it, but after giving up on all works on television his role in the documentary was taken by Juan Di Natale. Di Natale and Pergolini were by that time co-presenters of the talk show Caiga quien caiga. Di Natale pointed that he wasn''t meant to act as if he was Pergolini, but the script writers wrote instead the scripts based on his own personality. The first season, aired in 2005 on Canal 13, narrates the history of Argentina from the british invasions of the Río de la Plata to the fall of Juan Manuel de Rosas during the Battle of Caseros. The second season, aired in 2006 on Telefé, resumes the narration from that point and continues up to the suicide of Leandro N. Alem in 1896. The third one, aired in 2008 on Telefé, resumes as well from the end of previous season and ends with the meeting of Juan Domingo Perón and Eva Duarte at the Luna Park during a fund-raising to help after the San Juan earthquake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TQaJb7XvKtNhpfiKrforksPQMW.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:33674'),
  ('345069452367878831', 'Alguien te mira', 2007, 'Soap, Mystery, Drama', 'Pablo Illanes', null, 'Álvaro Rudolphy, Francisco Melo, Sigrid Alegría, Francisco Pérez-Bannen, Alejandra Fosalba, Luz Valdivieso, Francisca Imboden, Claudio Arredondo', null, 'Rodrigo returns to Chile after escaping from the country for unknown reasons. While in Santiago, the appearance of a serial killer turns the police and the wealthiest circle of the capital upside down ... Who is behind these crimes?', 'Rodrigo returns to Chile after escaping from the country for unknown reasons. While in Santiago, the appearance of a serial killer turns the police and the wealthiest circle of the capital upside down ... Who is behind these crimes?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5QLhBP5WorT6hykEr5iN6F8dnHh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16323'),
