  ('455517390838112787', 'Alias', 2001, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'J.J. Abrams', null, 'Jennifer Garner, Victor Garber, Ron Rifkin, Carl Lumbly, Kevin Weisman, Rachel Nichols, Amy Acker, Balthazar Getty', 'TV-14', 'Sydney Bristow, an agent who has been tricked to believe she is working for the U.S. government, is actually working for a criminal organization named the Alliance of Twelve. Upon learning this, Sydney becomes a double agent for the real CIA.', 'Sydney Bristow, an agent who has been tricked to believe she is working for the U.S. government, is actually working for a criminal organization named the Alliance of Twelve. Upon learning this, Sydney becomes a double agent for the real CIA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Dl3KIxWlSEvnXogNHxdXA4pbAk.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2046'),
  ('670520942924360140', 'Alias el Mexicano', 2013, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Gerardo Reyes', null, 'Juan Sebastián Calero, Biassini Segura, Carolina Gaitán, Rafael Novoa, Fabio Rubiano, Waldo Urrego, Rubén Zamora, Rodrigo Oviedo', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/au9bEshvTV2tHpTIcutiyXt1Dln.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81733'),
  ('1099537722735442426', 'Alias Grace', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Sarah Polley', null, 'Sarah Gadon, Edward Holcroft, Rebecca Liddiard, Zachary Levi, Kerr Logan, David Cronenberg, Paul Gross, Anna Paquin', 'TV-MA', 'Based on the true story of Grace Marks, a housemaid and immigrant from Ireland who was imprisoned in 1843, perhaps wrongly, for the murder of her employer Thomas Kinnear. Grace claims to have no memory of the murder yet the facts are irrefutable. A decade after, Dr. Simon Jordan tries to help Grace recall her past.', 'Based on the true story of Grace Marks, a housemaid and immigrant from Ireland who was imprisoned in 1843, perhaps wrongly, for the murder of her employer Thomas Kinnear. Grace claims to have no memory of the murder yet the facts are irrefutable. A decade after, Dr. Simon Jordan tries to help Grace recall her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6ChYjCPMpzAPzR7jm0omLbu9hS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72615'),
  ('724043097425096887', 'Alias Smith and Jones', 1971, 'Western, Crime', 'Glen A. Larson', null, 'Ben Murphy, Roger Davis', 'TV-PG', 'Alias Smith and Jones is an American Western series that originally aired on ABC from 1971 to 1973. It stars Pete Duel as Hannibal Heyes and Ben Murphy as Jedediah "Kid" Curry, a pair of cousin outlaws trying to reform. The governor offers them a conditional amnesty, as he wants to keep the pact under wraps for political reasons. The condition is that they will still be wanted— until the governor can claim they have reformed and warrant clemency.', 'Alias Smith and Jones is an American Western series that originally aired on ABC from 1971 to 1973. It stars Pete Duel as Hannibal Heyes and Ben Murphy as Jedediah "Kid" Curry, a pair of cousin outlaws trying to reform. The governor offers them a conditional amnesty, as he wants to keep the pact under wraps for political reasons. The condition is that they will still be wanted— until the governor can claim they have reformed and warrant clemency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvivxPeLnXUGiZtgeHdLVA6xGmb.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:3275'),
  ('130401015003300675', 'Alibi', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Evgeniy Stychkin, Olga Sutulova, Timofey Tribuntsev, Yakov Levda, Varvara Borodina, Aleksandr Ustyugov, Taisiya Vilkova, Vilma Kutaviciute', null, 'Petr is not only a successful writer but also is the owner of the agen- cy called Alibi — that creates alibis for the clients who need to hide their lies and failures. His second business is hidden, so he himself has a double life. But his attitude to lies changes when his own wife appears at the agency asking for an alibi. From this moment on, he will solve not only his client’s problems, but his own. Unfortu- nately, he’ll be able to help everyone but himself.', 'Petr is not only a successful writer but also is the owner of the agen- cy called Alibi — that creates alibis for the clients who need to hide their lies and failures. His second business is hidden, so he himself has a double life. But his attitude to lies changes when his own wife appears at the agency asking for an alibi. From this moment on, he will solve not only his client’s problems, but his own. Unfortu- nately, he’ll be able to help everyone but himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8K6vEcm0sol6ljAgF8Heqqz1O3j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137031'),
  ('727920462269514169', 'Alice', 1976, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Robert Getchell', null, 'Linda Lavin, Vic Tayback, Beth Howland, Celia Weston, Philip McKeon, Charles Levin', 'TV-PG', 'Alice is an American sitcom television series that ran from August 31, 1976 to March 19, 1985 on CBS. The series is based on the 1974 film Alice Doesn''t Live Here Anymore. The show stars Linda Lavin in the title role, a widow who moves with her young son to start her life over again, and finds a job working at a roadside diner on the outskirts of Phoenix, Arizona. Most of the episodes revolve around events at Mel''s Diner.', 'Alice is an American sitcom television series that ran from August 31, 1976 to March 19, 1985 on CBS. The series is based on the 1974 film Alice Doesn''t Live Here Anymore. The show stars Linda Lavin in the title role, a widow who moves with her young son to start her life over again, and finds a job working at a roadside diner on the outskirts of Phoenix, Arizona. Most of the episodes revolve around events at Mel''s Diner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEEtQs1mPz3kvvaEFR7HVnME9Or.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:494'),
  ('46710806321824248', 'Alice', 2009, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Nick Willing', null, 'Caterina "Hiding in the closet" Scorsone, Andrew-Lee Potts, Matt Frewer, Harry Dean Stanton, Alessandro Juliani, Eugene Lipinski, Tim Curry, Charlotte Sullivan', 'NR', 'Alice Hamilton, a fiercely independent twenty-something, watches as her lover Jack Chase is kidnapped and driven into darkness. Desperate to find Jack, Alice puts her trust in a stranger who calls himself White Rabbit and suddenly finds herself on the other side of a looking glass.', 'Alice Hamilton, a fiercely independent twenty-something, watches as her lover Jack Chase is kidnapped and driven into darkness. Desperate to find Jack, Alice puts her trust in a stranger who calls himself White Rabbit and suddenly finds herself on the other side of a looking glass.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2lvWLSOPtsqkgVIfEz9ai7D6TUr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33466'),
  ('72397549263325917', 'Alice', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kim Hee-seon, Joo Won, Kwak Si-yang, Choi Won-young, Lee Da-in, Yeon Woo, Bae Hae-seon, Lim Jae-hyeok', null, 'It’s the year 2050 and time travel exists thanks to Alice, the mechanism through which the intriguing practice is made possible. But a rumor based on a prophecy beings to spread about time travel coming to an end. When You Min Hyuk and Yoon Tae Yi are sent to the year 1992 to find out about the prophecy, Tae Yi realizes she’s pregnant and decides to stay in the past by herself. She changes her name to Park Sun Young and eventually gives birth to a beautiful son named Park Jin Gyeom, whose mental health suffers due to radiation exposure. Fast forward to the year 2010, and Sun Young is murdered by someone. 10 years after her death, her son Jin Gyeom is on a mission to find who is responsible for his mother’s death. But while searching, he runs into Yoon Tae Yi, a physics professor who looks exactly like this mother. What will become of these individuals caught tragically between time and space?', 'It’s the year 2050 and time travel exists thanks to Alice, the mechanism through which the intriguing practice is made possible. But a rumor based on a prophecy beings to spread about time travel coming to an end. When You Min Hyuk and Yoon Tae Yi are sent to the year 1992 to find out about the prophecy, Tae Yi realizes she’s pregnant and decides to stay in the past by herself. She changes her name to Park Sun Young and eventually gives birth to a beautiful son named Park Jin Gyeom, whose mental health suffers due to radiation exposure. Fast forward to the year 2010, and Sun Young is murdered by someone. 10 years after her death, her son Jin Gyeom is on a mission to find who is responsible for his mother’s death. But while searching, he runs into Yoon Tae Yi, a physics professor who looks exactly like this mother. What will become of these individuals caught tragically between time and space?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9RCm67BVGmqYyr1S3vfR2z22Yk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97267'),
  ('1134793836534463278', 'Alice & Jack', 2024, 'Drama', 'Victor Levin', null, 'Andrea Riseborough, Domhnall Gleeson, Aimee Lou Wood, Sunil Patel', null, 'When Alice and Jack first meet, they have a connection so powerful it seems nothing can break it, but can they find happiness together, or will their own emotional complexities get in the way?', 'When Alice and Jack first meet, they have a connection so powerful it seems nothing can break it, but can they find happiness together, or will their own emotional complexities get in the way?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5m3z9wVf0lzl47TLkKV8pvpeOJc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:232315'),
  ('552424592996378492', 'Alice & Zoroku', 2017, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hitomi Ohwada, Akio Otsuka, Aki Toyosaki, Ami Koshimizu, Akari Kito, Natsumi Fujiwara, Mamiko Noto, Shu Uchida', 'TV-14', 'The story centers on a little girl called Sana, who is one of the children that holds the power of "Alice''s Dream," an ability that enables her to materialize anything she imagines. After escaping a lab where she was a test subject, Sana ends up in a normal world where she encounters an old man named Zouroku, but will he help her?', 'The story centers on a little girl called Sana, who is one of the children that holds the power of "Alice''s Dream," an ability that enables her to materialize anything she imagines. After escaping a lab where she was a test subject, Sana ends up in a normal world where she encounters an old man named Zouroku, but will he help her?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHYmjLTc5niV7uuTBmIz4oTrSx6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70594'),
  ('531372846363617121', 'Alice in Borderland', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', null, null, 'Maaya Sakamoto, Takahiro Sakurai, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Tsubasa Yonaga, Minako Kotobuki, Yoshimasa Hosoya', null, 'Arisu, Karube, and Segawa, a trio of highschool delinquents, are bored with their current lives. During a firework celebration, Arisu wishes that he could live in a different world which would be more exciting for him. As such, his wish was granted, and the three were transported into a seemingly post-apocalyptic-like parallel world. After stepping into what seems to be an empty festival, they are greeted by a woman who tells them that they have already "entered their game". After clearing the game, she reveals to them that, in Borderlands, they must play games to survive.', 'Arisu, Karube, and Segawa, a trio of highschool delinquents, are bored with their current lives. During a firework celebration, Arisu wishes that he could live in a different world which would be more exciting for him. As such, his wish was granted, and the three were transported into a seemingly post-apocalyptic-like parallel world. After stepping into what seems to be an empty festival, they are greeted by a woman who tells them that they have already "entered their game". After clearing the game, she reveals to them that, in Borderlands, they must play games to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8huvRDPvqQ6N17krzUJf2tmb9PH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71907'),
  ('663566960468262151', 'Alice in Borderland', 2020, 'Mystery, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Kento Yamazaki, Tao Tsuchiya', 'TV-MA', 'With his two friends, a video-game-obsessed young man finds himself in a strange version of Tokyo where they must compete in dangerous games to win.', 'With his two friends, a video-game-obsessed young man finds himself in a strange version of Tokyo where they must compete in dangerous games to win.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ac8ruycRXzgcsndTZFK6ouGA0FA.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:110316'),
  ('849444248018080646', 'Alice in Wonderland', 1983, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'TARAKO, Kenichi Ogata, Masako Nozawa, Issei Futamata, Shozo Iizuka, Noriko Uemura, Kumiko Mizukura, Yoshiko Matsuo', null, 'A young girl named Alice follows a white rabbit into a hole, only to find herself in Wonderland, where she meets many interesting characters, including the mysterious Cheshire Cat and the terrible Queen of Hearts.', 'A young girl named Alice follows a white rabbit into a hole, only to find herself in Wonderland, where she meets many interesting characters, including the mysterious Cheshire Cat and the terrible Queen of Hearts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipLBlkU7IXDS6bMgpG4cv92eHwG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65305'),
  ('1077073732045746819', 'Alice in Wonderland', 1985, 'Action & Adventure, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Lewis Carroll', 'Natalie Gregory, Sheila Allen, Red Buttons, Anthony Newley, Roddy McDowall, Arte Johnson, Jayne Meadows, Robert Morley', null, 'Sometimes she''s too big. Or much too small. Sometimes things are backwards. And there''s always too much pepper in the soup! Nothing is quite right since Alice chased a very unusual White Rabbit and stumbled into an adventure that grows curiouser and curiouser. One of the greatest childhood fantasies is captured in Irwin Allen''s colorful production adapted from Lewis Carroll''s "Alice''s Adventures in Wonderland." Originally aired over two nights in 1985 on CBS.', 'Sometimes she''s too big. Or much too small. Sometimes things are backwards. And there''s always too much pepper in the soup! Nothing is quite right since Alice chased a very unusual White Rabbit and stumbled into an adventure that grows curiouser and curiouser. One of the greatest childhood fantasies is captured in Irwin Allen''s colorful production adapted from Lewis Carroll''s "Alice''s Adventures in Wonderland." Originally aired over two nights in 1985 on CBS.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HOFLKqXrfuWBUD2l52tbA3Fuex.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42553'),
