  ('1120047771277613933', 'All Elite Wrestling: Rampage', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Tony Khan', null, null, 'TV-14', 'AEW: Rampage, also known as Friday Night Rampage or simply Rampage, is a professional wrestling television program. It is produced by the American promotion All Elite Wrestling (AEW) and airs every Friday at 10pm ET on TNT in the United States. It is AEW''s second weekly television show, positioned behind their flagship show, Dynamite.', 'AEW: Rampage, also known as Friday Night Rampage or simply Rampage, is a professional wrestling television program. It is produced by the American promotion All Elite Wrestling (AEW) and airs every Friday at 10pm ET on TNT in the United States. It is AEW''s second weekly television show, positioned behind their flagship show, Dynamite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itLcy79zMVU9K4OTU4h8I61nPJi.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:126997'),
  ('381484316747316495', 'All For Love', 2020, 'Drama', null, 'Nubia Barreto', 'Ana María Estupiñán, Carlos Torres, Mario Duarte, Juan Millan, Vilma Vera, Alex Paez, Alden Rojas, Yuri Vargas', 'NR', 'A penniless country boy goes in search of his runaway sister in Bogotá, where he falls for an aspiring singer, but gets tangled up in organized crime.', 'A penniless country boy goes in search of his runaway sister in Bogotá, where he falls for an aspiring singer, but gets tangled up in organized crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTmIP28BCEtgWBdxRMgK33nS0EA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103086'),
  ('90025129119938270', 'All Grown Up!', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Kids', 'Arlene Klasky, Gábor Csupó, Paul Germain', null, 'E. G. Daily, Nancy Cartwright, Kath Soucie, Cheryl Chase, Cree Summer, Dionne Quan, Tara Strong', 'TV-Y', 'The former "Rugrats" tots now face preteen issues and dilemmas.', 'The former "Rugrats" tots now face preteen issues and dilemmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e950CuuRk3MdRytXJ9cE905QrLS.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:130'),
  ('331191091280196454', 'All Hail King Julien', 2014, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Tom McGrath, Eric Darnell', null, 'Danny Jacobs, Jeff Bennett, India de Beaufort, Kevin Michael Richardson, Andy Richter, Debra Wilson, Betsy Sodaro, Sarah Thyre', 'TV-Y7', 'King Julien is back and shaking his booty harder than ever! Discover the wild world of Madagascar as the king takes on the jungle’s craziest adventures in this comedy series. With his loyal sidekicks Maurice and Mort, they meet a whole new cast of colorful animals, including ambitious head of security Clover and the villainous Foosa. No one can stop this king from ruling with an iron fist...in the air...wavin'' like he just doesn''t care.', 'King Julien is back and shaking his booty harder than ever! Discover the wild world of Madagascar as the king takes on the jungle’s craziest adventures in this comedy series. With his loyal sidekicks Maurice and Mort, they meet a whole new cast of colorful animals, including ambitious head of security Clover and the villainous Foosa. No one can stop this king from ruling with an iron fist...in the air...wavin'' like he just doesn''t care.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tsE6Dbx7aejDDmAy4DX55YxE8pT.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:61751'),
  ('801911134129202746', 'All Hail King Julien: Exiled', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Kids', null, null, 'Danny Jacobs, Jeff Bennett, India de Beaufort, Kevin Michael Richardson, Andy Richter, Debra Wilson, Betsy Sodaro', 'TV-Y7', 'Julien''s been dethroned, but loyal friends and some very unlikely allies will propel the lovable lemur on a colorful journey to take back his kingdom.', 'Julien''s been dethroned, but loyal friends and some very unlikely allies will propel the lovable lemur on a colorful journey to take back his kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/claBnTcyYzB216D1jFG1oLLqP0v.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71867'),
  ('303122497014091878', 'All Her Fault', 2025, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Megan Gallagher', null, 'Sarah Snook, Jake Lacy, Sophia Lillis, Michael Peña, Dakota Fanning, Abby Elliott, Jay Ellis, Duke McCloud', 'TV-MA', 'In Chicago, Marissa Irvine arrives at 14 Arthur Avenue, expecting to pick up her young son Milo from his first playdate with a boy at his new school. But the woman who answers the door isn''t a mother she recognizes. She isn''t the nanny. She doesn''t have Milo. And so begins every parent''s worst nightmare.', 'In Chicago, Marissa Irvine arrives at 14 Arthur Avenue, expecting to pick up her young son Milo from his first playdate with a boy at his new school. But the woman who answers the door isn''t a mother she recognizes. She isn''t the nanny. She doesn''t have Milo. And so begins every parent''s worst nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8vZKZlc8H4OcgpbJuqP0iK4B2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:246386'),
  ('451907417806784002', 'All In', 2003, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, 'Choi Wan-gyu', 'Lee Byung-hun, Song Hye-kyo, Ji Sung, Park Sol-mi, Huh Joon-ho, Lee Duck-hwa, Sunwoo Eun-Sook, Park Won-sook', null, 'All In is a 2003 South Korean television drama series that aired on SBS from January 15 to April 3, 2003 on Wednesdays and Thursdays at 21:55 for 24 episodes. Inspired by the life of professional poker player Jimmy Cha, it starred Lee Byung-hun and Song Hye-kyo in a story about one''s man''s rise through the fiercely competitive world of casino gambling as he clashes with his rivals over money, success, and love. The drama was a ratings success in South Korea, with its final episode reaching a peak viewership rating of 47.7%, which is the 42nd highest-rated Korean drama episode of all time. It also won several awards, notably the Grand Prize for Lee Byung-hun at the 2003 SBS Drama Awards.', 'All In is a 2003 South Korean television drama series that aired on SBS from January 15 to April 3, 2003 on Wednesdays and Thursdays at 21:55 for 24 episodes. Inspired by the life of professional poker player Jimmy Cha, it starred Lee Byung-hun and Song Hye-kyo in a story about one''s man''s rise through the fiercely competitive world of casino gambling as he clashes with his rivals over money, success, and love. The drama was a ratings success in South Korea, with its final episode reaching a peak viewership rating of 47.7%, which is the 42nd highest-rated Korean drama episode of all time. It also won several awards, notably the Grand Prize for Lee Byung-hun at the 2003 SBS Drama Awards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h05ugNCArYmfnQ6BvdV29HEfitK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14351'),
  ('858454313004819481', 'All in Good Faith', 1985, 'Comedy', 'John Howard Davies', null, 'Richard Briers, Susan Jameson', null, 'British sitcom in which Reverend Philip Lambe, after becoming bored in his wealthy Oxfordshire parish, asks for a transfer to a more difficult assignment. Sent to Edendale, a fictional urban town in the Midlands, he is accompanied by his wife Emma, sixteen-year-old daughter Miranda and twelve-year-old son Peter.', 'British sitcom in which Reverend Philip Lambe, after becoming bored in his wealthy Oxfordshire parish, asks for a transfer to a more difficult assignment. Sent to Edendale, a fictional urban town in the Midlands, he is accompanied by his wife Emma, sixteen-year-old daughter Miranda and twelve-year-old son Peter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9qveCyL3m6tNOrdhUabZk7khKt.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:10'),
  ('842671070901694653', 'All in the Family', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Johnny Speight, Norman Lear', null, 'Carroll O''Connor, Jean Stapleton, Danielle Brisebois', 'TV-PG', 'Archie Bunker, a working class bigot, constantly squabbles with his family over the important issues of the day.', 'Archie Bunker, a working class bigot, constantly squabbles with his family over the important issues of the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2Y9QWyuyjRP78DZsatknEjn0iN.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:1922'),
  ('921770328149320412', 'All Is Well', 2019, 'Drama, Family', 'A Nai', null, 'Yao Chen, Ni Dahong, Guo Jingfei, Li Nian, Gao Xin, Gao Lu, Morning Chang, Tony Yang', null, 'Everything falls apart after the death of the Su family matriarch and after ‘suffering’ for so long under his wife, the weak and selfish Su Daqiang begins to meddle in his children’s lives and often asks them to meet the most unreasonable requests.', 'Everything falls apart after the death of the Su family matriarch and after ‘suffering’ for so long under his wife, the weak and selfish Su Daqiang begins to meddle in his children’s lives and often asks them to meet the most unreasonable requests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3I2yvziANqEoiNLQGnlO38Gofbj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87544'),
  ('193680535123195122', 'All Men Are Brothers', 2011, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Kuk Kok-Leung', 'Wen HaoJie, Zeng Lu, Wu Tong', 'Zhang Hanyu, Ray Lui, Liu Yuqiao, Kevin Yan, Hu Ke, He Jiayi, Ady An, Du Chun', null, 'Toward the end of Northern Song Dynasty, the government was deeply corrupted. The oppressed people finally rebelled. A hundred and eight men and women fought against the government and took their last stand in a place called Liangshan.', 'Toward the end of Northern Song Dynasty, the government was deeply corrupted. The oppressed people finally rebelled. A hundred and eight men and women fought against the government and took their last stand in a place called Liangshan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdnL7igbnJYcpr6VYd5O00GoAPr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84634'),
  ('675893738471971913', 'All My Children', 1970, 'Soap', 'Agnes Nixon', null, 'Bobbie Eakes, Michael E. Knight', null, 'All My Children is an American television soap opera that aired on ABC for 41 years, from January 5, 1970 to September 23, 2011, and on The Online Network since April 29, 2013 via Hulu, Hulu Plus, and iTunes. Created by Agnes Nixon, All My Children is set in Pine Valley, Pennsylvania, a fictitious suburb of Philadelphia which is modeled on the actual Philadelphia suburb of Rosemont.', 'All My Children is an American television soap opera that aired on ABC for 41 years, from January 5, 1970 to September 23, 2011, and on The Online Network since April 29, 2013 via Hulu, Hulu Plus, and iTunes. Created by Agnes Nixon, All My Children is set in Pine Valley, Pennsylvania, a fictitious suburb of Philadelphia which is modeled on the actual Philadelphia suburb of Rosemont.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zYDW6wunTm5gm8vo4dfhpvkT0w.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:879'),
  ('159510922128280455', 'All Night', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Jason Ubaldi', null, 'Ty Doran, Tetona Jackson, Jenn McAllister, Eva Marisol Gutowski, Brec Bassinger', 'TV-14', 'An overnight, lock-in graduation party in which a group of new grads will do whatever it takes to make their remaining high school dreams come true.', 'An overnight, lock-in graduation party in which a group of new grads will do whatever it takes to make their remaining high school dreams come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j09rhmtg13NyueqZii5WYZABbDD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75966'),
  ('967222728751616243', 'All of Us', 2003, 'Comedy, Family', 'Will Smith, Jada Pinkett Smith, Betsy Borns', null, 'Duane Martin, LisaRaye McCoy, Khamani Griffin, Tony Rock', 'TV-PG', 'Robert James, an entertainment reporter for a local Los Angeles television station, is handsome, smart and thoroughly modern in his thinking. Recently divorced from the somewhat self-absorbed Neesee, the mother of their endearing 6-year-old son, Robert refuses to buy into the old stereotype that being divorced means you can''t get along with the ex.', 'Robert James, an entertainment reporter for a local Los Angeles television station, is handsome, smart and thoroughly modern in his thinking. Recently divorced from the somewhat self-absorbed Neesee, the mother of their endearing 6-year-old son, Robert refuses to buy into the old stereotype that being divorced means you can''t get along with the ex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ydBzxhOhJKI8sGtYKuMP7wEele.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1566'),
  ('778582346082112667', 'All of Us Are Dead', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Chun Sung-il, JQ Lee, Kim Nam-su', null, 'Park Ji-hu, Yoon Chan-young, Cho Yi-hyun, Lomon, Yoo In-soo, Lee You-mi, Kim Byong-chul, Lee Kyoo-hyung', 'TV-MA', 'A high school becomes ground zero for a zombie virus outbreak. Trapped students must fight their way out — or turn into one of the rabid infected.', 'A high school becomes ground zero for a zombie virus outbreak. Trapped students must fight their way out — or turn into one of the rabid infected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTEFqAjLd5YTsMD6NSUxV6Dq7A6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:99966'),
  ('1036063249944794180', 'All or Nothing', 2016, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Carson Wentz, Doug Pederson, Jon Hamm, Jeffrey Lurie', 'TV-MA', 'For the first time in history, Amazon and NFL Films present an unprecedented inside look at the lives of players, coaches and owners of a franchise over the course of an entire NFL season. Witness the real life, behind the scenes journey on the field, off the field, and everything in between.', 'For the first time in history, Amazon and NFL Films present an unprecedented inside look at the lives of players, coaches and owners of a franchise over the course of an entire NFL season. Witness the real life, behind the scenes journey on the field, off the field, and everything in between.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzTYIvVu6fJ6X5224ZvvrsRFxzL.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:66943'),
  ('335100077503172156', 'All or Nothing – The German National Team in Qatar', 2023, 'Documentary, Comedy', null, null, 'Béla Réthy, Hansi Flick, Joshua Kimmich, Ilkay Gündogan, Leon Goretzka, Nico Schlotterbeck, Antonio Rüdiger, Oliver Bierhoff', null, 'The German national football team wants to be the world’s best once again at the World Cup in Qatar. After being eliminated in the preliminary round of the 2018 World Cup and in the last 16 at the 2021 European Championship, the former world champions want another title. But again their journey ends in the preliminary round. Exclusive behind-the-scenes insights show their dramatic failure.', 'The German national football team wants to be the world’s best once again at the World Cup in Qatar. After being eliminated in the preliminary round of the 2018 World Cup and in the last 16 at the 2021 European Championship, the former world champions want another title. But again their journey ends in the preliminary round. Exclusive behind-the-scenes insights show their dramatic failure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVljGgLQbNwf2apaQJbRTG3z8Gc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233894'),
  ('815103461269735567', 'All or Nothing: Arsenal', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Daniel Kaluuya, Mikel Arteta, Pierre-Emerick Aubameyang, Granit Xhaka, Folarin Balogun, Carlos Cuesta, Mohamed Elneny, Richard Garlick', 'TV-MA', 'Follow the iconic football club during an unforgettable season. As fans return to stadiums, the 2021-22 football season puts pressure on Arsenal''s manager Mikel Arteta and his young team to get back to their former glories and back into Europe. Offering unprecedented access and capturing the highs and lows of life on and off the pitch, this is football at its finest: raw, dramatic and full of passion.', 'Follow the iconic football club during an unforgettable season. As fans return to stadiums, the 2021-22 football season puts pressure on Arsenal''s manager Mikel Arteta and his young team to get back to their former glories and back into Europe. Offering unprecedented access and capturing the highs and lows of life on and off the pitch, this is football at its finest: raw, dramatic and full of passion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LztV8nZYJy30BVVpI1IwMhX8Dd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132376'),
  ('28583861827529176', 'All or Nothing: Brazil National Team', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Daniel Ramirez-Suarez', 'Daniel Ramirez-Suarez', 'Marquinhos, Everton Cebolinha, Rogério Langanke Caboclo, Paulo Vinícius Coelho, Fernandinho, Gabriel Jesus, Rodrigo Lasmar, Fagner', null, 'The series follows the newly crowned champions of the 2019 Copa América tournament, the Brazilian football team, in a behind-the-scenes multi-part exclusive.', 'The series follows the newly crowned champions of the 2019 Copa América tournament, the Brazilian football team, in a behind-the-scenes multi-part exclusive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/git59xe4wiAzdPoBWhL778coeUu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98887'),
  ('890270831970849189', 'All or Nothing: Juventus', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Guido Vaciago, Weston McKennie, Andrea Pirlo, Leonardo Bonucci, Giorgio Chiellini, Gianluigi Buffon, Cristiano Ronaldo, Álvaro Morata', null, 'Burning defeats and victorious triumphs, All or Nothing follows Juventus, one of the world’s greatest clubs, through a memorable season of change. Unprecedented and exclusive access to Ronaldo and to some of the greatest names of world football, dramatic moments behind the scenes, an unmissable series about a championship that will keep you on your toes until the very last day.', 'Burning defeats and victorious triumphs, All or Nothing follows Juventus, one of the world’s greatest clubs, through a memorable season of change. Unprecedented and exclusive access to Ronaldo and to some of the greatest names of world football, dramatic moments behind the scenes, an unmissable series about a championship that will keep you on your toes until the very last day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/623WQnO0JDULYt64tg5Px1omoEW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137952'),
  ('669087170022264609', 'All or Nothing: Manchester City', 2018, 'Documentary', null, 'Stephen Johnstone, Pep Blay, David Chidlow', 'Ben Kingsley, Pep Guardiola, Mikel Arteta, Vincent Kompany, Yaya Touré, Raheem Sterling, Nicolás Otamendi, Khaldoon Al Mubarak', 'NR', 'Legendary coach Pep Guardiola leads his Manchester City team through the 2017-18 football season.', 'Legendary coach Pep Guardiola leads his Manchester City team through the 2017-18 football season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Q3mKXNX7rm2kyPesS9KEFs8VcN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81705'),
  ('427341036444409007', 'All or Nothing: New Zealand All Blacks', 2018, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Taika Waititi', 'TV-MA', 'For the first time ever, The New Zealand All Blacks rugby team, known as the winningest team in global sports history, allows cameras into their super secretive world to witness one of their most difficult seasons yet. Over four months, they face the demands of the most physically gruelling team sport on the planet to uphold a legacy of excellence and dominance that goes back well over a century.', 'For the first time ever, The New Zealand All Blacks rugby team, known as the winningest team in global sports history, allows cameras into their super secretive world to witness one of their most difficult seasons yet. Over four months, they face the demands of the most physically gruelling team sport on the planet to uphold a legacy of excellence and dominance that goes back well over a century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbr06jHbw4EjmQsbaTt96aXUrB3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79950'),
  ('205851034499867816', 'All or Nothing: The Michigan Wolverines', 2018, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Mark Harmon, Jim Harbaugh', 'TV-MA', 'All or Nothing: The Michigan Wolverines goes behind-the-scenes of the winningest program in college football to chronicle Michigan''s 2017 season. Head coach Jim Harbaugh leads his alma mater''s young team as the series provides an intimate look at the lives, both on the field and off, of the student athletes charged with carrying on Michigan''s legacy.', 'All or Nothing: The Michigan Wolverines goes behind-the-scenes of the winningest program in college football to chronicle Michigan''s 2017 season. Head coach Jim Harbaugh leads his alma mater''s young team as the series provides an intimate look at the lives, both on the field and off, of the student athletes charged with carrying on Michigan''s legacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQEBSaensI3WUszKPBSLrtQl2Wj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78594'),
  ('636986936223570695', 'All or Nothing: Toronto Maple Leafs', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Will Arnett', null, 'The first of the All or Nothing franchise to follow an NHL team, the docu-series brings fans closer to the Toronto Maple Leafs organization than ever before, with cameras capturing every moment during the 104th NHL regular season and playoffs.', 'The first of the All or Nothing franchise to follow an NHL team, the docu-series brings fans closer to the Toronto Maple Leafs organization than ever before, with cameras capturing every moment during the 104th NHL regular season and playoffs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iU6Rqu8KCIVG4KWrYYJNIqb3Pgu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135325'),
  ('318379986689780827', 'All or Nothing: Tottenham Hotspur', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Tom Hardy, José Mourinho, Harry Kane, Son Heung-min, Dele Alli, Jan Vertonghen, Daniel Levy, Mauricio Pochettino', null, 'A fly-on-the-wall inside look at the goings-on of Tottenham Hotspur during the 2019-20 football season.', 'A fly-on-the-wall inside look at the goings-on of Tottenham Hotspur during the 2019-20 football season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3XKreto3MMZr0MDycFWyNn8MQz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106195'),
  ('588060568603095979', 'ALL OUT!!', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Shoya Chiba, Ryota Osaka, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Yuuto Adachi, Atsushi Kosaka, Chiharu Sawashiro, Daichi Kanbara, Daiki Hamano', 'TV-14', 'In rugby, there is no ace striker, there is no number four batter, so who is the star of the team? The story begins at school entrance ceremony of Kanagawa High School where Kenji Gion, a small but gutsy go-getter joins the rugby club. He joins with his classmate, Iwashimizu, who has a complicated past and sub-captain Hachiouji, who always takes good care of his Club members. Lastly, there is Captain Sekizan, who has overwhelming powers but keeps his cards close to his chest. With such differences in both personality and physical performance, the team must learn to work and grow together so they can become the best.', 'In rugby, there is no ace striker, there is no number four batter, so who is the star of the team? The story begins at school entrance ceremony of Kanagawa High School where Kenji Gion, a small but gutsy go-getter joins the rugby club. He joins with his classmate, Iwashimizu, who has a complicated past and sub-captain Hachiouji, who always takes good care of his Club members. Lastly, there is Captain Sekizan, who has overwhelming powers but keeps his cards close to his chest. With such differences in both personality and physical performance, the team must learn to work and grow together so they can become the best.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxZPVoXgnepxo4y30qFKuMUZKtW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68071'),
  ('197794918532713757', 'All Purpose Cultural Cat Girl Nuku Nuku (TV)', 1998, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Sachiko Sugawara, Kazue Ikura, Megumi Hayashibara, Akiko Hiramatsu, Akira Kamiya, Ken Narita, Saeko Shimazu, Atsushi Kisaichi', null, 'When Natsume Atsuko, nicknamed Nuku Nuku, comes to live with Ryounosuke''s family, he falls in love instantly. After all, to all appearances, she''s a beautiful, normal - if slightly ditzy - teenage girl. In reality, however, she''s an all-purpose cat-brained andorobot who''s escaped from Mishima Heavy Industries'' research laboratories. She''s not supposed to use her special powers, but when more of Mishima''s experiments run amuck and her friends are threatened, she''ll do whatever she can to save them. It''s never just another day at school when your classmate''s an All Purpose Cultural Cat Girl!', 'When Natsume Atsuko, nicknamed Nuku Nuku, comes to live with Ryounosuke''s family, he falls in love instantly. After all, to all appearances, she''s a beautiful, normal - if slightly ditzy - teenage girl. In reality, however, she''s an all-purpose cat-brained andorobot who''s escaped from Mishima Heavy Industries'' research laboratories. She''s not supposed to use her special powers, but when more of Mishima''s experiments run amuck and her friends are threatened, she''ll do whatever she can to save them. It''s never just another day at school when your classmate''s an All Purpose Cultural Cat Girl!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhbWNG2g0Ajl3rGaVocXRInBkKF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:29152'),
  ('894127560235749081', 'All Quiet in Peking', 2014, 'Drama', null, 'Liu He-ping', 'Liu Ye, Chen Baoguo, Jiao Huang, Ni Dahong, Wang Qingxiang, Cheng Yu, Liao Fan, Dong Yong', 'TV-14', 'In 1948, as China''s civil war reaches a critical point and the Kuomintang''s economy collapses, Communist agent Fang Meng''ao goes undercover as an Air Force colonel. Assigned to investigate corruption—led by his own father—and later to help transport national assets to Taiwan, he becomes entangled in a complex power struggle. Caught between duty, family, and political shifts, Fang plays a pivotal role in a covert mission tied to the peaceful liberation of Beijing.', 'In 1948, as China''s civil war reaches a critical point and the Kuomintang''s economy collapses, Communist agent Fang Meng''ao goes undercover as an Air Force colonel. Assigned to investigate corruption—led by his own father—and later to help transport national assets to Taiwan, he becomes entangled in a complex power struggle. Caught between duty, family, and political shifts, Fang plays a pivotal role in a covert mission tied to the peaceful liberation of Beijing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxZtA8oigu28xj0V8BKOcRlG3rY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74724'),
  ('494542580695836520', 'All Rise', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Greg Spottiswood', null, 'Simone Missick, Wilson Bethel, Jessica Camacho, J. Alex Brinson, Ruthie Ann Miles, Lindsay Mendez, Lindsey Gort, Tess Malis Kincaid', 'TV-PG', 'A look at the personal and professional lives of the judges, lawyers, clerks, bailiffs and cops who work at an L.A. County courthouse.', 'A look at the personal and professional lives of the judges, lawyers, clerks, bailiffs and cops who work at an L.A. County courthouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgDVAetqJvCoBrZin2MpsYUdnwT.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:90872'),
  ('173759277155717258', 'All Round to Mrs. Brown''s', 2017, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Brendan O''Carroll, Paddy Houlihan, Danny O''Carroll, Eilish O''Carroll, Pat Shields, Fiona Gibney, Aly Mahmoud', null, 'Mrs Brown opens the doors to her house for a Saturday night entertainment show in which she and the family are joined by celebrity guests.', 'Mrs Brown opens the doors to her house for a Saturday night entertainment show in which she and the family are joined by celebrity guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/at6YEi00r8MlVKStaVb1hVGMPQr.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:70829'),
