  ('808596864619181373', 'All Saints Street', 2020, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Haiqing Xia, Yanzhe Du, Yanyan Shi, Hao Xianghai, Zhen Zhang, Teng Xin', null, 'The pure and cute little devil Nini lives in Room 1031 of Wansheng Street Apartment. His roommates are no ordinary people: The lazy and wacky vampire Ira who spends most of his time gaming or watching TV, the unlucky dancer werewolf Vladimir, the serious and old-fashioned angel landlord Lynn and his naive little sister Lily, and many more. What none of them realize is that the power of the demon king is sleeping inside of Nini. With evil forces in hot pursuit, can Nini and his friends head off disaster?', 'The pure and cute little devil Nini lives in Room 1031 of Wansheng Street Apartment. His roommates are no ordinary people: The lazy and wacky vampire Ira who spends most of his time gaming or watching TV, the unlucky dancer werewolf Vladimir, the serious and old-fashioned angel landlord Lynn and his naive little sister Lily, and many more. What none of them realize is that the power of the demon king is sleeping inside of Nini. With evil forces in hot pursuit, can Nini and his friends head off disaster?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BaTP3cWQdnla6IhFWCuFEw7svo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106402'),
  ('441637344452287640', 'All Star Shore', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Guilherme Evaristo, Melinda Melrose, Chantelle Connelly, Patryk Spiker, Chase DeMoor, Tamaris Sepulveda, Hati Garderobe', 'TV-MA', '14 of the world’s biggest reality superstars from some of television’s most iconic series – “Jersey Shore,” “Love Is Blind,” “RuPaul’s Drag Race,” “Geordie Shore,” “Acapulco Shore,” “Rio Shore,” and “Bachelor in Paradise” – come together for an epic vacation at the ultimate shore house in the Canary Islands, to battle it out for a cash prize and global bragging rights.', '14 of the world’s biggest reality superstars from some of television’s most iconic series – “Jersey Shore,” “Love Is Blind,” “RuPaul’s Drag Race,” “Geordie Shore,” “Acapulco Shore,” “Rio Shore,” and “Bachelor in Paradise” – come together for an epic vacation at the ultimate shore house in the Canary Islands, to battle it out for a cash prize and global bragging rights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eT8BpxEIJqbBRztWBloHMKfO0bv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:157742'),
  ('238135873704261040', 'All That', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Michael Tollin, Brian Robbins', null, 'Chelsea Brummet, Lisa Foiles, Kyle Sullivan, Denzel Whitaker, Jack De Sena, Kianna Underwood, Ryan Coleman, Lil J.J.', 'TV-G', 'A zany sketch comedy featuring many wacky characters hosted for kids and by kids.', 'A zany sketch comedy featuring many wacky characters hosted for kids and by kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0yb77hjP0W5bRPJFL0FNMsd5uK.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:3814'),
  ('1075099887584513700', 'All That', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Brian Robbins, Michael Tollin', null, 'Kate Godfrey, Gabrielle Nevaeh, Nathan Janak, Lex Lumpkin, Chinguun Sergelen, Ryan Alessi, Reece Caddell', 'TV-G', 'Pop-culture phenomenon All That is returning for a new generation of kids. The new weekly sketch-comedy series will showcase an all-new cast of kids, with original cast members making special appearances.', 'Pop-culture phenomenon All That is returning for a new generation of kids. The new weekly sketch-comedy series will showcase an all-new cast of kids, with original cast members making special appearances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjZ6fYxUiHxwFYDbjLjI8rugXJy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90788'),
  ('716781896331061304', 'All That We Loved', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Sehun, Cho Jun-young, Jang Yeo-bin, Song Jae-rim, Jung Yoo-jin, Lee Seung-joon, Park Eun-hye, Jeong Hye-seon', null, 'A love story that covers adolescent teenagers having trouble deciding the gravity of love and friendship.', 'A love story that covers adolescent teenagers having trouble deciding the gravity of love and friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pioZKN9PG3LJIcDrU4wfrMwotPF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206619'),
  ('619953569867346312', 'All the Blue in the Sky', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Camille Lou, Hugo Becker, Marie Denarnaud, Jeannine Vissac, Karine Monneau, Nelly Lawson, Marie Barraud, Kevin Garnichat', null, 'A young man with early-onset Alzheimer''s disease leaves everything behind to embark on a road trip withan enigmatic young woman he''s just met through a classified ad.', 'A young man with early-onset Alzheimer''s disease leaves everything behind to embark on a road trip withan enigmatic young woman he''s just met through a classified ad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwj9oC5bzmlSsW4XIJHI0NFHkoM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259622'),
  ('195385680452338150', 'All the Flowers', 2022, 'Soap, Drama, Comedy', 'João Emanuel Carneiro', 'João Emanuel Carneiro, Daisy Chaves, Eliane Garcia', 'Sophie Charlotte, Regina Casé, Letícia Colin, Mariana Nunes, Fábio Assunção, Humberto Carrão, Caio Castro, Nicolas Prattes', null, 'Maíra was raised by her father believing that her mother had died. This was a lie her father told her in order to protect her from the scorn of her mother, who rejected her when she learned that her daughter was born with a disability. Many years later, Maíra comes across a stranger on their doorstep. That’s Zoé, her mother. Without revealing her true intentions, Zoe reappears asking her daughter’s forgiveness for having abandoned her. As in a dream that turns into a nightmare, Maíra experiences the strongest emotions of her life and what would be a happy fresh start for Maíra with her family turns into a long and dangerous journey.', 'Maíra was raised by her father believing that her mother had died. This was a lie her father told her in order to protect her from the scorn of her mother, who rejected her when she learned that her daughter was born with a disability. Many years later, Maíra comes across a stranger on their doorstep. That’s Zoé, her mother. Without revealing her true intentions, Zoe reappears asking her daughter’s forgiveness for having abandoned her. As in a dream that turns into a nightmare, Maíra experiences the strongest emotions of her life and what would be a happy fresh start for Maíra with her family turns into a long and dangerous journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dihpH1yIZpNqxCNTNnEOIXLUa7f.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:196429'),
  ('1071183006280804159', 'All the Light We Cannot See', 2023, 'Drama', 'Steven Knight', null, 'Aria Mia Loberti, Louis Hofmann, Lars Eidinger, Hugh Laurie, Mark Ruffalo', 'TV-MA', 'A blind French girl and a young German soldier''s paths collide during WWII.', 'A blind French girl and a young German soldier''s paths collide during WWII.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vctOvdEXakZWTJrP8bgPEoCbqS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155421'),
  ('189370825788994203', 'All The Liquors', 2023, 'Drama', 'Kim Jin-yeol', null, 'Kim Jun-hyung, Won Do-hyun, Jeong Ho-gyun, Roshin, Han Da-sol', null, 'A marketer must win over a stubborn chef who bans alcohol in his diner, but their clash brews into something far stronger than booze.', 'A marketer must win over a stubborn chef who bans alcohol in his diner, but their clash brews into something far stronger than booze.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jBZeazu5PB2jDU9zwhvwXjIlRq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220561'),
  ('892406840357614152', 'All the Queen''s Men', 2021, 'Drama', 'Christian Keyes', null, 'Eva Marcille, Skyh Alvester Black, Candace Neolani Maxwell, Racquel Palmer, Michael Bolwaire, Keith Swift, Dion Rome, Jeremy Williams', 'TV-MA', 'Marilyn "Madam" DeVille is at the top of her game in the Atlanta nightclub industry, and she won''t let anyone or anything stand her in way as she rules a crew of male exotic dancers.', 'Marilyn "Madam" DeVille is at the top of her game in the Atlanta nightclub industry, and she won''t let anyone or anything stand her in way as she rules a crew of male exotic dancers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXswCm8rvJUQbU89ihb0CQVJGpS.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:133174'),
  ('931731196546627895', 'All the Same… or Not', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', null, null, 'Gabriella Saraivah, Ana Jeckel, Duda Matte, Clara Buarque, Guilhermina Libanio, Guthierry Sotero, Miá Mello, Ronald Sotto', 'TV-PG', 'Carol and her friends prepare for a new year of going to school, to the beach, and having fun in their beloved Rio de Janeiro... but their friendship will be put to the test. Carol will deal with her mother''s marriage, her stepfather being her teacher, her insufferable half-brother, and her friends'' personal problems. But they will stick together... or not.', 'Carol and her friends prepare for a new year of going to school, to the beach, and having fun in their beloved Rio de Janeiro... but their friendship will be put to the test. Carol will deal with her mother''s marriage, her stepfather being her teacher, her insufferable half-brother, and her friends'' personal problems. But they will stick together... or not.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNsUg6ZTmcHy2hHauoASBWhdDTi.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:114105'),
  ('1083017201935761458', 'All the Sharks', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Tom Hird', 'TV-PG', 'Four teams of shark experts and enthusiasts travel the globe trying to find the most elusive shark species in this fin-tastic reality competition.', 'Four teams of shark experts and enthusiasts travel the globe trying to find the most elusive shark species in this fin-tastic reality competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUdDyEnpS27HhxkUeAsDWEJnRH4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:294011'),
  ('1141591132679114275', 'All the Sins', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Mika Ronkainen, Merja Aakko', 'Mika Ronkainen', 'Johannes Holopainen, Maria Sid, Matti Ristinen, Jaakko Ohtonen, Kreeta Salminen, Saimi Räty, Hannes Suominen, Tuula Väänänen', null, 'Cold-blooded murders in the Laestadian community of Varjakka take criminal investigators to the heart of guilt and forgiveness over three decades.', 'Cold-blooded murders in the Laestadian community of Varjakka take criminal investigators to the heart of guilt and forgiveness over three decades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAyAlFVc7GAFYbLxcMaiYsV8uHW.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:88227'),
  ('123315167371430587', 'All The Way To The Sun', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Wang Yang, Wang Ju, Li Landi, Wang Youjun, Ren Bin, Lin Peng, Gao Ye, Xu Shaoying', null, 'After graduating from Beijing, Li Mujia, a girl Beijing drifter, entered the most well-known law firm and worked hard to become a leading lawyer from an administrative assistant. Mujia met the market elite Li Guang, and their relationship had undergone several twists and turned as they grow rapidly. Mujia''s best friend Tian Rong failed to apply for a job after graduation and accidentally became a real estate agent. She hastily married a Beijing boy named Li Wanbing, which put her career and relationship to a huge ordeal after marriage. The two encountered various setbacks but found their own direction. From 2007 to 2019, girls'' pursuit and hope for life have involuntarily changed their appearance in reality. Fortunately, after ten years of hard work, they have finally found a positive side to life and have been able to rise to the sun all the way.', 'After graduating from Beijing, Li Mujia, a girl Beijing drifter, entered the most well-known law firm and worked hard to become a leading lawyer from an administrative assistant. Mujia met the market elite Li Guang, and their relationship had undergone several twists and turned as they grow rapidly. Mujia''s best friend Tian Rong failed to apply for a job after graduation and accidentally became a real estate agent. She hastily married a Beijing boy named Li Wanbing, which put her career and relationship to a huge ordeal after marriage. The two encountered various setbacks but found their own direction. From 2007 to 2019, girls'' pursuit and hope for life have involuntarily changed their appearance in reality. Fortunately, after ten years of hard work, they have finally found a positive side to life and have been able to rise to the sun all the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rc2FyiLjFJOv2bTR0ECSUnlKBTZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228085'),
  ('715923292453818466', 'All the Way Up', 2020, 'Drama', 'Franck Gastambide, Giulio Callegari, Xavier Lacaille', null, 'Saïdou Camara, Brahim Bouhlel, Franck Gastambide, Adel Bencherif, Delil Ozhan, Heardley Stinvil, Alicia Hava, Lucille Guillaume', null, 'A talented young rapper, supported by his two childhood friends, finds himself overnight "validated" by one of the stars in the business. Only, this alliance quickly turns into a dangerous rivalry ...', 'A talented young rapper, supported by his two childhood friends, finds himself overnight "validated" by one of the stars in the business. Only, this alliance quickly turns into a dangerous rivalry ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1W7cUndFL49GTzHKMcTBhhFu9ST.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:90816'),
  ('601455400148882196', 'All the Women in the World', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Janaína Fischer, Jorge Furtado', null, 'Emílio Dantas, Sophie Charlotte, Martha Nowill, Matheus Nachtergaele, Lília Cabral, Maria Ribeiro, Fernanda Torres, Felipe Camargo', 'TV-14', 'In this contemporary romantic comedy about love in all its forms, All the Women in the World tells the story of Paulo, a bohemian dreamer that lives his relationships intensively, falling deeply for all the women he meets. Never able to forget Maria Alice, his greatest love, he counts on the advice of his two best friends to face the emotions of his accomplishments and breakups.', 'In this contemporary romantic comedy about love in all its forms, All the Women in the World tells the story of Paulo, a bohemian dreamer that lives his relationships intensively, falling deeply for all the women he meets. Never able to forget Maria Alice, his greatest love, he counts on the advice of his two best friends to face the emotions of his accomplishments and breakups.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2SIuHMn6mqIM38nliICJtWHmhB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102596'),
  ('734894521597609501', 'All Watched Over by Machines of Loving Grace', 2011, 'Documentary, War & Politics', 'Adam Curtis', null, 'Adam Curtis, Ayn Rand, Stewart Brand, Peder Anker, David Attenborough, Richard Brautigan, Bill Clinton, Richard Dawkins', null, 'We have been colonised by the machines we have built. Although we don''t realise it, the way we see everything in the world today is through the eyes of the computers.', 'We have been colonised by the machines we have built. Although we don''t realise it, the way we see everything in the world today is through the eyes of the computers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JC5Qp4NNHXXxhzpcaSK4OxinBS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44045'),
  ('787970764169367817', 'All You Need', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Benjamin Gutsche', null, 'Frédéric Brossier, Benito Bause, Arash Marandi, Christin Nichols, Mads Hjulmand, Tom Keune, Ludwig Brix', null, 'All You Need is a Dramady series about four gay men in Berlin, searching for love and security in the age of Grindr.', 'All You Need is a Dramady series about four gay men in Berlin, searching for love and security in the age of Grindr.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KB4wLp5Pkd9y1FZhu0TxZvIEmh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:123424'),
  ('77260205430477728', 'All you need is crime', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Massimiliano Bruno, Andrea Bassi, Gianluca Bernardini', null, 'Marco Giallini, Gianmarco Tognazzi, Massimiliano Bruno, Giampaolo Morelli, Maurizio Lastrico', null, 'The series follows the ups and downs of a clumsy and oafish group of friends: Moreno, Giuseppe and Claudio who are forced to go back in time to regain access to their finances and help Giuseppe find his biological mother.', 'The series follows the ups and downs of a clumsy and oafish group of friends: Moreno, Giuseppe and Claudio who are forced to go back in time to regain access to their finances and help Giuseppe find his biological mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbWboRaVKbrMmY7TwicixBBOJPp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240593'),
  ('159089622382418362', 'All''s Fair', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jon Robin Baitz, Joe Baken, Ryan Murphy', null, 'Kim Kardashian, Naomi Watts, Niecy Nash, Teyana Taylor, Matthew Noszka, Sarah Paulson, Glenn Close', 'TV-MA', 'A team of female divorce attorneys leave a male-dominated firm to open their own powerhouse practice. Fierce, brilliant, and emotionally complicated, they navigate high-stakes breakups, scandalous secrets, and shifting allegiances—both in the courtroom and within their own ranks. In a world where money talks and love is a battleground, these women don''t just play the game—they change it.', 'A team of female divorce attorneys leave a male-dominated firm to open their own powerhouse practice. Fierce, brilliant, and emotionally complicated, they navigate high-stakes breakups, scandalous secrets, and shifting allegiances—both in the courtroom and within their own ranks. In a world where money talks and love is a battleground, these women don''t just play the game—they change it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akJ3gusmlRGvKoFzLgJxsIBL4W4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258742'),
  ('733220374297369109', 'Allá te espero', 2013, 'Drama', 'Herney Luna', null, 'Carlos Benjumea, Mónica Gómez, Sebastián Martínez, Alejandra Borrero, Valentina Rendón, Adriana Silva, Yeimy Paola Vargas', null, 'A colombian big family moves from their country house into the city due to economical problems. The husband is obsessed with pursuing the american dream so he decides to enter the USA illegally, as his sister in law did, while leaving his wife and son in their country. He promises he will earn enought money so that they could be able to join him. However, things don''t work out as expected and the whole family becomes divided due to their opinions on the american dream.', 'A colombian big family moves from their country house into the city due to economical problems. The husband is obsessed with pursuing the american dream so he decides to enter the USA illegally, as his sister in law did, while leaving his wife and son in their country. He promises he will earn enought money so that they could be able to join him. However, things don''t work out as expected and the whole family becomes divided due to their opinions on the american dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IgBLcJMINO9KDKvNh4TBpaIG5R.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116562'),
  ('214922430434952230', 'Allegiance', 2015, 'Drama', 'George Nolfi', null, 'Hope Davis, Scott Cohen, Margarita Levieva, Gavin Stenhouse, Morgan Spector, Kenneth Choi, Alexandra Peters', 'TV-14', 'Alex O''Connor, a young idealistic CIA analyst specializing in Russian affairs, learns a shocking secret and his close-knit, affluent family is about to be split apart when it''s revealed that his parents, Mark and Katya, are covert Russian spies deactivated decades ago. But today the Kremlin has re-enlisted them into service as they plan a terrorist operation inside the U.S. border that will bring America to its knees.', 'Alex O''Connor, a young idealistic CIA analyst specializing in Russian affairs, learns a shocking secret and his close-knit, affluent family is about to be split apart when it''s revealed that his parents, Mark and Katya, are covert Russian spies deactivated decades ago. But today the Kremlin has re-enlisted them into service as they plan a terrorist operation inside the U.S. border that will bring America to its knees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3JebriAnBipohn5qtWuezuA0D6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61703'),
  ('245234783448545754', 'Allegiance', 2024, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Anar Ali', null, 'Supinder Wraich, Enrico Colantoni, Toby Levins', null, 'A star rookie police officer must grapple with the limits of the justice system as she fights to exonerate her politician father and serve her diverse hometown of Surrey.', 'A star rookie police officer must grapple with the limits of the justice system as she fights to exonerate her politician father and serve her diverse hometown of Surrey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1lNNxOTDoGkwhDU7UsPWrc2RNyg.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:240936'),
  ('947775537123081920', 'Allen Gregory', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Andrew Mogel, Jonah Hill, Jarrad Paul', null, 'Jonah Hill, French Stewart, Nat Faxon, Joy Osmanski, Cristina Pucelli, Will Forte', null, 'Allen Gregory is a short-lived American animated television series that aired on Fox from October 30 to December 18, 2011. The series was created by Jonah Hill, Andrew Mogel and Jarrad Paul. The series was officially cancelled by Fox on January 8, 2012.', 'Allen Gregory is a short-lived American animated television series that aired on Fox from October 30 to December 18, 2011. The series was created by Jonah Hill, Andrew Mogel and Jarrad Paul. The series was officially cancelled by Fox on January 8, 2012.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDDAUkgsGOM2ZubRsP03LBSRy3y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39299'),
  ('614205917155312793', 'Allen v. Farrow', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Kirby Dick, Amy Ziering, Amy Herdy', null, 'Dylan Farrow, Mia Farrow, Ronan Farrow, Woody Allen, Soon-Yi Previn', 'TV-MA', 'The story of one Hollywood''s most notorious and public scandals: the accusation of sexual abuse against Woody Allen involving Dylan, his then 7-year-old daughter with Mia Farrow; their subsequent custody trial, the revelation of Allen’s relationship with Farrow’s daughter, Soon-Yi; and the controversial aftermath in the years that followed.', 'The story of one Hollywood''s most notorious and public scandals: the accusation of sexual abuse against Woody Allen involving Dylan, his then 7-year-old daughter with Mia Farrow; their subsequent custody trial, the revelation of Allen’s relationship with Farrow’s daughter, Soon-Yi; and the controversial aftermath in the years that followed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXC3tk2apwPxDpFHQaQH5ATDhlP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118321'),
