  ('177532702337763727', 'Allison & Lillia', 2008, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, 'Keiichi Sigsawa', 'Mamiko Noto, Motoko Kumai, Koichi Yamadera, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Nana Mizuki, Houko Kuwashima', null, 'Allison and Will set out on a mission to discover the fabled "peace treasure" in a continent wrought with long-standing conflict between two kingdoms. Their belief and aspirations are carried on by their daughter, Lillia, who strives to bring the warring nations together as a united land. This animated show motivates young viewers to dream of a world that is rid of hostility and disputes brought on by differences in nationality or ideology.', 'Allison and Will set out on a mission to discover the fabled "peace treasure" in a continent wrought with long-standing conflict between two kingdoms. Their belief and aspirations are carried on by their daughter, Lillia, who strives to bring the warring nations together as a united land. This animated show motivates young viewers to dream of a world that is rid of hostility and disputes brought on by differences in nationality or ideology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4CKH6zn3AnuGZ6xKlgzF40nmSRC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35501'),
  ('1094202413837263314', 'Ally McBeal', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy', 'David E. Kelley', null, 'Calista Flockhart, Greg Germann, Jane Krakowski, Regina Hall, Peter MacNicol, Vonda Shepard, Portia De Rossi, Josh Hopkins', null, 'Ally McBeal is a young lawyer working at the Boston law firm Cage and Fish. Ally''s lives and loves are eccentric, humorous, dramatic with an incredibly overactive imagination that''s working overtime!', 'Ally McBeal is a young lawyer working at the Boston law firm Cage and Fish. Ally''s lives and loves are eccentric, humorous, dramatic with an incredibly overactive imagination that''s working overtime!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/weS8htxS2j0EQ6jorK3WOR1dZpH.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1480'),
  ('107963404277193350', 'Alma de Hierro', 2008, 'Drama', 'Adrián Suar', 'Araceli Guajardo, Adrián Suar, Ximena Suárez', 'Adrián Uribe, Angelique Boyer, Alejandro Camacho, Blanca Guerra, Jorge Poza, Martha Julia, Rafael Inclán, Adamari López', 'NR', 'Alma de Hierro is a 2008–2009 Mexican telenovela produced by Televisa. It is a remake of the Argentinian soap opera Son de Fierro, with the character''s names rewritten and adapted to the Mexican audience. The main actors were Blanca Guerra, Alejandro Camacho, Christian Vega, Flavio Medina, Lisardo and Alejandra Barros, with Jorge Poza, Zuria Vega, Adamari López, Angelique Boyer, Eddy Vilard, Martha Julia and Luz María Aguilar playing supporting roles. The show earned 8 awards at the "TV y Novelas" award celebration, becoming the highest-awarded production of the 2009 season.', 'Alma de Hierro is a 2008–2009 Mexican telenovela produced by Televisa. It is a remake of the Argentinian soap opera Son de Fierro, with the character''s names rewritten and adapted to the Mexican audience. The main actors were Blanca Guerra, Alejandro Camacho, Christian Vega, Flavio Medina, Lisardo and Alejandra Barros, with Jorge Poza, Zuria Vega, Adamari López, Angelique Boyer, Eddy Vilard, Martha Julia and Luz María Aguilar playing supporting roles. The show earned 8 awards at the "TV y Novelas" award celebration, becoming the highest-awarded production of the 2009 season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/po8W7l4QTEs8U9dTF4oW6iX7WBn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39045'),
  ('640758803444601117', 'Alma Gêmea', 2005, 'Soap, Drama, Comedy, Mystery', 'Walcyr Carrasco', 'Walcyr Carrasco, Thelma Guedes', 'Priscila Fantin, Eduardo Moscovis, Flávia Alessandra, Liliana Castro, Ana Lúcia Torre, Elizabeth Savalla, Walderez de Barros, Drica Moraes', null, 'A young woman is fated to relive the love of an earlier life. Separated by time, young Serena and botanist Rafael surmount all obstacles as they live a love that is stronger than fate itself. These challenges include the lovely but ambitious Cristina, who is obsessed by the rich botanist and driven nearly mad by her attempts to shatter their great love. A romantic comedy set in the 1940s, Soul Mate underscores the importance of love, family values and the ties of affection with a light touch and plenty of humor.', 'A young woman is fated to relive the love of an earlier life. Separated by time, young Serena and botanist Rafael surmount all obstacles as they live a love that is stronger than fate itself. These challenges include the lovely but ambitious Cristina, who is obsessed by the rich botanist and driven nearly mad by her attempts to shatter their great love. A romantic comedy set in the 1940s, Soul Mate underscores the importance of love, family values and the ties of affection with a light touch and plenty of humor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2HxNkrtEOgP4VEKzVBdBHHsnO6o.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16120'),
  ('534237998246018605', 'Alma Pirata', 2006, 'Soap, Drama', 'Cris Morena', 'Marcos Osorio Vidal, Renato D''Angelo', 'Mariano Martínez, Nicolás Vázquez, Luisana Lopilato, Benjamín Rojas, Elsa Pinilla, Fabián Mazzei, Isabel Macedo, Julia Calvo', 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ib6sQVbqcqzL0DiXTJdVYm4mq53.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70924'),
  ('258477315845453101', 'Alma Rebelde', 1999, 'Soap, Drama', 'Hilda Morales', null, 'Lisette Morelos, Eduardo Verástegui, Karla Álvarez, Ariel López Padilla, Arleth Terán, Ana Martín, Aracely Arámbula, Otto Sirgo', null, 'Alma Rebelde is a 1999 Mexican telenovela, starring Lisette Morelos, Eduardo Verástegui and the late Edgar Ponce. It was produced by Televisa. This telenovela contained 90 episodes.', 'Alma Rebelde is a 1999 Mexican telenovela, starring Lisette Morelos, Eduardo Verástegui and the late Edgar Ponce. It was produced by Televisa. This telenovela contained 90 episodes.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:31450'),
  ('617896603068502359', 'Alma-chan Wants to Be a Family!', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Hika Tsukishiro, Ryota Suzuki, Mao Ichimichi', null, 'She''s small. She''s sweet. She''s…capable of obliterating a tank in under three seconds?! Built by Enji and Suzume, two underappreciated genius scientists, Alma is the ultimate self-learning AI. There’s just one thing: She thinks they’re her mom and dad! Now as unexpected co-parents, the duo must hide their budding romantic feelings while taking on the messiest experiment of all: family life!', 'She''s small. She''s sweet. She''s…capable of obliterating a tank in under three seconds?! Built by Enji and Suzume, two underappreciated genius scientists, Alma is the ultimate self-learning AI. There’s just one thing: She thinks they’re her mom and dad! Now as unexpected co-parents, the duo must hide their budding romantic feelings while taking on the messiest experiment of all: family life!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n73fDZchQ1xdD6XWFuajHFjIWzi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:289217'),
  ('470721956605639970', 'Alma''s Not Normal', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Sophie Willan', 'Sophie Willan', 'Sophie Willan, Jayde Adams, Lorraine Ashbourne, Siobhan Finneran, Nicholas Asbury, Dave Jones', null, 'Big dreams, no qualifications and always herself. Mum’s been sectioned, Gran’s too busy, but after a messy break-up, wild child Alma aims to break free in Bolton.', 'Big dreams, no qualifications and always herself. Mum’s been sectioned, Gran’s too busy, but after a messy break-up, wild child Alma aims to break free in Bolton.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9EUlK8ZHZCKSC8TLi5bXocHwBzc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:106161'),
  ('270463214065042067', 'Almania', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Phil Laude', null, 'Phil Laude, Pegah Ferydoni, Zejhun Demirov, Dela Dabulamanzi, Ludger Pistor, Johannes Zeiler, Milton Welsh, Jansel Dogan', null, 'Shortly after taking on his new job as a teacher, Stimpel realizes this career is not as easy as he thought it would be. After having a bad start off with his students, Stimpels love life also changes.', 'Shortly after taking on his new job as a teacher, Stimpel realizes this career is not as easy as he thought it would be. After having a bad start off with his students, Stimpels love life also changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQ7hgbyS1PfnCgOTRJdzWRb9puS.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:121062'),
  ('1079372486695079056', 'Almost Family', 2019, 'Drama', 'Annie Weisman', null, 'Brittany Snow, Emily Osment, Megalyn Echikunwoke, Mustafa Elzein, Mo McRae, Timothy Hutton, Victoria Cartagena', 'TV-14', 'An only child finds her life turned upside down when her father reveals that, over the course of his prize-winning career as a pioneering fertility doctor, he used his own sperm to conceive upwards of a hundred children, including two new sisters.', 'An only child finds her life turned upside down when her father reveals that, over the course of his prize-winning career as a pioneering fertility doctor, he used his own sperm to conceive upwards of a hundred children, including two new sisters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKh0YP4g5AnUN177V7ak39kMlPe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89624'),
  ('1061294861891108093', 'Almost Happy', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Sebastián Wainraich, Hernán Guerschuny, Alejandro De Grazia', null, 'Natalie Pérez, Sebastián Wainraich, Santiago Korovsky', 'TV-MA', 'A locally famous radio host has to deal with his ex-wife, who he still loves, and his two children.', 'A locally famous radio host has to deal with his ex-wife, who he still loves, and his two children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gW79AtCCEXtvXyUmREMq0vv724H.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:102878'),
  ('890074093126685147', 'Almost Human', 2013, 'Drama, Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'J. H. Wyman', null, 'Karl Urban, Michael Ealy, Minka Kelly, Mackenzie Crook, Michael Irby, Lili Taylor', 'TV-14', 'The year is 2048. By mandate, every cop must partner with a robot. Detective John Kennex returns to work after waking up from a 17-month coma. As he adjusts to working with his new partner, Dorian, a discontinued android with unexpected emotional responses, John also must learn to get along with his new colleagues.', 'The year is 2048. By mandate, every cop must partner with a robot. Detective John Kennex returns to work after waking up from a 17-month coma. As he adjusts to working with his new partner, Dorian, a discontinued android with unexpected emotional responses, John also must learn to get along with his new colleagues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KNvabIPtsfR01H1bJwc1sobRUM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:51019'),
  ('226339767416664569', 'Almost Live!', 1984, 'Comedy', null, null, 'John Keister, Pat Cashman, Tracey Conway, Nancy Guppy, Ross Shafer, Bob Nelson, Bill Nye, Joel McHale', null, 'Almost Live! was a local sketch comedy television show in Seattle, Washington, USA, produced and broadcast by NBC affiliate KING-TV from 1984 to 1999. A re-packaged version of the show also aired on Comedy Central from 1992 to 1993, and episodes aired on WGRZ-TV in the late 1990s. The show was broadcast on Saturday nights at 11:30, pushing Saturday Night Live back to midnight. The show is now aired in reruns by the Seattle NBC affiliate following Saturday Night Live.', 'Almost Live! was a local sketch comedy television show in Seattle, Washington, USA, produced and broadcast by NBC affiliate KING-TV from 1984 to 1999. A re-packaged version of the show also aired on Comedy Central from 1992 to 1993, and episodes aired on WGRZ-TV in the late 1990s. The show was broadcast on Saturday nights at 11:30, pushing Saturday Night Live back to midnight. The show is now aired in reruns by the Seattle NBC affiliate following Saturday Night Live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mF1US0KO8oznRUEQnrSmJKL7WAh.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:4534'),
  ('746094092240730709', 'Almost Naked Animals', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Noah Z. Jones, Doug Hadders, Adam Rotstein', null, 'Rob Tinkler, Howard Jerome, Emilie-Claire Barlow, Seán Cullen, Linda Kash, David Berni, Alyson Court, Julie Lemieux', 'TV-Y7', 'Underwear-clad animals led by Howie the canine run the beachfront hotel Banana Cabana, leading to mayhem, destruction and tons of all-around fun.', 'Underwear-clad animals led by Howie the canine run the beachfront hotel Banana Cabana, leading to mayhem, destruction and tons of all-around fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2syDt8t57eCmAZH22nTDfBaGKT.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:35097'),
  ('671563074638527360', 'Almost Paradise', 2020, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Christian Kane, Samantha Richelle, Art Acuña, Nonie Buencamino', 'TV-14', 'A former DEA agent forced into early retirement runs a gift shop in in the Philippines. Despite his best efforts to begin a tranquil new life, he’s pulled back into a world of dangerous people and deadly situations, either through his friends in the local police department or running into people from his old life. And the problem is: he likes it.', 'A former DEA agent forced into early retirement runs a gift shop in in the Philippines. Despite his best efforts to begin a tranquil new life, he’s pulled back into a world of dangerous people and deadly situations, either through his friends in the local police department or running into people from his old life. And the problem is: he likes it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtmV4qF9ADKn8BQ1nHq3eTFjuaS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:100383'),
  ('902106920356066792', 'Almost Royal', 2014, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Ed Gamble, Amy Hoggart, Gemma Whelan', 'TV-PG', 'Almost Royal is a tale of two young British aristocrats on their first trip around the United States, interacting with real-life Americans. Currently 50th and 51st in line to the throne, siblings George and Poppy Carlton are the latest Brits on the scene.', 'Almost Royal is a tale of two young British aristocrats on their first trip around the United States, interacting with real-life Americans. Currently 50th and 51st in line to the throne, siblings George and Poppy Carlton are the latest Brits on the scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ltbfUeFYJNExzkEbHiWcBtpNq0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:60932'),
  ('1006946147812534682', 'Alone', 2015, 'Reality', null, null, 'Katie Rydge, Jit Patel, Nathan Olsen, Dug North, Douglas S. Meyer, Baha Mahmutov, Kelsey Loper, Will Lamb', 'TV-MA', 'Hardcore survivalists are put by themselves in the Vancouver Island wilderness, without camera crews, teams, or producers – on a single mission to stay alive for as long as possible.', 'Hardcore survivalists are put by themselves in the Vancouver Island wilderness, without camera crews, teams, or producers – on a single mission to stay alive for as long as possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1r1KLEYFP1u0q5kH4mHDQaOOvF.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:63726'),
  ('356852841954027851', 'Alone in Love', 2006, 'Drama', null, 'Park Yeon-seon', 'Son Ye-jin, Kam Woo-sung, Lee Ha-na, Lee Jin-uk, Kim Kap-soo, Oh Yoon-ah, Ki Joo-bong, Gong Hyung-jin', null, 'Alone in Love is a 2006 South Korea television series, starring Gam Wu-seong, Son Ye-jin, Gong Hyung-jin and Lee Ha-na. It aired on SBS from April 3 to May 23, 2006 on Mondays and Tuesdays at 21:55 for 16 episodes. The ratings it received were not very high, but the series won acclaim for its subtle and realistic portrayal of love, marriage and divorce. The story follows Eun-ho and Dong-jin, two ordinary people - not particularly attractive or successful - as they come to terms with their relationship. Although already divorced for three years, they are unable to leave each other alone, persistently meeting, bickering, and offering support, comfort, even matchmaking for the other. The two seem destined to be together, but they are unwilling to face their past and confront the tragedy they have spent years trying to forget. It was based on the Japanese novel Love Generation by Hisashi Nozawa, which was published in 1996 and won the 4th Shimase Literary Prize for Romance in 1997. The Korean adaptation was written by Park Yeon-seon. This was the first TV series directed by film director Han Ji-seung.', 'Alone in Love is a 2006 South Korea television series, starring Gam Wu-seong, Son Ye-jin, Gong Hyung-jin and Lee Ha-na. It aired on SBS from April 3 to May 23, 2006 on Mondays and Tuesdays at 21:55 for 16 episodes. The ratings it received were not very high, but the series won acclaim for its subtle and realistic portrayal of love, marriage and divorce. The story follows Eun-ho and Dong-jin, two ordinary people - not particularly attractive or successful - as they come to terms with their relationship. Although already divorced for three years, they are unable to leave each other alone, persistently meeting, bickering, and offering support, comfort, even matchmaking for the other. The two seem destined to be together, but they are unwilling to face their past and confront the tragedy they have spent years trying to forget. It was based on the Japanese novel Love Generation by Hisashi Nozawa, which was published in 1996 and won the 4th Shimase Literary Prize for Romance in 1997. The Korean adaptation was written by Park Yeon-seon. This was the first TV series directed by film director Han Ji-seung.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8biLlOTS6egL8UxPcKDej2MwK3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2173'),
  ('852837941532355195', 'Alone Together', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Benji Aflalo, Esther Povitsky, Eben Russell', null, 'Benji Aflalo, Esther Povitsky', 'TV-14', 'Esther and Benji are platonic best friends who want nothing more than to be accepted by the vain and status-obsessed culture of Los Angeles. Despite their sometimes contentious relationship, when push comes to shove, they’ve got each other’s back … And they have nobody else to hang out with.', 'Esther and Benji are platonic best friends who want nothing more than to be accepted by the vain and status-obsessed culture of Los Angeles. Despite their sometimes contentious relationship, when push comes to shove, they’ve got each other’s back … And they have nobody else to hang out with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7aC2jYL9brQlasj67TV1DxQL4Q.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:71884'),
  ('418304487190208359', 'Alparslan: The Great Seljuks', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, War & Politics', 'Sedat İnci', 'Ayça Mutlugil', 'Barış Arduç, Fahriye Evcen, Mehmet Özgür, Sarp Levendoğlu, Gizem Karaca, Erdinç Gülener, Barış Bağcı, Yurdaer Okur', null, 'It deals with the state structure, political events, wars of the Great Seljuk Empire and the life of Sultan Alparslan.', 'It deals with the state structure, political events, wars of the Great Seljuk Empire and the life of Sultan Alparslan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wKqK8T1wTdhXfhnZzz2TuJE2Zh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:138171'),
