  ('1027579688388956741', 'American Chopper: Senior vs Junior', 2010, 'Reality', null, null, 'Paul Teutul, Jr., Mike Rowe, Michael Teutul, Vincent DiMartino, Jason Pohl, Paul Teutul, Sr.', null, 'It''s make it or break it time for each of the Teutul men as they head off in separate directions after a bruising family breakup. Who will come out on top as Orange County Choppers (OCC) and Paul JR Designs start cranking out competing bikes?', 'It''s make it or break it time for each of the Teutul men as they head off in separate directions after a bruising family breakup. Who will come out on top as Orange County Choppers (OCC) and Paul JR Designs start cranking out competing bikes?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7gv5aY8bLzFi2m7t1F7VZHlnfOk.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:33481'),
  ('144972531027456786', 'American Classic', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Michael Hoffman, Bob Martin', null, 'Kevin Kline, Jon Tenney, Laura Linney, Len Cariou, Jane Alexander, Jessica Hecht, Nell Verlaque, Billy Carter', null, 'Exiled Broadway star Richard Bean returns to his family''s small-town theater, igniting hope and chaos in his wake. As old loves resurface and buried secrets emerge Richard and the town are transformed by the power of making art.', 'Exiled Broadway star Richard Bean returns to his family''s small-town theater, igniting hope and chaos in his wake. As old loves resurface and buried secrets emerge Richard and the town are transformed by the power of making art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQoTcFVB9xO6tLnoSARRViitPQF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283228'),
  ('220964657520361222', 'American Conspiracy: The Octopus Murders', 2024, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Christian Hansen, Tony Casolaro, Michael Riconosciuto, Bobby Moses Nichols, Zachary Treitz, Cheri Seymour, John Powers, Charles Work', 'TV-MA', 'An investigative journalist pursuing a political conspiracy known as the Octopus is found dead in his hotel room. Decades later, new details emerge.', 'An investigative journalist pursuing a political conspiracy known as the Octopus is found dead in his hotel room. Decades later, new details emerge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lrcJuD9HPu5ZVcZaLk9cB0xufi5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244616'),
  ('479885199654334464', 'American Crime', 2015, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'John Ridley', null, 'Felicity Huffman, Timothy Hutton, Lili Taylor, Connor Jessup, Richard Cabral, Benito Martinez, Regina King', 'TV-14', 'An anthology drama focusing on all aspects of the U.S. criminal justice system dealing with crimes committed in America.', 'An anthology drama focusing on all aspects of the U.S. criminal justice system dealing with crimes committed in America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7L0DPc1HB4rPA2ZidnE2la7Pqt0.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:60791'),
  ('728839568927077750', 'American Crime Story', 2016, 'Crime, Drama', 'Scott Alexander, Larry Karaszewski, Tom Rob Smith', 'Hayley Byrnes', 'Sarah Paulson, Beanie Feldstein, Annaleigh Ashford, Margo Martindale, Edie Falco, Clive Owen', 'TV-MA', 'An anthology series centered around some of history''s most famous criminal investigations.', 'An anthology series centered around some of history''s most famous criminal investigations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtIS3Qk8ny1FWQLiuJ77MTDX5bZ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:64513'),
  ('566169471434859502', 'American Dad!', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Seth MacFarlane, Matt Weitzman, Mike Barker', null, 'Seth MacFarlane, Wendy Schaal, Rachael MacFarlane, Scott Grimes, Dee Bradley Baker', 'TV-14', 'The series focuses on an eccentric motley crew that is the Smith family and their three housemates: Father, husband, and breadwinner Stan Smith; his better half housewife, Francine Smith; their college-aged daughter, Hayley Smith; and their high-school-aged son, Steve Smith. Outside of the Smith family, there are three additional main characters, including Hayley''s boyfriend turned husband, Jeff Fischer; the family''s man-in-a-goldfish-body pet, Klaus; and most notably the family''s zany alien, Roger, who is "full of masquerades, brazenness, and shocking antics."', 'The series focuses on an eccentric motley crew that is the Smith family and their three housemates: Father, husband, and breadwinner Stan Smith; his better half housewife, Francine Smith; their college-aged daughter, Hayley Smith; and their high-school-aged son, Steve Smith. Outside of the Smith family, there are three additional main characters, including Hayley''s boyfriend turned husband, Jeff Fischer; the family''s man-in-a-goldfish-body pet, Klaus; and most notably the family''s zany alien, Roger, who is "full of masquerades, brazenness, and shocking antics."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eb9sH2am9IUSQ8GhXTNAVoujk8W.jpg', 22, 'tmdb:tv:1433'),
  ('296540277004634621', 'American Dragon: Jake Long', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Family, Kids', 'Jeff Goode', null, 'Dante Basco, Keone Young, John DiMaggio, kittie KaBoom, Charlie Finn, Mae Whitman, Paul Rugg, Amy Bruckner', 'TV-G', 'American Dragon is a coming of age comedy-action series about Jake Long, a 13-year-old Asian-American boy who strives to find balance in his life as a skateboard-grinding, New York ''tween while learning to master his mystical powers (in his secret identity) as the American Dragon, the protector and guardian of all magical creatures secretly living amidst the human world.', 'American Dragon is a coming of age comedy-action series about Jake Long, a 13-year-old Asian-American boy who strives to find balance in his life as a skateboard-grinding, New York ''tween while learning to master his mystical powers (in his secret identity) as the American Dragon, the protector and guardian of all magical creatures secretly living amidst the human world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntsNm1IiARWtUgNY9SI7VRCLOVD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:346'),
  ('233585873088290987', 'American Dreams', 2002, 'Drama, Family', 'Jonathan Prince', null, 'Gail O''Grady, Tom Verica, Brittany Snow, Will Estes, Jonathan Adams, Vanessa Lengies, Arlen Escarpeta, Sarah Ramos', 'TV-PG', 'Set to the soundtrack of the 1960s, a Philadelphia family moves toward the cultural upheaval in the years ahead. The Pryors'' teen daughter Meg tries to shed her ''good girl'' image by hanging with her worldly friend Roxanne and pursuing a dream of being an American Bandstand dancer. Meg''s emerging personality, and the changes her mother''s going through, don''t sit well with Father.', 'Set to the soundtrack of the 1960s, a Philadelphia family moves toward the cultural upheaval in the years ahead. The Pryors'' teen daughter Meg tries to shed her ''good girl'' image by hanging with her worldly friend Roxanne and pursuing a dream of being an American Bandstand dancer. Meg''s emerging personality, and the changes her mother''s going through, don''t sit well with Father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pr3WcVn1i7mKwae84MCOW0vpLYc.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:3400'),
  ('159467089369459293', 'American Experience', 1988, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'TV''s most-watched history series brings to life the compelling stories from our past that inform our understanding of the world today.', 'TV''s most-watched history series brings to life the compelling stories from our past that inform our understanding of the world today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/YkcFBVYG6jvvHBRL1BxraAcOxh.jpg', 38, 'tmdb:tv:1181'),
  ('343251209719031115', 'American Genius', 2015, 'Documentary', null, 'Chelsea Coates, Jonathan Grupper, Nick Greene', 'Jeff Wilburn', 'NR', 'Behind every great genius was a great rival - an unstoppable adversary whose incredible vision, determination, and ambition is their match. Out of their struggles came the world''s most brilliant inventions, the spoils of the heated battle between competitors.', 'Behind every great genius was a great rival - an unstoppable adversary whose incredible vision, determination, and ambition is their match. Out of their struggles came the world''s most brilliant inventions, the spoils of the heated battle between competitors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dd1WH5p7K8SW5whYyLtDaIEK0d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62795'),
  ('1122545539394052241', 'American Gigolo', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'David Hollander', null, 'Jon Bernthal, Gretchen Mol, Lizzie Brocheré, Gabriel LaBelle, Leland Orser, Rosie O''Donnell', 'TV-MA', 'Julian Kaye has always been an object of desire, so much so that people are willing to destroy him in order to have him. Exonerated, after 15 years in prison for a murder he didn’t commit, he now faces the challenge of picking up the pieces as the detective who put him behind bars tries to unravel the mystery that led to his wrongful incarceration.', 'Julian Kaye has always been an object of desire, so much so that people are willing to destroy him in order to have him. Exonerated, after 15 years in prison for a murder he didn’t commit, he now faces the challenge of picking up the pieces as the detective who put him behind bars tries to unravel the mystery that led to his wrongful incarceration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0nRFOLYUju4XHG7v2jZZf3n6vs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127585'),
  ('688195541643412250', 'American Gladiators', 1988, 'Reality', 'Dan Carr, Johnny C. Ferraro', null, 'Mike Adamle', 'TV-PG', 'American Gladiators is an American competition television program that aired weekly in syndication from September 1989 to May 1996. The series matched a cast of amateur athletes against each other, as well as against the show''s own gladiators, in contests of strength and agility. The concept was created by Dan Carr and John C. Ferraro, who held the original competition at Erie Tech High School in Erie, Pennsylvania. They sold the show to The Samuel Goldwyn Company where the concept was enhanced and became American Gladiators. An effort in 2004 to launch a live American Gladiators show on the Las Vegas Strip became mired in a securities fraud prosecution. However, the television series was restarted in 2008. Episodes from the original series were played on ESPN Classic from 2007 to 2009. Several episodes are available for download on Apple''s iTunes Service.', 'American Gladiators is an American competition television program that aired weekly in syndication from September 1989 to May 1996. The series matched a cast of amateur athletes against each other, as well as against the show''s own gladiators, in contests of strength and agility. The concept was created by Dan Carr and John C. Ferraro, who held the original competition at Erie Tech High School in Erie, Pennsylvania. They sold the show to The Samuel Goldwyn Company where the concept was enhanced and became American Gladiators. An effort in 2004 to launch a live American Gladiators show on the Las Vegas Strip became mired in a securities fraud prosecution. However, the television series was restarted in 2008. Episodes from the original series were played on ESPN Classic from 2007 to 2009. Several episodes are available for download on Apple''s iTunes Service.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFWYHXAXrVl1AD9WLOcl7ip3r3Y.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:6582'),
  ('375089955055403280', 'American Gladiators', 2008, 'Reality', null, null, 'Hulk Hogan, Mike O''Hearn, Matt Morgan, Jamie Kovac, Erin Toughill, Gina Carano, Tanoai Reed, Robin Coleman', null, 'American Gladiators is an American competition TV show that aired on NBC and Citytv in Canada. Hosted by Hulk Hogan and Laila Ali, the show matches amateur athletes against each other and the show''s own "gladiators" in contests of strength, agility, and endurance. It is a remake of the original series of the same name which ran from 1989–1996, with elements of the UK version of the 1990s. The show is refereed by Al Kaplon, a former American League umpire, who can also be seen as the referee in Dodgeball: A True Underdog Story. Play-by-play narration is handled by Van Earl Wright. Season 1 was taped at Sony Pictures Studios in Culver City, California. Beginning with Season 2, the show moved to the Los Angeles Sports Arena. It is produced by Reveille Productions and MGM Television. American Gladiators premiered on Sunday, January 6, 2008; an average of 12 million people watched the two-hour premiere. All other Season 1 episodes aired Mondays at 8:00 ET/PT, except for the finale, which aired Sunday February 17, 2008 at 7:00 ET/PT. Season 2 premiered May 12, 2008, on NBC, with a two-hour episode. The two-hour Season 2 finale aired on August 4, 2008 at 8:00 ET/PT. While the final two-hour episode of Season 1 was devoted entirely to the finals, the Season 2 finale consisted of the third semifinal round followed by the finals.', 'American Gladiators is an American competition TV show that aired on NBC and Citytv in Canada. Hosted by Hulk Hogan and Laila Ali, the show matches amateur athletes against each other and the show''s own "gladiators" in contests of strength, agility, and endurance. It is a remake of the original series of the same name which ran from 1989–1996, with elements of the UK version of the 1990s. The show is refereed by Al Kaplon, a former American League umpire, who can also be seen as the referee in Dodgeball: A True Underdog Story. Play-by-play narration is handled by Van Earl Wright. Season 1 was taped at Sony Pictures Studios in Culver City, California. Beginning with Season 2, the show moved to the Los Angeles Sports Arena. It is produced by Reveille Productions and MGM Television. American Gladiators premiered on Sunday, January 6, 2008; an average of 12 million people watched the two-hour premiere. All other Season 1 episodes aired Mondays at 8:00 ET/PT, except for the finale, which aired Sunday February 17, 2008 at 7:00 ET/PT. Season 2 premiered May 12, 2008, on NBC, with a two-hour episode. The two-hour Season 2 finale aired on August 4, 2008 at 8:00 ET/PT. While the final two-hour episode of Season 1 was devoted entirely to the finals, the Season 2 finale consisted of the third semifinal round followed by the finals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kX5cVF9BCrnlwSD4nrHt62vfX7v.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:14432'),
  ('171520148322571108', 'American Gladiators', 2026, 'Reality', null, null, 'Mike Mizanin, Eric Bugenhagen, Jessie Godderz, Michael Wardlow', null, 'A cast of amateur athletes are pitted against each other as well as the shows’ own gladiators across a range of challenges including a tough obstacle course.', 'A cast of amateur athletes are pitted against each other as well as the shows’ own gladiators across a range of challenges including a tough obstacle course.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOHcFrq4wbMZXgwHij2UiZnG6Xp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:256092'),
  ('727669947983980043', 'American Gods', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Bryan Fuller, Michael Green', null, 'Ricky Whittle, Ian McShane, Emily Browning, Yetide Badaki, Bruce Langley', 'TV-MA', 'An ex-con becomes the traveling partner of a conman who turns out to be one of the older gods trying to recruit troops to battle the upstart deities. Based on Neil Gaiman''s fantasy novel.', 'An ex-con becomes the traveling partner of a conman who turns out to be one of the older gods trying to recruit troops to battle the upstart deities. Based on Neil Gaiman''s fantasy novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KCAZaKHmoMIN9dHutqaMtubQqD.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:46639'),
  ('246162561911714450', 'American Gothic', 1995, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Crime', 'Shaun Cassidy', null, 'Gary Cole, Lucas Black, Paige Turco, Brenda Bakke, Sarah Paulson, Nick Searcy, Jake Weber, John Mese', 'TV-PG', 'Everything is not what it seems in Trinity, South Carolina. Sheriff Lucas Buck develops a sinister interest in Caleb. Caleb''s cousin Gail tries to protect him, but that''s complicated since she has feelings for Sheriff Buck. And Caleb''s dead sister, Merlyn, returns as an angel, warning him that Buck is an incarnation of evil - and may not be human.', 'Everything is not what it seems in Trinity, South Carolina. Sheriff Lucas Buck develops a sinister interest in Caleb. Caleb''s cousin Gail tries to protect him, but that''s complicated since she has feelings for Sheriff Buck. And Caleb''s dead sister, Merlyn, returns as an angel, warning him that Buck is an incarnation of evil - and may not be human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qajOMTtQ958JEpmokPXTruwA9qp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318'),
  ('1001485072649372484', 'American Gothic', 2016, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Corinne Brinkerhoff', null, 'Juliet Rylance, Antony Starr, Virginia Madsen, Justin Chatwin, Megan Ketch, Elliot Knight, Stephanie Leonidas, Gabriel Bateman', 'TV-14', 'A prominent Boston family attempts to redefine itself in the wake of a chilling discovery that links their recently deceased patriarch to a string of murders spanning decades — amid the mounting suspicion that one of them may have been his accomplice.', 'A prominent Boston family attempts to redefine itself in the wake of a chilling discovery that links their recently deceased patriarch to a string of murders spanning decades — amid the mounting suspicion that one of them may have been his accomplice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wy9hxKxvsuQi4WKYbqMtDy9qf5m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64550'),
  ('32135975037929331', 'American Greed', 2007, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Stacy Keach', 'TV-PG', 'A dissection of the dark side of the American Dream, a survey of how far some people go to become rich, no matter the cost to themselves and those around them. Real-life cases are reviewed and involve such criminal activity as credit card scams, identity theft, counterfeiting and Ponzi schemes.', 'A dissection of the dark side of the American Dream, a survey of how far some people go to become rich, no matter the cost to themselves and those around them. Real-life cases are reviewed and involve such criminal activity as credit card scams, identity theft, counterfeiting and Ponzi schemes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bilmBb9Q4sLesr1gdMknSGfQQ7H.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:21572'),
  ('848324134507521711', 'American Grit', 2016, 'Reality', null, null, 'John Cena', 'TV-14', 'American Grit contestants will be mentored by "The Cadre," made up of military members who, along with Cena, will push their civilian charges throughout the competition. The Cadre consists of: Navy Seal trainer, Rorke Denver; Purple Heart recipient, U.S. Army veteran Noah Galloway; Veteran U.S. Marine Gunnery Sergeant, Tawanda “Tee” Hanible; and U.S. Army Ranger sniper, Nick “The Reaper” Irving.', 'American Grit contestants will be mentored by "The Cadre," made up of military members who, along with Cena, will push their civilian charges throughout the competition. The Cadre consists of: Navy Seal trainer, Rorke Denver; Purple Heart recipient, U.S. Army veteran Noah Galloway; Veteran U.S. Marine Gunnery Sergeant, Tawanda “Tee” Hanible; and U.S. Army Ranger sniper, Nick “The Reaper” Irving.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVuCLgIgP2vhzXBkAKHI3iQfHVy.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66247'),
  ('663478543689940782', 'American Horror Stories', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ryan Murphy, Brad Falchuk', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'An anthology series of stand alone episodes delving into horror myths, legends and lore.', 'An anthology series of stand alone episodes delving into horror myths, legends and lore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8b9FGJ9WhpkeGFOHYgKjPT5AXS6.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:113036'),
  ('591528020617003578', 'American Horror Story', 2011, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ryan Murphy, Brad Falchuk', null, 'Emma Roberts, Matt Czuchry, Kim Kardashian, Annabelle Dexter-Jones, Michaela Jaé Rodriguez, Denis O''Hare, Cara Delevingne, Julie White', 'TV-MA', 'An anthology horror drama series centering on different characters and locations, including a house with a murderous past, an asylum, a witch coven, a freak show, a hotel, a farmhouse in Roanoke, a cult, the apocalypse and a summer camp.', 'An anthology horror drama series centering on different characters and locations, including a house with a murderous past, an asylum, a witch coven, a freak show, a hotel, a farmhouse in Roanoke, a cult, the apocalypse and a summer camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2c3AvZeTyNehRZXabTojAxfDuR.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:1413'),
