  ('557629006539226487', 'American Music Awards', 1974, 'Talk', null, null, null, null, 'An annual American music awards show. Unlike the Grammys, which are awarded on the basis of votes by members of the Recording Academy, the AMAs are determined by a poll of the public and music buyers.', 'An annual American music awards show. Unlike the Grammys, which are awarded on the basis of votes by members of the Recording Academy, the AMAs are determined by a poll of the public and music buyers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMfGSoq6otbyu7orszqAH4s9TQU.jpg', 52, 'tmdb:tv:16730'),
  ('1017243059488196390', 'American Nightmare', 2024, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, 'Aaron Quinn, Denise Huskins', 'TV-MA', 'After a harrowing home invasion and kidnapping in 2015, a couple is accused of staging the ordeal when the woman reappears, haunting the couple with a new series of tortures.', 'After a harrowing home invasion and kidnapping in 2015, a couple is accused of staging the ordeal when the woman reappears, haunting the couple with a new series of tortures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7dQEXvqzNxm3sFY3VV7PqKeHzB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:242845'),
  ('849809593737721489', 'American Ninja Warrior', 2009, 'Reality', null, null, 'Matt Iseman, Akbar Gbaja-Biamila', 'TV-PG', 'Follow competitors as they tackle a series of challenging obstacle courses in both city qualifying and city finals rounds across the country. Those that successfully complete the finals course in their designated region move on to the national finals round in Las Vegas, where they face a stunning four-stage course modeled after the famed Mt. Midoriyama course in Japan. The winner will take home a grand prize of $1 million.', 'Follow competitors as they tackle a series of challenging obstacle courses in both city qualifying and city finals rounds across the country. Those that successfully complete the finals course in their designated region move on to the national finals round in Las Vegas, where they face a stunning four-stage course modeled after the famed Mt. Midoriyama course in Japan. The winner will take home a grand prize of $1 million.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iAL6JYSfMp3v009qbQCyMwiGl2g.jpg', 18, 'tmdb:tv:37913'),
  ('722684487114223284', 'American Ninja Warrior Junior', 2018, 'Family, Kids', 'Ushio Higuchi', null, 'Matt Iseman, Akbar Gbaja-Biamila, Laurie Hernandez', null, 'The next generation of "American Ninja Warrior" begins, as some of the show''s biggest fans now get an opportunity to compete for the chance to be named American Ninja Warrior junior champion.', 'The next generation of "American Ninja Warrior" begins, as some of the show''s biggest fans now get an opportunity to compete for the chance to be named American Ninja Warrior junior champion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iLQKVYuoOFGWIHTNUMZvMJY99Q2.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:91390'),
  ('302366949034531873', 'American Odyssey', 2015, 'Drama', 'Adam Armus, Peter Horton, Nora Kay Foster', null, 'Anna Friel, Peter Facinelli, Jake Robinson, Jim True-Frost, Sadie Sink, Omar Ghazaoui, Nate Mooney, Elena Kampouris', null, 'In this "Traffic"-like action drama, an international conspiracy explodes when three strangers'' lives unexpectedly collide - a female soldier, a corporate lawyer and a political activist.', 'In this "Traffic"-like action drama, an international conspiracy explodes when three strangers'' lives unexpectedly collide - a female soldier, a corporate lawyer and a political activist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCkrtf8QWK09Udnnso6mqnIKniz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61702'),
  ('815457491312101579', 'American Pickers', 2010, 'Reality', 'Mike Wolfe', null, 'Mike Wolfe, Danielle Colby-Cushman', 'TV-14', 'Pickers like Mike Wolfe and Frank Fritz are on a mission to recycle America, even if it means diving into countless piles of grimy junk or getting chased off a gun-wielding homeowner’s land. Hitting back roads from coast to coast, the two men earn a living by restoring forgotten relics to their former glory, transforming one person’s trash into another’s treasure.', 'Pickers like Mike Wolfe and Frank Fritz are on a mission to recycle America, even if it means diving into countless piles of grimy junk or getting chased off a gun-wielding homeowner’s land. Hitting back roads from coast to coast, the two men earn a living by restoring forgotten relics to their former glory, transforming one person’s trash into another’s treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obWweSxU8XrAtCqteHLasV8ktmD.jpg', 23, 'tmdb:tv:32025'),
  ('103915337736771757', 'American Playboy: The Hugh Hefner Story', 2017, 'Documentary, Drama', null, null, 'Hugh Hefner, Matt Whelan, Shara Connolly, Joy Buckle, Adam Jonas Segaller, Ella Becroft, Laura Thompson, Ian Bell', 'TV-MA', 'A fascinating docuseries chronicling Playboy magazine’s charismatic founder, Hugh Hefner, and his impact on global culture. Told from his unique perspective with never-before-seen footage from his private archive, discover the captivating story about the man behind the bunny.', 'A fascinating docuseries chronicling Playboy magazine’s charismatic founder, Hugh Hefner, and his impact on global culture. Told from his unique perspective with never-before-seen footage from his private archive, discover the captivating story about the man behind the bunny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4SnAInc7QqEHn95ENMnoWNS12T.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70445'),
  ('439645700032508209', 'American Primeval', 2025, 'Western, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Mark L. Smith', null, 'Taylor Kitsch, Betty Gilpin, Dane DeHaan, Saura Lightfoot Leon, Derek Hinkey, Joe Tippett, Jai Courtney, Preston Mota', 'TV-MA', 'A mother and son fleeing from their past form a found family while confronting a harsh landscape of freedom and cruelty in the American West.', 'A mother and son fleeing from their past form a found family while confronting a harsh landscape of freedom and cruelty in the American West.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ff0s9OHGNSZL6cVteIb7LNvTnJD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215866'),
  ('570253676746426848', 'American Princess', 2019, 'Drama', 'Jamie Denbo', null, 'Georgia Flood, Lucas Neff, Seana Kofoed, Rory O''Malley, Mary Hollis Inboden, Lucas Hazlett, Erin Pineda', 'TV-14', 'When she discovers her fiance is cheating on her hours before their wedding, Manhattan socialite Amanda runs off to join a Renaissance fair as the latest wench-in-training.', 'When she discovers her fiance is cheating on her hours before their wedding, Manhattan socialite Amanda runs off to join a Renaissance fair as the latest wench-in-training.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RCOoqHvUF4KX1j2qjg3EE1geLd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79829'),
  ('437138566971775987', 'American Restoration', 2010, 'Reality', null, null, 'Rick Dale', 'TV-PG', 'American Restoration is an American reality television series airing on the History channel. Produced by Leftfield Pictures, the series is recorded in Las Vegas, Nevada, where it chronicles the daily activities at Rick''s Restorations, an antique restoration shop, with its owner Rick Dale, his staff, and teenage son, as they restore various vintage items to their original condition.', 'American Restoration is an American reality television series airing on the History channel. Produced by Leftfield Pictures, the series is recorded in Las Vegas, Nevada, where it chronicles the daily activities at Rick''s Restorations, an antique restoration shop, with its owner Rick Dale, his staff, and teenage son, as they restore various vintage items to their original condition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XN4w0a1CLbwcdAiRzCy8wAnS6s.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:34015'),
  ('703622197778756890', 'American Ripper', 2017, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Jeff Mudgett, Conor Hall', 'TV-14', 'American serial killer H.H. Holmes has a dark legacy. Now, through his grandson''s research, it may be that Holmes and Jack the Ripper are one in the same.', 'American serial killer H.H. Holmes has a dark legacy. Now, through his grandson''s research, it may be that Holmes and Jack the Ripper are one in the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXB0J9A1BQLcTNKOSqs2rbyy4jh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72813'),
  ('24864623916397533', 'American Rust', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Dan Futterman, Philipp Meyer', null, 'Jeff Daniels, Maura Tierney, David Alvarez, Alex Neustaedter, Julia Mayorga, Bill Camp', 'TV-MA', 'A compelling family drama and a timeless story told through the eyes of complicated and compromised chief of police Del Harris of a Pennsylvania Rust Belt town full of good people making bad choices.', 'A compelling family drama and a timeless story told through the eyes of complicated and compromised chief of police Del Harris of a Pennsylvania Rust Belt town full of good people making bad choices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYtFBWV6KzDg5t1NgthsxvNnFPt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:91746'),
