  ('65726517087347669', 'American Woman', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'John Riggi', null, 'Alicia Silverstone, Mena Suvari, Jennifer Bartels, Makenna James, Lia McHugh', 'TV-14', 'This 1970s period dramedy inspired by the real life Kyle Richards and set amid the sexual revolution and the rise of second-wave feminism follows Bonnie, an unconventional mother struggling to raise her two daughters after leaving her husband. With the help of her two best friends, Kathleen and Diana, these three women will each discover their own brand of independence in a world reluctant to give it.', 'This 1970s period dramedy inspired by the real life Kyle Richards and set amid the sexual revolution and the rise of second-wave feminism follows Bonnie, an unconventional mother struggling to raise her two daughters after leaving her husband. With the help of her two best friends, Kathleen and Diana, these three women will each discover their own brand of independence in a world reluctant to give it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LV9CuqKMOU49j4MllVuQMMepfo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71148'),
  ('184128487324391992', 'Amerika', 1987, 'Drama', null, 'Donald Wrye', 'Lara Flynn Boyle, Kris Kristofferson, Robert Urich, Sam Neill, Wendy Hughes, Cindy Pickett, Armin Mueller-Stahl, Richard Bradford', 'NR', 'Amerika is a miniseries about life in the United States, ten years after a bloodless takeover engineered by the Soviet Union.', 'Amerika is a miniseries about life in the United States, ten years after a bloodless takeover engineered by the Soviet Union.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDGXITdBaXbLSviaRF0edaelbO9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9115'),
  ('996120864205212558', 'Amici di Maria De Filippi', 2001, 'Reality', 'Maria De Filippi', null, 'Maria De Filippi, Rudy Zerbi, Lorella Cuccarini, Anna Pettinelli, Alessandra Celentano, Veronica Peparini, Emanuel Lo, Valentina Pesaresi', 'NR', 'Amici di Maria De Filippi is an Italian talent show hosted by Maria De Filippi. Amici is a singing and dancing school involving a class of about 20 students, specially chosen, with between 18 and 25 who aspire to become professional singers, songwriters and dancers. Additional original categories of "actors", "musicians" and "TV presenters" have since been dropped in the recent seasons.', 'Amici di Maria De Filippi is an Italian talent show hosted by Maria De Filippi. Amici is a singing and dancing school involving a class of about 20 students, specially chosen, with between 18 and 25 who aspire to become professional singers, songwriters and dancers. Additional original categories of "actors", "musicians" and "TV presenters" have since been dropped in the recent seasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHFOlO0lB8WeyuPS2i5V7ZbCfhB.jpg', 25, 'tmdb:tv:32678'),
  ('487880338659255415', 'Amidst a Snowstorm of Love', 2024, 'Drama', 'Mobao Feibao', null, 'Leo Wu, Zhao Jinmai, Wang Xingyue, Ding Xiaoying, Dong Zifan, Wang Jiaxuan, Han Donglin, Wang Runze', null, 'As a professional billiards player, Yin Guo has become quite a notable athlete. After receiving an invitation to play in a tournament in Hel, Yin Guo eagerly accepts. Little does she know that meeting former professional billiards player, Lin Yiyang, in Hel will change her life forever.', 'As a professional billiards player, Yin Guo has become quite a notable athlete. After receiving an invitation to play in a tournament in Hel, Yin Guo eagerly accepts. Little does she know that meeting former professional billiards player, Lin Yiyang, in Hel will change her life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1v5ABzgSMlVJG2acb6S6JAkEM2S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221112'),
  ('565006931349632555', 'Amigas y rivales', 2001, 'Drama', 'Emilio Larrosa', 'Alejandro Pohlenz', 'Michelle Vieth, Arath de la Torre, Ludwika Paleta, Rodrigo Vidal, Angélica Vale, Johnny Lozada, Adamari López, Gabriel Soto', 'TV-PG', 'Amigas y rivales is a Mexican telenovela, which was produced by and broadcast on Televisa in 2001.', 'Amigas y rivales is a Mexican telenovela, which was produced by and broadcast on Televisa in 2001.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1ufpjYSfQ0yqf860oXmlIaFS1M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12861'),
