  ('105097749067809355', 'Anthony Bourdain: No Reservations', 2005, 'Documentary, Talk, Reality', null, 'Anthony Bourdain', 'Anthony Bourdain', 'TV-PG', 'Anthony Bourdain uncovers the best cuisine across the world. At each location, Tony dives headfirst into life''s colorful and rich pageant, bringing his intellectual curiosity, empathy, wit and boundless appetite.', 'Anthony Bourdain uncovers the best cuisine across the world. At each location, Tony dives headfirst into life''s colorful and rich pageant, bringing his intellectual curiosity, empathy, wit and boundless appetite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97ZIHh3HfiiS0KNrScRRhxOVzPg.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:4533'),
  ('500589539733378695', 'Anthony Bourdain: Parts Unknown', 2013, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Anthony Bourdain', 'TV-PG', 'Bourdain travels across the globe to uncover little-known areas of the world and celebrate diverse cultures by exploring food and dining rituals. Known for his curiosity, candor, and acerbic wit, Bourdain takes viewers off the beaten path of tourist destinations – including some war-torn parts of the world – and meets with a variety of local citizens to offer a window into their lifestyles, and occasionally communes with an internationally lauded chef on his journeys.', 'Bourdain travels across the globe to uncover little-known areas of the world and celebrate diverse cultures by exploring food and dining rituals. Known for his curiosity, candor, and acerbic wit, Bourdain takes viewers off the beaten path of tourist destinations – including some war-torn parts of the world – and meets with a variety of local citizens to offer a window into their lifestyles, and occasionally communes with an internationally lauded chef on his journeys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qg7lcydNf8DBVFIFK3XEuccv1jf.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:56305'),
  ('686952214850293229', 'Anthony Bourdain: The Layover', 2011, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Anthony Bourdain', null, 'The Layover is a travel and food show on the Travel Channel hosted by Anthony Bourdain. The show premiered on November 21, 2011 in an episode based on Singapore. The format and the content of the show are based on what a traveler can do, eat, visit and enjoy within 24 to 48 hours in a city. Each episode starts with the host landing at the city, with the clock starting the countdown until the time that he will leave the city. As a seasoned traveler, he meets up with locals and explores the city in and out, within matters of hours, both the touristy way and the local way. On February 15, 2012, Travel Channel renewed the show for the 2012/2013 season, selecting November 19, 2012 for the second season premiere; featured cities for the season include Atlanta, Chicago, Dublin, New Orleans, Paris, Philadelphia, São Paulo, Seattle, Toronto, and Taipei.', 'The Layover is a travel and food show on the Travel Channel hosted by Anthony Bourdain. The show premiered on November 21, 2011 in an episode based on Singapore. The format and the content of the show are based on what a traveler can do, eat, visit and enjoy within 24 to 48 hours in a city. Each episode starts with the host landing at the city, with the clock starting the countdown until the time that he will leave the city. As a seasoned traveler, he meets up with locals and explores the city in and out, within matters of hours, both the touristy way and the local way. On February 15, 2012, Travel Channel renewed the show for the 2012/2013 season, selecting November 19, 2012 for the second season premiere; featured cities for the season include Atlanta, Chicago, Dublin, New Orleans, Paris, Philadelphia, São Paulo, Seattle, Toronto, and Taipei.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykebedPvZRJdiuTLd3P6YjzolS0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:41993'),
  ('892533298226657677', 'Anthracite', 2024, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Fanny Robert', null, 'Hatik, Noémie Schmidt, Camille Lou, Nicolas Godart, Raphaël Ferret, Kad Merad, Jean-Marc Barr, Stefano Cassetti', null, 'An old case is wrenched open when a reporter goes missing, leading his web sleuth daughter to a small mountain town haunted by a sect, secrecy and death.', 'An old case is wrenched open when a reporter goes missing, leading his web sleuth daughter to a small mountain town haunted by a sect, secrecy and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6qdl7ycf1dheDih4g7m3OiZRC6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244431'),
  ('1089759269436010676', 'Anti-Mafia Squad', 2009, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Pietro Valsecchi', null, 'Dino Abbrescia, Bruno Torrisi, Paolo Pierobon, Daniela Marra, Giulio Berruti, Davide Iacopini, Silvia D''Amico, Roberto Salemi', 'NR', 'Fighting a modern, fragmented and brutal Mafia, the Sicilian Anti-Mafia Squad seeks to crush the criminal network that holds a death grip on the region. Sophisticated surveillance helps, unless the enemy lies within.', 'Fighting a modern, fragmented and brutal Mafia, the Sicilian Anti-Mafia Squad seeks to crush the criminal network that holds a death grip on the region. Sophisticated surveillance helps, unless the enemy lies within.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vghwdFgLoblFqPqaor5ZCCEsypo.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:41518'),
  ('491095016806256116', 'Anti-Magic Academy: The 35th Test Platoon', 2015, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Reina Ueda, Ryoko Shiraishi, Rumi Okubo, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Iori Nomizu, Kanae Itou, Akane Kohinata, Chika Anzai', 'TV-MA', 'Set in a world where witches run havoc, the military decides to shift from using sword to utilizing guns to neutralize magical threats. The Anti-Magic Academy is an institution that specializes in training witch hunters. Takeru Kusunagi, who can’t use guns and continues to fight with a sword, is relegated to the 35th Test Platoon, a motley group who can’t cooperate. One day, Ouka Ohtori, an elite pistol master who was forced into demotion, joins the platoon. Will they be able to gather their strengths and work together?', 'Set in a world where witches run havoc, the military decides to shift from using sword to utilizing guns to neutralize magical threats. The Anti-Magic Academy is an institution that specializes in training witch hunters. Takeru Kusunagi, who can’t use guns and continues to fight with a sword, is relegated to the 35th Test Platoon, a motley group who can’t cooperate. One day, Ouka Ohtori, an elite pistol master who was forced into demotion, joins the platoon. Will they be able to gather their strengths and work together?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xbHgFPwQiWyf9mSj3cx9UD5xot.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70296'),
  ('561838835934904125', 'Antigang', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Luc Dionne', 'Nadine Bismuth', 'Patrice Robitaille, Fabien Cloutier, Karine Gonthier-Hyndman, Catherine Trudeau, Vincent Graton, Irdens Exantus', null, 'The show follows a special police unit dedicated to fighting organized crime and major criminal networks, including street gangs, biker gangs, Italian/Irish/Lebanese mafias, and Mexican cartels.', 'The show follows a special police unit dedicated to fighting organized crime and major criminal networks, including street gangs, biker gangs, Italian/Irish/Lebanese mafias, and Mexican cartels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSjS6oQFkpCPvZPAeZCEqo5Nxv8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:298954'),
  ('231504440920067553', 'Antihero', 2024, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Kazutaka Iida', 'Nana Yamamoto, Teppei Fukuda, Hayato Miyamoto', 'Hiroki Hasegawa, Takumi Kitamura, Mayu Hotta, Yuko Oshima, Yoshino Kimura, Mansai Nomura, Takanori Iwata, Misuzu Kanno', null, 'Japan has a conviction rate of 99.9% for criminal cases that go to trial. A lawyer (Hiroki Hasegawa) is able to defeat those odds and obtain an acquittal for his client, even though there''s conclusive evidence that says otherwise. Sometimes, due to minor things, good and evil can switch sides and good people can become bad people.', 'Japan has a conviction rate of 99.9% for criminal cases that go to trial. A lawyer (Hiroki Hasegawa) is able to defeat those odds and obtain an acquittal for his client, even though there''s conclusive evidence that says otherwise. Sometimes, due to minor things, good and evil can switch sides and good people can become bad people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WzBXCQjcdm1zEsYVZPIA1KPi64.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:249928'),
  ('64469312401329849', 'Antikrundan', 1989, 'Reality, Talk, Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Antikrundan is the Swedish version of the original BBC format Antiques Roadshow. The show visits different locations in Sweden and lets people bring their antiques to be valued by experts. It remains popular and often has more than 2 million viewers. The 19th season was shown in 2009. Most of the experts have been with the programme since the start. Jesper Aspegren was the original host. He left in 1999 and was succeeded by Anne Lundberg. Antikrundan started out as a coproduction between SVT Malmö and the BBC where the Antiques Roadshow would visit Scandinavia for two programmes. Antikrundan premiered in August 1989 on TV2 and has since been shown on SVT every year. Antiques Roadshow is shown on BBC Lifestyle and TV8 in Sweden.', 'Antikrundan is the Swedish version of the original BBC format Antiques Roadshow. The show visits different locations in Sweden and lets people bring their antiques to be valued by experts. It remains popular and often has more than 2 million viewers. The 19th season was shown in 2009. Most of the experts have been with the programme since the start. Jesper Aspegren was the original host. He left in 1999 and was succeeded by Anne Lundberg. Antikrundan started out as a coproduction between SVT Malmö and the BBC where the Antiques Roadshow would visit Scandinavia for two programmes. Antikrundan premiered in August 1989 on TV2 and has since been shown on SVT every year. Antiques Roadshow is shown on BBC Lifestyle and TV8 in Sweden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eysoy4dwAMcbJ2QKWZC1T5p6FH9.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:15305'),
  ('121792901789228377', 'Antique Bakery', 2008, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', 'Fumi Yoshinaga', null, 'Shin-ichiro Miki, Keiji Fujiwara, Mamoru Miyano, Eiji Hanawa, Norio Wakamoto, Kazue Ikura, Asami Sanada', null, 'Antique Bakery is a small bakery that''s run by four handsome men. Tachibana the owner, Chikage the one who was sent to watch over his childhood friend, Ono the "demonically charming" master pastry chef, and Kanda a former boxer.', 'Antique Bakery is a small bakery that''s run by four handsome men. Tachibana the owner, Chikage the one who was sent to watch over his childhood friend, Ono the "demonically charming" master pastry chef, and Kanda a former boxer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQ4Le3uxECGfdrNosxjlWJmB7yl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34741'),
  ('803564520008883404', 'Antique Bureau Midgame', 2020, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Ma Boyong', null, 'Xia Yu, Vision Wei, Aliyah, Chen Jin, Sha Baoliang, Bi Yanjun, Du Zhiguo, Chie Tanaka', null, 'A young heir, burdened by his grandfather’s disgraced past, uncovers a major antique forgery scheme tied to a fake painting in the Forbidden City. Teaming up with unlikely allies, he dives into the shadowy world of counterfeit artifacts, racing against a powerful auction house to expose the truth and protect China’s cultural treasures.', 'A young heir, burdened by his grandfather’s disgraced past, uncovers a major antique forgery scheme tied to a fake painting in the Forbidden City. Teaming up with unlikely allies, he dives into the shadowy world of counterfeit artifacts, racing against a powerful auction house to expose the truth and protect China’s cultural treasures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gcxs5lr3F7LPUEosG5c5DZBZtUB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103431'),
  ('842577080511897239', 'Antiques Roadshow', 1979, 'Documentary, Family', null, null, null, null, 'Antiques Roadshow is a British television show in which antiques appraisers travel to various regions of the United Kingdom to appraise antiques brought in by local people. It has been running since 1979. There are also international versions of the programme.', 'Antiques Roadshow is a British television show in which antiques appraisers travel to various regions of the United Kingdom to appraise antiques brought in by local people. It has been running since 1979. There are also international versions of the programme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZnCNv58d7L0Ee3BZI3j2NSBtU.jpg', 48, 'tmdb:tv:2042'),
  ('876882944967109876', 'Antiques Roadshow', 1997, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-G', 'Based on the popular BBC series running since 1979, the PBS Antiques Roadshow combines history with discovery. Each year, the show visits a handful of cities to appraise items brought in by viewers. Are these items worth a lot of money, more than the visitors expect?', 'Based on the popular BBC series running since 1979, the PBS Antiques Roadshow combines history with discovery. Each year, the show visits a handful of cities to appraise items brought in by viewers. Are these items worth a lot of money, more than the visitors expect?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8x5uqmnZoHJtKcOccQInSOEMo7S.jpg', 30, 'tmdb:tv:33739'),
  ('792663402587013097', 'Antônio Maria', 1968, 'Soap, Drama', 'Geraldo Vietri', 'Geraldo Vietri, Walther Negrão', 'Sérgio Cardoso, Aracy Balabanian, Elísio de Albuquerque, Maria Luíza Castelli, Wilson Fragoso, Carmen Monegal, Dennis Carvalho, Gian Carlo Sartorello', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3XDOPwH1CCvH88PR7KkQ4StkdbE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:282336'),
  ('951369236043855116', 'Anupamaa', 2020, 'Drama, Soap', 'Rajan Shahi', null, 'Rupali Ganguly, Adrija Roy, Shivam Khajuria, Sudhanshu Pandey, Paras Kalnawat, Madalasa Sharma, Tasneem Sheikh, Muskaan Bamne', null, 'Anupama had to sacrifice a lot to become an ideal wife, daughter-in-law, and mother. After a bitter realisation, she sets out to live on her own terms.', 'Anupama had to sacrifice a lot to become an ideal wife, daughter-in-law, and mother. After a bitter realisation, she sets out to live on her own terms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i3ZcFxUiGr6HV5yv1i6n7uKHyj7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116479'),
  ('664285181208232041', 'Anxious People', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', null, 'Camilla Ahlgren, Alex Haridi', 'Alfred Svensson, Dan Ekborg, Leif Andrée, Per Andersson, Carla Sehn, Lottie Ejebrant, Anna Granath, Rafael Edholm', 'TV-MA', 'A bank robber holds the visitors of an open house hostage and then promptly vanishes, leaving the police baffled — and suspicious of everyone.', 'A bank robber holds the visitors of an open house hostage and then promptly vanishes, leaving the police baffled — and suspicious of everyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPYIfEA4LS3tRb8wkHlENP4F14Y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:139155'),
  ('671814749555084787', 'Any Human Heart', 2010, 'Drama', 'William Boyd', 'William Boyd', 'Jim Broadbent, Matthew Macfadyen, Sam Claflin, Gillian Anderson, Stuart McQuarrie, Conor Nealon, Hayley Atwell, Ed Stoppard', null, 'Logan Mountstuart, writer and adventurer, narrates his life, from the Paris of the twenties to the eighties in London, passing through the New York of the fifties.', 'Logan Mountstuart, writer and adventurer, narrates his life, from the Paris of the twenties to the eighties in London, passing through the New York of the fifties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHvkvAEaB33dRdQTt3VYRrv1scR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34603'),
  ('89137829799577211', 'Anyone But Me', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Liza Weil, Josh Holland, Rachael Hip-Flores, Nicole Pacent, Jessy Hodges, Alexis Slade, Johnny Yoder, Mitchell Adams', null, 'Anyone But Me is a live-action, web television drama that first aired in 2008. The show is in serial short-format webisodes, each lasting between six and fifteen minutes, following the lives of a group of teenagers in New York City and Westchester County, New York. Anyone But Me was developed by Tina Cesa Ward and playwright Susan Miller from Ward''s original work. Anyone But Me''s initial launch and distribution was on Strike.TV. Subsequently it has been offered on its own website and other online video providers such as YouTube and Hulu.', 'Anyone But Me is a live-action, web television drama that first aired in 2008. The show is in serial short-format webisodes, each lasting between six and fifteen minutes, following the lives of a group of teenagers in New York City and Westchester County, New York. Anyone But Me was developed by Tina Cesa Ward and playwright Susan Miller from Ward''s original work. Anyone But Me''s initial launch and distribution was on Strike.TV. Subsequently it has been offered on its own website and other online video providers such as YouTube and Hulu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/blTnWT1vesNxTfGo4gy1xUOJ1JV.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:31861'),
  ('709035942870731419', 'Anything for Love', 1997, 'Soap, Drama, Family', 'Manoel Carlos', 'Letícia Dornelles, Manoel Carlos', 'Regina Duarte, Gabriela Duarte, Antônio Fagundes, Susana Vieira, Fábio Assunção, Vivianne Pasmanter, Carolina Ferraz, Eduardo Moscovis', null, 'Helena is an independendent woman with strong emotions. More than a dedicated mother, she is also a friend to her daughter. Her daughter is experiencing difficulties in her marriage with Marcelo because of his renewed interest in a formoe girlfriend. Marcelo‘s mother deslikes Helena and would like nothing better to see her son‘s marriage destroyed. Helena starts her life over again when she falls in love at first sight with Atilio, whom she marries. Although of poor health, her daughter wants to have a baby, believing that by fulfiling her husband‘s dream, she can save her marriage. As fate would have it, mother and daughter fall pregnant at the same time, each giving birth to a boy.', 'Helena is an independendent woman with strong emotions. More than a dedicated mother, she is also a friend to her daughter. Her daughter is experiencing difficulties in her marriage with Marcelo because of his renewed interest in a formoe girlfriend. Marcelo‘s mother deslikes Helena and would like nothing better to see her son‘s marriage destroyed. Helena starts her life over again when she falls in love at first sight with Atilio, whom she marries. Although of poor health, her daughter wants to have a baby, believing that by fulfiling her husband‘s dream, she can save her marriage. As fate would have it, mother and daughter fall pregnant at the same time, each giving birth to a boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lq3lz2xtJmtNtmoXM7AVtXL1D5v.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38204'),
  ('187792228997805795', 'Anything Goes', 2025, 'Soap, Drama', 'Manuela Dias', 'Manuela Dias, Sérgio Marques, Marcio Haiduck', 'Taís Araújo, Renato Góes, Bella Campos, Cauã Reymond, Alice Wegmann, Humberto Carrão, Débora Bloch, Alexandre Nero', null, 'The story of a mother and daughter with opposing views on the path to success in life takes the audience on a contemporary journey about character, ethics and honesty.', 'The story of a mother and daughter with opposing views on the path to success in life takes the audience on a contemporary journey about character, ethics and honesty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ub4Lbl2Ymn6bJ2ld6mKkKVy25m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233519'),
  ('1117087053456754493', 'Anyway, I''m Falling in Love with You.', 2025, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Sakura Shinfuku, Kazuki Ura, Sion Yoshitaka, Shoya Chiba, Satoshi Inomata, Yuto Uemura, Azusa Tadokoro, Yuuichirou Umehara', null, 'It’s the year 2020, and Mizuho is having the worst 17th birthday ever. Her parents forgot it’s her birthday, she still can’t seem to get close to the senior she likes, and all her school trips and tournaments are canceled thanks to a new disease going around. She’s convinced she’ll never have the kind of youth she’s always dreamt of…until her childhood friend, Kizuki, suddenly asks her out.', 'It’s the year 2020, and Mizuho is having the worst 17th birthday ever. Her parents forgot it’s her birthday, she still can’t seem to get close to the senior she likes, and all her school trips and tournaments are canceled thanks to a new disease going around. She’s convinced she’ll never have the kind of youth she’s always dreamt of…until her childhood friend, Kizuki, suddenly asks her out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGLx65LO5w4MLaXLmwt1Yo4BN7C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258680'),
  ('751051647192297548', 'ANZAC Girls', 2014, 'War & Politics, Drama', null, null, 'Georgia Flood, Antonia Prebble, Laura Brent, Anna McGahan, Caroline Craig, Todd Lasance, Charles Mayer, Dustin Clare', null, 'The unique, and rarely told true stories of Australian and New Zealand nurses serving at Gallipoli and the Western Front during the First World War.', 'The unique, and rarely told true stories of Australian and New Zealand nurses serving at Gallipoli and the Western Front during the First World War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odnMnf2wKKq5cvBSc2xH7TaXQV9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61444'),
  ('589526756604250127', 'Ao Haru Ride', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Io Sakisaka', null, 'Natsuki Deguchi, Kaito Sakurai, Sara Shida, Riko, Taisuke Niihara, Daiki Kanechika, Ryosuke Sota, Miyazato Sol', null, 'At the end of the first year of high school, Futaba Yoshioka meets Kou Tanaka who was her first love. In their middle school days, they attended the same school, but he suddenly transferred to another school. Three years later, he appears in front of her again with the different last name of Kou Mabuchi. His personality also seems to have changed from warm to cold. He is like a totally different person from three years ago. Futaba Yoshioka slowly learns what happened to Kou Mabuchi for the past three years and she become to have feelings for him again.', 'At the end of the first year of high school, Futaba Yoshioka meets Kou Tanaka who was her first love. In their middle school days, they attended the same school, but he suddenly transferred to another school. Three years later, he appears in front of her again with the different last name of Kou Mabuchi. His personality also seems to have changed from warm to cold. He is like a totally different person from three years ago. Futaba Yoshioka slowly learns what happened to Kou Mabuchi for the past three years and she become to have feelings for him again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZge06sEIXeyQ0YNGW12fPDYzn3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:228156'),
  ('285004416601425300', 'Ao Oni The Blue Monster', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ryota Osaka, Eri Kitamura, Shuta Morishima, Takahiro Mizushima, Hiroki Touchi', 'TV-MA', 'In most ordinary high schools, many stories and rumors float around—some scandalous, some happy and some...more macabre. One such example is of monsters lurking in an abandoned mansion outside of town. Such tales, however, prove too tempting to resist for Hiroshi and his friends Mika, Takeshi, and Takurou. They decide to brave the rumored dangers in order to investigate the manor and complete a test of courage. Each of them approaches the mansion with an overwhelming sense of dread. And when they enter, they come upon a blue monster named Ao Oni who attacks them. As Hiroshi and his friends try to solve the various puzzles in the mansion and escape their new blue nemesis, they find themselves meeting several horrible endings as they fail miserably.', 'In most ordinary high schools, many stories and rumors float around—some scandalous, some happy and some...more macabre. One such example is of monsters lurking in an abandoned mansion outside of town. Such tales, however, prove too tempting to resist for Hiroshi and his friends Mika, Takeshi, and Takurou. They decide to brave the rumored dangers in order to investigate the manor and complete a test of courage. Each of them approaches the mansion with an overwhelming sense of dread. And when they enter, they come upon a blue monster named Ao Oni who attacks them. As Hiroshi and his friends try to solve the various puzzles in the mansion and escape their new blue nemesis, they find themselves meeting several horrible endings as they fail miserably.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cKuDLJ1mHXn1ZFHPwAvYxO0h9Az.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68137'),
  ('987824957731283669', 'Ao-chan Can''t Study!', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Juri Kimura, Toshinari Fukamachi, Yusuke Shirai, Takashi Kondo, Kenjiro Tsuda, Azumi Waki, Junta Terashima', 'TV-14', 'Ao Horie''s father, a popular erotic fiction author, chose Ao''s name because A stands for “apple” and O stands for “orgy”! Desperate to escape her father''s legacy and get into a prestigious university, Ao devotes herself to studying instead of pursuing romance. She has no time for boys, but there''s just one problem: Kijima, her handsome and popular classmate, just confessed his love to her! And to make matters worse, she can''t stop thinking dirty thoughts about him! Looks like escaping her father''s influence will be harder than she thought...', 'Ao Horie''s father, a popular erotic fiction author, chose Ao''s name because A stands for “apple” and O stands for “orgy”! Desperate to escape her father''s legacy and get into a prestigious university, Ao devotes herself to studying instead of pursuing romance. She has no time for boys, but there''s just one problem: Kijima, her handsome and popular classmate, just confessed his love to her! And to make matters worse, she can''t stop thinking dirty thoughts about him! Looks like escaping her father''s influence will be harder than she thought...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5TUS9UTGeJtmFiF9GCmjxuADgG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87462'),
  ('102892680617837975', 'Aoashi', 2022, 'Animation', null, null, 'Kouki Osuzu', 'TV-14', 'Ashito Aoi is a young, aspiring soccer player from a backwater town in Japan. His hopes of getting into a high school with a good soccer club are dashed when he causes an incident during a critical match for his team, which results in their loss and elimination from the tournament. Nevertheless, he catches the eye of someone important who happened to be visiting from Tokyo. How will things turn out for Ashito?', 'Ashito Aoi is a young, aspiring soccer player from a backwater town in Japan. His hopes of getting into a high school with a good soccer club are dashed when he causes an incident during a critical match for his team, which results in their loss and elimination from the tournament. Nevertheless, he catches the eye of someone important who happened to be visiting from Tokyo. How will things turn out for Ashito?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/erwRgEPtUtyv3Vkmxt0MhjKi5kA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:126437'),
  ('120995435507334336', 'Aoharu x Machinegun', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Tomoaki Maeno, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Mikako Komatsu, Eri Kitamura, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Ryohei Kimura, Yui Horie', 'TV-14', 'When Hotaru moves into a new apartment alone, there''s a mysterious man standing nearby the apartment. Hotaru decides to confront the man, who turns out to live in the neighboring apartment. The next day at school, Hotaru''s best friend Kanae tells Hotaru that a host tricked her out of her money. When Hotaru goes to confront the host, he happens to be none other than Hotaru''s neighbor, Masamune?!', 'When Hotaru moves into a new apartment alone, there''s a mysterious man standing nearby the apartment. Hotaru decides to confront the man, who turns out to live in the neighboring apartment. The next day at school, Hotaru''s best friend Kanae tells Hotaru that a host tricked her out of her money. When Hotaru goes to confront the host, he happens to be none other than Hotaru''s neighbor, Masamune?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PNOj3WJ91rgBnLTe7UeSsAYTjL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63088'),
  ('819963206596620800', 'Aoi Bungaku Series', 2009, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery', null, null, null, null, 'An animated adaptation of six classical Japanese literature pieces, including No Longer Human (Ningen Shikkaku) and Run, Melos (Hashire, Melos) by Osamu Dazai, Kokoro by Natsume Souseki, Hell Screen (Jigoku Hen) and The Spider''s Thread (Kumo no Ito) by Ryunosuke Akutagawa and In the Forest, Under Cherries in Full Bloom (Sakura no Mori no Mankai no Shita) by Ango Sakaguchi.', 'An animated adaptation of six classical Japanese literature pieces, including No Longer Human (Ningen Shikkaku) and Run, Melos (Hashire, Melos) by Osamu Dazai, Kokoro by Natsume Souseki, Hell Screen (Jigoku Hen) and The Spider''s Thread (Kumo no Ito) by Ryunosuke Akutagawa and In the Forest, Under Cherries in Full Bloom (Sakura no Mori no Mankai no Shita) by Ango Sakaguchi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ht1PGrCdSY95E1Zh22ZNU7033MF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61289'),
  ('380196595389863939', 'AOKANA: Four Rhythm Across the Blue', 2016, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Misato Fukuen, Azumi Asakura, Nozomi Yamamoto, Madoka Yonezawa, Ryota Osaka, Naomi Wakabayashi, Takayuki Kondo, Risa Taneda', 'TV-14', 'In the Four Islands Archipelago, people can use Grav-Shoes to fly around! This is the story of Asuka Kurashina, a transfer student that arrives at Kunahama Academy from outside the Four Islands. After seeing the ability of wearers to soar in the sky, she quickly develops an interest in flying with the Grav-Shoes and also joins the school''s FC (Flying Circus) club to further her passion.', 'In the Four Islands Archipelago, people can use Grav-Shoes to fly around! This is the story of Asuka Kurashina, a transfer student that arrives at Kunahama Academy from outside the Four Islands. After seeing the ability of wearers to soar in the sky, she quickly develops an interest in flying with the Grav-Shoes and also joins the school''s FC (Flying Circus) club to further her passion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7qJXTAoA3ITA8yf7lyLJSXwEgX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65713'),
  ('89946639747166951', 'Aoki Densetsu Shoot!', 1993, 'Animation', null, null, 'Hikaru Midorikawa, Nobutoshi Canna, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Noriko Hidaka, Masami Kikuchi, Toshio Furukawa, Tomokazu Seki, Isshin Chiba', null, 'Toshihiko Tanaka is a boy who entered Kakegawa High School with his friends Kenji &amp; Kazuhiro, in order to play soccer with Yoshiharu Kubo, a great soccer player whom they have idolized. While his other two friends were reluctant to play again, "Toshi" eventually convinces them to play for the team. The team soon find themselves in the midst of a quest to the All-Japan High School Championship, while overcoming obstacles along the way.', 'Toshihiko Tanaka is a boy who entered Kakegawa High School with his friends Kenji &amp; Kazuhiro, in order to play soccer with Yoshiharu Kubo, a great soccer player whom they have idolized. While his other two friends were reluctant to play again, "Toshi" eventually convinces them to play for the team. The team soon find themselves in the midst of a quest to the All-Japan High School Championship, while overcoming obstacles along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXbxNaneTcdLRsQ7NJkdBN7yY5t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34173'),
  ('592271756874917681', 'AOTU World', 2015, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', '七创社', null, 'Qiege Qin, Siro, Yi Kou Jing, Tekilen', null, 'A god created AOTU World and established the 7 Oracles to rule it on behalf of this god. The poor and rich, enslaved and free, suffering and happiness, destruction and birth: every status is ordained by God. Mortals can only accept, but cannot resist. However, God has given his people the opportunity to change their fate through "AOTU Contest." The contestants use their unique "ability" gifted by the Contest System and inbate wisdom and courage in hopes of winning the competition and becoming the world''s ruler.', 'A god created AOTU World and established the 7 Oracles to rule it on behalf of this god. The poor and rich, enslaved and free, suffering and happiness, destruction and birth: every status is ordained by God. Mortals can only accept, but cannot resist. However, God has given his people the opportunity to change their fate through "AOTU Contest." The contestants use their unique "ability" gifted by the Contest System and inbate wisdom and courage in hopes of winning the competition and becoming the world''s ruler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pS0XgMIcdQvlS732bdRscmQQ7YK.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:116753'),
  ('110093222802972764', 'Apache: The Life of Carlos Tevez', 2019, 'Drama', 'Adrián Caetano, Marcos Osorio Vidal, Diego Alonso', 'Gisela Benenzon, Marcos Osorio Vidal', 'Balthazar Murillo, Vanesa González, Alberto Ajaka, Sofía Gala Castiglione, Matías Recalt, Gregorio Barrios, Fernando Contigiani García', 'TV-MA', 'This gritty dramatization of the life of Carlos Tevez shows his rise to soccer stardom amid the harrowing conditions in Argentina''s Fuerte Apache.', 'This gritty dramatization of the life of Carlos Tevez shows his rise to soccer stardom amid the harrowing conditions in Argentina''s Fuerte Apache.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jN50JvMxnVmctBeKxZenQ2qHyL6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92443'),
  ('309632047768734703', 'Apaches', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'Miguel Sáez Carral', null, 'Eloy Azorín, Verónica Echegui, Paco Tous, Nerea Barros, Alberto Ammann, Lucía Jiménez, Ingrid García Jonsson', 'TV-MA', 'A young journalist is forced into a life of crime to save his father and family in this series based on the novel by Miguel Sáez Carral.', 'A young journalist is forced into a life of crime to save his father and family in this series based on the novel by Miguel Sáez Carral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOZZxNxR1gSZTGDofjTWVAXO5nD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63378'),
  ('470708664436607041', 'APB', 2017, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Crime, Drama', 'Matt Nix, David Slack', null, 'Justin Kirk, Natalie Martinez, Caitlin Stasey, Ernie Hudson, Taylor Handley, Tamberla Perry, James Farruggio', 'TV-14', 'After a billionaire engineer witnesses his best friend’s murder, he takes charge of Chicago’s troubled 13th District and reboots it as a technically innovative police force, challenging the district to rethink everything about the way they fight crime.', 'After a billionaire engineer witnesses his best friend’s murder, he takes charge of Chicago’s troubled 13th District and reboots it as a technically innovative police force, challenging the district to rethink everything about the way they fight crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6nobSVxOse1XFO43CLyH6r6u5DN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67129'),
  ('740638988139746349', 'Apex Legends', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Animation', 'Drew McCoy, Chad Grenier, Mohammad Alavi', 'Mohammad Kamal Alavi', 'Gabe Kunda, Ike Amadi, Yukiko Aruga, Krizia Bajos, Barbara Beretta, Anjali Bhimani, JB Blanc, JB Blanc', null, 'Master an ever-growing roster of legendary characters with powerful abilities and experience strategic squad play and innovative gameplay in the next evolution of Hero Shooter and Battle Royale.', 'Master an ever-growing roster of legendary characters with powerful abilities and experience strategic squad play and innovative gameplay in the next evolution of Hero Shooter and Battle Royale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIfKOoFyudgiGftu8Qjh16RBaqS.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:299141'),
  ('591660418980743978', 'Apharan', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'Mohinder Pratap Singh, Ekta Kapoor', null, null, null, 'Rudra Srivastava, a senior inspector with Uttarakhand police is lured into kidnapping a young girl at her request. The plot begins as a simple plan to extort money in exchange for her release. When the chain of events go wrong and a series of lies unfold, he realizes that he is now a part of a deadly conspiracy. Will he be able to escape the outcome of his choices or become a victim of the web of lies?', 'Rudra Srivastava, a senior inspector with Uttarakhand police is lured into kidnapping a young girl at her request. The plot begins as a simple plan to extort money in exchange for her release. When the chain of events go wrong and a series of lies unfold, he realizes that he is now a part of a deadly conspiracy. Will he be able to escape the outcome of his choices or become a victim of the web of lies?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18gAXh0FIepWN73Zvycoit0Cedm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:84962'),
  ('413571315082035278', 'Apnea', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Gaia Guasti, Aurélien Molas, Simon Moutaïrou', 'Aurélien Molas, Gaia Guasti, Simon Moutaïrou', 'Laetitia Casta, Noée Abita, Sergi López, Alba Gaïa Bellugi, Manuel Severi, Véronique Volta, Paul Garatte, Marie-Pierre Nouveau', null, 'An island in the Mediterranean is hit by an unprecedented fishing shortage and a string of suspicious deaths. These events coincide with the arrival of a mysterious stranger, Théa, rescued at sea, who will change the life of young Chloé.', 'An island in the Mediterranean is hit by an unprecedented fishing shortage and a string of suspicious deaths. These events coincide with the arrival of a mysterious stranger, Théa, rescued at sea, who will change the life of young Chloé.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/391yQtDxfgNRznOPYnPITngovT7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87780'),
  ('223703457524403791', 'Apocalipse', 2017, 'Drama, Soap, Action & Adventure, Mystery', 'Vivian de Oliveira', 'Vivian de Oliveira, Cristiane Cardoso, Alexandre Teixeira', 'Igor Rickli, Juliana Knust, Sergio Marone, Paloma Bernardi, Samara Felippo, Fernando Pavão, Emílio Orciollo Netto, Sidney Sampaio', null, 'A mysterious and spiritual portrayal of one of the most intense and controversial stories in the Holy Bible: the end of the world.', 'A mysterious and spiritual portrayal of one of the most intense and controversial stories in the Holy Bible: the end of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPqg2d7b24Nh1p7KLbySIvj2lRW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75209'),
  ('16966390664169915', 'Apocalypse Bringer Mynoghra: World Conquest Starts with the Civilization of Ruin', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Toshiki Kumagai, Tomori Kusunoki, Kikuko Inoue, Rico Sasaki', 'TV-14', 'In Eternal Nations, a fantasy strategy game where players manage an empire, Takuto Ira is a legendary player who sits atop the leaderboard. Takuto goes unconscious during a hospitalization and awakens on the continent of Idoragya, which looks just like the game. Takuto meets Sludge Atou, his favorite unit in the game, and decides to build Mynoghra, an evil empire.', 'In Eternal Nations, a fantasy strategy game where players manage an empire, Takuto Ira is a legendary player who sits atop the leaderboard. Takuto goes unconscious during a hospitalization and awakens on the continent of Idoragya, which looks just like the game. Takuto meets Sludge Atou, his favorite unit in the game, and decides to build Mynoghra, an evil empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cT7yE9XHOkvaVtR2GpfuDO3VtCe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:280038'),
  ('197691190635552172', 'Apocalypse Hotel', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Saho Shirasu, Sumire Morohoshi, Hiroki Touchi, Shin-ichiro Miki, Hiroyuki Kinoshita, Cho, Takako Honda, Mutsumi Tamura', null, 'Following the collapse of civilization, one storied hotel stands among the ruins of Tokyo’s Ginza district. Overrun by nature, this lone hotel continues to defy humanity’s collapse. Current guests: zero. Check-ins scheduled today: zero. Yesterday’s website traffic: zero. Enter with caution in this story of survival and mystery in a world where the memory of humanity begins to fade.', 'Following the collapse of civilization, one storied hotel stands among the ruins of Tokyo’s Ginza district. Overrun by nature, this lone hotel continues to defy humanity’s collapse. Current guests: zero. Check-ins scheduled today: zero. Yesterday’s website traffic: zero. Enter with caution in this story of survival and mystery in a world where the memory of humanity begins to fade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nyoCfoSrHRsrgholvTOqZug0zSN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:262929'),
  ('152363347549474607', 'Apocalypse Zero', 1996, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Takayuki Yamaguchi', null, 'Koichi Yamadera, Megumi Ogata, Hidekatsu Shibata, Mitsuko Horie, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Yuzuru Fujimoto, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Hiro Yuuki', 'TV-MA', 'Kakugo and Harara are two siblings who have been trained to fight demons, monsters, and other creatures that are now roaming about in the post-apocalyptic 21st century. Along with their superior fighting techniques and specialized skills, they were also given special suits called Zero armor, which were made from the souls of dead warriors. Unfortunately Harara succumbs to evil within the Zero armor, and Kakugo is the only human alive that has the skills and equipment to defeat his sibling.', 'Kakugo and Harara are two siblings who have been trained to fight demons, monsters, and other creatures that are now roaming about in the post-apocalyptic 21st century. Along with their superior fighting techniques and specialized skills, they were also given special suits called Zero armor, which were made from the souls of dead warriors. Unfortunately Harara succumbs to evil within the Zero armor, and Kakugo is the only human alive that has the skills and equipment to defeat his sibling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/llRS9RAQ4ffmcreGzy4HBMEc26s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:26539'),
  ('338518217777390986', 'Apocalypse: D-Day', 2024, 'Documentary, War & Politics', 'Isabelle Clarke, Daniel Costelle', null, 'Mathieu Kassovitz, Dwight D. Eisenhower, Winston Churchill, Franklin D. Roosevelt, Joseph Stalin, Adolf Hitler', null, '6 June 1944. A titanic fleet launched an assault on the beaches of Normandy. Objective: to liberate Europe from Hitler''s yoke. Drawing on the lessons learned from the Dieppe raid in August 1942, the mission was a spectacular success.', '6 June 1944. A titanic fleet launched an assault on the beaches of Normandy. Objective: to liberate Europe from Hitler''s yoke. Drawing on the lessons learned from the Dieppe raid in August 1942, the mission was a spectacular success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOejR6Oqu4OYuHrALmcjtgCjaF8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:227907'),
  ('327245105438274887', 'Apocalypse: Hitler Takes on the West', 2021, 'Documentary, War & Politics', 'Isabelle Clarke, Daniel Costelle, Mickaël Gamrasni', 'Daniel Costelle, Isabelle Clarke', 'Mathieu Kassovitz, Adolf Hitler, Winston Churchill, Philippe Pétain, Charles de Gaulle, Benito Mussolini, Hermann Göring, Franklin D. Roosevelt', null, 'May 10th, 1940, Hitler takes on the West. Will he precipitate Europe into the Apocalypse?', 'May 10th, 1940, Hitler takes on the West. Will he precipitate Europe into the Apocalypse?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8ciniCkluYmB0JlWCpOAmgtHQl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:124927'),
  ('213288297359760521', 'Apocalypse: Never-Ending War (1918-1926)', 2018, 'Documentary, War & Politics', 'Isabelle Clarke, Daniel Costelle, Mickaël Gamrasni', 'Isabelle Clarke, Daniel Costelle', 'Mathieu Kassovitz', null, 'November 11, 1918. The world emerges from the most horrific conflict ever known. While leaders of the victorious countries design a new world order, traumatized societies struggle to find their footing. In the aftermath of war the Russian, German, Austro-Hungarian and Ottoman Empires fall apart, currencies fluctuate wildly, and vast numbers of refugees flee misery. Before long, age-old hatreds, fears, and resentments resurface and drive the world to the brink of a new apocalypse.', 'November 11, 1918. The world emerges from the most horrific conflict ever known. While leaders of the victorious countries design a new world order, traumatized societies struggle to find their footing. In the aftermath of war the Russian, German, Austro-Hungarian and Ottoman Empires fall apart, currencies fluctuate wildly, and vast numbers of refugees flee misery. Before long, age-old hatreds, fears, and resentments resurface and drive the world to the brink of a new apocalypse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFPxkHuZ5N63jrnKo4iIkuiUBCH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83961'),
  ('297929345085577418', 'Apocalypse: Stalin', 2015, 'Documentary, War & Politics', 'Isabelle Clarke, Daniel Costelle', null, 'Mathieu Kassovitz, Joseph Stalin', 'TV-14', 'The rise of Stalin, from his early beginning as a bankrobber to the cold-blooded leader of the Soviet Union.', 'The rise of Stalin, from his early beginning as a bankrobber to the cold-blooded leader of the Soviet Union.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYiP6PMCTNuSv1EnJ2sdaBKEkpC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64364'),
  ('285808940174045259', 'Apocalypse: The Fall of Hitler', 2023, 'Documentary, War & Politics', 'Daniel Costelle, Isabelle Clarke', 'Isabelle Clarke, Daniel Costelle', 'Mathieu Kassovitz, Adolf Hitler, Eva Braun, Heinrich Himmler, Joseph Goebbels, Hermann Göring', null, 'Summer 1943: Hitler engages in a decisive battle in Kursk to win the war in the East. This is without counting on the pugnacity of the Red Army and the Allied intervention in the West. Month after month, the noose tightens on the Nazi tyrant who refuses to admit defeat and precipitates his country in its fall.', 'Summer 1943: Hitler engages in a decisive battle in Kursk to win the war in the East. This is without counting on the pugnacity of the Red Army and the Allied intervention in the West. Month after month, the noose tightens on the Nazi tyrant who refuses to admit defeat and precipitates his country in its fall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDeokJUhMA42REuT3MPKdhK0VYO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214849'),
  ('342909424237104574', 'Apocalypse: The Rise of Hitler', 2011, 'Documentary, War & Politics', 'Daniel Costelle, Isabelle Clarke', null, 'Mathieu Kassovitz, Adolf Hitler, Rudolf Hess, Hermann Göring, Joseph Goebbels, Paul von Hindenburg, Eva Braun, Benito Mussolini', null, 'Adolf Hitler (1889-1945) was a mediocre who rose to power because of the blindness and ignorance of the Germans, who believed he was nothing more than an eccentric dreamer. But when the crisis of 1929 devastated the economy, the population, fearful of chaos and communism, voted for him. And no one defended democracy. As the dictatorship extended its relentless shadow, the leader claimed peace, but was preparing the Apocalypse.', 'Adolf Hitler (1889-1945) was a mediocre who rose to power because of the blindness and ignorance of the Germans, who believed he was nothing more than an eccentric dreamer. But when the crisis of 1929 devastated the economy, the population, fearful of chaos and communism, voted for him. And no one defended democracy. As the dictatorship extended its relentless shadow, the leader claimed peace, but was preparing the Apocalypse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3N4GPqPu2d416ts5ETl3FKqWlrQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68558'),
  ('75949940285128843', 'Apocalypse: The Second World War', 2009, 'Documentary, War & Politics', 'Isabelle Clarke, Daniel Costelle, Jean-Louis Guillaud', 'Henri de Turenne, Isabelle Clarke, Daniel Costelle', 'Mathieu Kassovitz, Dwight D. Eisenhower, Adolf Hitler, Franklin D. Roosevelt, Charles de Gaulle, Heinrich Himmler, Erwin Rommel, Joseph Stalin', 'TV-PG', 'A six-part French documentary about the Second World War composed exclusively of actual footage of the war as filmed by war correspondents, soldiers, resistance fighters and private citizens. The series is shown in color, with the black and white footage being fully colorized, save for some original color footage. The only exception to the treatment are most Holocaust scenes, which are presented in the original black and white.', 'A six-part French documentary about the Second World War composed exclusively of actual footage of the war as filmed by war correspondents, soldiers, resistance fighters and private citizens. The series is shown in color, with the black and white footage being fully colorized, save for some original color footage. The only exception to the treatment are most Holocaust scenes, which are presented in the original black and white.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rR7mhk7cynxJCPCOPBwd9f73IP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33189'),
  ('220964702266672789', 'Apocalypse: Verdun', 2016, 'Documentary, War & Politics', 'Daniel Costelle, Isabelle Clarke', null, 'Mathieu Kassovitz, Joseph Joffre, Philippe Pétain', null, 'February 1916. World War I has been raging for two years and has killed over three million people, neither side gaining the upper hand. The Germans mobilize more artillery and men in Verdun than in any other offensive -- for three hundred days -- but the French hold out. Constructed from over five hundred hours of restored, colorized archival footage.', 'February 1916. World War I has been raging for two years and has killed over three million people, neither side gaining the upper hand. The Germans mobilize more artillery and men in Verdun than in any other offensive -- for three hundred days -- but the French hold out. Constructed from over five hundred hours of restored, colorized archival footage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FM2H2ARUivvA9tcFa9FIPgiAGA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278170'),
  ('856936865162891918', 'Apocalypse: War of Worlds (1945-1991)', 2019, 'Documentary, War & Politics', 'Isabelle Clarke, Daniel Costelle, Mickaël Gamrasni', 'Isabelle Clarke, Mickaël Gamrasni, Daniel Costelle', 'Mathieu Kassovitz', null, 'The story of this fantastic period of history between 1945 and 1991, which was defined by the confrontation of two worlds and two systems. The capitalist West, dominated by the ever-powerful United States, is pitted against the Communist East, the Soviet Empire.', 'The story of this fantastic period of history between 1945 and 1991, which was defined by the confrontation of two worlds and two systems. The capitalist West, dominated by the ever-powerful United States, is pitted against the Communist East, the Soviet Empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38vSeL3hf4ISV4jDICMrkMyuAKV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95224'),
  ('734909174449826457', 'Apocalypse: World War I', 2014, 'Documentary, War & Politics', 'Isabelle Clarke, Daniel Costelle', null, 'Mathieu Kassovitz', 'TV-14', 'Colorized historical footage in ascending order of World War 1. Not only the relatively known Flanders and France battles, but also the generally unknown Italian-Austrian, German-Polish-Russian, Japanese-German, Ottoman Empire- Allied and African German Colonies, and other unknown or forgotten fronts and battles.', 'Colorized historical footage in ascending order of World War 1. Not only the relatively known Flanders and France battles, but also the generally unknown Italian-Austrian, German-Polish-Russian, Japanese-German, Ottoman Empire- Allied and African German Colonies, and other unknown or forgotten fronts and battles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ilyercptCSZMHJC1EcDKLyDhKXk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61314'),
  ('123445451431411484', 'Apostle', 2008, 'War & Politics, Mystery, Drama', 'Oleg Antonov, Grigori Manukov', null, 'Andrey Smirnov, Andrei Gusev, Yuriy Nazarov, Alexandr Novin, Alyona Babenko, Aleksandr Bashirov, Karen Badalov, Larisa Malevannaya', null, 'At the beginning of the war, the Germans throw their saboteur into the USSR. The landing is unsuccessful - the spy is captured by the NKVD. When trying to escape, a saboteur who turned out to be a Russian thief in law, accidentally remaining in the occupied territory, dies. In order to find the other spies involved in the operation, the security officers have to turn to the criminal''s twin brother, a rural teacher. He takes the place of the deceased in the German intelligence network and enters into a deadly game...', 'At the beginning of the war, the Germans throw their saboteur into the USSR. The landing is unsuccessful - the spy is captured by the NKVD. When trying to escape, a saboteur who turned out to be a Russian thief in law, accidentally remaining in the occupied territory, dies. In order to find the other spies involved in the operation, the security officers have to turn to the criminal''s twin brother, a rural teacher. He takes the place of the deceased in the German intelligence network and enters into a deadly game...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9C0RQVMi1Omy3CJ0cCTCNeUzEpy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68548'),
  ('155076990043091302', 'Apostrophes', 1975, 'Talk', 'Bernard Pivot', null, 'Bernard Pivot', null, 'Apostrophes was a live, weekly, literary, prime-time, talk show on French television created and hosted by Bernard Pivot. It ran for fifteen years (724 episodes) from January 10, 1975, to June 22, 1990, and was one of the most watched shows on French television (around 6 million regular viewers). It was broadcast on Friday nights on the channel France 2 (which was called "Antenne 2" from 1975 to 1992). The hourlong show was devoted to books, authors and literature. The format varied between one-on-one interviews with a single author and open discussions between four or five authors.', 'Apostrophes was a live, weekly, literary, prime-time, talk show on French television created and hosted by Bernard Pivot. It ran for fifteen years (724 episodes) from January 10, 1975, to June 22, 1990, and was one of the most watched shows on French television (around 6 million regular viewers). It was broadcast on Friday nights on the channel France 2 (which was called "Antenne 2" from 1975 to 1992). The hourlong show was devoted to books, authors and literature. The format varied between one-on-one interviews with a single author and open discussions between four or five authors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8sAKVFRZDoZa51a60BO24Pf6jnb.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:30243'),
  ('77709568348553032', 'Apotheosis', 2022, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Zhang Pei, Yanyi Chen, Bingtian Wang, Xiangjin Luan, Yang Miao, Wen Liu', null, 'Luo Zheng is at the bottom of the Luo Clan hierarchy, despite his family being the founders of a power refining technique that could instantly defeat any opponent. One night, enraged by unfair treatment from a family steward, Luo Zheng burns the family records. In doing so, the hidden magic in the book engulfs him and Luo Zheng becomes a new skilled fighter. Fleeing his home and despicable clan, Luo Zheng must learn to harness his powers to rescue his younger sister while his own cousins are on his pursuit.', 'Luo Zheng is at the bottom of the Luo Clan hierarchy, despite his family being the founders of a power refining technique that could instantly defeat any opponent. One night, enraged by unfair treatment from a family steward, Luo Zheng burns the family records. In doing so, the hidden magic in the book engulfs him and Luo Zheng becomes a new skilled fighter. Fleeing his home and despicable clan, Luo Zheng must learn to harness his powers to rescue his younger sister while his own cousins are on his pursuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hLNKpJ8vFFPCGOYAJOnHtEbne3h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213791'),
  ('178048874829486560', 'Appare-Ranman!', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Natsuki Hanae, Fumiko Orikasa, Aoi Yuuki, Soma Saito, Sora Amamiya, Seiichiro Yamashita, Takahiro Sakurai, Kazuyuki Okitsu', 'TV-14', 'During the back-end of the 19th century, the genius but socially awkward engineer Sorano Appare and the wise yet cowardly samurai Isshiki Kosame find themselves drifting in the sea between Japan and America. With no money, the duo decide to enter the Trans-America Wild Race to win the prize money so they can get home. The two encounter rivals, bandits, and challenges in the wilderness as they race through America, from the starting line in Los Angeles to the finish line in New York, in the steam-powered car they built.', 'During the back-end of the 19th century, the genius but socially awkward engineer Sorano Appare and the wise yet cowardly samurai Isshiki Kosame find themselves drifting in the sea between Japan and America. With no money, the duo decide to enter the Trans-America Wild Race to win the prize money so they can get home. The two encounter rivals, bandits, and challenges in the wilderness as they race through America, from the starting line in Los Angeles to the finish line in New York, in the steam-powered car they built.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0kYFyG8DmDlT8KBmfOTHDsOeKp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94498'),
  ('488478236795732992', 'Apparitions', 2008, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Joe Ahearne', null, 'Martin Shaw, Rick Warden, Luigi Diberti, John Shrapnel, Shaun Dooley, Siobhan Finneran, Michelle Joseph, Sarah-Jayne Steed', 'TV-MA', 'Apparitions is a BBC drama about Father Jacob Myers, a priest of the Roman Catholic Church, played by Martin Shaw, who examines evidence of miracles to be used in canonisation but also performs exorcisms. As he learns, Jacob''s duties run deeper than just sending demons back to Hell; he later must prevent them all from escaping. Unlike most portrayals of exorcism and spirit possession in fiction, Apparitions is more religiously accurate and fact-based, incorporating the nature of demonic possession as described by the Church. It also recounts historical events associated with Christianity and other Abrahamic religions, which may have been caused by Heaven or Hell, indicating that the War described in the Bible may not have fully concluded. The series is written by Joe Ahearne.', 'Apparitions is a BBC drama about Father Jacob Myers, a priest of the Roman Catholic Church, played by Martin Shaw, who examines evidence of miracles to be used in canonisation but also performs exorcisms. As he learns, Jacob''s duties run deeper than just sending demons back to Hell; he later must prevent them all from escaping. Unlike most portrayals of exorcism and spirit possession in fiction, Apparitions is more religiously accurate and fact-based, incorporating the nature of demonic possession as described by the Church. It also recounts historical events associated with Christianity and other Abrahamic religions, which may have been caused by Heaven or Hell, indicating that the War described in the Bible may not have fully concluded. The series is written by Joe Ahearne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpd7vaCQo2059Ju0yfxL1Ibo6Or.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8258'),
  ('968232148232825262', 'Apple & Onion', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', 'George Gendi', null, 'George Gendi, Richard Ayoade, Sayed Badreya, Dawnn Lewis, Kevin Michael Richardson, Roger Craig Smith, Florian Ordoñez, Olivio Ordonez', 'TV-Y7', 'In a world of talking food, best mates Apple and Onion fumble through city life, tackling ordinary problems by extraordinary means.', 'In a world of talking food, best mates Apple and Onion fumble through city life, tackling ordinary problems by extraordinary means.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtCfVYJUJrHnQzrO426hZbYHhXK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:78254'),
  ('574069223428105792', 'Apple Cider Vinegar', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Samantha Strauss', null, 'Kaitlyn Dever, Alycia Debnam-Carey, Aisha Dee, Mark Coles Smith, Tilda Cobham-Hervey, Chai Hansen, Matt Nable, Ashley Zukerman', 'TV-MA', 'Two young women advocate for wellness remedies to cure deadly illnesses, unraveling their lives as they unknowingly — and knowingly — mislead the world.', 'Two young women advocate for wellness remedies to cure deadly illnesses, unraveling their lives as they unknowingly — and knowingly — mislead the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d55nhKP5A3YEwwOa91Qh7bs3yOt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241501'),
  ('59509976811942573', 'Apple My Love', 2024, 'Drama', 'Chao Planoy', null, 'Supitcha Limsommut, Sutima Korkiatvanich, Penpat Kairapee, Patthanarat Ketkaew, Kornrawee Wongtrakul, Napat Zen Youngblood, Thapanawat Kaewbumrung, Mon Taechin Phaisanwan', null, 'After getting her vision back, Kris sees a person in her dreams, but when she wakes up, the only thing she can remember are a pair of eyes. She starts drawing them to help her remember, but when she sees Karn for the first time, she recognizes that the pair in her dreams and Karn''s are one and the same...', 'After getting her vision back, Kris sees a person in her dreams, but when she wakes up, the only thing she can remember are a pair of eyes. She starts drawing them to help her remember, but when she sees Karn for the first time, she recognizes that the pair in her dreams and Karn''s are one and the same...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n84yvifMQ2cir96IHVIRzVPk52h.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:258447'),
  ('426549858638331042', 'Apple of My Eye', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Chae Hye-young, Baek Eun-jeong, Yoo Sang-young', 'Seo Jun-young, Yoon Da-young, Kim Si-hoo, Choi Jong-hwan, Song Chae-hwan, Lee Eung-kyung, Choi Jae-won, Lee Yoon-seong', null, 'A work about the delightful and heartbreaking story of a family growing up while raising a child, centering on a single dad Geum Kang San and adopted child Ok Mi Rae who is the apple of his eye.', 'A work about the delightful and heartbreaking story of a family growing up while raising a child, centering on a single dad Geum Kang San and adopted child Ok Mi Rae who is the apple of his eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wIgh7yDZOVY5J3kddXY6xA89SE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221934'),
  ('662978212789052708', 'Apple Tree Yard', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Emily Watson, Ben Chaplin, Mark Bonnar, Steven Elder, Jack Hamilton, Susan Lynch, Lydia Leonard, Olivia Vinall', 'TV-14', 'What starts out as a simple, reckless mid-life affair between a genetic scientist named Yvonne and a Westminster paper pusher takes an intriguing turn when she realizes he’s a spook – then suddenly gets very dark indeed. A provocative study of obsession, longing and just how far down a criminal path desire can take you.', 'What starts out as a simple, reckless mid-life affair between a genetic scientist named Yvonne and a Westminster paper pusher takes an intriguing turn when she realizes he’s a spook – then suddenly gets very dark indeed. A provocative study of obsession, longing and just how far down a criminal path desire can take you.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7eNIjuiLyAGZx6ILVGWWouon4YU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69773'),
  ('566510735541235196', 'Apples Never Fall', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Melanie Marnich', null, 'Annette Bening, Sam Neill, Jake Lacy, Alison Brie, Conor Merrigan-Turner, Essie Randles, Georgia Flood, Jeanine Serralles', 'TV-MA', 'Follow the Delaneys, who from the outside appear to be an enviably contented family. Former tennis coaches Joy and Stan are parents to four adult children. After fifty years of marriage, they have finally sold their famed tennis academy and are ready to start what should be the golden years of their lives. But after Joy disappears, her children are forced to re-examine their parents’ marriage and their family history with fresh eyes.', 'Follow the Delaneys, who from the outside appear to be an enviably contented family. Former tennis coaches Joy and Stan are parents to four adult children. After fifty years of marriage, they have finally sold their famed tennis academy and are ready to start what should be the golden years of their lives. But after Joy disappears, her children are forced to re-examine their parents’ marriage and their family history with fresh eyes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/goa4saZkf8r4zmBNgS6IiiPxEEN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222031'),
  ('491788246252133890', 'Appleseed XIII', 2011, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Maaya Sakamoto, Koichi Yamadera, Mikako Takahashi, Sakiko Tamagawa, Naomi Shindo, Ami Koshimizu, Hiro Shimono, Jouji Nakata', null, 'Following World War V, a global-scale conflict fought with non-nuclear weapons that almost halved the earth''s population, the city-nation of Olympus stands as a beacon of hope in a world of chaos. The utopian metropolis is governed by Gaia, a vast artificial intelligence, and administered by genetically engineered humanoids known as bioroids. Although Olympus seems like a peaceful city on the surface, racial (human vs. bioroids vs. cyborgs), religious, and political conflicts lurk underneath -threatening to overturn the delicately balanced peace of this so-called utopia.', 'Following World War V, a global-scale conflict fought with non-nuclear weapons that almost halved the earth''s population, the city-nation of Olympus stands as a beacon of hope in a world of chaos. The utopian metropolis is governed by Gaia, a vast artificial intelligence, and administered by genetically engineered humanoids known as bioroids. Although Olympus seems like a peaceful city on the surface, racial (human vs. bioroids vs. cyborgs), religious, and political conflicts lurk underneath -threatening to overturn the delicately balanced peace of this so-called utopia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vd5X3LvKBZmN65SrqkwiV1xx96.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45348'),
  ('911492952882577700', 'Appropriate Adult', 2011, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, 'Neil McKay', 'Dominic West, Emily Watson, Robert Glenister, Monica Dolan, Anthony Flanagan, Samuel Roukin, Gerard Horan, Selin Hizli', null, 'The extraordinary story of Gloucester housewife Janet Leach who played a key role in the uncovering of the crimes of Fred and Rosemary West.', 'The extraordinary story of Gloucester housewife Janet Leach who played a key role in the uncovering of the crimes of Fred and Rosemary West.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJWUhvJXoTdiAkuRz8WbFiMlpRH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44434'),
  ('613220434141409321', 'April Showers Bring May Flowers', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Saori Hayami, Shimba Tsuchiya, Yoshino Aoyama, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Tasuku Hatanaka', null, 'Pessimistic high school student Hana Tabata doesn''t believe her life could ever be like that of a heroine from the shoujo manga she reads—she''s convinced she''s ugly, and she''s always alone. Still, she can''t help but imagine herself as a leading lady when she''s changing out flowers early one morning...until she''s caught in the act by her handsome classmate Yousuke Ueno! Hana can''t wrap her head around his kind words at first, but as they grow closer, she finds her life slowly beginning to change…', 'Pessimistic high school student Hana Tabata doesn''t believe her life could ever be like that of a heroine from the shoujo manga she reads—she''s convinced she''s ugly, and she''s always alone. Still, she can''t help but imagine herself as a leading lady when she''s changing out flowers early one morning...until she''s caught in the act by her handsome classmate Yousuke Ueno! Hana can''t wrap her head around his kind words at first, but as they grow closer, she finds her life slowly beginning to change…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpDGvJoMz6UFF08PTN2nlTUgZIf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217409'),
  ('907696560262171795', 'Apuesta por un amor', 2004, 'Drama, Soap', 'Bernardo Romero Pereiro, Gabriela Ortigoza', 'Gabriela Ortigoza, Juan Carlos Alcalá', 'Patricia Manterola, Juan Soler, Eric del Castillo, Jorge Vargas, Fabián Robles, Mónika Sánchez, Dacia González, Margarita Ambriz', 'TV-14', 'Apuesta por un Amor is a Mexican telenovela produced by Angelli Nesma Medina for Televisa in 2004. Patricia Manterola and Juan Soler starred as the protagonists, while Alejandra Ávalos, Roberto Ballesteros and Fabián Robles starred as the antagonists.', 'Apuesta por un Amor is a Mexican telenovela produced by Angelli Nesma Medina for Televisa in 2004. Patricia Manterola and Juan Soler starred as the protagonists, while Alejandra Ávalos, Roberto Ballesteros and Fabián Robles starred as the antagonists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iShHEsgIsBen59pF1p9ejTaRoLa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13918'),
  ('688001250164384625', 'Aqua Teen Hunger Force', 2000, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Matt Maiellaro, Dave Willis', null, 'Dana Snyder, Carey Means, Dave Willis', 'TV-14', 'The surreal adventures of three anthropomorphic fast food items: Master Shake, Frylock and Meatwad, and their human nextdoor neighbor, Carl Brutananadilewski.', 'The surreal adventures of three anthropomorphic fast food items: Master Shake, Frylock and Meatwad, and their human nextdoor neighbor, Carl Brutananadilewski.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCWOkfMLsT2sGHadCkmR65MWtJu.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:251'),
  ('895476461649040681', 'Aquaman', 1967, 'Animation, Kids, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Marvin Miller, Ted Knight, Jerry Dexter, Diana Maddox', 'TV-Y', 'Aquaman is a Filmation animated series that premiered on CBS on September 9, 1967, and ended June 1970. It is a 30-minute version of The Superman/Aquaman Hour of Adventure, repackaged without the Superman and Superboy segments. The show is composed of previously-aired adventures featuring the DC Comics superheroes Aquaman and his sidekick Aqualad, the Atom, the Flash and Kid Flash, the Green Lantern and Hawkman. The Justice League of America and Teen Titans are also featured in team adventures.', 'Aquaman is a Filmation animated series that premiered on CBS on September 9, 1967, and ended June 1970. It is a 30-minute version of The Superman/Aquaman Hour of Adventure, repackaged without the Superman and Superboy segments. The show is composed of previously-aired adventures featuring the DC Comics superheroes Aquaman and his sidekick Aqualad, the Atom, the Flash and Kid Flash, the Green Lantern and Hawkman. The Justice League of America and Teen Titans are also featured in team adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/346THllqSorcNec6HvIMy0NmqFi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10724'),
  ('624409908002201134', 'Aquaman: King of Atlantis', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Victor Courtright, Marly Halpern-Graser', null, 'Cooper Andrews, Gillian Jacobs, Thomas Lennon, Dana Snyder', 'TV-PG', 'It’s Aquaman’s first day on the job as king of Atlantis and he’s got a LOT of catching up to do. Luckily, he has his two royal advisors to back him up – Vulko, the scholar, and Mera, the water controlling warrior-princess. Between dealing with unscrupulous surface dwellers, elder evils from beyond time and his own half-brother who wants to overthrow him, Aquaman is going to have to rise to the challenge and prove to his subjects, and to himself, that he’s the right man for the trident!', 'It’s Aquaman’s first day on the job as king of Atlantis and he’s got a LOT of catching up to do. Luckily, he has his two royal advisors to back him up – Vulko, the scholar, and Mera, the water controlling warrior-princess. Between dealing with unscrupulous surface dwellers, elder evils from beyond time and his own half-brother who wants to overthrow him, Aquaman is going to have to rise to the challenge and prove to his subjects, and to himself, that he’s the right man for the trident!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IaKfcoz91R7t0gscRHuzyuWPVm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98137'),
  ('135898958707860559', 'Aquarion', 2005, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nobunaga Shimazaki, Ayane Sakura, Ari Ozawa, Haruka Chisuga, Jouji Nakata, Ryoko Shiraishi, Saima Nakano, Takayuki Asai', 'TV-14', 'Set in the future, a giant fighting machine called the Aquarion is humanity''s only effective weapon in the fight against the technologically advanced species called the Shadow Angels.', 'Set in the future, a giant fighting machine called the Aquarion is humanity''s only effective weapon in the fight against the technologically advanced species called the Shadow Angels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7nYCiRLElXOcSICrZ8jdBqQP1m.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:8872'),
  ('306480811992697470', 'Aquarius', 2015, 'Drama, Crime', 'John McNamara', null, 'David Duchovny, Grey Damon, Gethin Anthony, Emma Dumont, Claire Holt, Michaela McManus, Brían F. O''Byrne, Milauna Jackson', 'TV-14', 'In the late 1960s, a Los Angeles police sergeant with a complicated personal life starts tracking a small-time criminal and budding cult leader seeking out vulnerable women to join his “cause.” The name of that man is Charles Manson.', 'In the late 1960s, a Los Angeles police sergeant with a complicated personal life starts tracking a small-time criminal and budding cult leader seeking out vulnerable women to join his “cause.” The name of that man is Charles Manson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTihIjUI2ScBXVgcZiyTAq1PBBA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61239'),
  ('178125354795408717', 'Arabela', 1980, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Václav Vorlíček, Miloš Macourek', null, null, null, 'Arabela was a children''s television series produced in Czechoslovakia which aired from 1979 to 1981. The series has 13 episodes and is in the Czech language.', 'Arabela was a children''s television series produced in Czechoslovakia which aired from 1979 to 1981. The series has 13 episodes and is in the Czech language.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujdoOQj0ts750xMREaOCyxtvrj0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:17784'),
  ('1050204708792366143', 'Arabela se vrací aneb Rumburak králem Říše pohádek', 1993, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Jana Brejchová, Marián Labuda, Stella Zázvorková, Vlastimil Brodský, Petr Nárožný, Radoslav Brzobohatý, Vladimír Dlouhý, Jiří Lábus', null, 'A lot has happened since the magic bell last rang. Arabela and Petr have been together for 10 years and are still waiting in vain for a child. Honzík and Mařenka have become university students, studying folklore, i.e. fairy tales. The realm of fairy tales is seriously threatened. The giant Balibul is banished from the land of giants for being a vegetarian and settles near the kingdom to learn how to eat people. Every day he demands a new victim. Bystrozraký escapes from prison to avoid becoming his victim and seizes the magic cloak. He flies into the world of humans.', 'A lot has happened since the magic bell last rang. Arabela and Petr have been together for 10 years and are still waiting in vain for a child. Honzík and Mařenka have become university students, studying folklore, i.e. fairy tales. The realm of fairy tales is seriously threatened. The giant Balibul is banished from the land of giants for being a vegetarian and settles near the kingdom to learn how to eat people. Every day he demands a new victim. Bystrozraký escapes from prison to avoid becoming his victim and seizes the magic cloak. He flies into the world of humans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kAMCKvm61NIDdaVyw2yYiEdxMyh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43650'),
  ('168857568809183647', 'Arabian Nights', 2000, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Family', 'Peter Barnes', 'Peter Barnes', 'Mili Avital, Alan Bates, James Frain, Rufus Sewell, Tchéky Karyo, Dougray Scott, Jason Scott Lee, Vanessa-Mae', null, 'Targeted for assassination by his first wife and his evil brother, a young sultan must marry by the next full moon or he will lose his kingdom. His uncertainty over his newfound bride causes her to stall the sultan with a series of fantastic stories to ease the tension and stall her impending execution.', 'Targeted for assassination by his first wife and his evil brother, a young sultan must marry by the next full moon or he will lose his kingdom. His uncertainty over his newfound bride causes her to stall the sultan with a series of fantastic stories to ease the tension and stall her impending execution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMLISBzw6QDo60h2C1NGUL00puS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20658'),
  ('938564639550843214', 'Araiya-san! Ore to Aitsu ga Onnayu de!?', 2019, 'Animation', null, null, 'Ayaka Igasaki, Shohei Kajikawa, Ringo Aoba, Tetsuto Furuwaka, Momoko Obana', null, 'Male student Souta Tsukishima begins working at his family''s public bathhouse as a back washer. While concealing her true identity, Souta''s classmate Aoi Yuzuki visits the bathhouse. A relationship between the two begins to develop when Souta washes Aoi''s back.', 'Male student Souta Tsukishima begins working at his family''s public bathhouse as a back washer. While concealing her true identity, Souta''s classmate Aoi Yuzuki visits the bathhouse. A relationship between the two begins to develop when Souta washes Aoi''s back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upxgNd7JdqbxUXDuEkgba18iG8F.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88090'),
  ('676974566505493584', 'Arakawa Under the Bridge', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Hiroshi Kamiya, Maaya Sakamoto, Keiji Fujiwara, Takehito Koyasu, Chiaki Omigawa, Miyuki Sawashiro, Tomokazu Sugita, Chiwa Saito', 'TV-14', 'Ko Ichinomiya''s family motto is "Never be indebted to anyone," but after losing his pants and falling into the Arakawa River, he quickly finds himself in debt to his savior, the cutely insane Nino who happens to live under the bridge. To repay her, he vows to help her with her desire to "experience love." Along the way he''ll meet the river''s other residents, including a hot-blooded kappa, a Sister in drag, and a literal rock star.', 'Ko Ichinomiya''s family motto is "Never be indebted to anyone," but after losing his pants and falling into the Arakawa River, he quickly finds himself in debt to his savior, the cutely insane Nino who happens to live under the bridge. To repay her, he vows to help her with her desire to "experience love." Along the way he''ll meet the river''s other residents, including a hot-blooded kappa, a Sister in drag, and a literal rock star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAV7p66J8tDlrkH4cis5fXjGllc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:35423'),
  ('861276189973923514', 'Aranyak', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Rohan Sippy', 'Charudutt Acharya', 'Raveena Tandon, Ashutosh Rana, Parambrata Chatterjee, Zakir Hussain, Meghna Malik, Lalit Parimoo, Indraneil Sengupta, Priyanka Setia', 'TV-MA', 'After a foreign teenage tourist goes missing in a misty village, Kasturi, a frazzled local cop, is forced to team up with her city-bred successor, Angad, on a high-profile case that unearths skeletons and resurrects a long-forgotten legend of a savage serial killer in the woods.', 'After a foreign teenage tourist goes missing in a misty village, Kasturi, a frazzled local cop, is forced to team up with her city-bred successor, Angad, on a high-profile case that unearths skeletons and resurrects a long-forgotten legend of a savage serial killer in the woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3YgODvXTkNiYBbiqv56yHDVuZkZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128217'),
  ('627579683741174406', 'Aranybulla', 2022, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, 'Mark Kis-Szabo, Béla Trux', 'Kőszegi Ákos, Zsolt Trill, Franciska Törőcsik, Zoltán Rátóti, Kornél Simon, István Dankó, Zoltán Géczi, Tamás Széles', null, 'King Andrew II''s accession to the throne proved to be an adventure, and he set to work to take decisive action against the country''s enemies. In 1222, he passed a set of laws that changed economic policy and became a unique document in the history of Europe.', 'King Andrew II''s accession to the throne proved to be an adventure, and he set to work to take decisive action against the country''s enemies. In 1222, he passed a set of laws that changed economic policy and became a unique document in the history of Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25pN8aCrRvIOiOflEZYI7U1ZIMM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216169'),
  ('330195808179810206', 'Arashi ni Shiyagare', 2010, 'Comedy, Family, Talk, Reality', null, null, 'Satoshi Ohno, Kazunari Ninomiya, Sho Sakurai, Jun Matsumoto, Masaki Aiba', null, 'Arashi ni Shiyagare (嵐にしやがれ) (Must Be ARASHI!) is an ongoing Japanese variety show on NTV starring the members of Arashi. The show began on 24 April 2010 and it airs from 10:00 to 10:54 p.m. (JST) every Saturday. It is Arashi''s sixth and current variety show to be aired on NTV as well as their third show to be aired during primetime. There will be a male guest, which the members of Arashi addresses as ''Aniki'' (Brother), who will teach Arashi different things. The other section, called ''Encounter the Unknown'', is where Arashi will pick up new skills, such as interviewing celebrities, learning the tips to climb a mountain, from meeting experienced professionals they usually have not met before.', 'Arashi ni Shiyagare (嵐にしやがれ) (Must Be ARASHI!) is an ongoing Japanese variety show on NTV starring the members of Arashi. The show began on 24 April 2010 and it airs from 10:00 to 10:54 p.m. (JST) every Saturday. It is Arashi''s sixth and current variety show to be aired on NTV as well as their third show to be aired during primetime. There will be a male guest, which the members of Arashi addresses as ''Aniki'' (Brother), who will teach Arashi different things. The other section, called ''Encounter the Unknown'', is where Arashi will pick up new skills, such as interviewing celebrities, learning the tips to climb a mountain, from meeting experienced professionals they usually have not met before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUvEfCYJR1KMNpqiqG9ALuHCOTn.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:106410'),
  ('1118222245841917058', 'Arc the Lad', 1999, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Masuo Amada, Hiroshi Iwasaki, Hiro Yuuki, Daisuke Namikawa, Yui Horie', null, 'For years, a clandestine organization known as White House has experimented in transforming adults and children into mutants known as Chimeras. Young Elk, master of the spirit of flame, has managed to escape and transform himself into an up-and-coming member of the Hunter''s Guild, tracking down targets for money. Following a hunt involving a crazed hijacker on the run from White House, Elk meets Lieza, herself an escapee from a village attacked by White House and master of the docile dog-monster Pandit. Following the incident, Elk devotes himself to uncovering the motive behind it, and exacting revenge on the rouge known as Arc, who ostensibly led the attack on Elk''s village and killed the young man''s parents.', 'For years, a clandestine organization known as White House has experimented in transforming adults and children into mutants known as Chimeras. Young Elk, master of the spirit of flame, has managed to escape and transform himself into an up-and-coming member of the Hunter''s Guild, tracking down targets for money. Following a hunt involving a crazed hijacker on the run from White House, Elk meets Lieza, herself an escapee from a village attacked by White House and master of the docile dog-monster Pandit. Following the incident, Elk devotes himself to uncovering the motive behind it, and exacting revenge on the rouge known as Arc, who ostensibly led the attack on Elk''s village and killed the young man''s parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jBGsAzjumIMpb1RVKFsCWLWXI4B.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15124'),
  ('297499976103052049', 'Arcadia', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Bas Adriaensen, Zita Theunynck, Philippe De Schepper', null, 'Melody Klaver, Gene Bervoets, Lynn Van Royen, Monic Hendrickx, Abigail Abraham, Maarten Heijmans, Ellie de Lange, Romana Vrede', 'TV-14', 'Following a major catastrophe, a new society, Arcadia, is born. Resources have become scarce and a point system, known as the Citizen Score, is introduced. It determines what you can and may do and what a citizen is entitled to.', 'Following a major catastrophe, a new society, Arcadia, is born. Resources have become scarce and a point system, known as the Citizen Score, is introduced. It determines what you can and may do and what a citizen is entitled to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6cYzs0fGLBLMg2enM6seVnf7bgO.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:208487'),
  ('930954626952705140', 'Arcadia of My Youth: Endless Orbit SSX', 1982, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', 'Leiji Matsumoto', null, 'Makio Inoue, Kei Tomiyama, Yoko Asagami, Reiko Tajima, Yuriko Yamamoto, Satomi Majima, Hiromi Tsuru, Yasuo Tanaka', 'NR', 'Arcadia of My Youth: Endless Orbit SSX is an animated television series created by Leiji Matsumoto. It''s the sequel to the 1982 animated film Arcadia of My Youth. However, like many of the stories set in the Leijiverse, the continuity of the series does not necessarily agree with other Harlock series or films.', 'Arcadia of My Youth: Endless Orbit SSX is an animated television series created by Leiji Matsumoto. It''s the sequel to the 1982 animated film Arcadia of My Youth. However, like many of the stories set in the Leijiverse, the continuity of the series does not necessarily agree with other Harlock series or films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXwS0G7HO2FMIKzrHdemm5FHofb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37392'),
  ('81465506517065031', 'Arcane', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Christian Linke, Alex Yee', null, 'Hailee Steinfeld, Ella Purnell', 'TV-14', 'Amid the stark discord of twin cities Piltover and Zaun, two sisters fight on rival sides of a war between magic technologies and clashing convictions.', 'Amid the stark discord of twin cities Piltover and Zaun, two sisters fight on rival sides of a war between magic technologies and clashing convictions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abf8tHznhSvl9BAElD2cQeRr7do.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:94605'),
  ('714274371349910642', 'Arcane: Bridging the Rift', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Ella Purnell, Hailee Steinfeld, Harry Lloyd, Kevin Alejandro', null, 'The story of how Arcane came to be. Learn the origins of Riot Games'' relationship with Fortiche Productions, the animation studio behind the series, and how the two teamed up to bring the world of League of Legends to life and create the animated series’ unique story, characters, and style.', 'The story of how Arcane came to be. Learn the origins of Riot Games'' relationship with Fortiche Productions, the animation studio behind the series, and how the two teamed up to bring the world of League of Legends to life and create the animated series’ unique story, characters, and style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oGLsDE1zshsB773KarGX8FsXP0h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203701'),
  ('217509116987941992', 'Archangel', 2005, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Daniel Craig, Yekaterina Rednikova, Gabriel Macht, Konstantin Lavronenko, Alexey Diakov, Harry Ditson, Anna Gerasimova, Avtandil Makharadze', 'TV-MA', 'Fluke Kelso, a dissipated, middle-aged former Oxford historian, who is in Moscow to attend a conference on the newly opened Soviet archives, receives in his hotel a very unexpected visitor.', 'Fluke Kelso, a dissipated, middle-aged former Oxford historian, who is in Moscow to attend a conference on the newly opened Soviet archives, receives in his hotel a very unexpected visitor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8nIZ669NG0d1jhshRiwBnqBCd9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30301'),
  ('890901418468854252', 'Archer', 2009, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure, Animation', 'Adam Reed', null, 'H. Jon Benjamin, Judy Greer, Amber Nash, Chris Parnell, Aisha Tyler, Lucky Yates', 'TV-MA', 'Sterling Archer is the world''s most daunting spy. He works for ISIS, a spy agency run by his mother. In between dealing with his boss and his co-workers - one of whom is his ex-girlfriend - Archer manages to annoy or seduce everyone that crosses his path. His antics are only excusable because at the end of the day, he still somehow always manages to thwart whatever crises was threatening mankind.', 'Sterling Archer is the world''s most daunting spy. He works for ISIS, a spy agency run by his mother. In between dealing with his boss and his co-workers - one of whom is his ex-girlfriend - Archer manages to annoy or seduce everyone that crosses his path. His antics are only excusable because at the end of the day, he still somehow always manages to thwart whatever crises was threatening mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vhnrkTGYPqcB63ALcSJm0WoaKHT.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:10283'),
  ('613313913239678898', 'Archibald''s Next Big Thing', 2019, 'Kids, Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Tony Hale, Jacob Moffat, Drew Champion', null, 'Tony Hale, Rosamund Pike, Kari Wahlgren, Jordan Fisher, Chelsea Kane, Adam Pally', 'TV-Y7', 'Happy-go-lucky chicken Archibald may not remember to do his chores, but he never forgets to have fun. After all, life''s an adventure!', 'Happy-go-lucky chicken Archibald may not remember to do his chores, but he never forgets to have fun. After all, life''s an adventure!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojqEPDUwkpLBwIvDIQqVeeWwklJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:93310'),
  ('358395952409475779', 'Archie Bunker''s Place', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Johnny Speight, Norman Lear', null, 'Carroll O''Connor, Danielle Brisebois, Allan Melvin, Barbara Meek, Denise Miller, Jason Wingreen, Bill Quinn, Barry Gordon', 'TV-PG', 'Archie Bunker''s Place is an American sitcom originally broadcast on the CBS network, conceived in 1979 as a spin-off and continuation of All in the Family. While not as popular as its predecessor, the show maintained a large enough audience to last for four seasons, until its cancellation in 1983. In its first season, the show performed so well that it knocked Mork & Mindy out of its new Sunday night time slot.', 'Archie Bunker''s Place is an American sitcom originally broadcast on the CBS network, conceived in 1979 as a spin-off and continuation of All in the Family. While not as popular as its predecessor, the show maintained a large enough audience to last for four seasons, until its cancellation in 1983. In its first season, the show performed so well that it knocked Mork & Mindy out of its new Sunday night time slot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjNp6j9XIfUtNrIJWOC9uzfvZN4.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4277'),
  ('121727150063937329', 'Archie: The Man Who Became Cary Grant', 2023, 'Drama', 'Jeff Pope', null, 'Jason Isaacs, Laura Aikman, Harriet Walter', null, 'The four-part drama series will tell the story of Cary Grant’s life, from his humble beginnings as Archie Leach in Bristol, England to the Hollywood leading man he became.', 'The four-part drama series will tell the story of Cary Grant’s life, from his humble beginnings as Archie Leach in Bristol, England to the Hollywood leading man he became.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omaHUkjfGf8W5HtnnmXpxplukTF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207759'),
  ('544668834232012124', 'Archie''s Weird Mysteries', 1999, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Andrew Rannells, America Young, Camille Schmidt, Chris Lundquist, Paul Sosso, Ben Beck', 'TV-Y7', 'Things are getting weird in Riverdale, home of all-American boy and high school newspaper reporter, Archie Andrews. Ever since an experiment in the high school physics lab went awry, Riverdale has become a magnet for the stuff of which B-movies are made.', 'Things are getting weird in Riverdale, home of all-American boy and high school newspaper reporter, Archie Andrews. Ever since an experiment in the high school physics lab went awry, Riverdale has become a magnet for the stuff of which B-movies are made.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6i0FAD2YCXdcOzQur90mThIYHiW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3747'),
  ('778411652906584286', 'Archive 81', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Rebecca Sonnenshine', null, 'Mamoudou Athie, Dina Shihabi, Evan Jonigkeit, Martin Donovan, Matt McGorry, Julia Chan, Ariana Neal', 'TV-MA', 'An archivist takes a job restoring damaged videotapes and gets pulled into the vortex of a mystery involving the missing director and a demonic cult.', 'An archivist takes a job restoring damaged videotapes and gets pulled into the vortex of a mystery involving the missing director and a demonic cult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1jeSEm6a88GFcLzlHQr60D0dOi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112314'),
  ('752274032784859482', 'Archiwista', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Andrzej Ciborski, Piotr Mikołajczak', null, 'Henryk Talar, Mirosław Zbrojewicz, Rafał Mohr, Anna Kraszewska', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBdQ7DnZ81qaY2585Sh3MuY5EDu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:97274'),
  ('981036608045812787', 'Arctic Air', 2012, 'Drama', 'Ian Weir', null, 'Adam Beach, Pascale Hutton, John Reardon, Emilie Ullerup, Kevin McNulty, Carmen Moore, Timothy Webber, Stephen Lobo', null, 'Arctic Air is about a Yellowknife-based maverick airline and the unconventional family who runs it. The owners are Mel Ivarson, an old school bush pilot; Krista Ivarson, Mel''s daughter; and Bobby Martin, the son of Ivarson''s deceased partner. Episodes focus on interpersonal conflicts between the characters as well as dramatic flying missions with their aging fleet of Douglas DC-3s, de Havilland Canada DHC-3 Otters and other aircraft. Each episode has one or more flying missions. The series was canceled on March 17, 2014, due to government budgetary cuts', 'Arctic Air is about a Yellowknife-based maverick airline and the unconventional family who runs it. The owners are Mel Ivarson, an old school bush pilot; Krista Ivarson, Mel''s daughter; and Bobby Martin, the son of Ivarson''s deceased partner. Episodes focus on interpersonal conflicts between the characters as well as dramatic flying missions with their aging fleet of Douglas DC-3s, de Havilland Canada DHC-3 Otters and other aircraft. Each episode has one or more flying missions. The series was canceled on March 17, 2014, due to government budgetary cuts', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2396GkmGemKX7NOrzaqnogdLJCa.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:43260'),
  ('1145907361296691472', 'Arctic Ascent with Alex Honnold', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Alex Honnold, Hazel Findlay, Mikey Schaefer, Aldo Kane, Sanni McCandless', 'TV-PG', 'Alex Honnold leads an expedition to Greenland to climb a huge 4,000 foot sea cliff and investigate the impacts climate change on the region.', 'Alex Honnold leads an expedition to Greenland to climb a huge 4,000 foot sea cliff and investigate the impacts climate change on the region.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2B7QGN575Xm2Fgz0FPIhNx735PM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:131433'),
  ('165888465447629536', 'Arctic Circle', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Olli Haikka, Petja Peltomaa, Joona Tena', null, 'Iina Kuustonen, Pihla Viitala, Venla Ronkainen, Elena Leeve, Mikko Leppilampi, Taneli Mäkelä', 'NR', 'During a routine search of an old cabin in the remote and wintery back country, Finnish policewoman, Nina Kautsalo, discovers two dead prostitutes, with a third still fighting for her life. The ensuing investigation takes a surprise twist when an extremely rare and deadly virus is discovered in the surviving woman’s bloodwork. When the Finnish Bureau of Investigation takes over the case, German virologist, Thomas Lorenz is called in to assist in identifying and containing the virus. Set within the endless white expanse of the arctic circle, Nina and Thomas must rely on each other to have any hope of saving the ones they love. But what takes precedence? A deadly virus or an active serial killer?', 'During a routine search of an old cabin in the remote and wintery back country, Finnish policewoman, Nina Kautsalo, discovers two dead prostitutes, with a third still fighting for her life. The ensuing investigation takes a surprise twist when an extremely rare and deadly virus is discovered in the surviving woman’s bloodwork. When the Finnish Bureau of Investigation takes over the case, German virologist, Thomas Lorenz is called in to assist in identifying and containing the virus. Set within the endless white expanse of the arctic circle, Nina and Thomas must rely on each other to have any hope of saving the ones they love. But what takes precedence? A deadly virus or an active serial killer?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b239FgK8ut5wu6IftmdcZuj4PJ0.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:71115'),
  ('267858463380360627', 'Arde Madrid', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Paco León, Anna R. Costa', null, 'Inma Cuesta, Paco León, Debi Mazar, Anna Castillo, Julián Villagrán, Ken Appledorn, Osmar Núñez, Fabiana García Lago', 'NR', 'Madrid, 1961. Ana Mari is single, lame, Francoist and instructor of the Sección Femenina. By order of the dictator Franco, she must go to work as a maid to Ava Gardner''s house and spy on her, pretending to be married to Manolo, a hustler who will become the driver of the American actress.', 'Madrid, 1961. Ana Mari is single, lame, Francoist and instructor of the Sección Femenina. By order of the dictator Franco, she must go to work as a maid to Ava Gardner''s house and spy on her, pretending to be married to Manolo, a hustler who will become the driver of the American actress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQrVjU83WYxispobGbwyaEtcF0l.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83256'),
  ('1026203193237238719', 'Are We There Yet?', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Ali LeRoi', null, 'Terry Crews, Essence Atkins, Teala Dunn, Coy Stewart, Telma Hopkins, Christian Finnegan, Keesha Sharp', 'TV-PG', 'Are We There Yet? opens where the popular film of the same name left off, with Nick and Suzanne newly married. After six months, their family is beginning to show growing pains, from the complexities of life as newlyweds to weathering the storm of teenage children. Work makes life all the more complicated. Former athlete Nick has sold his sports paraphernalia store and now works in information technology. Party planner Suzanne also has a hectic professional schedule.', 'Are We There Yet? opens where the popular film of the same name left off, with Nick and Suzanne newly married. After six months, their family is beginning to show growing pains, from the complexities of life as newlyweds to weathering the storm of teenage children. Work makes life all the more complicated. Former athlete Nick has sold his sports paraphernalia store and now works in information technology. Party planner Suzanne also has a hectic professional schedule.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDhGyrMlgrM5GKtPaJINP3Xg1kr.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:36473'),
  ('184899264202139948', 'Are You Afraid of the Dark?', 1992, 'Mystery, Kids, Drama', 'D.J. MacHale, Ned Kandel', null, 'Daniel DeSanto, David Deveau, Vanessa Lengies, Kareem Blackwell, Elisha Cuthbert', 'TV-Y7', 'This spooky anthology series for kids recounts ghost stories told by the young members of the Midnight Society as they gather around a campfire. Each episode opens with members of the Midnight Society at their secret spot in the woods, where they prepare their fire and the night''s storyteller announces the title of the his or her offering. However, the cameras soon leave the storyteller and switch to the tale being told.', 'This spooky anthology series for kids recounts ghost stories told by the young members of the Midnight Society as they gather around a campfire. Each episode opens with members of the Midnight Society at their secret spot in the woods, where they prepare their fire and the night''s storyteller announces the title of the his or her offering. However, the cameras soon leave the storyteller and switch to the tale being told.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CB16J0RHvbaO8Z7KXXwcknqlSX.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:2913'),
  ('32527930576466854', 'Are You Afraid of the Dark?', 2019, 'Mystery', 'BenDavid Grabinski', null, 'Conor Sherry, Telci Huynh, Luca Padovan, Dior Goodjohn, Chance Hurstfield', 'TV-PG', 'Each season of this horror anthology series follows a different group of kids, members of the Midnight Society, as they discover terrifying curses and creatures.', 'Each season of this horror anthology series follows a different group of kids, members of the Midnight Society, as they discover terrifying curses and creatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WUw41k7F0KClpJMyvwBgVVRmbb.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:93693'),
  ('310527148238279522', 'Are You Being Served?', 1972, 'Comedy', 'David Croft, Jeremy Lloyd', null, 'Frank Thornton, John Inman, Mollie Sugden, Wendy Richard, Nicholas Smith, Mike Berry, Arthur English', 'TV-PG', 'This comedy series, which follows the exploits of employees at London''s fictional "Grace Brothers" department store, is full of sexual innuendo, slapstick, visual gags, and double entendres. Much of the show''s humor parodies Britain''s class system, and many of the show''s characters are based on stereotypes of the period, including the effeminate Mr. Humphries and the rich, but stingy, store owner.', 'This comedy series, which follows the exploits of employees at London''s fictional "Grace Brothers" department store, is full of sexual innuendo, slapstick, visual gags, and double entendres. Much of the show''s humor parodies Britain''s class system, and many of the show''s characters are based on stereotypes of the period, including the effeminate Mr. Humphries and the rich, but stingy, store owner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rQHn58WwUENWyrFhoZjLUkYpxT.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:168'),
  ('824457186926196277', 'Are You Human?', 2018, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Mystery', 'Jo Jung-joo', 'Jo Jung-joo', 'Seo Kang-joon, Gong Seung-yeon, Lee Jun-hyuk, Park Hwan-Hee, Kim Sung-ryung, Yu Oh-seong, Park Young-kyu, Choi Deok-moon', null, 'Nam Shin is a son from a family who runs a large company. After an unexpected accident, he falls into a coma. His mother Oh Ro-Ra is an authority on brain science and artificial intelligence. She creates an android named Nam Shin III which looks like just like her son Nam Shin. The android pretends to be Nam Shin and he has a bodyguard So-Bong.', 'Nam Shin is a son from a family who runs a large company. After an unexpected accident, he falls into a coma. His mother Oh Ro-Ra is an authority on brain science and artificial intelligence. She creates an android named Nam Shin III which looks like just like her son Nam Shin. The android pretends to be Nam Shin and he has a bodyguard So-Bong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVjRu96T5T68hoVwqPd8QZQo5Sp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72548'),
  ('527930336231608558', 'Are You Lost?', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Kentarō Okamoto', null, 'Kiyono Yasuno, Azumi Waki, Mao Ichimichi, Hiyori Kouno, Akio Otsuka', 'TV-14', 'A disastrous school trip leaves four students stranded on an uninhabited island. Staying alive on a deserted island is easy for Homare, thanks to her survivalist father''s training. While the others struggle, she shows them that being isolated may not be as dreadful as they thought.', 'A disastrous school trip leaves four students stranded on an uninhabited island. Staying alive on a deserted island is easy for Homare, thanks to her survivalist father''s training. While the others struggle, she shows them that being isolated may not be as dreadful as they thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6ptupwJU5MmSfaSYfr8fvAYdev.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88805'),
  ('1144502350812495228', 'Are you OK', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Wang Miao', 'Ji Aojie, Tao Dian, Sheng Feng, Wei Chao', null, 'Today, the imperial court is soliciting traversals, giving them various positions according to their talents, changing the civilization after the fall, and trying to create a new world. Zuo Yunqi is just an ordinary young master, mixed with the court in disguise as a spy to save his father. However, he was recognized by one hired specifically to spot such spies, and the two engaged in an epic battle of wits. When the two jointly prevented a terrifying conspiracy, they found that the traversals secretly established an alliance to try to overthrow those in power and build a new society of peaceful coexistence. Zuo Yunqi and his party were forced to participate in this battle.', 'Today, the imperial court is soliciting traversals, giving them various positions according to their talents, changing the civilization after the fall, and trying to create a new world. Zuo Yunqi is just an ordinary young master, mixed with the court in disguise as a spy to save his father. However, he was recognized by one hired specifically to spot such spies, and the two engaged in an epic battle of wits. When the two jointly prevented a terrifying conspiracy, they found that the traversals secretly established an alliance to try to overthrow those in power and build a new society of peaceful coexistence. Zuo Yunqi and his party were forced to participate in this battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzVgoW5I9AOfjPCForKSC6z6V8v.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:105929'),
  ('318433170168815974', 'Are You Safe?', 2022, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Cao Dun, Huang Yan Wei, Li Haishu', 'Li Haishu, Huang Yan Wei', 'Tan Jianci, Rong Zishan, Lu Zizhen, He Lei, Zhao Wei, Qu Shanshan, Liang Dawei, Leng Xinqing', null, 'It tells the story of Qin Huai, Zhou You and Chen Mo, the "Three Musketeers" who traveled in the online world. Although they have different personalities, they all adhere to the initial intention of "science and technology to be good". The three men joined forces in the process of confronting an Internet illegal gang again and again. Suspicion to the story of liver and gallbladder.', 'It tells the story of Qin Huai, Zhou You and Chen Mo, the "Three Musketeers" who traveled in the online world. Although they have different personalities, they all adhere to the initial intention of "science and technology to be good". The three men joined forces in the process of confronting an Internet illegal gang again and again. Suspicion to the story of liver and gallbladder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLPfSF8AbJ1p8wACVD5YOLd4QwV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210003'),
  ('678769323684812721', 'Are You Smarter Than a 5th Grader?', 2007, 'Family, Kids, Reality', 'Barry Poznick, John Stevens, Mark Burnett', null, 'Jeff Foxworthy', 'TV-PG', 'Are You Smarter Than a 5th Grader? is a television game show format based on posing grade-school level questions to adults, hosted by Jeff Foxworthy. This television show began broadcast on the Fox Broadcasting Company network as a special in the United States and Canada on February 27, 2007, and it grew to be popular enough that a half-hour-long syndicated TV series was developed by the owners.', 'Are You Smarter Than a 5th Grader? is a television game show format based on posing grade-school level questions to adults, hosted by Jeff Foxworthy. This television show began broadcast on the Fox Broadcasting Company network as a special in the United States and Canada on February 27, 2007, and it grew to be popular enough that a half-hour-long syndicated TV series was developed by the owners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bohAK2y1EmIsZzKDwNjwmunC7c6.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:5592'),
  ('245767719240658440', 'Are You Smarter Than a Celebrity', 2024, 'Comedy, Reality', null, null, 'Travis Kelce, Queen Noveen', null, 'Contestants play for the chance to win up to $100,000 by answering questions about things they learned in grade school. There''s a classroom full of celebrities they can get help from – including Nikki Glaser, Nicole Byer, Lala Kent, Ryan Fitzpatrick and more! Can they ace grades 1 through 5 for a chance to play for the big money? Or will they flunk out along the way? It''s time to find out!', 'Contestants play for the chance to win up to $100,000 by answering questions about things they learned in grade school. There''s a classroom full of celebrities they can get help from – including Nikki Glaser, Nicole Byer, Lala Kent, Ryan Fitzpatrick and more! Can they ace grades 1 through 5 for a chance to play for the big money? Or will they flunk out along the way? It''s time to find out!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mDyk5zGaICXq3kSZ4uIH3Nkw0tX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:252006'),
  ('1050715307493060321', 'Are You Sure?!', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jimin, Jung Kook', 'TV-PG', 'Whenever BTS''s Jimin and Jung Kook meet, chaos and excitement ensue! In the summer of 2023, they embark on an unforgettable trip before their military enlistment. Their unpredictable adventure is full of surprises. Will Jimin and Jung Kook complete their journey safely?', 'Whenever BTS''s Jimin and Jung Kook meet, chaos and excitement ensue! In the summer of 2023, they embark on an unforgettable trip before their military enlistment. Their unpredictable adventure is full of surprises. Will Jimin and Jung Kook complete their journey safely?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NZzvgSnCBBxdDRmYJHRfBXVs43.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:254799'),
  ('382578205799740446', 'Are You The One', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Zhang Wanyi, Wang Churan, Chang Huasen, Liu Lingzi, Yuan Yuxuan, Zhang Chi, Duan Yixuan', null, 'The clever and decisive Liu Miantang, as the first lord of Mount Yang, led the people of Mount Yang to punish the wicked, promote goodness, and uphold justice. However, she suffered serious injuries under the attack of various evil forces and was rescued by Cui Xingzhou, the Prince of Huai Yang. When Liu Miantang woke up, she had no memory of Mount Yang, mistaking Cui Xingzhou for her husband, Cui Jiu. However, if their identities were exposed, can they face it honestly while enduring hardships?', 'The clever and decisive Liu Miantang, as the first lord of Mount Yang, led the people of Mount Yang to punish the wicked, promote goodness, and uphold justice. However, she suffered serious injuries under the attack of various evil forces and was rescued by Cui Xingzhou, the Prince of Huai Yang. When Liu Miantang woke up, she had no memory of Mount Yang, mistaking Cui Xingzhou for her husband, Cui Jiu. However, if their identities were exposed, can they face it honestly while enduring hardships?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YgYVgzFLg3drAMm3FlpWzhSbcy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:237882'),
  ('446653436074200735', 'Are You The One?', 2014, 'Reality', null, null, 'Kamie Crawford', 'TV-14', 'In the most ambitious dating experiment ever attempted, a group of gorgeous single women and guys are put through an extensive and scientific matchmaking process to find their Perfect Match.', 'In the most ambitious dating experiment ever attempted, a group of gorgeous single women and guys are put through an extensive and scientific matchmaking process to find their Perfect Match.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0ffWnsnRiw0NM9bDppksVguxLl.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:61535'),
  ('1106849997871027977', 'Are You There, Chelsea?', 2012, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Laura Prepon, Lauren Lapkus, Jake McDorman, Lenny Clarke, Mark Povinelli, Ali Wong, Chelsea Handler', 'TV-14', 'Chelsea Newman is young, strong-willed, and a force of nature determined to live life to the fullest and make no apologies. Her friends are along for the ride, but they all know it''s Chelsea''s way or the highway. Her fiery Cuban BFF accuses her of "collecting weirdoes", but to Chelsea, different types of people just make life more interesting. Chelsea works at her local bar, where her co-workers are just as crazy as she is. Based on Chelsea Handler''s 2008 best-selling autobiography, ''Are You There, Vodka? It''s Me, Chelsea''.', 'Chelsea Newman is young, strong-willed, and a force of nature determined to live life to the fullest and make no apologies. Her friends are along for the ride, but they all know it''s Chelsea''s way or the highway. Her fiery Cuban BFF accuses her of "collecting weirdoes", but to Chelsea, different types of people just make life more interesting. Chelsea works at her local bar, where her co-workers are just as crazy as she is. Based on Chelsea Handler''s 2008 best-selling autobiography, ''Are You There, Vodka? It''s Me, Chelsea''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mpTqwUvfYJcLy5f9g1IPKtrjmAT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42067'),
  ('276633677627817536', 'Arena', 1975, 'Documentary', null, 'John Read, Nicholas Shakespeare, Harold Pinter', null, 'NR', 'Arena is a British television documentary series, made and broadcast by the BBC. Voted by leading TV executives in Broadcast as one of the top 50 most influential programmes of all time, it has run since 1 October 1975 with over five hundred episodes made, directed by the likes of Martin Scorsese, Alan Yentob, Roly Keating, Frederick Baker, Volker Schlondorff and Vikram Jayanti. Arena''s subjects are a roll-call of the world''s best known cultural figures from the 20th and 21st centuries, from singers Bob Dylan and Amy Winehouse to academics Edward Said and Eric Hobsbawm, from writers Jean Genet and V S Naipaul to artists Francis Bacon and Louise Bourgeois. The current series editor is Anthony Wall.', 'Arena is a British television documentary series, made and broadcast by the BBC. Voted by leading TV executives in Broadcast as one of the top 50 most influential programmes of all time, it has run since 1 October 1975 with over five hundred episodes made, directed by the likes of Martin Scorsese, Alan Yentob, Roly Keating, Frederick Baker, Volker Schlondorff and Vikram Jayanti. Arena''s subjects are a roll-call of the world''s best known cultural figures from the 20th and 21st centuries, from singers Bob Dylan and Amy Winehouse to academics Edward Said and Eric Hobsbawm, from writers Jean Genet and V S Naipaul to artists Francis Bacon and Louise Bourgeois. The current series editor is Anthony Wall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOEqqj5kac2J96w3P9yhEhAnOeh.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2050'),
  ('563892415798968737', 'Ares', 2020, 'Mystery', 'Pieter Kuijpers', 'Michael Leendertse', 'Jade Olieberg, Tobias Kersloot, Lisa Smit, Frieda Barnhard, Hans Kesting, Rifka Lodeizen, Robin Boissevain, Jennifer Welts', 'TV-MA', 'When her friend suffers a bizarre accident, Rosa realizes the secret student society they''ve just joined is built on demonic secrets from Dutch history.', 'When her friend suffers a bizarre accident, Rosa realizes the secret student society they''ve just joined is built on demonic secrets from Dutch history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVUiL32XmwQyba3EH2E3g77dXge.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86769'),
  ('479322881908069709', 'Argentina ''78', 2024, 'Documentary', null, 'Lucas Bucci, Tomás Sposato, Julia Scarone', 'Mario Firmenich, Matías Bauso, César Luis Menotti, Mario Kempes, Daniel Passarella', null, 'In the midst of Argentina''s bloodiest era, the country took center stage as the host of the World Cup. The military government, the national team, and even the resistance risked everything for this monumental event.', 'In the midst of Argentina''s bloodiest era, the country took center stage as the host of the World Cup. The military government, the national team, and even the resistance risked everything for this monumental event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZgozqyoS7Vcs63OHPtIot9K4h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:278304'),
  ('57255872840993709', 'Argentina 2001', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Luis Luque, Diego Cremonesi, Nicolás Furtado, César Troncoso, Luis Machín, Jean Pierre Noher, Alejandra Flechner, Cecilia Rossetto', null, 'This Spanish-language series chronicles the politics and events leading up to the most severe economic and social crisis in Argentina’s history since its return to democracy. At the center of a government in crisis, a political appointee works as a liaison between the current administration and opposition party figures who seek to rise to power.', 'This Spanish-language series chronicles the politics and events leading up to the most severe economic and social crisis in Argentina’s history since its return to democracy. At the center of a government in crisis, a political appointee works as a liaison between the current administration and opposition party figures who seek to rise to power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3IoJEiipoZVz82gQET4lhZsiZy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128301'),
  ('486881637877542069', 'Argentine National Team, Road to Qatar', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Gonzalo Arias', 'Martín Méndez', 'Lionel Messi, Ángel Di María, Rodrigo De Paul, Lionel Scaloni, Leandro Paredes, Lautaro Martinez, Sergio Agüero, Pablo Aimar', null, 'Argentina National Football Team is getting ready for the World Cup and opens the door to behind-the-scenes. The qualifiers, the Copa América, the Finalissima and match preparation for Qatar as never seen before.', 'Argentina National Football Team is getting ready for the World Cup and opens the door to behind-the-scenes. The qualifiers, the Copa América, the Finalissima and match preparation for Qatar as never seen before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLeqKotFP8dTHk5fadCHlcc5iiV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206085'),
  ('873041934264708784', 'Argento Soma', 2000, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Takehito Koyasu, Yui Horie, Kikuko Inoue, Jouji Nakata, Sayuri, Houko Kuwashima, Yuji Takada, Soichiro Hoshi', 'NR', 'The 21st century was supposed to mark the beginning of mankind''s golden age of space travel. However, humanity''s lingering dreams of the stars are shelved when Earth suddenly comes under attack by alien entities. Trampling across the planet''s surface, these giant invaders leave nothing but death and destruction in their wake. Having suffered personal losses from the invasion, Takuto Kaneshiro joins the fight against the extraterrestrial enemies. In his quest for vengeance, the disillusioned young Takuto must seek out any possible allies, but the line between friend and foe is dangerously thin. When old powers crumble and new opportunities arise, many are prepared to capitalize on the chaos. Takuto soon realizes that the aliens may be the least complicated obstacle to uncovering the greater truth behind the catastrophic invasion.', 'The 21st century was supposed to mark the beginning of mankind''s golden age of space travel. However, humanity''s lingering dreams of the stars are shelved when Earth suddenly comes under attack by alien entities. Trampling across the planet''s surface, these giant invaders leave nothing but death and destruction in their wake. Having suffered personal losses from the invasion, Takuto Kaneshiro joins the fight against the extraterrestrial enemies. In his quest for vengeance, the disillusioned young Takuto must seek out any possible allies, but the line between friend and foe is dangerously thin. When old powers crumble and new opportunities arise, many are prepared to capitalize on the chaos. Takuto soon realizes that the aliens may be the least complicated obstacle to uncovering the greater truth behind the catastrophic invasion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gw1ess1otVWg8Pf3GNBk55wat1r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32535'),
  ('345254740551699319', 'Argevollen', 2014, 'Animation, War & Politics, Drama', null, null, 'Hiroshi Tsuchida, Sayaka Ohara, Saori Onishi, Ryota Osaka, Aimi, Chinami Hashimoto, Chinatsu Akasaki, Harumi Sakurai', null, 'The story takes place in a world where two countries, Arandas and Ingelmia, have been warring against each other for a very long time. Tokimune, a young man belonging to Independent Unit 8 of Arandas, saves a girl named Jamie when she is attacked by enemy forces. In order to survive, he pilots the new mech Argevollen and fights. The new mech Argevollen is defined by its U-Link system wherein the Argevollen molds to its pilot''s mind and cannot be piloted by anyone else. This customization allows the pilot to envision what the mech will do in his mind to use it, rather than physically move and steer it.', 'The story takes place in a world where two countries, Arandas and Ingelmia, have been warring against each other for a very long time. Tokimune, a young man belonging to Independent Unit 8 of Arandas, saves a girl named Jamie when she is attacked by enemy forces. In order to survive, he pilots the new mech Argevollen and fights. The new mech Argevollen is defined by its U-Link system wherein the Argevollen molds to its pilot''s mind and cannot be piloted by anyone else. This customization allows the pilot to envision what the mech will do in his mind to use it, rather than physically move and steer it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKHfz6CtjjK8zW7Grw6176f8eMk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64957'),
  ('299087640831616517', 'Argon', 2017, 'Drama', 'Shin Ha-eun, Jeon Yeong-shin', 'Ju Won-kyu, Jeon Yeong-shin, Shin Ha-eun', 'Kim Joo-hyuk, Chun Woo-hee, Park Won-sang, Lee Seung-joon, Shin Hyun-been, Park Hee-von, Lee Kyung-young, Cho Hyun-chul', 'TV-MA', 'In a world filled with provocative (and often misleading) news, a passionate team of investigative TV reporters strives to bring truths to light.', 'In a world filled with provocative (and often misleading) news, a passionate team of investigative TV reporters strives to bring truths to light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10owHXs2WFV5AlWFGGeq3U3nEzX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73453'),
  ('785717142172084395', 'Argos', 2022, 'News', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBBDbIbWTSZVOp5lNAM108fAFX2.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:253318'),
  ('978238738988624988', 'Ari Shaffir: Double Negative', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Eric Abrams', 'Ari Shaffir', 'Ari Shaffir', null, 'Wry yet thoughtful, comedian Ari Shaffir brings his edgy humor to two fast-paced stand-up specials about children and adulthood.', 'Wry yet thoughtful, comedian Ari Shaffir brings his edgy humor to two fast-paced stand-up specials about children and adulthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwxaMqIGBILQJa3qBhMlnAyzlzl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72888'),
  ('686637332260523600', 'Aria', 2005, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Erino Hazuki, Chiwa Saito, Ryo Hirohashi, Sayaka Ohara, Chinami Nishimura, Kaori Mizuhashi', 'TV-G', 'Set in the early 24th century against the backdrop of the city of Neo Venezia on the planet Mars. No longer the barren red planet, Mars has been flooded, inhabited and is something of a tourist hub for those looking for rest, relaxation and a gondola ride – the primary mode of travel in Neo Venezia. The Undines are professional gondoliers, tour guides for the people passing through. Akari Mizunashi is an Undine in training and this is a piece of her story.', 'Set in the early 24th century against the backdrop of the city of Neo Venezia on the planet Mars. No longer the barren red planet, Mars has been flooded, inhabited and is something of a tourist hub for those looking for rest, relaxation and a gondola ride – the primary mode of travel in Neo Venezia. The Undines are professional gondoliers, tour guides for the people passing through. Akari Mizunashi is an Undine in training and this is a piece of her story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XgXgWmsX1Un8eBHPjcBYpoae6M.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:53787'),
  ('655031339240023435', 'Aria the Scarlet Ammo', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Rie Kugimiya, Junji Majima, Mariya Ise, Ayako Kawasumi, Kaori Ishihara, Takuya Eguchi, Mikako Takahashi, Takayuki Kondo', 'TV-14', 'In response to the worsening crime rate, Japan creates Tokyo Butei High, an elite academy where "Butei" or armed detectives hone their deadly skills in hopes of becoming mercenary-like agents of justice. One particular Butei is Kinji Tooyama, an anti-social and curt sophomore dropout who was once a student of the combat-centric Assault Division. Kinji now lives a life of leisure studying logistics in order to cover up his powerful but embarrassing special ability. However, his peaceful days soon come to an end when he becomes the target of the infamous "Butei Killer," and runs into an emotional hurricane and outspoken prodigy of the highest rank, Aria Holmes Kanzaki, who saves Kinji''s life and demands that he become her partner after seeing what he is truly capable of.', 'In response to the worsening crime rate, Japan creates Tokyo Butei High, an elite academy where "Butei" or armed detectives hone their deadly skills in hopes of becoming mercenary-like agents of justice. One particular Butei is Kinji Tooyama, an anti-social and curt sophomore dropout who was once a student of the combat-centric Assault Division. Kinji now lives a life of leisure studying logistics in order to cover up his powerful but embarrassing special ability. However, his peaceful days soon come to an end when he becomes the target of the infamous "Butei Killer," and runs into an emotional hurricane and outspoken prodigy of the highest rank, Aria Holmes Kanzaki, who saves Kinji''s life and demands that he become her partner after seeing what he is truly capable of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2BJBJ5PtxQoyJDB9Khzv34xxteU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46439'),
  ('183307255159817649', 'Aria the Scarlet Ammo AA', 2015, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Ayane Sakura, Ayaka Imamura, Mai Nakahara, Rie Kugimiya, Mao Ichimichi, Yui Horie, Chinami Hashimoto, Momo Asakura', null, 'In the world of Hidan no Aria AA, there are special students called Butei who are authorized to carry weapons, investigate crimes and solve various incidents. One of the best of these students is an S-rank second year at Tokyo Butei High School named Aria Kanzaki. On the opposite end of the scale is E-rank first year named Akari Mamiya.', 'In the world of Hidan no Aria AA, there are special students called Butei who are authorized to carry weapons, investigate crimes and solve various incidents. One of the best of these students is an S-rank second year at Tokyo Butei High School named Aria Kanzaki. On the opposite end of the scale is E-rank first year named Akari Mamiya.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oEwQ3BmxrH9upzT6JKREDiOyPQg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71618'),
  ('610990715225701565', 'Ariana Grande: Dangerous Woman Diaries', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Ariana Grande', null, 'Ariana Grande, Jason Glover, Kristopher Terry, Scott Nicholson, Brian Nicholson', null, 'A behind the scenes look at Ariana Grande’s Dangerous Woman Tour and the making of Sweetener and music video from “the light is coming” and “God is a woman”.', 'A behind the scenes look at Ariana Grande’s Dangerous Woman Tour and the making of Sweetener and music video from “the light is coming” and “God is a woman”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fW9uxz4sz79NElox8BGDUEB2JPn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84590'),
  ('751021968349977744', 'Arifureta: From Commonplace to World''s Strongest', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Toshinari Fukamachi, Yuuki Kuwahara, Minami Takahashi, Yoko Hikasa, Saori Onishi, Yumiri Hanamori, Ai Kakuma, Hiroshi Watanabe', 'TV-14', 'Hajime Nagumo and his high school class are suddenly summoned to a fantastical land as heroes. But while most of his classmates have powerful stats and abilities, Hajime does not. Underappreciated and unprepared, he tumbles into the depths of a monster-infested dungeon where voracity and sacrifice are his only options. To thrive in this savage world, he’ll have no choice but to welcome the abyss.', 'Hajime Nagumo and his high school class are suddenly summoned to a fantastical land as heroes. But while most of his classmates have powerful stats and abilities, Hajime does not. Underappreciated and unprepared, he tumbles into the depths of a monster-infested dungeon where voracity and sacrifice are his only options. To thrive in this savage world, he’ll have no choice but to welcome the abyss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Te6pYJNdh4YyWY1G7ANxNHpedi.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:86034'),
  ('229668066927128321', 'Aristocrats', 1999, 'Drama', null, 'Harriet O''Carroll', 'Geraldine Somerville, Serena Gordon, Anne-Marie Duff, Jodhi May, Graham Norton', 'TV-14', 'Based on a true story, Aristocrats draws back the curtain on an 18th century English family near the summit of society, revealing a tapestry of romance, prejudice, infidelity, and revolution.', 'Based on a true story, Aristocrats draws back the curtain on an 18th century English family near the summit of society, revealing a tapestry of romance, prejudice, infidelity, and revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QIgj5F8XPUqMKGTbsfC4Awvt6N.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7132'),
  ('674747430378554991', 'Ariza', 2020, 'Crime', null, null, 'Tolga Sarıtaş, Ayça Ayşin Turan, Ahmet Mümtaz Taylan, Olgun Toker, Dilara Aksüyek, Pınar Çağlar Gençtürk, Hazal Benli, Yeşim Salkım', null, 'The series tells an incredibly gripping story of a regular man and taxi driver named Ali Rıza, whose life changes forever upon encountering a breathtaking customer named Halide, the precious daughter of a known mob boss', 'The series tells an incredibly gripping story of a regular man and taxi driver named Ali Rıza, whose life changes forever upon encountering a breathtaking customer named Halide, the precious daughter of a known mob boss', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrbuAhoHNyTQCUSBcM3AEQxwKmi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108382'),
  ('161684929908936123', 'ARK: The Animated Series', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Jeremy Stieglitz, Jesse Rapczak', null, 'Madeleine Madden, Michelle Yeoh, Gerard Butler, David Tennant, Jeffrey Wright, Zahn McClarnon, Devery Jacobs, Elliot Page', 'TV-14', 'In a mysterious primeval land populated by dinosaurs and other extinct creatures, people from throughout human history have been resurrected. When 21st century Australian paleontologist Helena Walker awakes there after tragedy, she must learn to survive and find new allies, or die again at the hands of ruthless warlords, all while trying to uncover the true nature of their strange new world.', 'In a mysterious primeval land populated by dinosaurs and other extinct creatures, people from throughout human history have been resurrected. When 21st century Australian paleontologist Helena Walker awakes there after tragedy, she must learn to survive and find new allies, or die again at the hands of ruthless warlords, all while trying to uncover the true nature of their strange new world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qzBCXJLifxund1QMa8BiXmH3xp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123625'),
  ('435267477340730279', 'Arknights', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuki Kaida, Tomoyo Kurosawa, Atsumi Tanezaki, Ayane Sakura, Risa Taneda, Yoko Hikasa, Momo Asakura, Chiaki Kobayashi', 'TV-14', 'In the wake of unknown Catastrophes in the heart of Terra, a mineral of unimaginable power has been discovered. With it, society''s technology has made huge leaps and bounds, but the substance causes a deadly incurable disease, leading to a worldwide enslavement of the infected. As a rebellion is now on the rise, a pharmaceutical company races for a cure to save humanity.', 'In the wake of unknown Catastrophes in the heart of Terra, a mineral of unimaginable power has been discovered. With it, society''s technology has made huge leaps and bounds, but the substance causes a deadly incurable disease, leading to a worldwide enslavement of the infected. As a rebellion is now on the rise, a pharmaceutical company races for a cure to save humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DDsRfaTNDZDhiy9TnZBxUOfkB2.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:137065'),
  ('564489814235616202', 'Arli$$', 1996, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Robert Wuhl, Sandra Oh, Jim Turner, Michael Boatman', 'TV-MA', 'A behind-the-scenes look at the glitzy, big-money world of professional sports following the eternally optimistic and endlessly resourceful L.A. sports agent Arliss Michaels whose Achilles'' heel is his inability to say “no” to clients and employees.', 'A behind-the-scenes look at the glitzy, big-money world of professional sports following the eternally optimistic and endlessly resourceful L.A. sports agent Arliss Michaels whose Achilles'' heel is his inability to say “no” to clients and employees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJgRJdI1UsdpXEpkVtlmT0quTzm.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:172'),
  ('644197815961955025', 'Armed Girl''s Machiavellism', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Tasuku Hatanaka, Yuuki Takada, Nozomi Nishida, Sayaka Kitahara, Eriko Matsui, Rina Hidaka, Akane Kohinata, Mamiko Noto', 'TV-14', 'The Private Aichi Symbiosis Academy was originally a high school for high-class girls. When it became co-ed, the girls, out of fear, asked to be permitted to bring weapons to school. When that was enforced, a five-member vigilante corps-like organization called the "Supreme Five Swords" was also formed. After many generations, the five swords eventually became a group which corrected problematic students, and the academy started proactively accepting such students in order to correct them. Nomura Fudou was sent to this school after being part of a huge brawl. What will he do when the only options he has after enrolling are being expelled from that school or being corrected the way the rest of the male students there were...by being forced to dress and act like a girl!', 'The Private Aichi Symbiosis Academy was originally a high school for high-class girls. When it became co-ed, the girls, out of fear, asked to be permitted to bring weapons to school. When that was enforced, a five-member vigilante corps-like organization called the "Supreme Five Swords" was also formed. After many generations, the five swords eventually became a group which corrected problematic students, and the academy started proactively accepting such students in order to correct them. Nomura Fudou was sent to this school after being part of a huge brawl. What will he do when the only options he has after enrolling are being expelled from that school or being corrected the way the rest of the male students there were...by being forced to dress and act like a girl!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6UoTzmBwC73sbVKjIwb0Q0kJl2E.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70882'),
  ('968856248539058885', 'Armed Reaction', 1998, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', null, '冼少玲, Tessa Choy Ting-Ting', 'Jessica Hsuan, Moses Chan Ho, Joyce Tang Lai-Ming, Lo Chung-Him, Gloria Tang, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Tony Hung, Fred Cheng Chun-Hung', null, 'Armed Reaction is a 1998 Hong Kong modern cop drama produced by TVB. The drama stars Bobby Au-yeung and Esther Kwan as the main leads with Joyce Tang, Marco Ngai, Mimi Chu and Joe Ma in main supporting roles. The drama takes place before 1997 Handover of Hong Kong and Royal Hong Kong Police revolves around the lives of two police woman, one who works leisurely behind desk duty but has to take her job more seriously once her husband leaves her and a new rookie cop who is deemed too ambitious and rash by her superior.', 'Armed Reaction is a 1998 Hong Kong modern cop drama produced by TVB. The drama stars Bobby Au-yeung and Esther Kwan as the main leads with Joyce Tang, Marco Ngai, Mimi Chu and Joe Ma in main supporting roles. The drama takes place before 1997 Handover of Hong Kong and Royal Hong Kong Police revolves around the lives of two police woman, one who works leisurely behind desk duty but has to take her job more seriously once her husband leaves her and a new rookie cop who is deemed too ambitious and rash by her superior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwxryiak9cc4hrZypUF4kw81muF.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4957'),
  ('407658216454364727', 'Armitage III', 1995, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Chiaki J. Konaka', null, 'Masaharu Sato, Yasunori Masutani, Hiroko Kasahara, Ryusei Nakao, Hirohiko Kakegawa', null, 'In the year 2046, a cop and his female android partner called Armitage, part of the latest android line known as "class III" models that look, act and feel human, investigate illegal manufacture of class III androids on colonized Mars.', 'In the year 2046, a cop and his female android partner called Armitage, part of the latest android line known as "class III" models that look, act and feel human, investigate illegal manufacture of class III androids on colonized Mars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUSuhszUrM6ffR1MRBphnpRtsyX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69980'),
  ('530332290246337403', 'Armor Hero', 2009, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jerry Wu, Bai Xu Xu, Guo Shuai, Zhang Chao, 秦炎仕, Li Guangxu, 卢洁云, Yang Ya', null, 'Xin Nan, Bei Miao, Dong Shan, Xi Zhao, and Kun Zhong are the descendants of the fire village, the water village, the wood village, the metal village, and the earth village, respectively. Their bodies contain a mysterious gene. Under the use of the Guang Ying Armor they will receive magical combat armors that have been passed down since the ancient times. With these armors, they will become the embodiment of righteousness - Yan Long Xia, the Fire Dragon Hero, Hei Xi Xia, the Black Rhinoceros Hero, Feng Ying Xia, the Wind Eagle Hero, Xue Ao Xia, the Snow Mastiff Hero, and Di Hu Xia, the Earth Tiger Hero. As these heroes, they will fight against the emperor of the darkness and his minions. To disrupt the happiness of the community, the evil ones used pollutants to create a pollution monsters that destroys the environment and the peace of the community', 'Xin Nan, Bei Miao, Dong Shan, Xi Zhao, and Kun Zhong are the descendants of the fire village, the water village, the wood village, the metal village, and the earth village, respectively. Their bodies contain a mysterious gene. Under the use of the Guang Ying Armor they will receive magical combat armors that have been passed down since the ancient times. With these armors, they will become the embodiment of righteousness - Yan Long Xia, the Fire Dragon Hero, Hei Xi Xia, the Black Rhinoceros Hero, Feng Ying Xia, the Wind Eagle Hero, Xue Ao Xia, the Snow Mastiff Hero, and Di Hu Xia, the Earth Tiger Hero. As these heroes, they will fight against the emperor of the darkness and his minions. To disrupt the happiness of the community, the evil ones used pollutants to create a pollution monsters that destroys the environment and the peace of the community', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psDkDWEttYviXX0EJ9Wt5eVVuCq.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:122077'),
  ('486483135959702382', 'Armor Hero XT', 2011, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, '李巍, Wu Haoze, 张亚男, 贺宽, Karen Hsu, 沈人杰, 龚平, Koji Sueyoshi', null, 'In a peaceful Chinese city, the ''Dark Lord'' Lucius wrecks havoc. However, 3 teenagers are are given "morphers" that turn into MP3 players, video game systems, and HD Cameras that allow them to summon their special Armor in order to become Earth''s new defenders.', 'In a peaceful Chinese city, the ''Dark Lord'' Lucius wrecks havoc. However, 3 teenagers are are given "morphers" that turn into MP3 players, video game systems, and HD Cameras that allow them to summon their special Armor in order to become Earth''s new defenders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1z8fgEsGWGukG0s9Jc2lyGAUVoD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:122079'),
  ('198507226969335527', 'Armor Hunter Merowlink', 1988, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Fumiyuki Eda, Ryosuke Takahashi', null, 'Sakiko Tamagawa, Yasunori Matsumoto, Akio Otsuka', null, 'Armor Hunter Merowlink was a twelve episode anime OVA spinoff of Armored Trooper VOTOMS. It takes place in the same universe as VOTOMS, but the two stories are entirely independent of each other. Merowlink is the story of a soldier whose unit is sacrificed on the battlefield for reasons unknown. Although he was not meant to survive, the main character, Merowlink Ality, manages to survive only to be framed for a crime he did not commit. Merowlink escapes his captors and begins hunting down his former commanding officers, both to get revenge for his dead platoon members and to find out the nature of the conspiracy that led to their death.', 'Armor Hunter Merowlink was a twelve episode anime OVA spinoff of Armored Trooper VOTOMS. It takes place in the same universe as VOTOMS, but the two stories are entirely independent of each other. Merowlink is the story of a soldier whose unit is sacrificed on the battlefield for reasons unknown. Although he was not meant to survive, the main character, Merowlink Ality, manages to survive only to be framed for a crime he did not commit. Merowlink escapes his captors and begins hunting down his former commanding officers, both to get revenge for his dead platoon members and to find out the nature of the conspiracy that led to their death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cl82UBDFGE6SxN0SD4IAJ6rNV6I.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44631'),
  ('635211771185102088', 'Armor Shop for Ladies & Gentlemen', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mark Ishii, Mikako Komatsu', 'TV-14', 'In a world of sword and sorcery a young villager named Kautsu comes upon a unique armor shop that only deals with a certain kind of equipment for female adventurers.', 'In a world of sword and sorcery a young villager named Kautsu comes upon a unique armor shop that only deals with a certain kind of equipment for female adventurers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5KMAzCF6IA9sH9QhkA47pTCJWU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:82958'),
  ('194977242597935781', 'Armored Fleet Dairugger XV', 1982, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hideyuki Tanaka, Toshio Furukawa, Ryoma Yamamoto, Kozo Shioya, Satomi Majima, Keiko Han, Hideyuki Hori, Harumi Izuka', null, 'Armored Fleet Dairugger XV was an anime series aired in Japan from 1982 to 1983. It is also referred to as Dairugger 15, Dairugger XV, Armored Armada Dairugger XV, Armored Squadron Dairugger XV, or Machine Platoon Dairugger. In the United States, it was heavily edited to become part of the Voltron series. The Dairugger footage was the primary source for the "Vehicle Voltron" episodes, though various footage was also inserted into the more commonly known "Lion Voltron" episodes.', 'Armored Fleet Dairugger XV was an anime series aired in Japan from 1982 to 1983. It is also referred to as Dairugger 15, Dairugger XV, Armored Armada Dairugger XV, Armored Squadron Dairugger XV, or Machine Platoon Dairugger. In the United States, it was heavily edited to become part of the Voltron series. The Dairugger footage was the primary source for the "Vehicle Voltron" episodes, though various footage was also inserted into the more commonly known "Lion Voltron" episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBwqnW40FqhJCULFM7FLmKYTNN4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9330'),
  ('80634275672880374', 'Armored Trooper VOTOMS', 1983, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hozumi Goda, Kazuko Yanaga', null, 'The story of stoic Armored Trooper pilot Chirico Cuvie and his quest for answers after a sudden betrayal leaves him on the run from his own military.', 'The story of stoic Armored Trooper pilot Chirico Cuvie and his quest for answers after a sudden betrayal leaves him on the run from his own military.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYv6w515vwe3IowcvbPrk4R6ckl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32377'),
  ('536170149702743714', 'Army Wives', 2007, 'Drama', 'Katherine Fugate', null, 'Catherine Bell, Brian McNamara, Wendy Davis, Terry Serpico, Kelli Williams, Alyssa Diaz, J. J. Soria, Torrey DeVitto', 'TV-PG', 'Army Wives is an American drama series that follows the lives of four army wives, one army husband, and their families.', 'Army Wives is an American drama series that follows the lives of four army wives, one army husband, and their families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vycEpFfopE9M6AjCEubMOnrYSKm.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:5325'),
  ('964907020526110550', 'Arn: The Knight Templar', 2010, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Sofia Helin, Joakim Nätterqvist, Stellan Skarsgård', 'TV-MA', 'Arn has to endure so much before he can get the love of his life Cecilie, who has been put away in a monastery.', 'Arn has to endure so much before he can get the love of his life Cecilie, who has been put away in a monastery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34gWDfPhZ7ScCkLiDVZboswdyzx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:52229'),
  ('511106588118747787', 'Arnaques !', 2021, 'News', 'Julien Courbet', null, 'Julien Courbet', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35iRhqBAluQezVLEBLjpnLQtTSe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:238897'),
  ('1034683663446693493', 'Arnold', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Sylvester Stallone', 'TV-MA', 'This intimate docuseries follows Arnold Schwarzenegger''s multifaceted life and career, from bodybuilding champ to Hollywood icon to politician.', 'This intimate docuseries follows Arnold Schwarzenegger''s multifaceted life and career, from bodybuilding champ to Hollywood icon to politician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9KmWrG9rbFhB7jWW4vFHTmqv28.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:226135'),
  ('1116815956093890487', 'Around the World in 80 Days', 1989, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'John Gay, Jules Verne, Buzz Kulik', 'Jules Verne', 'Pierce Brosnan, Eric Idle, Peter Ustinov, Jack Klugman, Julia Nickson, Ian McNeice, James B. Sikking, Lee Remick', 'TV-PG', 'The plot centres around Phileas Fogg making a £20,000 wager with three members of the Reform Club that he can circumnavigate the world in 80 days. He takes with him his newly employed French valet Passepartout, and is pursued by Detective Wilbur Fix who mistakenly thinks Fogg robbed the Bank of England and is using the wager as a cover to escape capture.', 'The plot centres around Phileas Fogg making a £20,000 wager with three members of the Reform Club that he can circumnavigate the world in 80 days. He takes with him his newly employed French valet Passepartout, and is pursued by Detective Wilbur Fix who mistakenly thinks Fogg robbed the Bank of England and is using the wager as a cover to escape capture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2VO11OVKtGpJNPLQOBsVlcKEuE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20580'),
  ('519943682515416783', 'Around the World in 80 Days', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Family, Drama', 'Caleb Ranson, Ashley Pharoah', null, 'David Tennant, Leonie Benesch, Ibrahim Koma', 'TV-14', 'Following an outrageous bet, Fogg and his valet, Passepartout, take on the legendary journey of circumnavigating the globe in just 80 days, swiftly joined by aspiring journalist Abigail Fix, who seizes the chance to report on this extraordinary story.', 'Following an outrageous bet, Fogg and his valet, Passepartout, take on the legendary journey of circumnavigating the globe in just 80 days, swiftly joined by aspiring journalist Abigail Fix, who seizes the chance to report on this extraordinary story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8Np9NZlkzrSdEmpLSgoUkoyJeh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96228'),
  ('1132596276306985249', 'Around the World in Eighty Days', 1972, 'Comedy, Animation, Family, Documentary', null, null, 'Janet Waldo, Ross Higgins, Alistair Duncan, Max Osbiston, Owen Weingott', 'TV-14', 'Around the World in 80 Days is an animated television series that lasted one season of sixteen episodes, broadcast during the 1972-1973 season by NBC. It was the first Australian-produced cartoon to be shown on American network television. Leif Gram directed all sixteen episodes, and the stories were loosely adapted by Chester "Chet" Stover from the novel by Jules Verne.', 'Around the World in 80 Days is an animated television series that lasted one season of sixteen episodes, broadcast during the 1972-1973 season by NBC. It was the first Australian-produced cartoon to be shown on American network television. Leif Gram directed all sixteen episodes, and the stories were loosely adapted by Chester "Chet" Stover from the novel by Jules Verne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8zuPTvJmQnvbDxtlI2KX2CjTBdu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:29501'),
  ('439103525628189300', 'Around the World with Willy Fog', 1983, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Kids', 'Claudio Biern Boyd', 'Claudio Biern Boyd', 'Claudio Rodríguez, Gloria Cámara, Manuel Peiró, José Moratalla, Rafael de Penagos, Luis Marín, Antolín García, Eduardo Jover', null, 'Willy Fog is a British millionaire who bets that he will be able to go around the world in only eighty days.', 'Willy Fog is a British millionaire who bets that he will be able to go around the world in only eighty days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWKS3vmYHvCXaxTUU8eVyXpHsY2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5150'),
  ('302083420980765250', 'Arpeggio of Blue Steel: Ars Nova', 2013, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Kazuyuki Okitsu, Mai Fuchigami, Minami Tsuda, Shinobu Matsumoto, Eiji Miyashita, Nao Toyama, Saki Fujita, Manami Numakura', 'TV-14', 'By 2039, global warming had caused sea levels to rise and large amount of territory to be lost. As though in response, a mysterious group of warships clad in mist, “the Fleet of Mist,” appeared in every corner of the ocean, and began attacking human ships. In spite of humanity mustering all their strength, they were utterly defeated by the Mist''s overwhelming force. All of humanity''s trade routes were blockaded by the Fleet of Mist, their political economy was destroyed, and the human race was steadily beaten down. Seven years later, the Fleet of Mist''s submarine I-401 appears before cadet Gunzo Chihaya. The humanoid life form that pilots the sub, who should be their enemy, is instead offering her services to mankind.', 'By 2039, global warming had caused sea levels to rise and large amount of territory to be lost. As though in response, a mysterious group of warships clad in mist, “the Fleet of Mist,” appeared in every corner of the ocean, and began attacking human ships. In spite of humanity mustering all their strength, they were utterly defeated by the Mist''s overwhelming force. All of humanity''s trade routes were blockaded by the Fleet of Mist, their political economy was destroyed, and the human race was steadily beaten down. Seven years later, the Fleet of Mist''s submarine I-401 appears before cadet Gunzo Chihaya. The humanoid life form that pilots the sub, who should be their enemy, is instead offering her services to mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/erZZ8bqu9eg41CFGZ28BSyQrM8X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:57406'),
  ('396024767430047616', 'Arrested Development', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Mitchell Hurwitz', null, 'Jason Bateman, Portia De Rossi, Will Arnett, Michael Cera, Alia Shawkat, Tony Hale, David Cross, Jeffrey Tambor', 'TV-MA', 'The story of a wealthy family that lost everything, and the one son who had no choice but to keep them all together.', 'The story of a wealthy family that lost everything, and the one son who had no choice but to keep them all together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4r4RD7RsNcJVoz0H6z3dBoTBtW.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4589'),
  ('232492413749272756', 'Arrow', 2012, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Andrew Kreisberg, Greg Berlanti, Marc Guggenheim', null, 'Stephen Amell, Rick Gonzalez, Katherine McNamara, David Ramsey, Katie Cassidy, Juliana Harkavy, Joseph David-Jones, Ben Lewis', 'TV-14', 'Spoiled billionaire playboy Oliver Queen is missing and presumed dead when his yacht is lost at sea. He returns five years later a changed man, determined to clean up the city as a hooded vigilante armed with a bow.', 'Spoiled billionaire playboy Oliver Queen is missing and presumed dead when his yacht is lost at sea. He returns five years later a changed man, determined to clean up the city as a hooded vigilante armed with a bow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8ZHFj1jC384JEkTt3vNg1DfWEb.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:1412'),
  ('547422766617534498', 'Arrow: Blood Rush', 2013, null, null, null, 'Colton Haynes, Emily Bett Rickards', null, 'A six episode mini series broadcast online alongside Arrow. Felicity meets Roy and has a special mission for him.', 'A six episode mini series broadcast online alongside Arrow. Felicity meets Roy and has a special mission for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fsrKFJPxXBuBDAFoL3IlAWBFWvG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72895'),
  ('422274159003661270', 'Arsenal Military Academy', 2019, 'War & Politics, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Bai Lu, Xu Kai, Toby Lee, Wu Jiayi, Wang Yizhe, Hong Yao, Liu Runnan, Gao Yuer', null, 'In 1910s China, nineteen year old Xie Xiang follows in her deceased brother''s footsteps and enrolls in military school disguised as a man. She befriends her fellow cadets and and earns the respect of her instructors during the intense training. However, when the unfortunate arrival of the Imperial Japanese troops creates a web of distressing conspiracies, the batch and their allies are forced to prove their courage and resilience.', 'In 1910s China, nineteen year old Xie Xiang follows in her deceased brother''s footsteps and enrolls in military school disguised as a man. She befriends her fellow cadets and and earns the respect of her instructors during the intense training. However, when the unfortunate arrival of the Imperial Japanese troops creates a web of distressing conspiracies, the batch and their allies are forced to prove their courage and resilience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVqP8rGqTrjJtJV9t4UuiPKwLEq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92648'),
  ('344349444522759826', 'Arsène Lupin', 1971, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Jacques Nahum', null, 'Georges Descrières, Marthe Keller, Yvon Bouchard, Roger Carel, Henri Virlogeux, Yves Barsacq, Jacques Monod, Bernard Giraudeau', 'NR', 'Arsène Lupin is a French TV show which was co-produced with German, Canadian, Belgian, Dutch, Swiss, Italian and Austrian TV stations. It was only loosely based on Maurice Leblancs novels. Georges Descrières'' portrayal of Arsène Lupin showed more similarity to Graf Yoster than to Maurice Leblanc''s original. He behaved in the first place as a perfect gentleman who never got angry. He was always relaxed, because whatever could possibly had bothered him in daily life was taken care of by his butler. It wasn''t questioned how he had come to his financial independence although the series sometimes discreetly implied that he was a professional criminal. Besides rescuing damsels in distress Lupin took on criminals, competing with their wit and intelligence. Either he stole paintings from rich people who had to be considered white-collar criminals or he acted as a detective who derailed criminal schemes. However, when he was attacked, he could defend himself effortlessly by using elegant jujutsu methods. Among the guest stars were German actors such as Günter Strack and Sky du Mont. Jean-Paul Salomé said in his commentary on the DVD version of his film Arsène Lupin he had like this series as a child. German TV, one the investors, would broadcast the show eventually between 18:00-20:00 o''clock because it was only allowed to show commercials within that very timeslot. For them to get a financial return on investment the show had to be appropriate for families and also for children who would watch it alone. Subsequently it was nearby to ask to defuse and flatten some of Leblanc''s plots in order to avoid possible complaints that could force the station to broadcast the show beyond the "Vorabendprogramm".', 'Arsène Lupin is a French TV show which was co-produced with German, Canadian, Belgian, Dutch, Swiss, Italian and Austrian TV stations. It was only loosely based on Maurice Leblancs novels. Georges Descrières'' portrayal of Arsène Lupin showed more similarity to Graf Yoster than to Maurice Leblanc''s original. He behaved in the first place as a perfect gentleman who never got angry. He was always relaxed, because whatever could possibly had bothered him in daily life was taken care of by his butler. It wasn''t questioned how he had come to his financial independence although the series sometimes discreetly implied that he was a professional criminal. Besides rescuing damsels in distress Lupin took on criminals, competing with their wit and intelligence. Either he stole paintings from rich people who had to be considered white-collar criminals or he acted as a detective who derailed criminal schemes. However, when he was attacked, he could defend himself effortlessly by using elegant jujutsu methods. Among the guest stars were German actors such as Günter Strack and Sky du Mont. Jean-Paul Salomé said in his commentary on the DVD version of his film Arsène Lupin he had like this series as a child. German TV, one the investors, would broadcast the show eventually between 18:00-20:00 o''clock because it was only allowed to show commercials within that very timeslot. For them to get a financial return on investment the show had to be appropriate for families and also for children who would watch it alone. Subsequently it was nearby to ask to defuse and flatten some of Leblanc''s plots in order to avoid possible complaints that could force the station to broadcast the show beyond the "Vorabendprogramm".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQVkbqMT90Q2UFWS9XKtL03TuYb.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:39214'),
  ('241537905709108368', 'Art Attack', 1990, 'Kids', 'Neil Buchanan', null, 'Neil Buchanan', null, 'Art Attack is a British children''s television series revolving around art. The original series was one of CITV''s longest running programmes, running from 1990 to 2007, and was presented throughout by Neil Buchanan. The new series launched on Disney Junior on 6 June 2011 and was presented by Jassa Ahluwalia. Each show involved Ahluwalia voicing-over footage of an artist producing three works of art, taking the viewer through the various stages of production step by step. The show''s latest series is hosted by Lloyd Warbey. The new series launched on SAB TV on 10 June 2013 at 7 am IST.', 'Art Attack is a British children''s television series revolving around art. The original series was one of CITV''s longest running programmes, running from 1990 to 2007, and was presented throughout by Neil Buchanan. The new series launched on Disney Junior on 6 June 2011 and was presented by Jassa Ahluwalia. Each show involved Ahluwalia voicing-over footage of an artist producing three works of art, taking the viewer through the various stages of production step by step. The show''s latest series is hosted by Lloyd Warbey. The new series launched on SAB TV on 10 June 2013 at 7 am IST.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1QTIgwrkEqjrC4Q6sIWKZ61zcS.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:1780'),
  ('83579757747579524', 'Art Attack (Spain)', 1999, 'Family, Kids', null, null, 'Jordi Cruz', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7nyMRUw9RmcUraidtkqioYBi2wB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:104193'),
  ('901514882740463892', 'Art Detectives', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Dan Gaster, Will Ing, Paul Powell', null, 'Stephen Moyer, Nina Singh', null, 'In the Metropolitan Police''s smallest department, the Heritage Crime Unit, an art-loving detective tackles cases connected to the world of art, antiques, collectibles and cultural heritage.', 'In the Metropolitan Police''s smallest department, the Heritage Crime Unit, an art-loving detective tackles cases connected to the world of art, antiques, collectibles and cultural heritage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKMbkJfbK2TdAvEcnydGoC9PqUj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:272947'),
  ('453732570818990487', 'Arte', 2020, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Mikako Komatsu', 'TV-14', 'Born into an aristocratic family in Florence, Italy, during the 16th century Renaissance era, Arte has dreams of becoming an artist. In an age of social classes, Arte is willing to cast aside her aristocratic lifestyle and stops at nothing to achieve her dreams. She finds apprenticeship in a painting studio owned by Leo, an artist who is strict but prioritizes ability over gender.', 'Born into an aristocratic family in Florence, Italy, during the 16th century Renaissance era, Arte has dreams of becoming an artist. In an age of social classes, Arte is willing to cast aside her aristocratic lifestyle and stops at nothing to achieve her dreams. She finds apprenticeship in a painting studio owned by Leo, an artist who is strict but prioritizes ability over gender.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vtlujR0LEjyBTT5s0CEtYdqeCaw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95697'),
  ('327633705569168932', 'ARTE Reportage', 1998, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'NR', 'Documentaries on important issues around the world, from human rights to the outcomes of elections.', 'Documentaries on important issues around the world, from human rights to the outcomes of elections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WxyKwqV9ct98vlfbMcWDuIFNOq.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:98310'),
  ('935407133727458907', 'Arthdal Chronicles', 2019, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Kim Won-suk, Sang-yeon Park, Kim Young-hyun', 'Kim Young-hyun, Sang-yeon Park', 'Lee Joon-gi, Shin Sae-kyeong, Jang Dong-gun, Kim Ok-bin, 임진웅, Shin Seo-Woo, Song Jae-ryong, Hyeon Jin', 'TV-14', 'In a mythical land called Arth, the inhabitants of the ancient city of Arthdal and its surrounding regions vie for power as they build a new society.', 'In a mythical land called Arth, the inhabitants of the ancient city of Arthdal and its surrounding regions vie for power as they build a new society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5bKj5U2Z7AgkK3Mekji8xDHOuD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:88463'),
  ('457466390403590031', 'Arthur', 1996, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Family', 'Marc Brown', null, 'Bruce Dinsmore, Jodie Resther, Daniel Brochu, Melissa Altro, Sonja Ball, Arthur Holden, Tracy Braunstein, Simon Peacock', 'TV-Y', 'The show revolves around the lives of 8-year-old Arthur Read, an anthropomorphic aardvark, his friends and family, and their daily interactions with each other.', 'The show revolves around the lives of 8-year-old Arthur Read, an anthropomorphic aardvark, his friends and family, and their daily interactions with each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYN8okmcsmhd4bGVcqifZ5OCumB.jpg', 25, 'tmdb:tv:2153'),
  ('297278762420889073', 'Arthur & George', 2015, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Ed Whitmore', null, 'Martin Clunes, Arsher Ali, Charles Edwards, Emma Fielding, Art Malik, Hattie Morahan', 'TV-14', 'Arthur & George is a three-part adaptation of Julian Barnes'' novel about Sherlock Holmes creator Arthur Conan Doyle as played by actor Martin Clunes. Set in 1906 in Staffordshire, Hampshire and London the drama follows Sir Arthur and his trusted secretary, Alfred ‘Woodie’ Wood as they investigate the case of George Edalji, a young Anglo-Indian solicitor who was imprisoned for allegedly mutilating animals and writing obscene letters.', 'Arthur & George is a three-part adaptation of Julian Barnes'' novel about Sherlock Holmes creator Arthur Conan Doyle as played by actor Martin Clunes. Set in 1906 in Staffordshire, Hampshire and London the drama follows Sir Arthur and his trusted secretary, Alfred ‘Woodie’ Wood as they investigate the case of George Edalji, a young Anglo-Indian solicitor who was imprisoned for allegedly mutilating animals and writing obscene letters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9GdKg0ctuD7hlk59U2men8wPs7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62047'),
  ('263209920490671172', 'Arthur''s Law', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Benjamin Gutsche', 'Sebastian Bleyl, Ceylan Yildirim', 'Jan Josef Liefers, Martina Gedeck, Nora Tschirner, David Bredin, Ronald Kukulies, Michael Klammer, Cristina do Rego, Robert Gallinowski', null, 'Unemployed Arthur Ahnepol wants his obnoxious wife to die to claim the life insurance and start a new life with his mistress, which sets off a series of disastrous events.', 'Unemployed Arthur Ahnepol wants his obnoxious wife to die to claim the life insurance and start a new life with his mistress, which sets off a series of disastrous events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2yZFXWZLfa2tCAzLfJOrYLAXzK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82277'),
  ('328802525018152114', 'Artificial City', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Soo Ae, Kim Kang-woo, Kim Mi-sook, Lee E-dam, Lee Hak-ju, Kim Joo-ryoung, Kim Young-jae, Kim Ji-hyun', null, 'A mystery psychological thriller drama that depicts characters with various desires and different psychology, and their tangled relationships against the backdrop of a society that conceals their dark sides and is maintained through someone''s sacrifice.', 'A mystery psychological thriller drama that depicts characters with various desires and different psychology, and their tangled relationships against the backdrop of a society that conceals their dark sides and is maintained through someone''s sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wB5r70L0gf2XiTD8r5vy0YDtW7o.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138947'),
  ('879799942508253624', 'Artilheiros', 2026, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3x22yS6qXVbEHKUMuBV9d6TU34.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:315608'),
  ('1048613649753030367', 'Artist', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Aleksandr Gorbatov, Marina Aleksandrova, Andrey Merzlikin, Victor Dobronravov, Kirill Zaytsev, Sergey Gazarov, Ramil Sabitov, Konstantin Lavronenko', null, 'March 1944. At the front, the Red Army is conducting a confident offensive. The Allies are about to open a second front, and it seems that the final defeat of Nazi Germany is very close. However, the joy of the coming victory is overshadowed by a series of daring and brutal murders. No one has ever managed to see the bandits up close. According to the scant testimony of random eyewitnesses, the composition of the attackers is constantly changing. And every time they leave portraits of the dead at the crime scene. For these drawings and cruelty, the gang was nicknamed "Death''s Head", and its leader was called an Artist.', 'March 1944. At the front, the Red Army is conducting a confident offensive. The Allies are about to open a second front, and it seems that the final defeat of Nazi Germany is very close. However, the joy of the coming victory is overshadowed by a series of daring and brutal murders. No one has ever managed to see the bandits up close. According to the scant testimony of random eyewitnesses, the composition of the attackers is constantly changing. And every time they leave portraits of the dead at the crime scene. For these drawings and cruelty, the gang was nicknamed "Death''s Head", and its leader was called an Artist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/peGW6u1szLF4WI1FhQXQp19Wg5W.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:209662'),
  ('443945848884351862', 'Aruanas', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Estela Renner, Marcos Nisti', 'Carolina Kotscho, Augusto Canani', 'Débora Falabella, Taís Araújo, Leandra Leal, Thainá Duarte, Camila Pitanga, Ravel Andrade, Vitor Thiré, Bruno Goya', null, 'Three friends leading a nonprofit organisation investigate environmental crimes in the Amazon involving a major mining company.', 'Three friends leading a nonprofit organisation investigate environmental crimes in the Amazon involving a major mining company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrwUIJh8ojOlfkuRhxeXx79NCQg.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:90822'),
  ('753721416107344608', 'Aruna''s Magic', 2023, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Maíra Oliveira', 'Ana Pacheco, Cecilia Mendonça', 'Jamilly Mariano, Erika Januza, Giovanna Ewbank, Cleo, Caio Manhente, Thiago Voltolini, Suzana Pires, Alex Teix', 'TV-PG', 'In search of her place, Mima, a teenager afraid to own up to her power, awakens three witches from the past, who set her on a journey to recover Aruna, a particle capable of reactivating magic and restoring solar balance to the world.', 'In search of her place, Mima, a teenager afraid to own up to her power, awakens three witches from the past, who set her on a journey to recover Aruna, a particle capable of reactivating magic and restoring solar balance to the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mDQC8R4GO2m2V4JUFR03pCtJUIx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:196308'),
  ('102219703082028160', 'As a Reincarnated Aristocrat, I''ll Use My Appraisal Skill to Rise in the World', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Natsumi Fujiwara, Taito Ban, Narumi Kaho, Miho Okasaki, Kana Hanazawa, Hiroki Touchi, Hitomi Nabatame, Haruka Tomatsu', 'TV-14', 'Ars Louvent is reincarnated in another world as the young son of a minor noble who owns a small domain. Ars is not particularly strong or intelligent, but he was born with the Appraisal Skill that''s able to see others'' abilities and statuses. He uses his skill to find the best hidden talents in the world to make their small, weak domain into the best.', 'Ars Louvent is reincarnated in another world as the young son of a minor noble who owns a small domain. Ars is not particularly strong or intelligent, but he was born with the Appraisal Skill that''s able to see others'' abilities and statuses. He uses his skill to find the best hidden talents in the world to make their small, weak domain into the best.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYjQNi15IWz76nbqFBFPlVsO9lL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:237150'),
  ('435417039714155680', 'As Beautiful As You', 2024, 'Drama', 'Jiu Yuexi', 'Li Di Min', 'Tan Songyun, Xu Kai, He Ruixian, Gao Han, Shi Shi, Wu Shile, Zhou Dawei, Wang Yilan', null, 'Ji Xing, a technical talent who works diligently in a technology company, resigned resolutely in order to realize her dream and embarked on the road of entrepreneurship. The team formed by Ji Xing and her younger brother was in jeopardy at the beginning of the business. Just when there was no hope, Ji Xing won the support of Han Ting, President of Dongyang Technology, with his unique insights. With Han Ting''s investment, the startup Xingchen is finally on the right track. But Ji Xing "lost" her first boyfriend who she had been in love with for seven years. The difficulties of starting a business and the pain of breaking up with her love almost destroyed her. Fortunately, she has the close protection of the sister group.', 'Ji Xing, a technical talent who works diligently in a technology company, resigned resolutely in order to realize her dream and embarked on the road of entrepreneurship. The team formed by Ji Xing and her younger brother was in jeopardy at the beginning of the business. Just when there was no hope, Ji Xing won the support of Han Ting, President of Dongyang Technology, with his unique insights. With Han Ting''s investment, the startup Xingchen is finally on the right track. But Ji Xing "lost" her first boyfriend who she had been in love with for seven years. The difficulties of starting a business and the pain of breaking up with her love almost destroyed her. Fortunately, she has the close protection of the sister group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bA4beN83d67IHvZzQXO29d9mLHp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:219915'),
  ('1124357628354194963', 'As If', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Feyyaz Yiğit, Aziz Kedi', 'Aziz Kedi, Feyyaz Yiğit', 'Feyyaz Yiğit, Kıvanç Kılınç, Ahmet Kürşat Öçalan', null, 'Yılmaz and İlkkan are two friends who are constantly fighting each other. Their biggest feature is always being able to do things that will turn their ordinary lives upside down. They magnify small events incredibly and give you a nervous breakdown. They are the embodiment of the misfortunes, strange events and despair we experience every day.', 'Yılmaz and İlkkan are two friends who are constantly fighting each other. Their biggest feature is always being able to do things that will turn their ordinary lives upside down. They magnify small events incredibly and give you a nervous breakdown. They are the embodiment of the misfortunes, strange events and despair we experience every day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1uhSlwcjuzOTxviRDqiMkExnVv.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:115678'),
  ('520588685107695471', 'As Miss Beelzebub Likes It.', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Saori Onishi, Rikuya Yasuda, Misaki Kuno, Satoshi Hino, Ai Kakuma, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Chinatsu Akasaki, Aoi Yuuki', 'TV-PG', 'Banished from Heaven, Beelzebub rules over Pandemonium where former angels that turned into demons work. One day, Beelzebub gets a new attendant named Mullin. Beelzebub seems wise and cool... but she''s actually a girl that loves fluffy things! Mullin is shocked at this revelation but still tries to get closer to Beelzebub every day. They are surrounded by various other unique and clumsy demons, and in this story might be about the demons giving a certain emotion a name... maybe.', 'Banished from Heaven, Beelzebub rules over Pandemonium where former angels that turned into demons work. One day, Beelzebub gets a new attendant named Mullin. Beelzebub seems wise and cool... but she''s actually a girl that loves fluffy things! Mullin is shocked at this revelation but still tries to get closer to Beelzebub every day. They are surrounded by various other unique and clumsy demons, and in this story might be about the demons giving a certain emotion a name... maybe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cF4Q2Q0Q5XR9AV0gpnRzsq9mjgR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83022'),
  ('522192111873894733', 'As Schools Match Wits', 1961, null, 'Leonard Collamore', null, 'Beth Ward', 'NR', 'As Schools Match Wits is a high school quiz show, hosted by Beth Ward, that airs on PBS member station WGBY in Springfield, Massachusetts, and produced in association with Westfield State College. America''s longest-running high school quiz show, As Schools Match Wits is well known throughout western Massachusetts and northern Connecticut.', 'As Schools Match Wits is a high school quiz show, hosted by Beth Ward, that airs on PBS member station WGBY in Springfield, Massachusetts, and produced in association with Westfield State College. America''s longest-running high school quiz show, As Schools Match Wits is well known throughout western Massachusetts and northern Connecticut.', null, 6, 'tmdb:tv:6334'),
  ('868083367625543406', 'As the Crow Flies', 2022, 'Drama', 'Meriç Acemi', null, 'Birce Akalay, Miray Daner, İbrahim Çelikkol, İrem Sak, Defne Kayalar, Burak Yamantürk, Demircan Kaçel', null, 'A young fan maneuvers her way into a seasoned anchor''s newsroom but soon confronts the dark side of ambition, envy and the desire to be seen.', 'A young fan maneuvers her way into a seasoned anchor''s newsroom but soon confronts the dark side of ambition, envy and the desire to be seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGkWqWBcJdhgUqnHUQVNLO1mopr.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:202010'),
  ('1119506231304136994', 'As the Saying Goes', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Sergio Corona, Miguel Garza', 'TV-14', 'Dramatization of real-life situations and stories that are related to popular sayings, by Don Tomas.', 'Dramatization of real-life situations and stories that are related to popular sayings, by Don Tomas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aTQY3hxqds0bEjz12G6vWE8fsQ.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:68845'),
  ('1150082275970920680', 'As the World Turns', 1956, 'Soap', 'Irna Phillips', null, 'Kathryn Hays, Tamara Tunie, Michael Park, Grayson McCouch, Benjamin Hendrickson, Jordana Brewster, Terri Garber, Julianne Moore', null, 'As the World Turns is an American television soap opera that aired on CBS from April 2, 1956 to September 17, 2010. Irna Phillips created As the World Turns as a sister show to her other soap opera The Guiding Light. Running for 54 years, As the World Turns holds the second-longest continuous run of any daytime network soap opera in American history, surpassed only by Guiding Light. As the World Turns was produced in New York City for all of its time. Set in the fictional town of Oakdale, Illinois, the show debuted on April 2, 1956, at 1:30 pm EST.', 'As the World Turns is an American television soap opera that aired on CBS from April 2, 1956 to September 17, 2010. Irna Phillips created As the World Turns as a sister show to her other soap opera The Guiding Light. Running for 54 years, As the World Turns holds the second-longest continuous run of any daytime network soap opera in American history, surpassed only by Guiding Light. As the World Turns was produced in New York City for all of its time. Set in the fictional town of Oakdale, Illinois, the show debuted on April 2, 1956, at 1:30 pm EST.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKp1hYBFCoLyLhfpirpKAvDhCTi.jpg', 54, 'tmdb:tv:910'),
  ('795948545448276968', 'As Time Goes By', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Colin Bostock-Smith', 'Bob Larbey', 'Judi Dench, Geoffrey Palmer, Moira Brooker, Jenny Funnell, Philip Bretherton', 'TV-PG', 'Two lovers are reunited after decades apart following a mutual misunderstanding.', 'Two lovers are reunited after decades apart following a mutual misunderstanding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgpSfLu6uzGRB4SLz6Jtai5T3Xq.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:88'),
  ('359345784097435164', 'As Told by Ginger', 2000, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Emily Kapnek, Kate Boutilier, Eryk Casemiro', null, 'Melissa Disney, Aspen Miller, Liz Georges, Kenn Michael, Jeannie Elias, Tress MacNeille, Laraine Newman, Cree Summer', 'TV-Y7', 'As Told by Ginger focuses on middle schooler Ginger Foutley who, with her friends, tries to become more than a social geek.', 'As Told by Ginger focuses on middle schooler Ginger Foutley who, with her friends, tries to become more than a social geek.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Kd09yYpf2qEYusPB9rtsidMnJu.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1760'),
  ('316527183508649718', 'As We See It', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jason Katims', 'Jesikah Suggs', 'Rick Glassman, Sue Ann Pien, Albert Rutecki, Chris Pang, Sosie Bacon, Joe Mantegna', 'TV-MA', 'Finding love, making friends, getting a job, adulting. Watch as three roommates on the autism spectrum navigate their early 20s with all its joy, tears and laughter. With the help of their families, aide, and sometimes even each other, these roommates experience setbacks and celebrate triumphs on their own unique journeys towards independence and acceptance.', 'Finding love, making friends, getting a job, adulting. Watch as three roommates on the autism spectrum navigate their early 20s with all its joy, tears and laughter. With the help of their families, aide, and sometimes even each other, these roommates experience setbacks and celebrate triumphs on their own unique journeys towards independence and acceptance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bh7OXB05LgElZDMOoxFNSJL9o4h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:139397'),
  ('936866400746267367', 'As You Stood By', 2025, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Lee Jeong-lim', null, 'Jeon So-nee, Lee You-mi, Jang Seung-jo, Lee Mu-saeng', 'TV-MA', 'When two women plot to end an abusive marriage through murder, an unexpected visitor arrives — threatening to shatter everything they''ve carefully planned.', 'When two women plot to end an abusive marriage through murder, an unexpected visitor arrives — threatening to shatter everything they''ve carefully planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ciqsMz21p8xp5udriFjRGM5OYs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:271885'),
  ('802069615642519009', 'Asa ga Kita', 2015, 'Drama', null, 'Mika Ohmori', 'Haru, Hiroshi Tamaki, Aoi Miyazaki, Dean Fujioka, Tomochika, Takeshi Masu, Shinobu Terajima, Yoichi Hayashi', null, 'Towards the end of the Edo era, in the town of Kyoto, there lived a wealthy merchant by the name of Imai Tadamasa. He was blessed with 3 children, Hatsu, Asa and Kyutaro. His eldest, Hatsu, was a traditional girl who loved to play the koto and sew. Whilst his second daughter, Asa, was an impish hoyden who loved sumo wrestling. Asa was engaged to be married to the second son of a distinguished family who ran a money changer business in Osaka, Shirooka Shinjiro. Although Asa was furious when she had first heard about the betrothal, when she met up with Shinjiro for the first time, his charisma greatly attracted her and she fell in love with him in no time.', 'Towards the end of the Edo era, in the town of Kyoto, there lived a wealthy merchant by the name of Imai Tadamasa. He was blessed with 3 children, Hatsu, Asa and Kyutaro. His eldest, Hatsu, was a traditional girl who loved to play the koto and sew. Whilst his second daughter, Asa, was an impish hoyden who loved sumo wrestling. Asa was engaged to be married to the second son of a distinguished family who ran a money changer business in Osaka, Shirooka Shinjiro. Although Asa was furious when she had first heard about the betrothal, when she met up with Shinjiro for the first time, his charisma greatly attracted her and she fell in love with him in no time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNx40I5mkvowLdGsrGPzkKMJMPR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83853'),
  ('217605395765491732', 'Asaf', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Cihangir Ceyhan, Ahmet Rıfat Şungar, Burçin Terzioğlu, Saadet Işıl Aksoy, Fatih Al, Çağdaş Onur Öztürk, Uygar Özçelik, Serra Arıtürk', 'TV-MA', 'A father grapples with his divorce as he spins into a world of organized crime. With his son''s life on the line, what will his next move be?', 'A father grapples with his divorce as he spins into a world of organized crime. With his son''s life on the line, what will his next move be?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlBMoPwyGOalN0Bu8H6ylsfaYHf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274955'),
  ('985713242547899004', 'Asbest', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Katja Eichinger', null, 'Lulu Hacke, Wotan Wilke Möhring, Koder Alian, Jasmin Tabatabai, Kida Khodr Ramadan, Stipe Erceg, David Kross', null, 'Neon lights instead of spotlights, jail instead of football stadium: Momo Kaval can not believe it! For a robbery in which he was involved with his criminal cousins, he is the only one arrested. Director Kida Khodr Ramadan immerses himself in a network of clan crime, turf fights and corruption with a grandiose cast of actors. In his film debut, German rapper Xidir aka Alian Koder plays a 19-year-old who claims to be innocent and is still sentenced to nine years in prison. But how innocent is he really? The idea for the five-part gangster series comes from Katja Eichinger.', 'Neon lights instead of spotlights, jail instead of football stadium: Momo Kaval can not believe it! For a robbery in which he was involved with his criminal cousins, he is the only one arrested. Director Kida Khodr Ramadan immerses himself in a network of clan crime, turf fights and corruption with a grandiose cast of actors. In his film debut, German rapper Xidir aka Alian Koder plays a 19-year-old who claims to be innocent and is still sentenced to nine years in prison. But how innocent is he really? The idea for the five-part gangster series comes from Katja Eichinger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DvZhoBscnmu3QDVRMlYBzWr1Bl.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:218729'),
  ('665859030267277585', 'Ascendance of a Bookworm', 2019, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuka Iguchi, Show Hayami, Mutsumi Tamura, Takehito Koyasu, Megumi Nakajima, Tsuyoshi Koyama, Fumiko Orikasa, Tomoaki Maeno', 'TV-14', 'When a sickly young girl suddenly becomes obsessed with inventing new things, her family and friends are all puzzled. "What has gotten into Myne?" they wondered, never dreaming that the answer is not a "What" but a "Who": Urano Motosu, a book-loving apprentice librarian who died in an earthquake in Tokyo who somehow found herself in Myne''s body! And since Myne''s world is still in a medieval stage, where books can only be owned by the elite, the new Myne intends to do everything she can to bring her beloved books to the masses in the time she has left.', 'When a sickly young girl suddenly becomes obsessed with inventing new things, her family and friends are all puzzled. "What has gotten into Myne?" they wondered, never dreaming that the answer is not a "What" but a "Who": Urano Motosu, a book-loving apprentice librarian who died in an earthquake in Tokyo who somehow found herself in Myne''s body! And since Myne''s world is still in a medieval stage, where books can only be owned by the elite, the new Myne intends to do everything she can to bring her beloved books to the masses in the time she has left.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVGueAM88cc4sX6PeMvuAPObDc4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:91768'),
  ('126345256074327230', 'Ascension', 2014, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Philip Levens, Adrian Cruz', null, 'Tricia Helfer, Gil Bellows, Brian Van Holt, Andrea Roth, Brandon P Bell, Jacqueline Byers, Tiffany Lonsdale, P.J. Boudousqué', 'TV-MA', 'In 1963, the U.S. government launched a covert space mission sending hundreds of men, women and children on a century-long voyage aboard the starship Ascension to populate a new world. Nearly 50 years into the journey, as they approach the point of no return, a mysterious murder of a young woman causes the ship’s population to question the true nature of their mission.', 'In 1963, the U.S. government launched a covert space mission sending hundreds of men, women and children on a century-long voyage aboard the starship Ascension to populate a new world. Nearly 50 years into the journey, as they approach the point of no return, a mysterious murder of a young woman causes the ship’s population to question the true nature of their mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBfc0PXqQkRYTmIyN2fmbhy365e.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60741'),
  ('187409372679445689', 'Asfur', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hanan Savyon, Guy Amir', null, 'Shalom Michaelshvili, Efrat Dor, Oz Zehavi, Guy Amir, Hanan Savyon, Gal Gadot', 'TV-MA', 'Asfur is an Israeli television series, which is broadcast on the channel HOT3. Its title, which literally means "bird" in Arabic, is the main protagonist''s "good luck bird" – his late grandfather believed that its arrival symbolized a positive turn of events. Hot had already started working on two additional seasons even before the television pilot was aired. Season two began airing on October 17, 2011. Savyon and Amir sold the format to John Wells in October 2011. The adaptation, named "Hard Up", will air on FOX.', 'Asfur is an Israeli television series, which is broadcast on the channel HOT3. Its title, which literally means "bird" in Arabic, is the main protagonist''s "good luck bird" – his late grandfather believed that its arrival symbolized a positive turn of events. Hot had already started working on two additional seasons even before the television pilot was aired. Season two began airing on October 17, 2011. Savyon and Amir sold the format to John Wells in October 2011. The adaptation, named "Hard Up", will air on FOX.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUDZqG6YNmHjU4buSCr01jUq615.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:32357'),
  ('77694404239409016', 'Ash', 2013, 'War & Politics, Drama', 'Vadim Perelman', 'Marina Stepnova', 'Vladimir Mashkov, Evgeny Mironov, Elena Lyadova, Sergey Garmash, Chulpan Khamatova, Andrey Smolyakov, Pyotr Mamonov, Vladimir Gostyukhin', null, '1938, Soviet Russia. There were two of them, both strong and courageous. But one fateful day, Igor Petrov, the commander of a Red Army unit, is compelled to exchange ID papers with a satecracker known as Ash. The incident leads both men to start their lives completely anew. For the following ten years, Petrov and Ash will live their lives in the fear of discovery. They will commit acts of bravery and insidious crimes in the name of the other so that the thiet becomes a hero, while the commander turns into a violent outlaw. The only thing they have in common is a tragic, painful love for the same woman. For ten years they will each encounter death and destruction before fate brings them together once more. There will be two of them again - strong and courageous, ready to fight for their love.. with the knowledge that retribution awaits them.', '1938, Soviet Russia. There were two of them, both strong and courageous. But one fateful day, Igor Petrov, the commander of a Red Army unit, is compelled to exchange ID papers with a satecracker known as Ash. The incident leads both men to start their lives completely anew. For the following ten years, Petrov and Ash will live their lives in the fear of discovery. They will commit acts of bravery and insidious crimes in the name of the other so that the thiet becomes a hero, while the commander turns into a violent outlaw. The only thing they have in common is a tragic, painful love for the same woman. For ten years they will each encounter death and destruction before fate brings them together once more. There will be two of them again - strong and courageous, ready to fight for their love.. with the knowledge that retribution awaits them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tSnnt0ZGxma9Y0KQYMNzkn7Jt6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75675'),
  ('725278324975074231', 'Ash vs Evil Dead', 2015, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Sam Raimi, Ivan Raimi, Tom Spezialy', null, 'Bruce Campbell, Ray Santiago, Dana DeLorenzo, Lucy Lawless, Arielle O''Neill', 'TV-MA', 'Bruce Campbell reprises his role as Ash Williams, an aging lothario and chainsaw-handed monster hunter who’s spent the last three decades avoiding maturity, and the terrors of the Evil Dead. But when a Deadite plague threatens to destroy all of mankind, he’s forced to face his demons — both metaphorical and literal.', 'Bruce Campbell reprises his role as Ash Williams, an aging lothario and chainsaw-handed monster hunter who’s spent the last three decades avoiding maturity, and the terrors of the Evil Dead. But when a Deadite plague threatens to destroy all of mankind, he’s forced to face his demons — both metaphorical and literal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tNtSk46s3f1ePr59p0JG6uacc8.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62264'),
  ('183325646143025068', 'Ashes of Love', 2018, 'Drama', null, 'Ma Jia, Ma Yu Xin', 'Yang Zi, Deng Lun, Luo Yunxi, Wang Yifei, Chen Yuqi, Zhou Tingwei, Kathy Chow Hoi-Mei, He Zhonghua', 'TV-14', 'Jin Mi is the daughter of a flower deity who is fed a pill that prevents her from feeling or expressing romantic love. She gets tangled in a love triangle with Heavenly Prince Xu Feng and the ambitious Night Deity Run Yu.', 'Jin Mi is the daughter of a flower deity who is fed a pill that prevents her from feeling or expressing romantic love. She gets tangled in a love triangle with Heavenly Prince Xu Feng and the ambitious Night Deity Run Yu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/FdUxxXN0NqS03gxzKgxiWCobue.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80884'),
  ('224907935935915204', 'Ashes to Ashes', 2008, 'Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Ashley Pharoah, Matthew Graham', null, 'Keeley Hawes, Philip Glenister, Dean Andrews, Marshall Lancaster, Montserrat Lombard, Daniel Mays', 'TV-14', 'Crime drama series featuring Life On Mars'' DCI Gene Hunt. After being shot in 2008, DI Alex Drake lands in 1981, where she finds herself in familiar company.', 'Crime drama series featuring Life On Mars'' DCI Gene Hunt. After being shot in 2008, DI Alex Drake lands in 1981, where she finds herself in familiar company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ky35fNxJQkO9bCwB010pB4brTL3.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1180'),
  ('262768109456887395', 'Ashita Koso', 1968, 'Drama, Family', null, null, 'Yumiko Fujita, Michiko Nakahata, Shunichi Nakamura, Kiyoto Harada, Masakane Yonekura, Shin Saburi, Shōbun Inoue, Chigusa Tsuyuhara', null, 'The 8th NHK Asadora. Starring Yumiko Fujita in a family drama. The first Asadora filmed in color.', 'The 8th NHK Asadora. Starring Yumiko Fujita in a family drama. The first Asadora filmed in color.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dRaAhhSngDZpAerMN8FxH8yjevr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209382'),
  ('1109800385041150901', 'Ashita no Nadja', 2003, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Ami Koshimizu, Mitsuki Saiga, Takumi Yamazaki, Daisuke Kishio, Reiko Kiuchi, Kazuya Ichijo, Rumi Shishido, Hisako Kyoda', 'NR', 'This story takes place about one hundred years ago. Nadja is a bright, cheerful girl who was raised in an orphanage near London, England. Nadja was entrusted to the orphanage when she was a baby. So she thought her father and mother were dead. But before her thirteenth birthday, she found out that her mother might be alive... Nadja sets out on a journey to find her mother! With all of Europe as the stage, Nadja''s exciting adventure begins!', 'This story takes place about one hundred years ago. Nadja is a bright, cheerful girl who was raised in an orphanage near London, England. Nadja was entrusted to the orphanage when she was a baby. So she thought her father and mother were dead. But before her thirteenth birthday, she found out that her mother might be alive... Nadja sets out on a journey to find her mother! With all of Europe as the stage, Nadja''s exciting adventure begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/teeVmgBKlB97nN6ZVHGfemRcY3I.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34821'),
  ('413784789468992754', 'Ashley Garcia: Genius in Love', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Mario López, Seth Kurland', null, 'Paulina Chávez, Reed Horstmann, Bella Podaras, Conor Husting, Jencarlos Canela, Haley Pullos, Chelsea Kane, Mario López', 'TV-PG', '15-year-old scientist Ashley Garcia explores the great unknown of modern teendom after moving across the country to pursue a career in robotics.', '15-year-old scientist Ashley Garcia explores the great unknown of modern teendom after moving across the country to pursue a career in robotics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekoY0lniQPaeK7ejgcjDnirML6B.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99517'),
  ('592580633774742841', 'Ashley Madison: Sex, Lies & Scandal', 2024, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'When a dating site for people seeking adulterous affairs is hacked, millions of users'' intimate data is exposed, wrecking marriages and destroying lives.', 'When a dating site for people seeking adulterous affairs is hacked, millions of users'' intimate data is exposed, wrecking marriages and destroying lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4MOko7qeZ9Qxa4tDz3zYPIklQY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253249'),
  ('847006945027178302', 'Asi', 2007, 'Family, Drama', 'Tomris Giritlioğlu', null, 'Tuba Büyüküstün, Murat Yildirim, Çetin Tekindor, Nur Sürer, Selma Ergeç, Tuncel Kurtiz, Cemal Hünal, Tülay Günal', null, 'Asi is a Turkish television drama serial. The series originally aired from Jule 21, 2007 to June 15, 2009. It ran for two seasons on Kanal D.', 'Asi is a Turkish television drama serial. The series originally aired from Jule 21, 2007 to June 15, 2009. It ran for two seasons on Kanal D.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJfigyqlcMGrDmd0FytlA0Bnrna.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:31252'),
