  ('793064502484699610', 'Bad Exorcist', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Bartosz Walaszek', null, 'No demon is safe as Bogdan Boner, the alcohol-loving, self-taught exorcist-for-hire, returns with more inventive, obscene and deadly deeds.', 'No demon is safe as Bogdan Boner, the alcohol-loving, self-taught exorcist-for-hire, returns with more inventive, obscene and deadly deeds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ed6ObDGwIPRQPvtoFLHgBKlmUU.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:114183'),
  ('1052733207198390303', 'Bad Genius: The Series', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Pat Boonnitipat', 'Pat Boonnitipat, Tanida Hantaweewatana, Vasudhorn Piyaromna', 'Plearnpichaya Komalarajun, Sawanya Paisarnpayak, Jinjett Wattanasin, Paris Intarakomalyasut, Saksit Tangthong, Apasiri Nitibhon, Ratchanok Saeng-Chuto, Willie McIntosh', null, 'A top student gets pulled into a cheating racket with increasingly higher risks and even higher rewards. But she may lose much more than she gains.', 'A top student gets pulled into a cheating racket with increasingly higher risks and even higher rewards. But she may lose much more than she gains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYpWGXTOGWHg1Fs2zjmgRJrnHT4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106868'),
  ('850839473535396526', 'Bad Girl', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Azusa Tachibana, Nina Hanamiya, Misato Matsuoka, Miharu Hanai, Kaori Maeda, Lynn, Yui Horie', 'TV-14', 'At heart, Yuu Yuutani is a total goody-two-shoes and only has eyes for the school''s Madonna, Atori Mizutori. To get the attention of Atori, Yuu gives up the honor roll to become a bad girl! Too bad this very good girl isn''t very good at being bad!', 'At heart, Yuu Yuutani is a total goody-two-shoes and only has eyes for the school''s Madonna, Atori Mizutori. To get the attention of Atori, Yuu gives up the honor roll to become a bad girl! Too bad this very good girl isn''t very good at being bad!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16y6aBnSSNUOikPkk21SFyhGgjD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258000'),
  ('554248785965569947', 'Bad Girl Antics', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Juan Pablo Di Pace', 'TV-14', 'It is the story between Ricardo, a man trapped in a routine, and his teenage love, a nonconformist and adventurous woman who will take him out of his realistic framework.', 'It is the story between Ricardo, a man trapped in a routine, and his teenage love, a nonconformist and adventurous woman who will take him out of his realistic framework.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uYXnoKk7tDPHwApbYudCM12loP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:216133'),
  ('535977333607535399', 'Bad Girlfriend', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Chae Seo-an, Yang Hyuk, Park Young-woon, Yoo Jung-hoo', 'TV-PG', 'Ji Soo, an advertising planner who is faithful to her desire to date someone she likes, is proud of her working abilities at her company. She is dating Tae Oh who is her superior at work and Ji Ho, a cheerful young man, who is out there trying to make ends meet. But when Ji Ho went to work at Ji Soo''s company, Ji Soo''s daily life, which seemed perfect, began to collapse... Will Ji Soo be able to handle all this and continue her two-legged relationship?', 'Ji Soo, an advertising planner who is faithful to her desire to date someone she likes, is proud of her working abilities at her company. She is dating Tae Oh who is her superior at work and Ji Ho, a cheerful young man, who is out there trying to make ends meet. But when Ji Ho went to work at Ji Soo''s company, Ji Soo''s daily life, which seemed perfect, began to collapse... Will Ji Soo be able to handle all this and continue her two-legged relationship?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vseKAWDPbmIBjnHSoptaIZnMm9l.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204625'),
  ('631324974934103150', 'Bad Girls', 1999, 'Drama, Crime', 'Maureen Chadwick, Ann McManus', null, 'Victoria Alcock, Kika Mirylees, Helen Fraser, Antonia Okonma, Nicola Stapleton, Stephanie Beacham, Amanda Barrie, Liz May Brice', 'TV-14', 'Bad Girls is a British television drama series that was broadcast on ITV from 1 June 1999 to 20 December 2006 and starred Simone Lahbib, Mandana Jones, Debra Stephenson, Linda Henry, Jack Ellis and many more throughout the eight-year run. The series was broadcast in 17 countries and was produced by Shed Productions, the company which later produced Footballers'' Wives and Waterloo Road. It is set in the fictional women''s prison of Larkhall, and features a mixture of serious and light storylines focusing on the prisoners and staff of G Wing. From 2010, the UK broadcast rights were bought by CBS Drama, and is repeated regularly – as of September 2012, the channel is re-running the series again in a late-night time slot.', 'Bad Girls is a British television drama series that was broadcast on ITV from 1 June 1999 to 20 December 2006 and starred Simone Lahbib, Mandana Jones, Debra Stephenson, Linda Henry, Jack Ellis and many more throughout the eight-year run. The series was broadcast in 17 countries and was produced by Shed Productions, the company which later produced Footballers'' Wives and Waterloo Road. It is set in the fictional women''s prison of Larkhall, and features a mixture of serious and light storylines focusing on the prisoners and staff of G Wing. From 2010, the UK broadcast rights were bought by CBS Drama, and is repeated regularly – as of September 2012, the channel is re-running the series again in a late-night time slot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlYanINWRod3cKUyV4evJJsq1xW.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:2850'),
  ('479779487048652292', 'Bad Girls Club', 2006, 'Reality', 'Jonathan Murray, Mary-Ellis Bunim', null, null, 'TV-14', 'A cast of young women, who recognize that their outrageous behavior has hindered their relationships, careers and lives, are brought together in a beautiful mansion. They claim they want to change, but will living together help them move forward and turn their lives around – or will chaos rule?', 'A cast of young women, who recognize that their outrageous behavior has hindered their relationships, careers and lives, are brought together in a beautiful mansion. They claim they want to change, but will living together help them move forward and turn their lives around – or will chaos rule?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cEMlNl2madv94cfsNHbPiFBCaFg.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:4940'),
  ('820782625491926928', 'Bad Guy', 2010, 'Drama', null, null, 'Han Ga-in, Kim Nam-gil, Kim Jae-uck, Mun Ka-young, Jung So-min, Park Joon Mok, Oh Yeon-soo, Kim Hye-ok', 'TV-14', 'Bad Guy is a 2010 South Korean melodrama television series, starring Kim Nam-gil, Han Ga-in, Kim Jae-wook, Oh Yeon-soo and Jung So-min. Directed by Lee Hyung-min, it aired on SBS from May 26 to August 5, 2010 on Wednesdays and Thursdays at 21:55 for 17 episodes.', 'Bad Guy is a 2010 South Korean melodrama television series, starring Kim Nam-gil, Han Ga-in, Kim Jae-wook, Oh Yeon-soo and Jung So-min. Directed by Lee Hyung-min, it aired on SBS from May 26 to August 5, 2010 on Wednesdays and Thursdays at 21:55 for 17 episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wwE3VvcyGhtsRMZhLVKNz32Xuwd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32784'),
  ('944668404238552035', 'Bad Guys', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Crime, Drama', null, 'Han Jung-hoon', 'Kim Sang-joong, Park Hae-jin, Don Lee, Kang Ye-won, Cho Dong-hyuk, Hwang Seung-eon, Kim Tae-hun', null, 'To combat rising violent crimes, the Police Chief asks Detective Oh Goo Tak to form a team consisting of criminals. He is currently suspended from the police force for using excessive force. He then gathers team members: Park Woong Chul who is a gangster, Lee Jung Moon who is the youngest serial killer with extraordinary intelligence and Jung Tae Soo who is a contract killer. Police Inspector Yoo Mi Young also joins the team and she tries to have these guys work as a team by dealing with them rationally and sometimes emotionally.', 'To combat rising violent crimes, the Police Chief asks Detective Oh Goo Tak to form a team consisting of criminals. He is currently suspended from the police force for using excessive force. He then gathers team members: Park Woong Chul who is a gangster, Lee Jung Moon who is the youngest serial killer with extraordinary intelligence and Jung Tae Soo who is a contract killer. Police Inspector Yoo Mi Young also joins the team and she tries to have these guys work as a team by dealing with them rationally and sometimes emotionally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xaUyUOf3CPV5MxaALRxUQMxsDvE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61700'),
  ('347433698438830358', 'Bad Guys: Vile City', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Han Jung-hoon', 'Han Jung-hoon', 'Kim Moo-yul, Yang Ik-june, Ju Jin-mo, Kim Ji-soo, Song Young-chang, Kim Jong Yoon, Hong Ji-yoon, Ju Jin-mo', 'TV-MA', 'Ordered to take down a villainous business leader who controls the city, a prosecutor gathers a team of men who may not be so clean themselves.', 'Ordered to take down a villainous business leader who controls the city, a prosecutor gathers a team of men who may not be so clean themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ob8JeEgAjUwAZAATI6uqOI743R2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75765'),
  ('745505165616441321', 'Bad Influence: The Dark Side of Kidfluencing', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Kief Davidson', 'Kief Davidson', 'Claire RockSmith, Corinne Joy, Sophie Fergi, Sawyer Sharbino, Brandon Stewart, Taylor Lorenz, Ashley RockSmith, Karen North', 'TV-MA', 'In this eye-opening documentary exposé, teens and parents reveal disturbing accounts of abuse and exploitation within the world of child influencers.', 'In this eye-opening documentary exposé, teens and parents reveal disturbing accounts of abuse and exploitation within the world of child influencers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbgdBz6VezAOCgNAhzNP6dL7XBC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:286338'),
  ('232664419838155921', 'Bad Internet', 2016, 'Comedy', null, 'Mike Trapp', null, null, 'A satirical anthology series about the terrifying potential futures of internet technology and culture. Not at all similar to any other shows about technological overreaching.', 'A satirical anthology series about the terrifying potential futures of internet technology and culture. Not at all similar to any other shows about technological overreaching.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogqVsgXKk9gEUynU2eF4ENZaSM4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66733'),
  ('57909350599197861', 'Bad Judge', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Anne Heche', null, 'Kate Walsh, Tone Bell, Ryan Hansen, John Ducey, Miguel Sandoval', 'TV-14', 'The series chronicles the personal life (and the wild lifestyle) of Rebecca Wright, a tough-as-nails judge serving on the Los Angeles County Circuit Court, whose time off the bench is spent partying and displaying a reckless behavior. Her reputation is about to be tamed—and judged—by Robby Shoemaker, a eight-year-old boy whose parents Rebecca put behind bars. He might be the one that can turn Rebecca''s life around.', 'The series chronicles the personal life (and the wild lifestyle) of Rebecca Wright, a tough-as-nails judge serving on the Los Angeles County Circuit Court, whose time off the bench is spent partying and displaying a reckless behavior. Her reputation is about to be tamed—and judged—by Robby Shoemaker, a eight-year-old boy whose parents Rebecca put behind bars. He might be the one that can turn Rebecca''s life around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6xaYRcLvUAWwaoGw6EoUG39U7V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60783'),
