  ('710952639936156349', 'Ball Boy Tactics', 2025, 'Drama', 'Ji Seung-hyun', null, 'Choi Jae-hyeok, Yeom Min-hyeok, Choi Rak Yeong, Kwak Geon-hee', null, 'A quiet ex-gymnast and a playful basketball star fall into a slow-burning romance where every glance and touch speaks louder than words.', 'A quiet ex-gymnast and a playful basketball star fall into a slow-burning romance where every glance and touch speaks louder than words.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7SrIG3PnTCd2PeZawdgxqpxrUY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:292144'),
  ('592074760693089771', 'Ballard', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Kendall Sherwood', null, 'Maggie Q, Courtney Taylor, John Carroll Lynch, Michael Mosley, Rebecca Field, Victoria Moroles, Amy Hill', 'TV-14', 'Detective Renée Ballard plunges into a web of murder and corruption as she hunts a ruthless serial killer and uncovers a sinister police conspiracy that threatens everything she stands for. With her own demons nipping at her heels, Ballard must outwit both criminals and colleagues to bring long-overdue justice to the victims and their families.', 'Detective Renée Ballard plunges into a web of murder and corruption as she hunts a ruthless serial killer and uncovers a sinister police conspiracy that threatens everything she stands for. With her own demons nipping at her heels, Ballard must outwit both criminals and colleagues to bring long-overdue justice to the victims and their families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHQGu6ducKC7JcDU6lqWyx7tWW5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239826'),
  ('438066332930285931', 'Ballers', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Stephen Levinson', null, 'Dwayne Johnson, Rob Corddry, John David Washington, Omar Benson Miller, Troy Garity, London Brown, Donovan W. Carter, Brittany S. Hall', 'TV-MA', 'Looking at the lives of former and current football players, the show follows former superstar Spencer Strasmore as he gets his life on track in retirement while mentoring other current and former players through the daily grind of the business of football.', 'Looking at the lives of former and current football players, the show follows former superstar Spencer Strasmore as he gets his life on track in retirement while mentoring other current and former players through the daily grind of the business of football.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WyIazPyjmcFMC42nWEpI0jr56x.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:62704'),
  ('982266843526997262', 'Ballmastrz: 9009', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Christy Karacas', null, 'Natasha Lyonne, Jessica DiCicco, Dana Snyder, Eric Bauza, Dave Willis, Christy Karacas', 'TV-14', 'Thousands of years in the future, teams of Ballmastrz face off against each other using their own hyper-creative and artificially intelligent combat weapons to attack, defend and score.', 'Thousands of years in the future, teams of Ballmastrz face off against each other using their own hyper-creative and artificially intelligent combat weapons to attack, defend and score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lyCKQDRCtv2EOrzQi69K5h4Wuod.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:78672'),
  ('809999144166122673', 'Balls of Steel', 2005, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Matthew Pritchard, Alex Zane, Thaila Zucchi, Neg Dupree, Jenni Davies, Ross Lee', null, 'Balls of Steel was a Channel 4 comedy series developed by Objective Productions and hosted by Mark Dolan. Dolan''s special guests would perform stunts and hold their nerve during hidden camera set-ups in the presence of celebrities or the British public. Massive Balls of Steel, the spin-off series to Balls of Steel was shown on E4, showing highlights of the show.', 'Balls of Steel was a Channel 4 comedy series developed by Objective Productions and hosted by Mark Dolan. Dolan''s special guests would perform stunts and hold their nerve during hidden camera set-ups in the presence of celebrities or the British public. Massive Balls of Steel, the spin-off series to Balls of Steel was shown on E4, showing highlights of the show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tR1E9hD53SX05eQz6uVsKcaIFf3.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:12220'),
  ('232989153166457608', 'Ballykissangel', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kieran Prendiville', null, 'Niall Tóibín, Bosco Hogan, Gary Whelan, Deirdre Donnelly, Joe Savino, Frankie McCafferty, Áine Ní Mhuirí, Robert Taylor', 'TV-14', 'A young British priest adjusts to life in a rural Irish community where life revolves around the church and the local pub. Everyone knows everyone else''s business, and everyone usually has an opinion on it. While characters come and go, the small-town qualities remain.', 'A young British priest adjusts to life in a rural Irish community where life revolves around the church and the local pub. Everyone knows everyone else''s business, and everyone usually has an opinion on it. While characters come and go, the small-town qualities remain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZUfIrlXUXcptaTGNqy2jc5DGyA.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:3734'),
  ('697609824869638165', 'Balthazar', 2018, 'Crime', 'Clothilde Jamin, Clélia Constantine', null, 'Tomer Sisley, Philypa Phoenix, Yannig Samot, Côme Levin, Pauline Cheviller, Constance Labbé, Caterina Murino', 'TV-MA', 'Facing a series of complex murder cases, new police commander Hélène Bach must learn to work with the brilliant yet exasperating Raphaël, who can make the dead speak like no-one else.', 'Facing a series of complex murder cases, new police commander Hélène Bach must learn to work with the brilliant yet exasperating Raphaël, who can make the dead speak like no-one else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/98ZGgws85ybGSZ52NWx0iwbmXfL.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:84234'),
  ('1069847624885871969', 'Baman Piderman', 2009, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Alex Small-Butera, Lindsay Small-Butera', null, 'Alex Small-Butera, Lindsay Small-Butera', null, 'Baman Piderman is a goofy, all-ages, traditionally animated series on Mondomedia created by Lindsay and Alex Small-Butera. Full of friendship, absurdity, and a somewhat disconcerting level of continuity, Baman Piderman is a unique animated labor of love that has been weirding people out since 2008.', 'Baman Piderman is a goofy, all-ages, traditionally animated series on Mondomedia created by Lindsay and Alex Small-Butera. Full of friendship, absurdity, and a somewhat disconcerting level of continuity, Baman Piderman is a unique animated labor of love that has been weirding people out since 2008.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrbqFg5sIkZBIrJihFxqflhinLw.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:242404'),
  ('805954644488818381', 'Bambi', 1948, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'The Bambi, often called the Bambi Award and stylised as BAMBI, is a German award presented annually by Hubert Burda Media to recognize excellence in international media and television to personalities in the media, arts, culture, sports, and other fields "with vision and creativity who affected and inspired the German public that year", both domestic and foreign. First held in 1948, it is the oldest media award in Germany. The trophy is named after Felix Salten''s book Bambi, A Life in the Woods and its statuettes are in the shape of the novel''s titular fawn character. They were originally made of porcelain until 1958, when the organizers switched to using gold, with the casting done by the art casting workshop of Ernst Strassacker in Süßen.', 'The Bambi, often called the Bambi Award and stylised as BAMBI, is a German award presented annually by Hubert Burda Media to recognize excellence in international media and television to personalities in the media, arts, culture, sports, and other fields "with vision and creativity who affected and inspired the German public that year", both domestic and foreign. First held in 1948, it is the oldest media award in Germany. The trophy is named after Felix Salten''s book Bambi, A Life in the Woods and its statuettes are in the shape of the novel''s titular fawn character. They were originally made of porcelain until 1958, when the organizers switched to using gold, with the casting done by the art casting workshop of Ernst Strassacker in Süßen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Bc1fE5mKIYmhhgl0fVcw3nvDra.jpg', 74, 'tmdb:tv:89293'),
  ('698820164326216455', 'Bamboo Blade', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ryo Hirohashi, Katsuyuki Konishi, Megumi Toyoguchi, Houko Kuwashima, Sachiko Kojima, Rina Sato, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Akira Ishida', 'TV-PG', 'Tamaki’s reflexes catch the eye of Toraji, an awful Kendo instructor. His only hope for redemption: sign Tamaki as his star pupil. If Toraji can make her feel like part of the team, he might turn his girls into a fearsome sisterhood of the bamboo blade!', 'Tamaki’s reflexes catch the eye of Toraji, an awful Kendo instructor. His only hope for redemption: sign Tamaki as his star pupil. If Toraji can make her feel like part of the team, he might turn his girls into a fearsome sisterhood of the bamboo blade!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvFiHofIahwA9h5d27wwsniEwlO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:24458'),
  ('984049491201158388', 'Bamse - The World''s Strongest Bear', 1972, 'Animation, Kids', 'Rune Andréasson, Maivor Andréasson', null, 'Olof Thunberg', null, 'The adventures of Bamse and his friends Skalman and Lille-Skutt.', 'The adventures of Bamse and his friends Skalman and Lille-Skutt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtbLr7Im3PzwvBvNJb2xY8DoYBM.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:55645'),
  ('475164217609466703', 'Ban Shu Legend', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Jing Tian, Zhang Zhehan, Li Jiahang, Fu Xinbo, Viann Zhang Xinyu, Guan Xiaotong, Dilraba Dilmurat, Zhang Meng', null, 'Produced by Yu Zheng and written by screenwriter Zhang Wei, this is the counterpart to his previous popular series Female Prime Minister. The story tells of the niece of the first female prime minister Ban Zhao. The titular Ban Shu earns her way up to become a teacher at the Royal Female Academy formed by the Empress Deng Wei. However, her job in the court becomes much harder when conspiracies begin totake place, as a result she decides to leave the court to spread the Han culture.', 'Produced by Yu Zheng and written by screenwriter Zhang Wei, this is the counterpart to his previous popular series Female Prime Minister. The story tells of the niece of the first female prime minister Ban Zhao. The titular Ban Shu earns her way up to become a teacher at the Royal Female Academy formed by the Empress Deng Wei. However, her job in the court becomes much harder when conspiracies begin totake place, as a result she decides to leave the court to spread the Han culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9pOMpeLG7EzVEKISXwp0d4bIxEr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74988'),
  ('375872185423226117', 'Banacek', 1972, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Anthony Wilson', null, 'George Peppard, George Murdock, Ralph Manza, Murray Matheson, Christine Belford', 'TV-PG', 'Banacek is an American detective TV series starring George Peppard that aired on the NBC network from 1972 to 1974. The series was part of the rotating NBC Wednesday Mystery Movie anthology. It alternated in its time slot with several other shows but was the only one to last beyond its first season.', 'Banacek is an American detective TV series starring George Peppard that aired on the NBC network from 1972 to 1974. The series was part of the rotating NBC Wednesday Mystery Movie anthology. It alternated in its time slot with several other shows but was the only one to last beyond its first season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Z98mt03uftItoIS91mu0ITxevF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1340'),
  ('42646265483013229', 'Banana', 2015, 'Drama', 'Russell T Davies', 'Russell T Davies', 'Letitia Wright, Fisayo Akinade, Hannah John-Kamen, Bethany Black, T''Nia Miller, Luke Newberry, Georgia Henshaw, Charlie Covell', 'TV-MA', 'Through eight stand-alone stories, this series follows different aspects of LGBT life. Each episode focuses on the unique storyline of a diverse character dealing with life, loves and losses. Scotty is a young lesbian dealing with unrequited love, while Dean harbors family secrets and has an affair with a mystery man from Newcastle. Sian is torn between her lover and her overprotective mother. Helen has an ex who won''t leave her alone.', 'Through eight stand-alone stories, this series follows different aspects of LGBT life. Each episode focuses on the unique storyline of a diverse character dealing with life, loves and losses. Scotty is a young lesbian dealing with unrequited love, while Dean harbors family secrets and has an affair with a mystery man from Newcastle. Sian is torn between her lover and her overprotective mother. Helen has an ex who won''t leave her alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tG59uhjgA0Q5vhRudNnDHtHV0Dy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61931'),
  ('807738240645206965', 'Banana Fish', 2018, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure, Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'Yuma Uchida, Kenji Nojima, Unsho Ishizuka, Hiroaki Hirata, Jun Fukuyama, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Makoto Furukawa, Soma Saito', 'TV-MA', 'A teenaged gang leader in New York City faces his abuser and rival gangs alongside a photojournalist from Japan as they investigate a deadly new drug.', 'A teenaged gang leader in New York City faces his abuser and rival gangs alongside a photojournalist from Japan as they investigate a deadly new drug.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d2TW5Rtd0uCasHlQygsDfWCROl2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80564'),
  ('1074231987906965331', 'Bananaman', 1983, 'Kids, Animation, Comedy', 'John Geering', null, 'Graeme Garden, Tim Brooke-Taylor, Bill Oddie, Jill Shilling', null, 'Animated parody of famous superheroes about a young boy called Eric, who found out that when he eats bananas he transforms into the super strong Bananaman!', 'Animated parody of famous superheroes about a young boy called Eric, who found out that when he eats bananas he transforms into the super strong Bananaman!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4arhFTur1f0PKyvsSp3s58vztmC.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:34881'),
  ('1024719142826948575', 'Bananas in Pyjamas', 1992, 'Kids, Comedy', 'Helena Harris', null, 'Kenneth Radley, Nicholas Opolski, Sandie Lillingston, Shane McNamara, Karina Kelly, Taylor Owyns, Jeremy Scribner', 'TV-Y7', 'Bananas in Pyjamas is an Australian children''s television show that premiered on 20 July 1992 on ABC. It has since become syndicated in many different countries, and dubbed into other languages. In the United States, the "Pyjamas" in the title was modified to reflect the American spelling pajamas. This aired in syndication from 1995 to 1997 as a half-hour series, then became a 15-minute show paired with a short-lived 15-minute series The Crayon Box, under a 30-minute block produced by Sachs Family Entertainment titled Bananas in Pajamas & The Crayon Box. Additionally, the characters and a scene from the show were featured in the Kids for Character sequel titled Kids for Character: Choices Count. The pilot episode was Pink Mug.', 'Bananas in Pyjamas is an Australian children''s television show that premiered on 20 July 1992 on ABC. It has since become syndicated in many different countries, and dubbed into other languages. In the United States, the "Pyjamas" in the title was modified to reflect the American spelling pajamas. This aired in syndication from 1995 to 1997 as a half-hour series, then became a 15-minute show paired with a short-lived 15-minute series The Crayon Box, under a 30-minute block produced by Sachs Family Entertainment titled Bananas in Pajamas & The Crayon Box. Additionally, the characters and a scene from the show were featured in the Kids for Character sequel titled Kids for Character: Choices Count. The pilot episode was Pink Mug.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opUFH6kWzgepKX7kkboYH9EUiP7.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:3103'),
  ('868260822340803738', 'Bananya', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuki Kaji, Ayumu Murase, Yuki Kaji', 'TV-Y7', 'Bananya is a series about the secret life of kitties who live in bananas.', 'Bananya is a series about the secret life of kitties who live in bananas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkHA9QgrHLh3vEq4WL5itDZAiCt.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:67656'),
  ('568895813128003779', 'Bancroft', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kate Brooke', null, 'Sarah Parish, Adam Long, Charles Babalola, Charlotte Hope, Lee Boardman, Adrian Edmondson, David Avery, Ryan McKen', 'TV-14', 'A dark and compelling thriller centering on Detective Superintendent Elizabeth Bancroft, a female detective with an explosive secret.', 'A dark and compelling thriller centering on Detective Superintendent Elizabeth Bancroft, a female detective with an explosive secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfJ1zdGMETbJjAhkx35gdp8cU2i.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:75456'),
  ('824848841763807496', 'Band of Brothers', 2001, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Michael Cudlitz, Rick Gomez, Scott Grimes, Damian Lewis, Ron Livingston, James Madio, Neal McDonough, Donnie Wahlberg', 'TV-MA', 'Drawn from interviews with survivors of Easy Company, as well as their journals and letters, Band of Brothers chronicles the experiences of these men from paratrooper training in Georgia through the end of the war. As an elite rifle company parachuting into Normandy early on D-Day morning, participants in the Battle of the Bulge, and witness to the horrors of war, the men of Easy knew extraordinary bravery and extraordinary fear - and became the stuff of legend. Based on Stephen E. Ambrose''s acclaimed book of the same name.', 'Drawn from interviews with survivors of Easy Company, as well as their journals and letters, Band of Brothers chronicles the experiences of these men from paratrooper training in Georgia through the end of the war. As an elite rifle company parachuting into Normandy early on D-Day morning, participants in the Battle of the Bulge, and witness to the horrors of war, the men of Easy knew extraordinary bravery and extraordinary fear - and became the stuff of legend. Based on Stephen E. Ambrose''s acclaimed book of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGzV187ogXzgJrvPRy2YPi29ofH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4613'),
  ('626100625324943079', 'Band of Gold', 1995, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kay Mellor', null, 'Geraldine James, Cathy Tyson', null, 'Band of Gold is a British drama series written by Kay Mellor and produced by Granada Television. It was initially broadcast on ITV between 1995 and 1997. Starring Geraldine James, Cathy Tyson, Barbara Dickson and Samantha Morton, the series revolves around the lives of a group of women who live and work in Bradford''s red-light district. Three seasons were produced (the third under the moniker of Gold, with only a small number of characters from the first two series).', 'Band of Gold is a British drama series written by Kay Mellor and produced by Granada Television. It was initially broadcast on ITV between 1995 and 1997. Starring Geraldine James, Cathy Tyson, Barbara Dickson and Samantha Morton, the series revolves around the lives of a group of women who live and work in Bradford''s red-light district. Three seasons were produced (the third under the moniker of Gold, with only a small number of characters from the first two series).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlLpCRlld5O6YQ81oObegp8Cd4u.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:9091'),
  ('733141586193132154', 'Bandi', 2026, 'Drama', 'Éric Rochant, Capucine Rochant', null, 'Rudgy Pajany, Jonathan Zaccaï, Rémy Laquittant, Djody Grimeau, William Paul-Joseph, Evan Lienafa, Ambre Bozza, Souane Rosamont', null, 'Following the death of their mother, their pillar of strength and their anchor, eleven siblings aged 7 to 23 try to stay united in the face of adversity. But for some of them, drug trafficking seems to be the only way to survive. A decision far from being unanimously accepted, and one that severely tests the strength of their family bonds.', 'Following the death of their mother, their pillar of strength and their anchor, eleven siblings aged 7 to 23 try to stay united in the face of adversity. But for some of them, drug trafficking seems to be the only way to survive. A decision far from being unanimously accepted, and one that severely tests the strength of their family bonds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbU23S58nbHK3PkIpbbprRFTVGl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:269161'),
  ('772892005449460565', 'Bandidos', 2024, 'Action & Adventure', 'Pablo Tébar', null, 'Alfonso Dosal, Ester Expósito, Mabel Cadena, Juan Pablo Medina, Ximena Lamadrid, Juan Pablo Fuentes, Andrea Chaparro, Nicolás Furtado', 'TV-MA', 'A gang of skilled misfits ventures to uncover a long-hidden Mayan treasure. Their strategy? Hazy. Their dynamic? Off. Luckily, they''re pretty ingenious.', 'A gang of skilled misfits ventures to uncover a long-hidden Mayan treasure. Their strategy? Hazy. Their dynamic? Off. Luckily, they''re pretty ingenious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hoM8DvKJw5KPfdHbcITxn0rO2HZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:241269'),
  ('1018659119377773779', 'Bandish Bandits', 2020, 'Family, Drama', 'Amritpal Singh Bindra, Anand Tiwari', 'Atmika Didwania, Karan Singh Tyagi, Lara Chandni', 'Ritwik Bhowmik, Shreya Chaudhary, Atul Kulkarni, Sheeba Chaddha, Rajesh Tailang, Kunaal Roy Kapur, Divya Dutta, Yashaswini Dayama', 'TV-14', 'A classical singer Radhe falls in love with pop singer Tamanna and embarks on a path that forces him to compromise his classical roots. With time, both the singers try to get out of their comfort zone while trying to protect their stardom. This series tests their resolve for their passion and love.', 'A classical singer Radhe falls in love with pop singer Tamanna and embarks on a path that forces him to compromise his classical roots. With time, both the singers try to get out of their comfort zone while trying to protect their stardom. This series tests their resolve for their passion and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ub1zXHPxqcKlFeUJMxdUq2LTDp7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:106872'),
  ('1066294445952606427', 'Bandits', 2014, 'Crime, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Uğraş Güneş', 'Uğraş Güneş', 'Uğur Polat, Şebnem Bozoklu, Salih Bademci, Erkan Kolçak Köstendil, Sevtap Özaltun, Caner Özyurtlu, Kaan Yıldırım, Zeynep Kankonde', null, 'Kandemir is the head of a gang which conducts robberies. Their main goal is to rob fairly. What connects the members of the gang to one another is friendship. Unfortunately, everything changes after an old friend of Kandemir, Ali Rıza Kaptan’s goes to prison. Kandemir and the gang settle into an old neighborhood which seems quiet and peaceful. However, nothing is as how it seems in the neighborhood. They introduce themselves to their neighbors as the Nevizade family. Protagonists Kandemir, Ferdi, Karlos, Yaren, Bahadır and Derya have had hard times and when they gather under one roof these gang members still carry the traces of those hard times. Kandemir wishes to confront his daughter and show her that he is no longer a man of monkey business, while blood brothers Ferdi and Karlos who ran away from an orphanage still carry the misery of the streets; Yaren who came to İstanbul with the hope of being a famous singer is singing in taverns; Bahadır uses his genius for hacking computers and Derya joins the gang with her acting skills in order to save her father.', 'Kandemir is the head of a gang which conducts robberies. Their main goal is to rob fairly. What connects the members of the gang to one another is friendship. Unfortunately, everything changes after an old friend of Kandemir, Ali Rıza Kaptan’s goes to prison. Kandemir and the gang settle into an old neighborhood which seems quiet and peaceful. However, nothing is as how it seems in the neighborhood. They introduce themselves to their neighbors as the Nevizade family. Protagonists Kandemir, Ferdi, Karlos, Yaren, Bahadır and Derya have had hard times and when they gather under one roof these gang members still carry the traces of those hard times. Kandemir wishes to confront his daughter and show her that he is no longer a man of monkey business, while blood brothers Ferdi and Karlos who ran away from an orphanage still carry the misery of the streets; Yaren who came to İstanbul with the hope of being a famous singer is singing in taverns; Bahadır uses his genius for hacking computers and Derya joins the gang with her acting skills in order to save her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpU3b1brJxtAWSU4ONKrHEgoAWx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76835'),
  ('561972288758473796', 'Bandits Cannot Rule The World', 2015, 'Crime, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Oktay Kaynarca, Yunus Emre Yıldırımer, Ozan Akbaba, Sabina Toziya, Hakan Karsak, Yiğit Uçan, Öner Ateş, Sevinç Gürşen Kıranlı', null, 'The series tells the life of Hizir Çakırbeyli. A mob boss who entered the realm of the mafia at a young age.', 'The series tells the life of Hizir Çakırbeyli. A mob boss who entered the realm of the mafia at a young age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9dCHYc4knzkr5bUiUaVrjnQtfNU.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:64535'),
  ('966388853741378065', 'Bang Baaja Baaraat', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Angira Dhar, Ayesha Raza Mishra, Ali Fazal, Rajit Kapoor, Shernaz Patel, Gajraj Rao', null, 'Two people from very different backgrounds fall in love and decide to get married, but not without their parents blessings. Three days before the wedding they introduce each other with their respective parents and all hell breaks lose.', 'Two people from very different backgrounds fall in love and decide to get married, but not without their parents blessings. Three days before the wedding they introduce each other with their respective parents and all hell breaks lose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/VCjXYF2vMnDvR8uYJUQp7bniZb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64409'),
  ('361115115650750004', 'Bang Bang Baby', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Andrea Di Stefano', 'Valentina Gaddi, sebastiano melloni, Andrea Di Stefano', 'Arianna Becheroni, Giorgia Arena, Barbara Chichianelli, Pietro Paschini, Adriano Giannini, Lucia Mascino, Dora Romano, Christina Andrea Rosamilia', null, 'Unfolding in Milan at the end of the 80s, Bang Bang Baby is a crime series centred around a shy and insecure teenager, Alice, who becomes a mafia organisation’s youngest member in a bid to win the love of her father, an ‘ndrangheta affiliate.', 'Unfolding in Milan at the end of the 80s, Bang Bang Baby is a crime series centred around a shy and insecure teenager, Alice, who becomes a mafia organisation’s youngest member in a bid to win the love of her father, an ‘ndrangheta affiliate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AoBsoUBHrlanwkcYPZWllXvc0HB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98734'),
  ('374034814182877586', 'BanG Dream!', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Aimi, Sae Otsuka, Rimi Nishimoto, Ayaka Ohashi, Ayasa Ito', 'TV-PG', 'Since she was very young, Kasumi Toyama has always been searching for the "Star Beat", a sparkling and exciting sound she heard while looking up at the night sky. Just after getting into high school, Kasumi comes across a "star-shaped guitar" in the storage area of an old pawn shop. Feeling a rush and excitement she has never felt before, Kasumi teams up with four other girls and embarks on a journey to seek out the shiny place. We promise to perform a live here!', 'Since she was very young, Kasumi Toyama has always been searching for the "Star Beat", a sparkling and exciting sound she heard while looking up at the night sky. Just after getting into high school, Kasumi comes across a "star-shaped guitar" in the storage area of an old pawn shop. Feeling a rush and excitement she has never felt before, Kasumi teams up with four other girls and embarks on a journey to seek out the shiny place. We promise to perform a live here!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odOfS98nLcWcgz4NaGkTwI8jgq3.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:69236'),
  ('1001651719303068270', 'BanG Dream! Girls Band Party!☆PICO', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', null, 'Yuniko Ayana', 'Aimi, Sae Otsuka, Rimi Nishimoto, Ayaka Ohashi, Ayasa Ito, Ami Maeshima, Ari Ozawa, Sumire Uesaka', 'TV-14', 'BanG Dream! Girls Band Party!☆PICO, or simply GARUPA☆PICO, is a mini-anime series featuring the characters from the smartphone game Girls Band Party!', 'BanG Dream! Girls Band Party!☆PICO, or simply GARUPA☆PICO, is a mini-anime series featuring the characters from the smartphone game Girls Band Party!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3NY5DJ4N5vJU1X8yiZ6Uc3jKDO.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:80729'),
  ('347250974013512628', 'BanG Dream! It''s MyGO!!!!!', 2023, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Hina Youmiya, Rin Tateishi, Hina Aoki, Mika Kohinata, Coco Hayashi, Kanon Takao', 'TV-14', 'The best way to fit in at a new school? Start a band! Anon has just transferred to Haneoka Girls’ Academy where girl bands are all the rage. But she started school late, so there aren’t many girls left to recruit. Then she meets her first friend and Haneoka’s misfit, Tomori, who’s hesitant to join. Still, Anon is determined to persuade Tomori and experience the true power of friendship and music.', 'The best way to fit in at a new school? Start a band! Anon has just transferred to Haneoka Girls’ Academy where girl bands are all the rage. But she started school late, so there aren’t many girls left to recruit. Then she meets her first friend and Haneoka’s misfit, Tomori, who’s hesitant to join. Still, Anon is determined to persuade Tomori and experience the true power of friendship and music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rV5YhLd0J1nf0DYUCTKQegAjYLw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224207'),
  ('162330574573514611', 'Banged Up Abroad', 2007, 'Documentary, Crime, Reality', 'Bart Layton', null, null, 'TV-14', 'Documentary series where viewers are taken inside accounts of capture, incarceration, and terror far away from home with intimate personal interviews and dramatic reenactments.', 'Documentary series where viewers are taken inside accounts of capture, incarceration, and terror far away from home with intimate personal interviews and dramatic reenactments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5683XdmIsxAICOtXEvcUUwe6FPd.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:7439'),
  ('577183795087754200', 'Bangkok Breaking', 2021, 'Crime', null, null, 'Sukollawat Kanarot, Sushar Manaying, Sahajak Boonthanakit, Pavarit Mongkolpisit, Suda Chuenban, Panupan Jantanawong, Nophand Boonyai, Thanidaphat Tinsutthinanon', 'TV-MA', 'The six-episode series is centered around the wild world of Bangkok''s road rescue services and Wanchai who is newly arrived in Bangkok and must unravel a city-wide conspiracy alongside a young, upstart journalist.', 'The six-episode series is centered around the wild world of Bangkok''s road rescue services and Wanchai who is newly arrived in Bangkok and must unravel a city-wide conspiracy alongside a young, upstart journalist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAru8tj4RXbLzDL3r89QoVyP6FY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132158'),
  ('99473794993374473', 'Bangkok Hilton', 1989, 'Drama', null, 'Ken Cameron, Tony Morphett, Terry Hayes', 'Nicole Kidman, Denholm Elliott, Hugo Weaving, Jerome Ehlers, Judy Morris, Norman Kaye, Joy Smithers, Noah Taylor', null, 'This classic Australian mini series was originally broadcast in 1989 as three 90 minute episodes and tells the story of a young woman who goes in search of the father she has never known. Her search takes her from Australia to England and then on to Bangkok. There she meets up with a charming young man, Arkie Regan, who plants drugs in her luggage and leaves her to her fate when the authorities find them during a routine search at the airport. Following her imprisonment in the notorious Bangkok Hilton prison she awaits the decision of the authorities on whether she should face the death penalty.', 'This classic Australian mini series was originally broadcast in 1989 as three 90 minute episodes and tells the story of a young woman who goes in search of the father she has never known. Her search takes her from Australia to England and then on to Bangkok. There she meets up with a charming young man, Arkie Regan, who plants drugs in her luggage and leaves her to her fate when the authorities find them during a routine search at the airport. Following her imprisonment in the notorious Bangkok Hilton prison she awaits the decision of the authorities on whether she should face the death penalty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opjxaDFu2pWtBc9FqHvYGUWifV7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5738'),
  ('894427639682177373', 'Bangkok Love Stories: Innocence', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Ekachai Uekrongtham', 'Nicole Theriault, Nida Patcharaveerapong, Tosatid Darnkhuntod, Nattapol Diloknawarit, Ponlawit Ketprapakorn, Narupornkamol Chaisang, Rudklao Amratisha', 'TV-14', 'From a teenage parkour enthusiast to a bawdy restaurateur, an eclectic group of characters find romance in Bangkok''s glittering Silom district.', 'From a teenage parkour enthusiast to a bawdy restaurateur, an eclectic group of characters find romance in Bangkok''s glittering Silom district.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHeRRETZPMd71YgXB3ynqgwnQG7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84001'),
  ('162716700063251396', 'BANGTAN BOMB', 2013, 'Reality', null, null, 'RM, Jin, Suga, j-hope, Jimin, V, Jung Kook', null, 'Bangtan Bomb are short videos of BTS released on their YouTube channel.', 'Bangtan Bomb are short videos of BTS released on their YouTube channel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i01uYYJoovqILhexlYA6E1CHh56.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:83319'),
  ('667643838827013179', 'Banished', 2015, 'Drama', 'Jimmy McGovern', null, 'Isabelle Estelle Corbusier, Orla Brady, Ewen Bremner, MyAnna Buring, Ryan Corr, David Dawson, Ned Dennehy, Brooke Harman', null, 'Banished is a British period drama television serial created by Jimmy McGovern. The seven-part serial first aired on BBC Two from 5 March to 16 April 2015. It received mixed reviews, with most of the criticism for its perceived inaccuracies to the depicted events. Though set in the stark historical reality of the founding of the penal colony in Australia in 1788 after the arrival of the First Fleet, it is not the story of Australia and how it came to be. Rather, it is a tale of love, faith, justice and morality played out on an epic scale in a confined community where the stakes are literally life and death.', 'Banished is a British period drama television serial created by Jimmy McGovern. The seven-part serial first aired on BBC Two from 5 March to 16 April 2015. It received mixed reviews, with most of the criticism for its perceived inaccuracies to the depicted events. Though set in the stark historical reality of the founding of the penal colony in Australia in 1788 after the arrival of the First Fleet, it is not the story of Australia and how it came to be. Rather, it is a tale of love, faith, justice and morality played out on an epic scale in a confined community where the stakes are literally life and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8EW8Fs6vTDimNky9CkiBn13vFp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62130'),
  ('478520791168644542', 'Banished from the Hero''s Party, I Decided to Live a Quiet Life in the Countryside', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryota Suzuki, Kanon Takao, Naomi Ohzora, Yumiri Hanamori, Ai Kakuma, Satoshi Mikami, Aya Uchida', 'TV-14', 'After being betrayed by the Hero’s party, Red hopes to start anew by opening an apothecary in a small town. He wants to keep his past life secret, but it won’t be easy...especially when a beautiful adventurer from his past asks to move in.', 'After being betrayed by the Hero’s party, Red hopes to start anew by opening an apothecary in a small town. He wants to keep his past life secret, but it won’t be easy...especially when a beautiful adventurer from his past asks to move in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hk5qqvJLRBDaPYBc8lKkSYQrR1c.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:113256'),
  ('869487976681465142', 'Bank Under Siege', 2024, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Miguel Herrán, María Pedraza, Hovik Keuchkerian, Tomy Aguilera, Isak Férriz, Òscar Rabadán, Tito Valverde, Chemi Hitos', 'TV-MA', 'Spain, 1981: When armed men hold up a bank and take hundreds hostage, a reporter races against the authorities to uncover the true motive for the heist.', 'Spain, 1981: When armed men hold up a bank and take hundreds hostage, a reporter races against the authorities to uncover the true motive for the heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QeR0OoO8lqsLG2c6hzVPSu9bVF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:236449'),
  ('445680360871759976', 'Banking District', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Jean-Marc Fröhle', null, 'Laura Sépul, Féodor Atkine, Arnaud Binard, Vincent Kucholl, Brigitte Fossey, Lauriane Gilliéron, Stéphane Metzger, Karim Barras', null, 'Summer 2011: the Swiss financial market is abuzz with the news that Paul Béguelin, the director-general of the private bank Béguelin, was found dead in his office. Is it a case of suicide or score settling? This question is going to haunt his sister Elisabeth. Catapulted to the center stage of the bank, she embarks on an internal investigation. This is the beginning of a long road toward the truth, which will immerse her in the murky mysteries of the bank, her family’s secrets and banking secrecy.', 'Summer 2011: the Swiss financial market is abuzz with the news that Paul Béguelin, the director-general of the private bank Béguelin, was found dead in his office. Is it a case of suicide or score settling? This question is going to haunt his sister Elisabeth. Catapulted to the center stage of the bank, she embarks on an internal investigation. This is the beginning of a long road toward the truth, which will immerse her in the murky mysteries of the bank, her family’s secrets and banking secrecy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/goxjUurdVO7eGAP7vOuJit9rcK2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:75159'),
  ('444399391872494285', 'Banshee', 2013, 'Crime, Drama', 'David Schickler, Jonathan Tropper', null, 'Antony Starr, Ivana Miličević, Hoon Lee, Frankie Faison, Ulrich Thomsen, Matthew Rauch, Matt Servitto, Lili Simmons', 'TV-MA', 'Banshee is an American drama television series set in a small town in Pennsylvania Amish country and features an enigmatic ex-con posing as a murdered sheriff who imposes his own brand of justice while also cooking up plans that serve his own interests.', 'Banshee is an American drama television series set in a small town in Pennsylvania Amish country and features an enigmatic ex-con posing as a murdered sheriff who imposes his own brand of justice while also cooking up plans that serve his own interests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nXFiz8Rn8eezVjSTZBd7HmnF1G.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:41727'),
  ('948851386127954547', 'Banshee: Origins', 2013, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Jonathan Tropper, David Schickler', null, 'Antony Starr, Ivana Miličević, Frankie Faison', null, 'Banshee: Origins is a series of webisodes based on the American drama television series produced by Cinemax called Banshee. The series offers flashbacks in-between the time where Lucas Hood was arrested and when Sheriff Lucas Hood first arrived in Banshee.', 'Banshee: Origins is a series of webisodes based on the American drama television series produced by Cinemax called Banshee. The series offers flashbacks in-between the time where Lucas Hood was arrested and when Sheriff Lucas Hood first arrived in Banshee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sDcs5S73hfDVF5dokYW9fRtEGj.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:62119'),
  ('967710808150318610', 'Baptiste', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Harry Williams, Jack Williams', null, 'Tchéky Karyo, Fiona Shaw, Dorka Gryllus, Miklós Béres, Gabriella Hámori, Anastasia Hille', 'TV-14', 'Battered by life, detective Julien Baptiste will investigate to the brink of obsession. Whatever the cost. Whatever it takes.', 'Battered by life, detective Julien Baptiste will investigate to the brink of obsession. Whatever the cost. Whatever it takes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgu7gih8wYtd4As95uDhVajjkM4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:86735'),
  ('3521392286224287', 'Bar Rescue', 2011, 'Reality', 'Darrin Reed', null, 'Jon Taffer', 'TV-PG', 'Jon Taffer is the Gordon Ramsay of the bar and nightclub business. In each episode, Taffer helps transform a struggling bar into a vibrant, profitable business, utilizing his expertise as a nightlife consultant', 'Jon Taffer is the Gordon Ramsay of the bar and nightclub business. In each episode, Taffer helps transform a struggling bar into a vibrant, profitable business, utilizing his expertise as a nightlife consultant', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vf6BNtzaszynP4gzN6w36b1McFt.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:44470'),
  ('820032633826123074', 'Barakamon', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Daisuke Ono, Suzuko Hara', 'TV-PG', 'After punching a famous curator in the face for criticizing his work as "textbook and lifeless," Handa Seishuu is sent to Gotō Island to calm his nerves and find new inspiration for his calligraphy. Growing up in the city all his life, though, Handa must adapt to country life while meeting an assortment of quirky people during his tenure.', 'After punching a famous curator in the face for criticizing his work as "textbook and lifeless," Handa Seishuu is sent to Gotō Island to calm his nerves and find new inspiration for his calligraphy. Growing up in the city all his life, though, Handa must adapt to country life while meeting an assortment of quirky people during his tenure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5biiZSKFkIFRxv6Ny6H6XwzyuKE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67048'),
  ('875900000710459259', 'Barareh Nights', 2005, 'Comedy, Family', 'Mehran Modiri', null, 'Mehran Modiri, Siamak Ansari, Mohammad Shiri, Falamak Joneydi, Saeid Pirdoost, Fatemeh Hashemi, Shaghayegh Dehghan, Hadi Kazemi', null, 'The show stars Mehran Modiri, as Shir Farhad, the son of Lower Barare''s khan, or leader. He lives with his sister, Saharnaz; mother, Shadone; and father, Salar Khan. The show begins when a journalist, Kiyanush, from Tehran is arrested for writing an article criticizing the government, escapes capture, and then is bitten by a snake. Shir Farhad finds him collapsed and brings him to the village of Barare, nurtures him to health, and gradually introduces him to the town and the other characters in the show, such as the families of Upper and Lower Barare''s Khans, as well as the flamboyant village poet, Baguri, and village doctor. Later in the series, new characters such as the village gendarme and Upper Barare''s Khan''s son and daughter, Keivun and Leilun, join the cast. Davune doesn''t appear in this.', 'The show stars Mehran Modiri, as Shir Farhad, the son of Lower Barare''s khan, or leader. He lives with his sister, Saharnaz; mother, Shadone; and father, Salar Khan. The show begins when a journalist, Kiyanush, from Tehran is arrested for writing an article criticizing the government, escapes capture, and then is bitten by a snake. Shir Farhad finds him collapsed and brings him to the village of Barare, nurtures him to health, and gradually introduces him to the town and the other characters in the show, such as the families of Upper and Lower Barare''s Khans, as well as the flamboyant village poet, Baguri, and village doctor. Later in the series, new characters such as the village gendarme and Upper Barare''s Khan''s son and daughter, Keivun and Leilun, join the cast. Davune doesn''t appear in this.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cbh9RdBTcJdm4ztfGfN5sQvWz5Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1701'),
  ('831987678102697573', 'Barbapapa', 1974, 'Kids, Animation, Family', 'Annette Tison, Talus Taylor', null, 'Youna Noiret, Lucille Boudonnat, Bernard Alane, Bruno Magne, Nathalie Karsenty, Fily Keita, Marie Facundo, Emmylou Homs', 'NR', 'The adventures of Barbapapa and Barbama and their seven children, where they search for their place in the world, while helping humans and animals.', 'The adventures of Barbapapa and Barbama and their seven children, where they search for their place in the world, while helping humans and animals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZBXZvelBZRWxxcUqEwlSdq4cA6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65136'),
  ('246705345426992222', 'Barbapapa: One Big Happy Family!', 2020, 'Kids, Animation', 'Annette Tison, Talus Taylor', null, 'Bruno Magne, Nathalie Karsenty, Fily Keita, Bernard Alane, Youna Noiret, Lucille Boudonnat, Kaycie Chase, Marie Facundo', null, 'The daily life of the extraordinary blob-shaped Barbapapa family, who can morph into other forms but retain their original colors. The Barbapapa family consists of parents Barbapapa and Barbamama and their seven children; the intellectual Barbalib, the coquette Barbabelle, the powerful Barbabravo, inventor Barbabright, animal lover Barbazoo, artist Barbabeau, and musician Barbalala, along with their pet dog, Lolita.', 'The daily life of the extraordinary blob-shaped Barbapapa family, who can morph into other forms but retain their original colors. The Barbapapa family consists of parents Barbapapa and Barbamama and their seven children; the intellectual Barbalib, the coquette Barbabelle, the powerful Barbabravo, inventor Barbabright, animal lover Barbazoo, artist Barbabeau, and musician Barbalala, along with their pet dog, Lolita.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kCfUwhv6biJ8lnRAVw6TZswZsj2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:121720'),
  ('743611157810956759', 'Barbarians', 2020, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Arne Nolting, Jan Martin Scharf, Andreas Heckmann', null, 'Laurence Rupp, Jeanne Goursaud, David Schütter, Gaetano Aronica, Bernhard Schütz, Eva Verena Müller, Florian Schmidtke, Jeremy Miliker', 'TV-MA', 'Three people''s fates are interwoven in the Battle of the Teutoburg Forest in 9 A.D., during which Germanic warriors halt the spread of the Roman Empire.', 'Three people''s fates are interwoven in the Battle of the Teutoburg Forest in 9 A.D., during which Germanic warriors halt the spread of the Roman Empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3cUaeLUGT8c0YIR8qCDDH2iJSU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:93785'),
  ('407404377923017705', 'Barbarians Rising', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Documentary', null, 'Simon George, Alexander Emmert, Elizabeth Dench', 'Michael Ealy', 'TV-14', 'Told from the perspective of the rebel leaders, the series chronicles a wave of rebellions against absolute power by those the Roman Empire called “barbarians” – tribes they viewed as beyond the fringe of civilization that lived a brutish and violent existence. But these also were men and women who launched epic struggles that shaped the world to come with a centuries-long fight to defeat the sprawling empire.', 'Told from the perspective of the rebel leaders, the series chronicles a wave of rebellions against absolute power by those the Roman Empire called “barbarians” – tribes they viewed as beyond the fringe of civilization that lived a brutish and violent existence. But these also were men and women who launched epic struggles that shaped the world to come with a centuries-long fight to defeat the sprawling empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9a6y8UZJ3jGcLLpJsOrDFZcSfO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66641'),
  ('399389767251987466', 'Barbaroslar', 2021, 'Drama, War & Politics, Action & Adventure', 'Adel Adeeb, Doğan Ümit Karaca', 'Cüneyt Aysan, Ozan Aksungur, Oğuz Ayaz', 'Engin Altan Düzyatan, Ulaş Tuna Astepe, Yiğit Özşener, Yetkin Dikinciler, Pelin Akil, Bahadır Yenişehirlioğlu, Devrim Evin, Emir Benderlioğlu', null, 'Barbaroslar: Sword of the Mediterranean will take viewers on a historic journey across the Ottoman Empire based on the life of 16th-century Ottoman admiral "Barbaros" Hayreddin Pasha and the adventures of four brothers who become seafarers. The drama series retells this adventure through the stories of four brothers; Ishak, Oruc, Hizir, and Ilyas, fighting high tides and the secrets of the seas. It focuses on their pursuit of a holy secret with the help of Master Suleyman, and during the course of their journey, they make enemies in, Pietro; the Pope''s hand reaching out to the Mediterranean who is also pursuing the secret and organizes an attack against their ship. But this doesn''t stop the brothers and they continue their original quest to find the holy secret all the while fighting their enemies at high tides.', 'Barbaroslar: Sword of the Mediterranean will take viewers on a historic journey across the Ottoman Empire based on the life of 16th-century Ottoman admiral "Barbaros" Hayreddin Pasha and the adventures of four brothers who become seafarers. The drama series retells this adventure through the stories of four brothers; Ishak, Oruc, Hizir, and Ilyas, fighting high tides and the secrets of the seas. It focuses on their pursuit of a holy secret with the help of Master Suleyman, and during the course of their journey, they make enemies in, Pietro; the Pope''s hand reaching out to the Mediterranean who is also pursuing the secret and organizes an attack against their ship. But this doesn''t stop the brothers and they continue their original quest to find the holy secret all the while fighting their enemies at high tides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4Ih65EVp6SQc8E89bQ7NbyGeei.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132752'),
  ('198045906789682619', 'Barbecue Showdown', 2020, 'Reality', 'Daniel Calin', null, 'Kevin Bludso, Melissa Cookston, Michelle Buteau', 'TV-PG', 'Eight of the country''s best backyard smokers and pitmasters vie for the title of American Barbecue Champion in a fierce but friendly faceoff.', 'Eight of the country''s best backyard smokers and pitmasters vie for the title of American Barbecue Champion in a fierce but friendly faceoff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4yf81AlYGP5sDKtAwluGmcPjMlU.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:109819'),
  ('290575055085034990', 'Barbie Dreamhouse Adventures: Go Team Roberts', 2019, 'Animation, Family, Kids, Comedy', null, null, 'America Young, Kirsten Day, Cassandra Lee Morris, Cassidy Naber, Ritesh Rajan', null, 'As the Roberts family heads to Costa Rica to investigate a mermaid legend, Barbie takes on a summer job at a water park run by a devious boss.', 'As the Roberts family heads to Costa Rica to investigate a mermaid legend, Barbie takes on a summer job at a water park run by a devious boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jeYIRekZ6jTBUiEoefj4qEsttvI.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:211638'),
  ('455296596593702786', 'Barbie Dreamhouse Challenge', 2023, 'Reality', 'Fred Soulie', null, 'Ashley Graham, Egypt Sherrod, Mike Jackson, Jasmine Roth, Antonia Lofaso, Ty Pennington, Alison Victoria, Jonathan Knight', 'TV-G', 'Watch as eight all-star teams turn a house in Southern California into a real-life Barbie Dreamhouse. One lucky Barbie lover will ultimately get the chance to stay in the house.', 'Watch as eight all-star teams turn a house in Southern California into a real-life Barbie Dreamhouse. One lucky Barbie lover will ultimately get the chance to stay in the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wy9SHFhK2kjynXyx90CmpZTvwg7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230494'),
  ('935392430977997242', 'Barbie: Dreamhouse Adventures', 2018, 'Animation, Family, Kids, Comedy', null, 'Grant Moran', 'America Young, Cassidy Naber, Kirsten Day, Cassandra Lee Morris, Ritesh Rajan, Lisa Fuson, Greg Chun, Desirae Whitfield', 'TV-Y', 'Barbie, her sisters, friends and neighbour Ken share vlogs filmed in her Dreamhouse.', 'Barbie, her sisters, friends and neighbour Ken share vlogs filmed in her Dreamhouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MraV12DdZjQEgQztjTQ2s9t5CK.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:89092'),
  ('466266862179313129', 'Barbie: It Takes Two', 2022, 'Family, Kids, Animation, Comedy', 'Marsha Griffin', null, 'America Young, Tatiana Varria, Nicolas Roye, Gabe Kunda', null, 'Barbie "Malibu" Roberts and Barbie "Brooklyn" Roberts chase their dreams of musical stardom.', 'Barbie "Malibu" Roberts and Barbie "Brooklyn" Roberts chase their dreams of musical stardom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KFeoNVIAKKxETRrbika8mAbswl.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:199175'),
  ('1139595602972257669', 'Barbie: Life in the Dreamhouse', 2012, 'Animation, Family', 'David Wiebe', null, null, 'TV-Y', 'The series is set as a reality TV-esque show following Barbie, her sisters and her friends in the day-to-day activities that take place in the Dreamhouse and surrounding areas. Much of the humor in the show derives from parodying and lampooning both the traditional reality TV format and the Barbie franchise itself.', 'The series is set as a reality TV-esque show following Barbie, her sisters and her friends in the day-to-day activities that take place in the Dreamhouse and surrounding areas. Much of the humor in the show derives from parodying and lampooning both the traditional reality TV format and the Barbie franchise itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7HIZXKDaDekFAIcWU7bxP8cTv6.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:61838'),
  ('985998158167578351', 'Bard of Blood', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Gaurav Verma, Bilal Siddiqi', 'Balal Siddiqi, Mayank Tewari, Gaurav Verma', 'Emraan Hashmi, Sobhita Dhulipala, Shishir Sharma, Abhishekh Khan, Danish Husain', 'TV-MA', 'Years after a disastrous job in Baluchistan, a former Indian spy must confront his past when he returns to lead an unsanctioned hostage-rescue mission.', 'Years after a disastrous job in Baluchistan, a former Indian spy must confront his past when he returns to lead an unsanctioned hostage-rescue mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKyQzUoYMQu7iWVOBGLQ493u4Qx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91016'),
  ('587767648370852283', 'Bardot', 2023, 'Drama', 'Christopher Thompson, Danièle Thompson', 'Christopher Thompson, Danièle Thompson', 'Julia de Nunez, Victor Belmondo, Jules Benchetrit, Fabian Wolfrom, Géraldine Pailhas, Hippolyte Girardot, Yvan Attal, Anne Le Ny', null, 'The life of the French actor Brigitte Bardot and model from 1949, when she first appeared on the cover of a magazine, to the birth of her son in 1960.', 'The life of the French actor Brigitte Bardot and model from 1949, when she first appeared on the cover of a magazine, to the birth of her son in 1960.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fAHVS8C88mWvwzMWqchNwYVcQO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217641'),
