  ('1081094656309848240', 'Bares für Rares', 2013, 'Talk, Reality, Documentary', null, null, 'Horst Lichter, Volker Wolf', null, 'In the show, selected applicants each present a curiosity, rarity or antique they have brought with them. Once they have received their expertise, they will have the opportunity on site to offer their exhibit to a changing five-person podium for sale and, ideally, to sell it to the highest bidder for „Bares“ ("cash").', 'In the show, selected applicants each present a curiosity, rarity or antique they have brought with them. Once they have received their expertise, they will have the opportunity on site to offer their exhibit to a changing five-person podium for sale and, ideally, to sell it to the highest bidder for „Bares“ ("cash").', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9SzcU00nl64FdgLs4otaHBfRkj.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:79917'),
  ('504825495500289447', 'Baretta', 1975, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Stephen J. Cannell', null, 'Robert Blake, Dana Elcar, Sharon Cintron, Burt Young', 'TV-PG', 'Baretta is an American detective television series which ran on ABC from 1975 to 1978. The show was a milder version of a successful 1973–74 ABC series, Toma, starring Tony Musante as chameleon-like, real-life New Jersey police officer David Toma. While popular, Toma received intense criticism at the time for its realistic and frequent depiction of police and criminal violence. When Musante left the series after a single season, the concept was retooled as Baretta, with Robert Blake in the title role.', 'Baretta is an American detective television series which ran on ABC from 1975 to 1978. The show was a milder version of a successful 1973–74 ABC series, Toma, starring Tony Musante as chameleon-like, real-life New Jersey police officer David Toma. While popular, Toma received intense criticism at the time for its realistic and frequent depiction of police and criminal violence. When Musante left the series after a single season, the concept was retooled as Baretta, with Robert Blake in the title role.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xayGSRT2GbcFTwNIqt6l355v29F.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:3216'),
  ('976623943524281019', 'Bargain', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jeon Woo-sung', 'Choi Byeong-yun, Kwak Jae-min, Jeon Woo-sung', 'Jeon Jong-seo, Jin Sun-kyu, Chang Ryul', 'TV-MA', 'A group of strangers gather at a remote motel with ulterior motives – seeking to bargain. After an unexpected earthquake traps them inside the building. With no one to trust, they must find a way to survive.', 'A group of strangers gather at a remote motel with ulterior motives – seeking to bargain. After an unexpected earthquake traps them inside the building. With no one to trust, they must find a way to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttsq2iTUvry6ILFuWt9JqZXYx2I.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158811'),
  ('312895727950954403', 'Bargain Hunt', 2000, 'Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-G', 'Two teams of amateur collectors have an hour at an antiques fair in which to acquire the best bargains possible.', 'Two teams of amateur collectors have an hour at an antiques fair in which to acquire the best bargains possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXVsAt8gDiqOTgTAPhSwSU1LIid.jpg', 53, 'tmdb:tv:1265'),
  ('862503282851272930', 'Barkskins', 2020, 'Drama', 'Elwood Reid', null, 'David Thewlis, Marcia Gay Harden, Aneurin Barnard, James Bloor, Zahn McClarnon, David Wilmot, Tallulah Haddon, Christian Cooke', 'TV-MA', 'A disparate group of outcasts and dreamers battle to escape their pasts while navigating the brutal frontier hardships, competing interests, and tangled loyalties at the crossroads of civilization: the New World. Based on the novel by Pulitzer-winner Annie Proulx.', 'A disparate group of outcasts and dreamers battle to escape their pasts while navigating the brutal frontier hardships, competing interests, and tangled loyalties at the crossroads of civilization: the New World. Based on the novel by Pulitzer-winner Annie Proulx.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8tjE58tGcXjAsLXo38BDJepy0P1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93737'),
  ('860028225039731368', 'Barnaby Jones', 1973, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Edward Hume', null, 'Buddy Ebsen, Lee Meriwether, Mark Shera', 'TV-PG', 'Barnaby Jones is a television detective series starring Buddy Ebsen and Lee Meriwether as father- and daughter-in-law who run a private detective firm in Los Angeles. The show ran on CBS from January 28, 1973 to April 3, 1980, beginning as a midseason replacement. William Conrad guest starred as Frank Cannon of Cannon on the first episode of Barnaby Jones, "Requiem for a Son" and the two series had a two-part crossover episode in 1975, "The Deadly Conspiracy".', 'Barnaby Jones is a television detective series starring Buddy Ebsen and Lee Meriwether as father- and daughter-in-law who run a private detective firm in Los Angeles. The show ran on CBS from January 28, 1973 to April 3, 1980, beginning as a midseason replacement. William Conrad guest starred as Frank Cannon of Cannon on the first episode of Barnaby Jones, "Requiem for a Son" and the two series had a two-part crossover episode in 1975, "The Deadly Conspiracy".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wn1kkCGHJcUQ7C8umfQH9LL2zXR.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:587'),
  ('960254124295506043', 'Barney & Friends', 1992, 'Comedy, Family, Kids', null, null, 'David Joyner, Carey Stinson, Dean Wendt, Julie Johnson, Jeff Ayers, Patty Wirtz, Michaela Dietz, Bob West', 'TV-Y', 'Barney & Friends is an American children''s television series aimed at children from ages 2 to 5. The series, which first aired on April 6, 1992, features the title character Barney, a purple anthropomorphic Tyrannosaurus rex who conveys educational messages through songs and small dance routines with a friendly, optimistic attitude.', 'Barney & Friends is an American children''s television series aimed at children from ages 2 to 5. The series, which first aired on April 6, 1992, features the title character Barney, a purple anthropomorphic Tyrannosaurus rex who conveys educational messages through songs and small dance routines with a friendly, optimistic attitude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijt54PA1pZ2ae68ODBk3vfWSK0e.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:4887'),
  ('106944960286522621', 'Barney Miller', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Theodore J. Flicker, Danny Arnold', 'Bob Colleary', 'Hal Linden, Max Gail, Ron Glass, Ron Carey, Steve Landesberg', 'TV-PG', 'Barney Miller is an American situation comedy television series set in a New York City police station in Greenwich Village. The series originally was broadcast from January 23, 1975 to May 20, 1982 on ABC. It was created by Danny Arnold and Theodore J. Flicker. Noam Pitlik directed the majority of the episodes.', 'Barney Miller is an American situation comedy television series set in a New York City police station in Greenwich Village. The series originally was broadcast from January 23, 1975 to May 20, 1982 on ABC. It was created by Danny Arnold and Theodore J. Flicker. Noam Pitlik directed the majority of the episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wfrcuXAlgbPyUenIbCONhICH23h.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:3253'),
  ('653500181365363640', 'Baron Noir', 2016, 'Drama, Crime', 'Éric Benzekri, Jean-Baptiste Delafon', null, 'Kad Merad, Anna Mouglalis, Astrid Whettnall, Alex Lutz, El Hadj Kamera', null, 'In a tale of epic scale, French politician Philippe Rickwaert thirsts for revenge against his political enemies. Philippe’s political career is in shambles after he is sacrificed by the presidential candidate from the Left, Francis Laugier, in order to save his election. Step by step, Philippe plots against him and forges an alliance with his closest advisor, Amélie Dorendeu.', 'In a tale of epic scale, French politician Philippe Rickwaert thirsts for revenge against his political enemies. Philippe’s political career is in shambles after he is sacrificed by the presidential candidate from the Left, Francis Laugier, in order to save his election. Step by step, Philippe plots against him and forges an alliance with his closest advisor, Amélie Dorendeu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gINvtfRTIrmdJnKp5iEntGJR9X3.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:65430'),
  ('921315278194072246', 'Baroness von Sketch Show', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Carolyn Taylor, Meredith MacNeill, Aurora Browne', null, 'Carolyn Taylor, Meredith MacNeill, Aurora Browne, Jennifer Whalen', 'TV-14', 'This all-female comedy satirizes modern life''s everyday concerns, from the pretentiousness of ordering a fancy coffee to office and sexual politics.', 'This all-female comedy satirizes modern life''s everyday concerns, from the pretentiousness of ordering a fancy coffee to office and sexual politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjzkNPM9Z4R73B2FgtReG8YXuf4.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:81974'),
  ('322419828703834291', 'Barrack O''Karma', 2019, 'Mystery', 'Yip Chun Fai', 'Ruby Law Pui-Ching', 'Joel Chan, Selena Lee, Lau Kong, Akina Hong Wah, Jazz Lam Tsz-Sin, Gloria Tang, Geoffrey Wong Chi-Hung, Bob Cheung Yin-Pok', null, 'Siu Wai-ming has been haunted by a dream of a woman wearing a cheongsam for many years. When he becomes an administrative manager for an old apartment building, he meets a tenant – air stewardess Alex Cheung – who looks exactly like the woman in his dream. As they get to know each other, the apartment building seems to come to life, performing the strange and fantastical lives of the tenants who live there.', 'Siu Wai-ming has been haunted by a dream of a woman wearing a cheongsam for many years. When he becomes an administrative manager for an old apartment building, he meets a tenant – air stewardess Alex Cheung – who looks exactly like the woman in his dream. As they get to know each other, the apartment building seems to come to life, performing the strange and fantastical lives of the tenants who live there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9690Qrq42J3fjFHTAXZMj41YGd4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93721'),
  ('380945321245915022', 'Barracuda', 2016, 'Drama', 'Christos Tsiolkas', null, 'Elias Anton, Matt Nable, Rachel Griffiths, Ben Kindon, Victoria Haralabidou, Jeremy Lindsay Taylor, Andrew Creer, Nicole Gulasekharam', null, 'Melbourne 1996. The Golden Age of Australian swimming is beginning and a scholarship to an exclusive boys school brings 16-year-old Danny Kelly one step closer to his ultimate goal - winning Olympic gold. Initially, Danny struggles to find his place in the prestigious social circles of the private boys school. However under the charge of highly regarded coach Frank Torma and a friendship/rivalry with teammate Martin Taylor, Danny is soon on track to become Australia’s youngest swimming champion, the unstoppable ''Barracuda''.', 'Melbourne 1996. The Golden Age of Australian swimming is beginning and a scholarship to an exclusive boys school brings 16-year-old Danny Kelly one step closer to his ultimate goal - winning Olympic gold. Initially, Danny struggles to find his place in the prestigious social circles of the private boys school. However under the charge of highly regarded coach Frank Torma and a friendship/rivalry with teammate Martin Taylor, Danny is soon on track to become Australia’s youngest swimming champion, the unstoppable ''Barracuda''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFVqxiqimdXh4UVh045B3jkrqZY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66809'),
  ('329374440776670994', 'Barracuda Queens', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Camilla Ahlgren', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'When they fall deep into debt, a group of young women in an affluent Stockholm suburb turns to robbing their neighbors'' houses. Inspired by real events.', 'When they fall deep into debt, a group of young women in an affluent Stockholm suburb turns to robbing their neighbors'' houses. Inspired by real events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDu6dNi1gmLrDeMEp4u2uV8C8vd.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:225152'),
  ('315210646002401692', 'Barrera de amor', 2005, 'Drama', 'Liliana Abud', 'Tere Medina, Jaime García Estrada, Orlando Merino', 'Yadhira Carrillo, Sergio Reynoso, Raquel Olmedo, Alexis Ayala, Chantal Andere, Norma Herrera, Gerardo Murguía, Manuel Landeta', null, 'Barrera de amor is a Mexican telenovela, which was produced by and broadcast on Televisa in 2005.', 'Barrera de amor is a Mexican telenovela, which was produced by and broadcast on Televisa in 2005.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIjgujWZLbnV919BUwqZCsCpLuy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:13086'),
  ('632154480850580671', 'Barrister Babu', 2020, 'Drama, Family, Soap', 'Shashi Mittal, Sumeet Hukamchand Mittal', null, 'Aura Bhatnagar Badoni, Pravisht Mishra, Barsha Chatterjee, Pallavi Mukherjee, Dev Aditya, Madhushree Sharma, Arina Dey, Premchand Singh', null, 'In a bid to save an 8-year-old girl from becoming the victim of Sati, Anirudh marries a curious and tyrant girl Bondita. Anirudh educates Bondita and makes her the first "Barrister Babu" of their region.', 'In a bid to save an 8-year-old girl from becoming the victim of Sati, Anirudh marries a curious and tyrant girl Bondita. Anirudh educates Bondita and makes her the first "Barrister Babu" of their region.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jLO3GOmWZrenraKkGqX3xj26wj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99313'),
  ('1149885567716451634', 'Barry', 2018, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Alec Berg, Bill Hader', 'Mark Ashmore, Nicky Hirsch', 'Bill Hader, Sarah Goldberg, Anthony Carrigan, Henry Winkler, Stephen Root, Robert Wisdom', 'TV-MA', 'A hit man from the Midwest moves to Los Angeles and gets caught up in the city''s theatre arts scene.', 'A hit man from the Midwest moves to Los Angeles and gets caught up in the city''s theatre arts scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1XpwD11f0BAEI7pX6UdMhUVX2F.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:73107'),
  ('883195094065082877', 'Bartender', 2006, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Takahiro Mizushima, Iemasa Kayumi, Ayumi Fujimura, Leo Morimoto, Masaaki Yajima', 'TV-14', 'Genius bartender, Sasakura Ryuu makes the most incredible cocktails anyone has ever tasted. Seeking his "Glass of God", individuals from all different walks of life visit his bar. With both a compassionate ear and a godly drink, Ryuu helps people with their problems.', 'Genius bartender, Sasakura Ryuu makes the most incredible cocktails anyone has ever tasted. Seeking his "Glass of God", individuals from all different walks of life visit his bar. With both a compassionate ear and a godly drink, Ryuu helps people with their problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3K7ZmbngHmOOtndH44jslnxk3co.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42860'),
  ('631847520320985985', 'BARTENDER Glass of God', 2024, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Takuma Terashima, Yoshino Nanjo, Haruka Shiraishi, Eriko Matsui, Ryoko Shiraishi, Makoto Furukawa, Hiroki Touchi, Naoya Uchida', null, 'At Eden Hall, each glass has a story. A quiet bar lies tucked away in the streets of Tokyo, and it seems only the most desperate souls burdened by their own troubles manage to find its doors. But after a glass of God poured by the brilliant bartender Ryu, they leave renewed. Ryu has a gift—he knows how to soothe the soul with the perfect drink. Who will he meet next?', 'At Eden Hall, each glass has a story. A quiet bar lies tucked away in the streets of Tokyo, and it seems only the most desperate souls burdened by their own troubles manage to find its doors. But after a glass of God poured by the brilliant bartender Ryu, they leave renewed. Ryu has a gift—he knows how to soothe the soul with the perfect drink. Who will he meet next?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aefIsbDvm2kDkZGEllkYWoMONrl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225168'),
  ('364499813999016356', 'Baseball', 1994, 'Documentary', null, 'Geoffrey C. Ward, Ken Burns', 'John Chancellor, Daniel Okrent, Buck O''Neil, Studs Terkel', 'TV-PG', 'The history of the sport of baseball in America, told through archival photos, film footage, and the words of those who contributed to the game in each era. Writers, historians, players, baseball personnel, and fans review key events and the significance of the game in America''s history.', 'The history of the sport of baseball in America, told through archival photos, film footage, and the words of those who contributed to the game in each era. Writers, historians, players, baseball personnel, and fans review key events and the significance of the game in America''s history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qneEtyv9BKgfb7sVmtnvDqTmV4b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19215'),
  ('838556088684957966', 'Based on a True Story', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Craig Rosenberg', null, 'Kaley Cuoco, Chris Messina, Tom Bateman, Liana Liberato', 'TV-MA', 'The lives of a realtor, a plumber and a former tennis star unexpectedly collide, exposing America’s obsession with true crime, murder and the slow-close toilet seat.', 'The lives of a realtor, a plumber and a former tennis star unexpectedly collide, exposing America’s obsession with true crime, murder and the slow-close toilet seat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xPLk78TFStBi1dQAlG2mnoSK60.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:197373'),
  ('690534265304327607', 'Basilisk', 2005, 'Animation, War & Politics, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Inori Minase, Reina Ueda, Tasuku Hatanaka, Yui Horie, Takuya Kirimoto', 'TV-MA', 'The story takes place in the year 1614. Two ninja clans, Tsubagakure of the Iga and Manjidani of Kouga, battle each other to determine which grandson of Tokugawa Ieyasu will become the next shogun. The deadly competition between 10 elite ninja from each clan unleashes a centuries-old hatred that threatens to destroy all hope for peace between them.', 'The story takes place in the year 1614. Two ninja clans, Tsubagakure of the Iga and Manjidani of Kouga, battle each other to determine which grandson of Tokugawa Ieyasu will become the next shogun. The deadly competition between 10 elite ninja from each clan unleashes a centuries-old hatred that threatens to destroy all hope for peace between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqLJUgkLjL7FK3NdSpnG7NZHPva.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:9410'),
  ('323964428289804840', 'Basketball Wives', 2010, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jennifer Williams, Jackie Christie', 'TV-14', 'Follow the extraordinary lives of a group of female best friends as they juggle the success and stresses of building businesses, battling groupies, and searching for stability in the unstable arena of being the significant other to a basketball superstar.', 'Follow the extraordinary lives of a group of female best friends as they juggle the success and stresses of building businesses, battling groupies, and searching for stability in the unstable arena of being the significant other to a basketball superstar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AdXQ6gPKaeA1p6hYofLI6BNd8ym.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:32789'),
  ('435408656038946092', 'Basketball: A Love Story', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Dan Klores', null, null, 'TV-G', '''Basketball: A Love Story'' is a series of 62 interconnected short stories that creates a vibrant mosaic of the game, featuring 165 exclusive interviews. The cast encompasses basketball''s most prominent figures and explores the complex nature of love as it relates to the game.', '''Basketball: A Love Story'' is a series of 62 interconnected short stories that creates a vibrant mosaic of the game, featuring 165 exclusive interviews. The cast encompasses basketball''s most prominent figures and explores the complex nature of love as it relates to the game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7At8dfNNXs9hnx2ZgTRyGMlwcA1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106121'),
  ('498326174464287952', 'Baskets', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Louis C.K., Zach Galifianakis, Jonathan Krisel', null, 'Zach Galifianakis, Martha Kelly, Louie Anderson', 'TV-MA', 'Chip Baskets wants to follow his dream of being a French clown—however, reality keeps interfering. Saddled with financial difficulties and facing an impenetrable language barrier, he moves back home to Bakersfield with high hopes. There, he is forced to confront his past while working as a rodeo clown and competing with his siblings for his mother''s approval and affection.', 'Chip Baskets wants to follow his dream of being a French clown—however, reality keeps interfering. Saddled with financial difficulties and facing an impenetrable language barrier, he moves back home to Bakersfield with high hopes. There, he is forced to confront his past while working as a rodeo clown and competing with his siblings for his mother''s approval and affection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkbttiaCH1brriYAoBFVvNHHOcn.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:64551'),
  ('983324468096994980', 'Bastard!!', 1992, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuka Koyama, Kazuki Yao, Tessyo Genda, Toshihiko Seki, Masami Kikuchi, Nobuo Tanaka, Rei Sakuma, Steiv Dixon', 'NR', 'Several hundred years after Anthrasax destroyed modern civilization, a group of four lords plans to set this old god free once again. To prevent this from happening, a former ally of the four is released from his 15 year imprisonment. Dark Schneider, a sorcerer who once tried to conquer the world, now fights to save it.', 'Several hundred years after Anthrasax destroyed modern civilization, a group of four lords plans to set this old god free once again. To prevent this from happening, a former ally of the four is released from his 15 year imprisonment. Dark Schneider, a sorcerer who once tried to conquer the world, now fights to save it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzmCDRyDrpLo71nLLp6IkHBJgBB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43798'),
  ('539171347187223888', 'BASTARD‼ -Heavy Metal, Dark Fantasy-', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kisho Taniyama, Tomori Kusunoki, Hiroki Yasumoto, Yoko Hikasa, Kanae Itou, Tomokazu Sugita, Kensho Ono, Nao Toyama', 'TV-MA', 'When evil forces threaten to resurrect Anthrasax, the God of Destruction, the Kingdom of Meta-llicana calls on a volatile dark wizard for help.', 'When evil forces threaten to resurrect Anthrasax, the God of Destruction, the Kingdom of Meta-llicana calls on a volatile dark wizard for help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9JU3dlMumuRXxHilT6RSWQ5OT9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:156898'),
  ('158388528640012229', 'Bat Masterson', 1958, 'Western, Drama', null, null, 'Gene Barry', 'TV-14', 'Bat Masterson is an American Western television series which showed a fictionalized account of the life of real-life marshal/gambler/dandy Bat Masterson. The title character was played by Gene Barry and the half-hour black-and-white shows ran on NBC from 1958 to 1961. The series was produced by Ziv Television Productions, the company responsible for such hit series as Sea Hunt and Highway Patrol.', 'Bat Masterson is an American Western television series which showed a fictionalized account of the life of real-life marshal/gambler/dandy Bat Masterson. The title character was played by Gene Barry and the half-hour black-and-white shows ran on NBC from 1958 to 1961. The series was produced by Ziv Television Productions, the company responsible for such hit series as Sea Hunt and Highway Patrol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OxFU939AMas2yV7fohnYf74dEX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:13895'),
  ('286189107643235474', 'BAT-FAM', 2025, 'Animation, Family', 'Mike Roth, Jase Ricci', null, 'Luke Wilson, Yonas Kibreab, James Cromwell, Haley Tju, London Hughes, Michael Benyaer, Bobby Moynihan', 'TV-Y7', 'Follow Batman, Alfred, and young Damian Wayne—who has taken on the mantle of Little Batman—alongside a few newcomers to Wayne Manor, as they navigate the fun and frustrations of life as a super family', 'Follow Batman, Alfred, and young Damian Wayne—who has taken on the mantle of Little Batman—alongside a few newcomers to Wayne Manor, as they navigate the fun and frustrations of life as a super family', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8C34YTylNBt4DWM1a9oAAXqmTSr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225361'),
  ('15732218750739103', 'Batang Quiapo', 2023, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Coco Martin, Christopher de Leon, John Estrada, Cherry Pie Picache, Rosanna Roces, Andrea Brillantes, Jake Cuenca, Michael De Mesa', null, 'A young man rises to be one of the biggest outlaws in the neighborhood while he navigates his way in life to survive in Quiapo. Hoping to earn the affection of his parents, his feat draws him closer to the truth about his identity.', 'A young man rises to be one of the biggest outlaws in the neighborhood while he navigates his way in life to survive in Quiapo. Hoping to earn the affection of his parents, his feat draws him closer to the truth about his identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9McqS8mgMf5NJCAKZIY6J1oOl8y.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:215803'),
  ('21873927019141937', 'Bates Motel', 2013, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Carlton Cuse, Kerry Ehrin, Anthony Cipriano', null, 'Vera Farmiga, Freddie Highmore, Max Thieriot, Olivia Cooke, Nestor Carbonell', 'TV-MA', 'A "contemporary prequel" to the 1960 film Psycho, depicting the life of Norman Bates and his mother Norma prior to the events portrayed in Hitchcock''s film, albeit in a different fictional town and in a modern setting. The series begins after the death of Norma''s husband, when she purchases a motel located in a coastal Oregon town so she and Norman can start a new life.', 'A "contemporary prequel" to the 1960 film Psycho, depicting the life of Norman Bates and his mother Norma prior to the events portrayed in Hitchcock''s film, albeit in a different fictional town and in a modern setting. The series begins after the death of Norma''s husband, when she purchases a motel located in a coastal Oregon town so she and Norman can start a new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXKcfZE7ulYxgjjYv51s0zDG69s.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:46786'),
  ('1137243155335065157', 'Batman', 1966, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'William Dozier, Lorenzo Semple Jr.', null, 'Adam West, Burt Ward, Yvonne Craig, Neil Hamilton, Stafford Repp, Alan Napier, William Dozier', 'TV-G', 'Wealthy entrepreneur Bruce Wayne and his ward Dick Grayson lead a double life: they are actually crime fighting duo Batman and Robin. A secret Batpole in the Wayne mansion leads to the Batcave, where Police Commissioner Gordon often calls with the latest emergency threatening Gotham City. Racing to the scene of the crime in the Batmobile, Batman and Robin must (with the help of their trusty Bat-utility-belt) thwart the efforts of a variety of master criminals, including The Riddler, The Joker, Catwoman, and The Penguin.', 'Wealthy entrepreneur Bruce Wayne and his ward Dick Grayson lead a double life: they are actually crime fighting duo Batman and Robin. A secret Batpole in the Wayne mansion leads to the Batcave, where Police Commissioner Gordon often calls with the latest emergency threatening Gotham City. Racing to the scene of the crime in the Batmobile, Batman and Robin must (with the help of their trusty Bat-utility-belt) thwart the efforts of a variety of master criminals, including The Riddler, The Joker, Catwoman, and The Penguin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZEJuuDh0Zpi5ELM3Zev0GBhQ3R.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2287'),
  ('1135913114994041474', 'Batman Beyond', 1999, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Will Friedle, Kevin Conroy, Cree Summer', 'TV-Y7', 'As new villains overrun Gotham City of the future, the aging Bruce Wayne hangs up the cape of the once invincible Batman. But when troubled teenager Terry McGinnis stumbles upon the Dark Knight''s secret, a new alliance is forged. And a triumphant new Batman is born.', 'As new villains overrun Gotham City of the future, the aging Bruce Wayne hangs up the cape of the once invincible Batman. But when troubled teenager Terry McGinnis stumbles upon the Dark Knight''s secret, a new alliance is forged. And a triumphant new Batman is born.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpbHPyhLstNd5qgtjaDMdPtyPeQ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:513'),
  ('280581866436163420', 'Batman Unlimited', 2015, 'Kids, Family, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Roger Craig Smith, Yuri Lowenthal, Will Friedle, Chris Diamantopoulos, Troy Baker', 'TV-Y7', 'This merchandise show displays short episodic battles, and other encounters, around Batman and his Batfamily like Nightwing, Red Robin and Robin. The episodes manage without dialogues.', 'This merchandise show displays short episodic battles, and other encounters, around Batman and his Batfamily like Nightwing, Red Robin and Robin. The episodes manage without dialogues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwFsHsa8VQeUUuiLygiDmypLo0D.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:100535'),
  ('343683245616016802', 'Batman: Caped Crusader', 2024, 'Animation, Crime, Action & Adventure, Mystery', 'Bruce Timm', null, 'Hamish Linklater', 'TV-14', 'Welcome to Gotham City, where the corrupt outnumber the good, criminals run rampant and law-abiding citizens live in a constant state of fear. Forged in the fire of tragedy, wealthy socialite Bruce Wayne becomes something both more and less than human—the Batman. His one-man crusade for justice attracts unexpected allies within the GCPD and City Hall, but his heroic actions spawn deadly, unforeseen ramifications.', 'Welcome to Gotham City, where the corrupt outnumber the good, criminals run rampant and law-abiding citizens live in a constant state of fear. Forged in the fire of tragedy, wealthy socialite Bruce Wayne becomes something both more and less than human—the Batman. His one-man crusade for justice attracts unexpected allies within the GCPD and City Hall, but his heroic actions spawn deadly, unforeseen ramifications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imuZQcnPNKNygPw28TESUq4tNsb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125909'),
  ('81434012350888250', 'Batman: The Animated Series', 1992, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama, Mystery', 'Bruce Timm, Eric Radomski', null, 'Kevin Conroy', 'TV-PG', 'Vowing to avenge the murder of his parents, Bruce Wayne devotes his life to wiping out crime in Gotham City as the masked vigilante "Batman".', 'Vowing to avenge the murder of his parents, Bruce Wayne devotes his life to wiping out crime in Gotham City as the masked vigilante "Batman".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBomQFW1vlm1yUYMNSbFZ45R4Ox.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2098'),
  ('821096391370469760', 'Batman: The Brave and the Bold', 2008, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'James Tucker, Michael Jelenic', null, 'Diedrich Bader', 'TV-Y7', 'The Caped Crusader is teamed up with Blue Beetle, Green Arrow, Aquaman and countless others in his quest to uphold justice.', 'The Caped Crusader is teamed up with Blue Beetle, Green Arrow, Aquaman and countless others in his quest to uphold justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukXZ1N9Pd99vDNetFKYNpFYgoXF.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:15804'),
  ('1021406427728213821', 'Battery', 2016, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Koki Uchiyama, Tasuku Hatanaka, Yui Fujimaki, Yuki Ono, Ryohei Kimura, Yuuichirou Umehara, Ayumu Murase, Kaito Ishikawa', 'TV-14', 'Takumi Harada is an extremely gifted baseball pitcher. Upon entering junior high school, Takumi moves to a town situated in the mountains due to his father''s job transfer. There, he meets a new classmate Go Nagakura, a catcher who is able to get Takumi''s most powerful pitches. Takumi and Go both join the school''s baseball team where they develop a firm friendship and grow as individuals through their battery.', 'Takumi Harada is an extremely gifted baseball pitcher. Upon entering junior high school, Takumi moves to a town situated in the mountains due to his father''s job transfer. There, he meets a new classmate Go Nagakura, a catcher who is able to get Takumi''s most powerful pitches. Takumi and Go both join the school''s baseball team where they develop a firm friendship and grow as individuals through their battery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugCejM0oYBHjp4ldn50W4TYoPBH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65957'),
  ('38743100842757683', 'Battle Angel', 1993, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Miki Ito, Kappei Yamaguchi, Shunsuke Kariya, Kazuhiko Kishino, Kazuyuki Sogabe, Mami Koyama, Shigeru Chiba', null, 'Doc Ido, a doctor and mechanic who lives and works in the postapocalyptic "Scrapyard", finds the remains of a female cyborg in a junk heap. After he revives and rebuilds her, the amnesiac "Gally" begins a life for herself in a world where every day can bring a new fight.', 'Doc Ido, a doctor and mechanic who lives and works in the postapocalyptic "Scrapyard", finds the remains of a female cyborg in a junk heap. After he revives and rebuilds her, the amnesiac "Gally" begins a life for herself in a world where every day can bring a new fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8wxHzbVzd6Qcq3qectKbkC5HYf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71999'),
  ('319555716469952370', 'Battle Arena Toshinden', 1996, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Tomokazu Seki, Takehito Koyasu, Yumi Touma, Kyoko Hikami, Daisuke Gori, Bin Shimada, Kikuko Inoue, Fumihiko Tachiki', null, 'For one year, Master Swordsman Eiji Shinjo has been haunted by the memory of his battle with the renegade champion, Gaia - a battle that was cut short by the forces of the malevolent syndicate known as "the organization." Denied victory, Eiji left the tournament followed by his opponents mocking laughter. Worse still, Eiji walked away no closer to finding his long lost brother, Sho. But now, a mysterious warrior is hunting down the champions of the previous tournament and using their own moves against them - and it looks like that person may be Sho. Who is this powerful new foe and who is his next target? Eiji and Kayin, his closest friend and greatest rival, struggle to unravel the mystery before they, too, join the ranks of the defeated. The answer lies at the heart of the Organization and its plans for world domination. At last, the ultimate battle between the greatest fighters in the world will be decided. But if Eiji loses, his friends - Ellis - may Die...', 'For one year, Master Swordsman Eiji Shinjo has been haunted by the memory of his battle with the renegade champion, Gaia - a battle that was cut short by the forces of the malevolent syndicate known as "the organization." Denied victory, Eiji left the tournament followed by his opponents mocking laughter. Worse still, Eiji walked away no closer to finding his long lost brother, Sho. But now, a mysterious warrior is hunting down the champions of the previous tournament and using their own moves against them - and it looks like that person may be Sho. Who is this powerful new foe and who is his next target? Eiji and Kayin, his closest friend and greatest rival, struggle to unravel the mystery before they, too, join the ranks of the defeated. The answer lies at the heart of the Organization and its plans for world domination. At last, the ultimate battle between the greatest fighters in the world will be decided. But if Eiji loses, his friends - Ellis - may Die...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HjRehzKzm9ubsj926NggUZtdBH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117012'),
  ('85088826014707361', 'Battle Camp', 2025, 'Reality', null, null, 'Taylor Lewan', null, 'Netflix reality stars duke it out in hair-raising physical challenges and scheme to avoid elimination to win $250K in this adventurous competition show.', 'Netflix reality stars duke it out in hair-raising physical challenges and scheme to avoid elimination to win $250K in this adventurous competition show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wuSaLjPrTagk892fEywXHA6i8Xu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:287366'),
  ('878982202662220767', 'Battle Creek', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Vince Gilligan, David Shore', null, 'Josh Duhamel, Dean Winters, Janet McTeer, Kal Penn, Aubrey Dollar, Edward Fordham, Jr.', 'TV-14', 'In this mismatched buddy cop dramedy, an amazingly handsome, happy-go-lucky FBI agent is paired with a local, hard scrabble Michigan homicide detective. As they solve crimes together, their polar opposite methods only slightly outweigh their disdain for each other.', 'In this mismatched buddy cop dramedy, an amazingly handsome, happy-go-lucky FBI agent is paired with a local, hard scrabble Michigan homicide detective. As they solve crimes together, their polar opposite methods only slightly outweigh their disdain for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5oqPaAiwflr1o4PlNvkAGRC9DCX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61676'),
  ('416253787403328236', 'Battle Doll: Angelic Layer', 2001, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ayako Kawasumi, Chiemi Chiba, Kikuko Inoue, Houko Kuwashima, Jun Fukuyama, Masaya Onosaka, Yuri Shiratori, Yui Horie', null, '12-year-old Misaki Suzuhara has just gotten involved in Angelic Layer, a battling game using electronic dolls called angels. Even as a newbie, Misaki shows advanced skills as she meets new friends and enters Angelic Layer tournaments to fight the greatest Angelic Layer champions of the nation.', '12-year-old Misaki Suzuhara has just gotten involved in Angelic Layer, a battling game using electronic dolls called angels. Even as a newbie, Misaki shows advanced skills as she meets new friends and enters Angelic Layer tournaments to fight the greatest Angelic Layer champions of the nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKkPwIghdPKjuTseO5xEXCAEi80.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34722'),
  ('679111605722482911', 'Battle for Dream Island', 2010, 'Action & Adventure, Family, Animation', 'Cary Huang, Michael Huang', null, 'Cary Huang, Michael Huang', null, 'When twenty inanimate objects desire change in their lives, a robotic speaker box arrives to give them all new incentive; a competition for an island of luxury known as ''Dream Island''.', 'When twenty inanimate objects desire change in their lives, a robotic speaker box arrives to give them all new incentive; a competition for an island of luxury known as ''Dream Island''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQNMSMohM881fPf3jJHnjVHmlSz.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:315646'),
  ('374423006983606745', 'Battle for Happiness', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Joo Young-ha', 'Joo Young-ha', 'Lee El, Jin Seo-yeon, Cha Ye-ryun, Park Hyo-ju, Woo Jeong-won, Lee Kyu-han, Moon Hee-kyung, Son Woo-hyeon', null, 'A suspense drama depicting mothers engaged in a fierce social media battle to destroy each others'' happiness for their own, to free themselves from oppression, hurt, and secrets, and regain their true selves.', 'A suspense drama depicting mothers engaged in a fierce social media battle to destroy each others'' happiness for their own, to free themselves from oppression, hurt, and secrets, and regain their true selves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/edzkG2WeTteDZ4SJ4ohyjszkOmQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214996'),
  ('597008484689250969', 'Battle for Moscow', 1985, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Vyacheslav Yezepov, Evgeny Novikov, Yakov Tripolsky, Viktor Zozulin, Vladimir Tkachenko, Anatoliy Nikitin, Viktor Shulgin, Aleksandr Voevodin', null, 'The Battle of Moscow is a 1985 Soviet multi-part war narrative, presenting a dramatized account of the 1941 Battle of Moscow and the events preceding it. The battle was the first major defeat of German Wehrmacht in the Second World War.', 'The Battle of Moscow is a 1985 Soviet multi-part war narrative, presenting a dramatized account of the 1941 Battle of Moscow and the events preceding it. The battle was the first major defeat of German Wehrmacht in the Second World War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6zmfQOTmpvatw2kZ6jNOnmimSr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86162'),
  ('330354426625970972', 'Battle Game in 5 Seconds', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ayumu Murase, Aimi, Mayumi Shintani, Kazuya Nakai, Yuichi Nakamura, Miyuri Shimabukuro, Akari Kito', 'TV-14', 'A new kind of battle of abilities for a new generation is about to begin! It all started on a regular morning like any other. Akira Shiroyanagi is a high school kid who loves nothing more than konpeito candy and games. One day, he ends up in a fight due to a mysterious girl named Mion. Mion then tells the people she had gathered that they no longer officially exist in any records. They were given powers and were about to be test subjects. Akira makes up his mind to use his powers to climb up the ranks and then crush this organization.', 'A new kind of battle of abilities for a new generation is about to begin! It all started on a regular morning like any other. Akira Shiroyanagi is a high school kid who loves nothing more than konpeito candy and games. One day, he ends up in a fight due to a mysterious girl named Mion. Mion then tells the people she had gathered that they no longer officially exist in any records. They were given powers and were about to be test subjects. Akira makes up his mind to use his powers to climb up the ranks and then crush this organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGuTtEc5q3pO6Kl2Pmszc9IwEe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112940'),
  ('628299735605233485', 'Battle Girl High School', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Aya Suzaki, Ayane Sakura, Sora Amamiya, Nao Toyama, Sumire Uesaka, Saori Hayami, Kaede Hondo, Shino Shimoji', 'TV-14', 'Set in the year 2045. The world has been contaminated by Irousu (mysterious invaders who suddenly appeared), and humans find themselves restricted and contained. Standing boldly against these invaders are ordinary girls everywhere, without a powerful army or even weapons.', 'Set in the year 2045. The world has been contaminated by Irousu (mysterious invaders who suddenly appeared), and humans find themselves restricted and contained. Standing boldly against these invaders are ordinary girls everywhere, without a powerful army or even weapons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdZ035bWBbT5ca08Pbfcx7pU2Dk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72504'),
  ('1100963764804833952', 'Battle of Changsha', 2014, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, 'Zeng Lu, Wu Tong', 'Wallace Huo, Yang Zi, Ren Chengwei, Zuo Xiaoqing, Niu Junfeng, Gao Xin, Wang Hong, Xia Lü', null, 'In 1938, as war engulfs Changsha, the Hu family struggles to protect their twins. Amid loss and destruction, Xiangxiang faces love, tragedy, and duty, while the people of Hunan unite to resist the Japanese invasion.', 'In 1938, as war engulfs Changsha, the Hu family struggles to protect their twins. Amid loss and destruction, Xiangxiang faces love, tragedy, and duty, while the people of Hunan unite to resist the Japanese invasion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXqjFEUfS3NpR3Ol9A4EiEiNDnb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71668'),
  ('1076319477858174107', 'Battle of Culiacán: Heirs of the Cartel', 2025, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'A gripping docuseries chronicling the attempted arrest of notorious drug lord Ovidio Guzmán, son of "El Chapo," and the tragic violence that ensued.', 'A gripping docuseries chronicling the attempted arrest of notorious drug lord Ovidio Guzmán, son of "El Chapo," and the tragic violence that ensued.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dAdAp5e2ruC3GZhjtunllNh3trT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:286287'),
  ('141303336273848259', 'Battle Of The Heart', 1989, null, null, null, 'Felix Wong Yat-Wah, Yammie Lam Kit-Ying, Betty Mak Chui-Han, Shek Sau, Kiki Sheung, Ronna Ko, Charlie Ng Kai-Ming, Lily Lai-Lai Liu', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0XryUS2k1zfNoiw1JPnC6D3r0N.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108439'),
  ('1140828243585723874', 'Battle of the Network Stars', 1976, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Howard Cosell', null, 'Battle of the Network Stars was a series of competitions where television stars from ABC, CBS, and NBC would compete in various sporting events. A total of nineteen of these competitions were held, all of which were aired by ABC. In 2013, the show appeared in TV Guide''s list of the 60 greatest game shows ever.', 'Battle of the Network Stars was a series of competitions where television stars from ABC, CBS, and NBC would compete in various sporting events. A total of nineteen of these competitions were held, all of which were aired by ABC. In 2013, the show appeared in TV Guide''s list of the 60 greatest game shows ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KTe1voKfQOzLDKUsiejRjUUWO1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11884'),
  ('506844789057761564', 'Battle of the Planets', 1978, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Tatsuo Yoshida', 'Jameson Brewer', 'Ronnie Schell, Casey Kasem, Janet Waldo, Alan Young, Alan Dinehart, Keye Luke', null, 'G-Force, a five-member superhero team, fights to defend Earth and its space colonies from the threat of the planet Spectra.', 'G-Force, a five-member superhero team, fights to defend Earth and its space colonies from the threat of the planet Spectra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYvvllQQ7Hb8hgm0PcqVstzFKcb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4695'),
  ('1128372749650033462', 'Battle of the Psychics', 2007, 'Reality, Mystery', null, null, 'Marat Basharov, Sergey Safronov, Vsevolod Kuznetsov', null, 'Battle of the Psychics (Bitva Extrasenov) is a Russian-language TNT TV show based on Britain’s Psychic Challenge. Each season starts with 8-13 participants selected for their superior psychic abilities, but tries to expose them as frauds. Tasks in the beginning of the series are relatively simple, such as revealing the contents of a sealed box or what lies behind an impenetrable screen, and progressively become more difficult. One participant judged to be worst is eliminated each week, but all participants advance to the next round if the panel is unable to come to a decision.', 'Battle of the Psychics (Bitva Extrasenov) is a Russian-language TNT TV show based on Britain’s Psychic Challenge. Each season starts with 8-13 participants selected for their superior psychic abilities, but tries to expose them as frauds. Tasks in the beginning of the series are relatively simple, such as revealing the contents of a sealed box or what lies behind an impenetrable screen, and progressively become more difficult. One participant judged to be worst is eliminated each week, but all participants advance to the next round if the panel is unable to come to a decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yyuXEH1OP2QtwJFOm2wIMsEc03B.jpg', 22, 'tmdb:tv:74218'),
  ('1033776271201242275', 'Battle of the Writers', 2024, 'Drama', 'Ping Guo Shu Shu Shu', null, 'Koraphat Lamnoi, Pharinyakorn Khansawa, Sorntast Buangam, Jassada Janmano, Willie Arawill Jartonk, Ruan Zeyi', null, 'A newcomer web novelist accused of plagiarizing the top author must clear his name when fate forces them to collaborate on a new project.', 'A newcomer web novelist accused of plagiarizing the top author must clear his name when fate forces them to collaborate on a new project.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qRpY2U515C9f75gK7iwuhGMYsSH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:248909'),
  ('1075519385100147004', 'Battle Spirits: Shonen Toppa Bashin', 2008, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mutsumi Tamura, Kaya Miyake, Ayahi Takagaki, Ryosuke Sakamaki, Akemi Kanda, Maya Nishimura, Masato Funaki, Tomoyuki Shimura', 'TV-PG', 'Bashin is a grade 6 student who loves trading card games. The globally popular card game Battle Spirits is all the rage. Through some strange circumstances, Bashin acquires a Pyroxene which gives Bashin the ability to become a Card Battler. He can summon the monster Spirits depicted on the cards so they can fight each other. Bashin learns that the legendary X Rare Card actually exists, and he engages in fierce card battles with other rivals to get the X Rare Card.', 'Bashin is a grade 6 student who loves trading card games. The globally popular card game Battle Spirits is all the rage. Through some strange circumstances, Bashin acquires a Pyroxene which gives Bashin the ability to become a Card Battler. He can summon the monster Spirits depicted on the cards so they can fight each other. Bashin learns that the legendary X Rare Card actually exists, and he engages in fierce card battles with other rivals to get the X Rare Card.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJHIafoFzOYmPBtgxaMum7m5pWj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:132359'),
  ('1068632834214046233', 'Battle Spirits: Sword Eyes', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Kids', null, null, null, null, 'The lands of Legendia have the forces of light and darkness in an eternal conflict, a war over the 12 Sword Braves. The two forces attempt to seize the Divine Sword of Judgment. In the distant stone continent of Pacifis, Tsurugi Tatewaki acquires the Shining Sword. As dark forces go after Tsurugi and the Sword Brave, he meets Bringer, a Card Battle Druid given the task to be his protector. Tsurugi learns how to fight with Battle Spirit cards and stands against the dark forces!', 'The lands of Legendia have the forces of light and darkness in an eternal conflict, a war over the 12 Sword Braves. The two forces attempt to seize the Divine Sword of Judgment. In the distant stone continent of Pacifis, Tsurugi Tatewaki acquires the Shining Sword. As dark forces go after Tsurugi and the Sword Brave, he meets Bringer, a Card Battle Druid given the task to be his protector. Tsurugi learns how to fight with Battle Spirit cards and stands against the dark forces!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhULquDIsPHcf09gpLoPEOytxvx.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:90357'),
  ('235341835362338018', 'BattleBots', 2000, 'Reality', null, null, 'Carmen Electra, Donna D''Errico, Traci Bingham, Heidi Mark, Bill Nye, Sean Salisbury, Arj Barker, Tony Rock', 'TV-PG', 'In a BattleBots event the competitors are remote-controlled armed and armored machines, designed to fight in an arena combat elimination tournament. If both combat robots are still operational at the end of the match the winner is determined by a point system based on damage, aggression, and strategy. The television show BattleBots aired on the American cable network Comedy Central for five seasons, covering five BattleBots tournaments. The first season aired starting in August 2000, and the fifth season aired starting in August 2002. Hosts of BattleBots were Bil Dwyer and Sean Salisbury and correspondents included former Baywatch actresses Donna D''Errico, Carmen Electra, and Traci Bingham, former Playboy Playmate Heidi Mark, and identical twins Randy and Jason Sklar. Bill Nye was the show''s "technical expert". After five ''seasons'', Comedy Central terminated their contract with BattleBots Inc. in late 2002.', 'In a BattleBots event the competitors are remote-controlled armed and armored machines, designed to fight in an arena combat elimination tournament. If both combat robots are still operational at the end of the match the winner is determined by a point system based on damage, aggression, and strategy. The television show BattleBots aired on the American cable network Comedy Central for five seasons, covering five BattleBots tournaments. The first season aired starting in August 2000, and the fifth season aired starting in August 2002. Hosts of BattleBots were Bil Dwyer and Sean Salisbury and correspondents included former Baywatch actresses Donna D''Errico, Carmen Electra, and Traci Bingham, former Playboy Playmate Heidi Mark, and identical twins Randy and Jason Sklar. Bill Nye was the show''s "technical expert". After five ''seasons'', Comedy Central terminated their contract with BattleBots Inc. in late 2002.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5XO0mLFvOmcWuz1hDrgzQF42849.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:1286'),
  ('283966135789129673', 'BattleBots', 2015, 'Reality', 'Edward P. Roski, Greg Munson', null, 'Chris Rose, Kenny Florian, Faruq Tauheed', null, 'BattleBots promises to wow viewers with next generation robots—bigger, faster and stronger than ever before. The show will focus on the design and build of each robot, the bot builder backstories, their intense pursuit of the championship and the spectacle of the event.', 'BattleBots promises to wow viewers with next generation robots—bigger, faster and stronger than ever before. The show will focus on the design and build of each robot, the bot builder backstories, their intense pursuit of the championship and the spectacle of the event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqZiksZMPIhOIVrnDLV03XZ6x5A.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:62959'),
  ('197363332670476131', 'Battlefish', 2018, 'Documentary, Reality', 'Craig Piligian, Mike Nichols', null, null, null, 'Over the course of a fishing season, tough men and women pursue lucrative albacore tuna in the competitive waters off the Oregon coast.', 'Over the course of a fishing season, tough men and women pursue lucrative albacore tuna in the competitive waters off the Oregon coast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f05CT7h9xoGTRC5ixFT3KmmB0Sp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82498'),
  ('302615971909144956', 'Battlestar Galactica', 1978, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Glen A. Larson', null, 'Lorne Greene, Dirk Benedict, Richard Hatch, Maren Jensen, Herbert Jefferson Jr., Terry Carter, Noah Hathaway, Tony Swartz', 'TV-PG', 'When the 12 Colonies of Man are wiped out by a cybernetic race called the Cylons, Commander Adama and the crew of the battlestar Galactica lead a ragtag fleet of human survivors in search of a "mythical planet" called Earth.', 'When the 12 Colonies of Man are wiped out by a cybernetic race called the Cylons, Commander Adama and the crew of the battlestar Galactica lead a ragtag fleet of human survivors in search of a "mythical planet" called Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27jl4H9PauenZlmVBbOO1pr1lGf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:501'),
  ('1013006079187591022', 'Battlestar Galactica', 2003, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Ronald D. Moore', null, 'Edward James Olmos, Mary McDonnell, Katee Sackhoff, Jamie Bamber, James Callis, Tricia Helfer, Callum Keith Rennie, Grace Park', 'TV-14', 'A re-imagining of the original series in which a "rag-tag fugitive fleet" of the last remnants of mankind flees pursuing robots while simultaneously searching for their true home, Earth.', 'A re-imagining of the original series in which a "rag-tag fugitive fleet" of the last remnants of mankind flees pursuing robots while simultaneously searching for their true home, Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imTQ4nBdA68TVpLaWhhQJnb7NQh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71365'),
  ('138604555212185616', 'Battlestar Galactica', 2004, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Glen A. Larson, Ronald D. Moore', 'Carla Robinson', 'Edward James Olmos, Mary McDonnell, Jamie Bamber, Katee Sackhoff, James Callis, Tricia Helfer, Tahmoh Penikett, Grace Park', 'TV-14', 'When an old enemy, the Cylons, resurface and obliterate the 12 colonies, the crew of the aged Galactica protect a small civilian fleet - the last of humanity - as they journey toward the fabled 13th colony, Earth.', 'When an old enemy, the Cylons, resurface and obliterate the 12 colonies, the crew of the aged Galactica protect a small civilian fleet - the last of humanity - as they journey toward the fabled 13th colony, Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99PJSbcO2LeM10uOGWeFihNp77j.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1972'),
  ('403015400883843188', 'Battlestar Galactica: Blood & Chrome', 2012, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'David Eick, Michael Taylor', 'Bradley Thompson, Michael Taylor, David Eick', 'Luke Pasqualino, Ben Cotton, Brian Markinson, Jill Teed, Lili Bordán, John Pyper-Ferguson, Zak Santiago, Leo Chiang', null, 'The first Cylon war has been raging for 10 years and a young Ensign William Adama joins the fleet. He''s disappointed not to be assigned to a fighter but to a freighter. His co-pilot, Lt. Coker Fasjovic, isn''t too keen on having a rookie flying his aircraft as he has only a short time before he again becomes a civilian. Their cargo is a civilian scientist, Dr. Becca Kelly, but they no sooner leave than she has new orders for them and a new destination. She is less than forthcoming about just what her secret mission is but Adama is keen, particularly as it involves going into Cylon controlled space. Nothing is as it seems however.', 'The first Cylon war has been raging for 10 years and a young Ensign William Adama joins the fleet. He''s disappointed not to be assigned to a fighter but to a freighter. His co-pilot, Lt. Coker Fasjovic, isn''t too keen on having a rookie flying his aircraft as he has only a short time before he again becomes a civilian. Their cargo is a civilian scientist, Dr. Becca Kelly, but they no sooner leave than she has new orders for them and a new destination. She is less than forthcoming about just what her secret mission is but Adama is keen, particularly as it involves going into Cylon controlled space. Nothing is as it seems however.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuHuvxnfcPXZauX1Pm7qwmc9k5L.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33240'),
  ('178987891093903042', 'Batwheels', 2022, 'Kids, Animation, Comedy', 'Michael G. Stern', null, 'Noah Kaye Bentley, Jacob Bertrand, Kimberly Brooks, Madigan Kacmar, Lilimar, Mick Wingert, Ethan Hawke, Titus Blake', 'TV-Y', 'The Batwheels are a team of sentient super-powered crimefighting vehicles that help Batman, Robin and Batgirl—as well as a host of additional DC Super Heroes—keep Gotham City safe. Created only recently by the Batcomputer, our mechanized heroes must navigate the growing pains of being a newly formed super-team as well as the growing pains that come with just being a kid.', 'The Batwheels are a team of sentient super-powered crimefighting vehicles that help Batman, Robin and Batgirl—as well as a host of additional DC Super Heroes—keep Gotham City safe. Created only recently by the Batcomputer, our mechanized heroes must navigate the growing pains of being a newly formed super-team as well as the growing pains that come with just being a kid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nDNUuNNoFaZFNjSwWCG5XwaOf9f.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:155780'),
  ('844193364420636737', 'Batwoman', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Caroline Dries', null, 'Javicia Leslie, Rachel Skarsten, Meagan Tandy, Nicole Kang, Camrus Johnson, Nick Creegan, Robin Givens', 'TV-14', 'Kate Kane, armed with a passion for social justice and a flair for speaking her mind, soars onto the streets of Gotham as Batwoman, an out lesbian and highly trained street fighter primed to snuff out the failing city''s criminal resurgence. But don''t call her a hero yet. In a city desperate for a savior, Kate must overcome her own demons before embracing the call to be Gotham''s symbol of hope', 'Kate Kane, armed with a passion for social justice and a flair for speaking her mind, soars onto the streets of Gotham as Batwoman, an out lesbian and highly trained street fighter primed to snuff out the failing city''s criminal resurgence. But don''t call her a hero yet. In a city desperate for a savior, Kate must overcome her own demons before embracing the call to be Gotham''s symbol of hope', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBpxKiitMuYXvtsXNSzya8DKKzV.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:89247'),
  ('533470037149632988', 'Bauhaus: A New Era', 2019, 'Drama', 'Lars Kraume', 'Lena Kiessler, Judith Angerbauer, Lars Kraume', 'August Diehl, Anna Maria Mühe, Trine Dyrholm, Valerie Pachner, Ludwig Trepte, Sven Schelker, Alexander Finkenwirth, Corinna Kirchhoff', null, '1919. World War I has just ended. Dörte Helm, a young art student in Weimar, follows Walter Gropius’ call and joins the newly-founded Bauhaus school. A love story grows between Gropius and Dörte, adding fuel to the fire of the ensuing scandal threatening the very existence of the Bauhaus; the school of art that would go on to shape the 20th century like no other…', '1919. World War I has just ended. Dörte Helm, a young art student in Weimar, follows Walter Gropius’ call and joins the newly-founded Bauhaus school. A love story grows between Gropius and Dörte, adding fuel to the fire of the ensuing scandal threatening the very existence of the Bauhaus; the school of art that would go on to shape the 20th century like no other…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50Z6XkPSzM6bpeUeLrqLWCR6QpF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92999'),
