  ('906216312357606424', 'BBC Breakfast', 2000, 'News', null, null, null, null, 'BBC Breakfast is a national British morning television news programme simulcast on BBC One and the BBC News channel. It is presented live from MediaCityUK and contains a mixture of news, sport, weather, business and feature items. The programme is broadcast seven days a week, every week of the year, including weekends and public holidays. It is a department of the BBC North Group division. Alison Ford, previously the UK Editor for BBC Newsgathering, was the Editor of the programme, until her death in July 2013. Her appointment followed the departure of David Kermode to 5 News.', 'BBC Breakfast is a national British morning television news programme simulcast on BBC One and the BBC News channel. It is presented live from MediaCityUK and contains a mixture of news, sport, weather, business and feature items. The programme is broadcast seven days a week, every week of the year, including weekends and public holidays. It is a department of the BBC North Group division. Alison Ford, previously the UK Editor for BBC Newsgathering, was the Editor of the programme, until her death in July 2013. Her appointment followed the departure of David Kermode to 5 News.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pEPwnMSVlTeH2xkeNvJOd5pvPkc.jpg', 22, 'tmdb:tv:2535'),
  ('819062547419849076', 'BBC Play of the Month', 1965, 'Drama', 'James MacTaggart', null, null, null, 'A BBC television anthology series featuring productions of classic and contemporary stage plays usually broadcast on BBC1. Each production featured a different work, often using prominent British stage actors in the leading roles. The series was transmitted from October 1965 to September 1983.', 'A BBC television anthology series featuring productions of classic and contemporary stage plays usually broadcast on BBC1. Each production featured a different work, often using prominent British stage actors in the leading roles. The series was transmitted from October 1965 to September 1983.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JdkYwK9k87M4ZhOhynoTeK3mtQ.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:20532'),
  ('301236633792569431', 'BBC Proms', 1947, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'The World''s Greatest Classical Music Festival. The BBC Proms is a classical music festival held every summer at the Royal Albert Hall in London, and in recent years has explored an innovative series of Proms around the UK with concerts in all four nations. Its aim: to bring the best in classical music to the widest possible audience, which remains true to founder-conductor Henry Wood’s original vision in 1895. Whether you are a classical connoisseur or think classical music isn’t for you, there is something for everyone in the eight-week stretch of concerts.', 'The World''s Greatest Classical Music Festival. The BBC Proms is a classical music festival held every summer at the Royal Albert Hall in London, and in recent years has explored an innovative series of Proms around the UK with concerts in all four nations. Its aim: to bring the best in classical music to the widest possible audience, which remains true to founder-conductor Henry Wood’s original vision in 1895. Whether you are a classical connoisseur or think classical music isn’t for you, there is something for everyone in the eight-week stretch of concerts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/605DvsE6xjYaJ3fYDRhnj0fmb2D.jpg', 79, 'tmdb:tv:23393'),
  ('787966305913261216', 'BBC2 Play of the Week', 1977, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sarah Pia Anderson', null, null, null, 'An anthology of plays and novels adapted into feature length TV movies, broadcast on BBC2 from September 1977 to April 1979.', 'An anthology of plays and novels adapted into feature length TV movies, broadcast on BBC2 from September 1977 to April 1979.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxw3egrIzeydlHvSruBVDpa3AU8.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:44697'),
  ('1063968030264321077', 'BBK/BRNK', 2016, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Soma Saito, Ari Ozawa, Yusuke Kobayashi, Shizuka Ishigami, Mikako Komatsu, Kenjiro Tsuda, Subaru Kimura, Megumi Han', 'TV-PG', 'It’s been ten years since Azuma Kazuki has been in Japan, and upon his arrival he is taken prisoner by a group of armed men. Azuma is saved by his childhood friend, Kogane Asabuki, thanks to a living weapon she wields on her right hand, known as a Bubuki. Learning about these weapons, Azuma becomes a Bubuki wielder himself and sets out on a journey.', 'It’s been ten years since Azuma Kazuki has been in Japan, and upon his arrival he is taken prisoner by a group of armed men. Azuma is saved by his childhood friend, Kogane Asabuki, thanks to a living weapon she wields on her right hand, known as a Bubuki. Learning about these weapons, Azuma becomes a Bubuki wielder himself and sets out on a journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Mi3N7l5X9Rm5U1lUzC4vD526zG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65210'),
  ('659587537305039686', 'Be Cool, Scooby-Doo!', 2015, 'Comedy, Animation, Mystery, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Matthew Lillard, Grey DeLisle, Kate Micucci, Frank Welker', 'TV-Y7', 'The gang decide to go traveling in the Mystery Machine, seeking fun and adventure during what could possibly be their last summer break together. However, havoc-wreaking monsters seem to be drawn to them, appearing almost every stop of the way.', 'The gang decide to go traveling in the Mystery Machine, seeking fun and adventure during what could possibly be their last summer break together. However, havoc-wreaking monsters seem to be drawn to them, appearing almost every stop of the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJksJvJnvrVQL9dMdqy1XwjD5KQ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:64228'),
  ('614794763256111224', 'Be Eternal: Champions of America', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Juanma Martínez Medina', 'Juanma Martínez Medina, Mariano Goscilo', 'Lionel Messi, Lionel Scaloni, Ángel Di María, Rodrigo De Paul, Lisandro Martínez, Alejandro Darío Gómez, Leandro Paredes, Nicolás Otamendi', 'TV-14', 'This series takes an unprecedented closeup look at Lionel Messi and the Argentine team''s battle to break a 28-year title drought in 2021''s Copa América.', 'This series takes an unprecedented closeup look at Lionel Messi and the Argentine team''s battle to break a 28-year title drought in 2021''s Copa América.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBlqr507IV9bDKHLEFBtEtTfCw3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213762'),
  ('246854421667944400', 'Be Home for Dinner', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Elliot Ngok Wah, Jason Chan Chi-San, Kristal Tin Yui-Nei, Stephen Au Kam-Tong, Helen Ma Hoi-Lun, Queenie Chu Wai-Man, Katy Kung, Yvonne Lam Yee-Man', 'NR', 'Chung Kwok-Chu is a renowned food critic and an assistant editor-in-chief of a newspaper, Ko Jim Daily. When his son, Si-Hon returns from Canada, Chu is disappointed to find that Si Hon intends to become a chef rather than taking up a professional career. His attempts to guide his son away are thwarted when Shum Bui-yee, a well-known and respected chef, reluctantly accepts Si-Hon as her assistant. Meanwhile, Kwok-Chu struggles to keep peace amongst extended family members.', 'Chung Kwok-Chu is a renowned food critic and an assistant editor-in-chief of a newspaper, Ko Jim Daily. When his son, Si-Hon returns from Canada, Chu is disappointed to find that Si Hon intends to become a chef rather than taking up a professional career. His attempts to guide his son away are thwarted when Shum Bui-yee, a well-known and respected chef, reluctantly accepts Si-Hon as her assistant. Meanwhile, Kwok-Chu struggles to keep peace amongst extended family members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gc1VZ5ZuuN1x9SsbafIq0kpFkgL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39011'),
  ('587084219924568338', 'Be Loved in House: I Do', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Aaron Lai, Hank Wang, Liao Wei-po, JN Yu, Yao Mi, Chen Xi Teng, Lotus Wang, Deyn Li', null, 'When a strict new boss bans dating in the office, a defiant employee sets out to challenge the rule—only to fall for the man behind it.', 'When a strict new boss bans dating in the office, a defiant employee sets out to challenge the rule—only to fall for the man behind it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpgcxs4Nbebg0uXh3zYtHBeZbob.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125694'),
  ('204156370279866335', 'Be Melodramatic', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lee Byeong-heon', null, 'Chun Woo-hee, Jeon Yeo-been, Han Ji-eun, Ahn Jae-hong, Gong Myoung, Yun Ji-on, Lee You-jin, Lee Ju-bin', null, 'At the start of their 30s, three friends navigate the demanding entertainment industry while juggling love, careers and dreams.', 'At the start of their 30s, three friends navigate the demanding entertainment industry while juggling love, careers and dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdPc2MoU8Cm87R3kYw1Hul0Dy76.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90720'),
  ('27189401322748157', 'Be Mine SuperStar', 2023, 'Drama', 'Orpheus', null, 'Phachara Suansri, Chalongrat Nobsamrong, Suphadach Wilairat, Kavinpat Thanahiransilp, Peerawat Sareewong, Warinda Damrongphol, Thongthong Mokjok, Yo Korkuer Deewattananukul', null, 'A superstar preparing for a role lets a loyal admirer into his world, and a gentle romance blossoms as the intern helps him learn how to love again.', 'A superstar preparing for a role lets a loyal admirer into his world, and a gentle romance blossoms as the intern helps him learn how to love again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lM4osESTKmG4nPEAF8z6LDY85M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218036'),
  ('279055956130999766', 'Be My Boyfriend', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lee Si yeong, Han Song Yi, Lee Min Seok', 'Han Song Yi', 'Shin Hyeon-seung, Lee Si-woo, Choi Yu-ju, Lim Sung-kyun, Kim Byeong-kwan, Jung Bo-min', null, 'A nobody, Lee Seung-min is the epitome of an ordinary Joe. He has a crush on the most popular girl in school, Oh Ji-na, an idol trainee. Then one day, Oh Ji-na proposes that they start a fake relationship. Can Ji-na and Seung-min pull off their complicated fake relationship and start dating for real?', 'A nobody, Lee Seung-min is the epitome of an ordinary Joe. He has a crush on the most popular girl in school, Oh Ji-na, an idol trainee. Then one day, Oh Ji-na proposes that they start a fake relationship. Can Ji-na and Seung-min pull off their complicated fake relationship and start dating for real?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQAocOGBuXSRPFJcZyjTshs1Jiv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118932'),
  ('278555522960174392', 'Be My Favorite', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'JittiRain', null, 'Perawat Sangpotirat, Gawin Caskey, Sarunchana Apisamaimongkol, Thanaboon Kiatniran, Kirati Puangmalee', null, 'Kawi gets a second chance at love—and revenge—when a magical crystal ball sends him back to the moment he lost everything.', 'Kawi gets a second chance at love—and revenge—when a magical crystal ball sends him back to the moment he lost everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLpDXaHAGMV1lhMswsPm1PWHYha.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:226471'),
  ('764745675681497563', 'Be My Guest', 1991, null, null, null, 'Anita Yuen Wing-Yee, Eddie Cheung Siu-Fai, Simon Lui Yu-Yeung, Emily Kwan Bo-Wai, Jason Pai Piao, Yvonne Lam Yee-Man, Power Chan Kwok-Pong, Yeung Ling', null, 'Be My Guest is an ongoing television programme produced by Television Broadcasts Limited in Hong Kong. It is originally broadcast on TVB Lifestyle Channel of TVB Pay Vision in 2006. It is also aired on certain Cathay Pacific flights. TVB released the VCD, DVD, and books. Stephen Chan Chi Wan, General Manager of TVB, is the host of this show and he interviews notable performing celebrities, politicians, business people in Hong Kong. There are also stage and ball shows of the programme but they are not released.', 'Be My Guest is an ongoing television programme produced by Television Broadcasts Limited in Hong Kong. It is originally broadcast on TVB Lifestyle Channel of TVB Pay Vision in 2006. It is also aired on certain Cathay Pacific flights. TVB released the VCD, DVD, and books. Stephen Chan Chi Wan, General Manager of TVB, is the host of this show and he interviews notable performing celebrities, politicians, business people in Hong Kong. There are also stage and ball shows of the programme but they are not released.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xeQ2HOBZd59J3LWyQ9PnCRdPbEu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222588'),
