  ('638325348932921644', 'Behind the Music', 1997, 'Documentary', 'Gay Rosenthal', 'Gay Rosenthal', 'Jim Forbes', 'TV-14', 'An intimate look into the personal lives of pop music''s greatest and most influential artists.', 'An intimate look into the personal lives of pop music''s greatest and most influential artists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMnNFb6eFKF5edRh62Km2IqfdAG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:937'),
  ('803130109157869812', 'Behind the Scenes', 2019, 'Drama', null, '苏梨叶', 'Zhou Dongyu, Luo Jin, Liu Ruilin, Wu Lipeng, Wang Xiao, Danni Chong, Gardner Tse Kwan-Ho, Chen Ran', 'NR', 'Media student Bu Xiao Gu has a dream: she is determined to become an outstanding producer. Her idol is Chun Yu Qiao, who is a top-notch producer at Xintian production company, and Xiao Gu manages to enter the company as an intern. But Yu Qiao’s unreasonable personality makes Xiao Gu feel great disappointment. With her hopes shattered, Xiao Gu is asleep at the wheel and not only causes a live broadcast accident which makes her lose her job, but also misses the deadline for her master thesis. However, Yu Qiao takes on the sole responsibility for the accident and thus saves Xiao Gu’s career. Xiao Gu finally recognizes Yu Qiao’s true personality and the two start to work and fight for their dreams together.', 'Media student Bu Xiao Gu has a dream: she is determined to become an outstanding producer. Her idol is Chun Yu Qiao, who is a top-notch producer at Xintian production company, and Xiao Gu manages to enter the company as an intern. But Yu Qiao’s unreasonable personality makes Xiao Gu feel great disappointment. With her hopes shattered, Xiao Gu is asleep at the wheel and not only causes a live broadcast accident which makes her lose her job, but also misses the deadline for her master thesis. However, Yu Qiao takes on the sole responsibility for the accident and thus saves Xiao Gu’s career. Xiao Gu finally recognizes Yu Qiao’s true personality and the two start to work and fight for their dreams together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHGi48eQu8RBb2BwI6npYhtkWno.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85512'),
  ('537482627739850651', 'Behind Your Touch', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Lee Nam-kyu, Kim Sok-yun', 'Lee Nam-kyu, Oh Bo-hyun, Kim Da-hee', 'Han Ji-min, Lee Min-ki, Suho, Joo Min-kyung, Yang Jae-seong, Park Seong-yeon, Kim Hie-won, Jung Yi-rang', null, 'A psychic vet and a detective join forces to crack small-town cases — but their skills are tested when they unravel a chilling serial killer mystery', 'A psychic vet and a detective join forces to crack small-town cases — but their skills are tested when they unravel a chilling serial killer mystery', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmGfPwRBOr8i8zxS0P0XCFJE21W.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210107'),
  ('932117996138132332', 'Behzat Ç.: An Ankara Policeman', 2010, 'Drama, War & Politics, Action & Adventure, Crime', null, 'Emrah Serbes, Ercan Mehmet Erdem', 'Erdal Beşikçioğlu, Canan Ergüder, Ege Aydan, İnanç Konukçu, Berkan Şal, Serdar Orçin, Gökhan Yıkılkan, Eray Eserol', null, 'Centered around a personally troubled, officially discredited police chief and his inharmonious police team in Ankara Police Force. Even though the show usually focuses on murders and other crimes that happens on a weekly basis, the undertone of the story leads to an eventual duel between Behzat Ç. and the rotten department officials and bureaucrats.', 'Centered around a personally troubled, officially discredited police chief and his inharmonious police team in Ankara Police Force. Even though the show usually focuses on murders and other crimes that happens on a weekly basis, the undertone of the story leads to an eventual duel between Behzat Ç. and the rotten department officials and bureaucrats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRqNQ5v2tvZ9ZRAXpYik0JamHkm.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:39176'),
  ('290763602328291143', 'Bei Hübner', 2004, 'Talk', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 6, 'tmdb:tv:316740'),
  ('779156082890864675', 'Being a Hero', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', null, 'Zhang Yuan''ang', 'Chen Xiao, Wang Yibo, Wang Jinsong, Liu Yijun, Zhao Zhaoyi, Zhang Yuqi, Guo Xiaoting, Tu Bing', null, 'Five years after his father''s murder by a drug cartel, former officer Wu Zhenfeng reappears as a wanted suspect, earning the nickname "Addict Lord." Now a narcotics officer, his former best friend Chen Yu is determined to uncover the truth behind Wu''s actions. As their paths collide, a high-stakes game of loyalty, deception, and hidden motives unfolds.', 'Five years after his father''s murder by a drug cartel, former officer Wu Zhenfeng reappears as a wanted suspect, earning the nickname "Addict Lord." Now a narcotics officer, his former best friend Chen Yu is determined to uncover the truth behind Wu''s actions. As their paths collide, a high-stakes game of loyalty, deception, and hidden motives unfolds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXb1VmDMGpCUHI3iqTJ4EpH7YsU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197706'),
  ('706082978831780209', 'Being Erica', 2009, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Jana Sinyor', 'Aaron Martin, Jana Sinyor, David Fortier', 'Erin Karpluk, Michael Riley, Reagan Pasternak, Morgan Kelly, Vinessa Antoine, Kathleen Laskey, John Boylan, Joanna Douglas', 'TV-14', 'Erica Strange has tons of regrets in her young life - so many she''s started a list. But when she shares her list with her therapist, he undertakes an unusual course of treatment: she is transported back in time and given the chance to make different decisions at pivotal moments in her life, based on her knowledge of the here and now.', 'Erica Strange has tons of regrets in her young life - so many she''s started a list. But when she shares her list with her therapist, he undertakes an unusual course of treatment: she is transported back in time and given the chance to make different decisions at pivotal moments in her life, based on her knowledge of the here and now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51RMb62ig5q2VWG9BOQBtsHjxoN.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:8459'),
  ('649725768505222820', 'Being Human', 2009, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Toby Whithouse', null, 'Damien Molony, Michael Socha, Kate Bracken, Steven Robertson', 'TV-14', 'Deciding to turn over a new leaf, a group of friends who also happen to be vampires and werewolves move into a house together, only to find that it is haunted by ghosts of people who have been killed under mysterious circumstances. As they deal with the challenges of being supernatural creatures, their desire to be human bonds them.', 'Deciding to turn over a new leaf, a group of friends who also happen to be vampires and werewolves move into a house together, only to find that it is haunted by ghosts of people who have been killed under mysterious circumstances. As they deal with the challenges of being supernatural creatures, their desire to be human bonds them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rlDefnxVHcXwwm2bxPHknNRl4l.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:7087'),
  ('714464789666443938', 'Being Human', 2011, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Toby Whithouse', null, 'Sam Witwer, Meaghan Rath, Sam Huntington, Kristen Hager', 'TV-14', 'Three paranormal roommates, a ghost, a vampire, and a werewolf, struggle to keep their dark secrets from the world, while helping each other navigate the complexities of living double lives.', 'Three paranormal roommates, a ghost, a vampire, and a werewolf, struggle to keep their dark secrets from the world, while helping each other navigate the complexities of living double lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d52U5AqwdZcTCq8QuRfxRP4G3kc.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:32022'),
  ('713323907325793572', 'Being Ian', 2005, 'Kids, Animation, Family, Mystery', 'Ian James Corlett', null, 'Richard Ian Cox, David Kaye, Louis Chirillo, Patricia Drake, Matt Hill, Tabitha St. Germain, Dexter Bell, Ty Olsson', 'TV-Y7', 'Being Ian is a Canadian animated series produced by Studio B Productions, Corus Entertainment and Nelvana, focusing on 12-year-old Ian Kelley, who aspires to become a filmmaker. It originally aired from January 1, 2005 to April 22, 2007. The series is created by and based on the early life of actor/writer Ian James Corlett. It is set in the city of Burnaby, British Columbia. Produced in 2004, it debuted January 4, 2005 on YTV. The series aired in the United States on Qubo from September 19, 2009 - October 24, 2009.', 'Being Ian is a Canadian animated series produced by Studio B Productions, Corus Entertainment and Nelvana, focusing on 12-year-old Ian Kelley, who aspires to become a filmmaker. It originally aired from January 1, 2005 to April 22, 2007. The series is created by and based on the early life of actor/writer Ian James Corlett. It is set in the city of Burnaby, British Columbia. Produced in 2004, it debuted January 4, 2005 on YTV. The series aired in the United States on Qubo from September 19, 2009 - October 24, 2009.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ve16Upv0vQ8kAPMCscGDC859Cor.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:223'),
  ('793608978890982286', 'Being Mary Jane', 2013, 'Drama', 'Mara Brock Akil', null, 'Gabrielle Union, Aaron D. Spears, Lisa Vidal, Stephen Bishop, Margaret Avery, B.J. Britt, Raven Goodwin, Richard Brooks', 'TV-14', 'Mary Jane Paul is a one-woman-show: a successful TV news anchor, and an entirely self-sufficient powerhouse who remains devoted to a family that doesn''t share her motivation. Intense drama and unforgettable moments unfold as Mary Jane juggles her life, her relationships, her work, and commitments to her family.', 'Mary Jane Paul is a one-woman-show: a successful TV news anchor, and an entirely self-sufficient powerhouse who remains devoted to a family that doesn''t share her motivation. Intense drama and unforgettable moments unfold as Mary Jane juggles her life, her relationships, her work, and commitments to her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4lx9nB4C1H9axyuZYn8GX2DYak.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:54511'),
  ('841500714052055019', 'Bel Ami', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Jang Keun-suk, IU, Lee Jang-woo, Han Chae-young, Kim Bo-yeon, Dokgo Young-jae, So Yoo-jin, Kim Ye-won', null, 'Dokgo Ma-te is the most beautiful man in the world. He is also an ambitious man and wants to make a lot money using his beautiful appearance. When he meets Hong Yoo-ra, the ex-daughter-in-law of a rich family, she recognises his ambitions and becomes his mentor. But when the poor, but adorable Kim Bo-tong surfaces with a huge crush on Ma-te, everything changes.', 'Dokgo Ma-te is the most beautiful man in the world. He is also an ambitious man and wants to make a lot money using his beautiful appearance. When he meets Hong Yoo-ra, the ex-daughter-in-law of a rich family, she recognises his ambitions and becomes his mentor. But when the poor, but adorable Kim Bo-tong surfaces with a huge crush on Ma-te, everything changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSPRGjyKa6QjxZOUKsP5093m3CA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61136'),
  ('388076608764895747', 'Bel-Air', 2022, 'Drama', 'Andy Borowitz, Susan Borowitz', null, 'Jabari Banks, Adrian Holmes, Cassandra Freeman, Jimmy Akingbola, Olly Sholotan, Coco Jones, Akira Akbar, Simone Joy Jones', 'TV-MA', 'The journey of a book smart teen whose life is forever transformed when he moves from the streets of west Philadelphia to live with his relatives in one of LA’s wealthiest suburbs.', 'The journey of a book smart teen whose life is forever transformed when he moves from the streets of west Philadelphia to live with his relatives in one of LA’s wealthiest suburbs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8tbXWXrL15RucA6H4khq87dEXa.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:107365'),
  ('457161025427571088', 'Belascoaran, PI', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Rodrigo Santos', null, 'Luis Gerardo Méndez, Paulina Gaitán, Irene Azuela, Silverio Palacios, Enrique Arreola, Nailea Norvind, Jorge Echegoyen, Gabino Rodríguez', null, 'Héctor Belascoarán leaves his corporate job and dull marriage to become an independent detective and tackle shocking criminal cases in 1970s Mexico City.', 'Héctor Belascoarán leaves his corporate job and dull marriage to become an independent detective and tackle shocking criminal cases in 1970s Mexico City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fzmGc1uFxwBfZHhwRe8uhxS1MMr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206709'),
  ('927970073732668325', 'Belcanto', 2025, 'Drama', 'Vittoria Puccini', 'Mariano Di Nardo, Federico Fava, Antonio Manca', 'Julia Messina, Vittoria Puccini, Caterina Ferioli, Giacomo Giorgio, Carmine Recano', null, 'Carolina, Antonia and her mother Maria escape to Milan after murdered her violent father, in the city Antonia seeks to follow her mother''s dream of become a singer but shortly after they discover that the true talent lies with Carolina.', 'Carolina, Antonia and her mother Maria escape to Milan after murdered her violent father, in the city Antonia seeks to follow her mother''s dream of become a singer but shortly after they discover that the true talent lies with Carolina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3oXUYI08SQMWmVWeDtWdW8Vaje.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:285129'),
  ('644746153638074443', 'Belgravia', 2020, 'Drama', 'Julian Fellowes', null, 'Tamsin Greig, Philip Glenister, Alice Eve, Ella Purnell, Jack Bardoe, Jeremy Neumark Jones, Tom Wilkinson, Harriet Walter', 'TV-14', 'A tale of secrets and scandals set in 1840s London. When the Trenchards accept an invitation to the now legendary ball hosted by the Duchess of Richmond on the fateful evening of the Battle of Waterloo, it sets in motion a series of events that will have consequences for decades to come as secrets unravel behind the porticoed doors of London’s grandest postcode.', 'A tale of secrets and scandals set in 1840s London. When the Trenchards accept an invitation to the now legendary ball hosted by the Duchess of Richmond on the fateful evening of the Battle of Waterloo, it sets in motion a series of events that will have consequences for decades to come as secrets unravel behind the porticoed doors of London’s grandest postcode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/glwPmxzDI3cbHOeFvHVohLpbcDb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85862'),
  ('575566919997782337', 'Belgravia: The Next Chapter', 2024, 'Drama', 'Helen Edmundson', null, 'Harriet Slater, Benjamin Wainwright, Edward Bluemel, Elaine Cassidy, Claude Perron, Sophie Thompson, David Fynn, Liam Garrigan', 'TV-14', 'Belgravia, 1871. When Lord Frederick Trenchard meets Clara Dunn, their courtship is full of passion. But after they marry, the scandalous world of high society and a long-buried family secret threaten to unravel their happiness.', 'Belgravia, 1871. When Lord Frederick Trenchard meets Clara Dunn, their courtship is full of passion. But after they marry, the scandalous world of high society and a long-buried family secret threaten to unravel their happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWXqzX8ZJ7KDLn2FjYAiem8DRy9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211180'),
  ('1123716400991791581', 'Believe', 2014, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Mark Friedman, Alfonso Cuarón', null, 'Jake McLaughlin, Johnny Sequoyah, Katie McClellan, Delroy Lindo, Kerry Condon, Kyle MacLachlan, Jamie Chung, John Ventimiglia', 'TV-14', 'Believe is about an unlikely relationship between a gifted young girl and a man sprung from prison, who has been tasked with protecting her from the evil elements that hunt her power.', 'Believe is about an unlikely relationship between a gifted young girl and a man sprung from prison, who has been tasked with protecting her from the evil elements that hunt her power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1h1txgv70Rl0b4OrNIJi6korazk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60611'),
  ('202696220565783369', 'Belíssima', 2005, 'Soap, Drama', 'Silvio de Abreu', 'Sérgio Marques, Vinícius Vianna, Silvio de Abreu', 'Glória Pires, Tony Ramos, Fernanda Montenegro, Cláudia Abreu, Marcello Antony, Lima Duarte, Irene Ravache, Cláudia Raia', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yViZbC40QzZ8uYZhHHVS185N3W2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42886'),
  ('3106658099418555', 'Bella and the Bulldogs', 2015, 'Family, Comedy', 'Gabriel Garza, Jonathan Butler', null, 'Brec Bassinger, Buddy Keaton, Lilimar, Jackie Radinsky, Haley Tju, Coy Stewart', 'TV-G', 'A head cheerleader''s life takes an unexpected twist when her rifle-like throwing arm takes her from the sidelines to becoming her middle school’s starting quarterback. Bella Dawson is a confident, caring and talented teenager, who suddenly finds herself fulfilling a lifelong dream but also having to navigate the world of her teammates Troy, Sawyer and Newt, without losing her two best friends, Pepper and Sophie from the cheer squad.', 'A head cheerleader''s life takes an unexpected twist when her rifle-like throwing arm takes her from the sidelines to becoming her middle school’s starting quarterback. Bella Dawson is a confident, caring and talented teenager, who suddenly finds herself fulfilling a lifelong dream but also having to navigate the world of her teammates Troy, Sawyer and Newt, without losing her two best friends, Pepper and Sophie from the cheer squad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jTmX79QjbuBuVnH9xVoA8jFAMT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62725'),
  ('578849915650896305', 'Bella Calamidades', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Julio Jiménez', null, 'Danna García, Segundo Cernadas, Adriana Campos, Tiberio Cruz, Claudia Rocio Mora, Gary Forero, Mimi Morales, Pedro Roda', 'NR', 'Bella Calamidades is a Spanish-language telenovela produced by RTI Colombia for Telemundo. A tongue-in-cheek romance story, it features a ravishing beauty plagued by bad luck. The series stars Danna Garcia and Segundo Cernadas.', 'Bella Calamidades is a Spanish-language telenovela produced by RTI Colombia for Telemundo. A tongue-in-cheek romance story, it features a ravishing beauty plagued by bad luck. The series stars Danna Garcia and Segundo Cernadas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3DZr4YUXRmJxgRB8WH9dNVjClz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5573'),
  ('716622654078417737', 'Bellas artes', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andrés Duprat, Mariano Cohn, Gastón Duprat', null, 'Oscar Martínez, Ángela Molina, Ana Wagener, Dani Rovira, Aixa Villagrán, Koldo Olabarri, Fernando Albizu', null, 'Antonio Dumas, a prestigious, intellectual, sophisticated, though also rather cynical and conceited art historian and cultural manager, is appointed director of an important museum of modern art in Madrid after winning a contest for that position. In this new position he will have to deal with a variety of different circumstances and conflicts, which range from trade union problems and political pressures to surreal situations involving exhibitions and artists, in the midst of the unusual fauna that inhabits the art world.', 'Antonio Dumas, a prestigious, intellectual, sophisticated, though also rather cynical and conceited art historian and cultural manager, is appointed director of an important museum of modern art in Madrid after winning a contest for that position. In this new position he will have to deal with a variety of different circumstances and conflicts, which range from trade union problems and political pressures to surreal situations involving exhibitions and artists, in the midst of the unusual fauna that inhabits the art world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qAwpgOb59jvBu6eFfxztUQ3tN1Y.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:128327'),
  ('193245144789158526', 'Belle and Sebastian', 1965, 'Drama', 'Cécile Aubry', null, 'Mehdi El Glaoui', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8MrgJHEbYfaabSaZVOHp2u7ogBh.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:43808'),
  ('566793986216366644', 'Belle and Sebastian', 1981, 'Animation, Drama, Family', null, null, 'Noriko Ohara, Ichiro Nagai, Keiko Yokozawa, Hiroko Suzuki, Toru Furuya, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Kaneto Shiozawa', null, 'Belle and Sebastian is an anime adaption of a series of French novels called Belle et Sébastien by Cécile Aubry. The series ran on the Japanese network NHK from April 7, 1981 – June 22, 1982. It consists of 52 episodes and was a co-production of MK Company, Visual 80 Productions and Toho Company, Ltd.. Toshiyuki Kashiwakura was the head writer and character designs were by Shuichi Seki. The show was broadcast on French and Japanese television in 1981, with American cable network Nickelodeon picking it up in 1984. In the United Kingdom, it aired on Children''s BBC in 1989 and 1990. This anime used many staffers from Nippon Animation''s World Masterpiece Theater franchise, thus the look and feel is similar to that of a WMT production even though Nippon Animation itself was not involved with this series. The series has been aired in many countries outside Japan and has been dubbed and subtitled in English and numerous other languages.', 'Belle and Sebastian is an anime adaption of a series of French novels called Belle et Sébastien by Cécile Aubry. The series ran on the Japanese network NHK from April 7, 1981 – June 22, 1982. It consists of 52 episodes and was a co-production of MK Company, Visual 80 Productions and Toho Company, Ltd.. Toshiyuki Kashiwakura was the head writer and character designs were by Shuichi Seki. The show was broadcast on French and Japanese television in 1981, with American cable network Nickelodeon picking it up in 1984. In the United Kingdom, it aired on Children''s BBC in 1989 and 1990. This anime used many staffers from Nippon Animation''s World Masterpiece Theater franchise, thus the look and feel is similar to that of a WMT production even though Nippon Animation itself was not involved with this series. The series has been aired in many countries outside Japan and has been dubbed and subtitled in English and numerous other languages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJ0xM73STVS0H81zdWEhfFKEvJm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10108'),
  ('214823585467119590', 'Belle Collective', 2021, 'Reality', null, null, 'Tambra Cherie, Antoinette Liles', 'TV-14', 'Five of Mississippi''s Black female entrepreneurs work together to redevelop a struggling mid-20th century historic district.', 'Five of Mississippi''s Black female entrepreneurs work together to redevelop a struggling mid-20th century historic district.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRkMqshmYrm9lqPWnIBfV9a6ozM.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:116911'),
  ('274927272794632816', 'Belle Collective: Birmingham', 2026, null, null, null, 'Stormi Steele, Amber Jones, Tiffaney Jones, Funmi Ford, Synetta Hawkins, K''La Inman', null, 'CEO and beauty mogul Stormi Steele, beloved by viewers of Love & Marriage: Huntsville, returns to television bolder than ever after a hyper-focused two-year break scaling her multimillion-dollar empire and wildly successful brand, Canvas Beauty. In Belle Collective: Birmingham, Stormi connects with a circle of driven, successful southern Belles in the rising cultural hub of Birmingham who are determined to transform the city into a thriving destination for beauty and influence. Stormi must navigate Birmingham''s deeply connected social and business scenes to forge alliances with fellow powerhouses including her savvy CFO Amber Jones, entrepreneur Tiffaney Jones, marketing strategist Funmi Ford, model and marketer Synetta Hawkins, and talent manager K''La Inman.', 'CEO and beauty mogul Stormi Steele, beloved by viewers of Love & Marriage: Huntsville, returns to television bolder than ever after a hyper-focused two-year break scaling her multimillion-dollar empire and wildly successful brand, Canvas Beauty. In Belle Collective: Birmingham, Stormi connects with a circle of driven, successful southern Belles in the rising cultural hub of Birmingham who are determined to transform the city into a thriving destination for beauty and influence. Stormi must navigate Birmingham''s deeply connected social and business scenes to forge alliances with fellow powerhouses including her savvy CFO Amber Jones, entrepreneur Tiffaney Jones, marketing strategist Funmi Ford, model and marketer Synetta Hawkins, and talent manager K''La Inman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qk9I4uIIH0oPqgywQTvW5diZfaw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317713'),
  ('600440316059023722', 'Bellevue', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Adrienne Mitchell, Jane Maggs', null, 'Anna Paquin, Shawn Doyle, Sharon Taylor, Billy MacLellan, Madison Ferguson, Patrick Labbé, Vincent Leclerc, Allen Leech', null, 'When a transgender teen goes missing, Annie Ryder—a cop at odds with her hometown—dives in to unravel the disappearance that suggests foul play, despite finding herself in a difficult position as she must cast suspicion on people she has known all her life.', 'When a transgender teen goes missing, Annie Ryder—a cop at odds with her hometown—dives in to unravel the disappearance that suggests foul play, despite finding herself in a difficult position as she must cast suspicion on people she has known all her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZdjb44LdNqKFA9g6pk8VnAbW4C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70344'),
  ('776824286777762287', 'Below', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Tina Rygh', 'Tina Rygh', 'Maria Austgulen, Mari Hauge Einbu, Isabel Bråthen, Janne Kokkin', null, 'A young woman whose life is turned upside down by a traffic accident that kills her best friend and leaves her paralyzed from the waist down.', 'A young woman whose life is turned upside down by a traffic accident that kills her best friend and leaves her paralyzed from the waist down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vIwJ3miXHqIOSm2lpMKaC7ifnj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207783'),
  ('735378611409870056', 'Below Deck', 2013, 'Reality', null, null, 'Kerry Titheradge, Fraser Olender, Kyle Stillie, Rainbeau de Roos, Solene Favreau, Barbara Kulaif, Jess Theron, Damo Yorg', 'TV-14', 'The upstairs and downstairs worlds collide when this young and single crew of "yachties" live, love and work together onboard a luxurious mega yacht while tending to the ever-changing needs of their wealthy, demanding charter guests.', 'The upstairs and downstairs worlds collide when this young and single crew of "yachties" live, love and work together onboard a luxurious mega yacht while tending to the ever-changing needs of their wealthy, demanding charter guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMkYEWMGB7F7YfzJ24DPXoDj8vo.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:50042'),
  ('105509142947043671', 'Below Deck Down Under', 2022, 'Reality, Drama', null, null, 'Jason Chambers, Daisy Kelliher, João Franco', 'TV-14', 'Set against the stunning backdrop of the tropical Whitsunday Islands and world-famous Great Barrier Reef in northeastern Australia, this series explores the complex, often explosive dynamics of the crew and a rotating group of demanding charter guests on M/Y Thalassa.', 'Set against the stunning backdrop of the tropical Whitsunday Islands and world-famous Great Barrier Reef in northeastern Australia, this series explores the complex, often explosive dynamics of the crew and a rotating group of demanding charter guests on M/Y Thalassa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s51ttvEaHvCO7L2yUie6IWu5VNt.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:125506'),
  ('1048286745995271652', 'Below Deck Mediterranean', 2016, 'Reality', 'Mark Cronin', null, 'Sandy Yawn, Aesha Scott, Max Salvador, Nathan Gallagher, Josh Bingham, Kizzi Kitchener, Victoria SanJuan', 'TV-14', 'Follow crew members living and working aboard a 150’ mega-yacht as it undertakes a charter season in the Mediterranean. Providing unparalleled service to wealthy and uncompromising guests is made even more difficult as the team faces everything from love triangles to seeing fellow crew members shockingly cross the line with guests.', 'Follow crew members living and working aboard a 150’ mega-yacht as it undertakes a charter season in the Mediterranean. Providing unparalleled service to wealthy and uncompromising guests is made even more difficult as the team faces everything from love triangles to seeing fellow crew members shockingly cross the line with guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u88QjNj1xyGwnZMtSZjA9jDNNro.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:66902'),
  ('817277088102056419', 'Below Deck Sailing Yacht', 2020, 'Reality', null, null, 'Glenn Shephard', null, 'Capt. Glenn Shephard and his crew set sail in a luxury sailing yacht to explore the crystal-clear blue waters of the Ionian Sea. The physicality of working on a sailing yacht brings new challenges to these young, attractive and adventurous yachties who are ready to work hard and play harder.', 'Capt. Glenn Shephard and his crew set sail in a luxury sailing yacht to explore the crystal-clear blue waters of the Ionian Sea. The physicality of working on a sailing yacht brings new challenges to these young, attractive and adventurous yachties who are ready to work hard and play harder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xRYK5NhY15uKaJ4a97xmWyHxSCi.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:97872'),
  ('101117610976312909', 'Below the Surface', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kasper Barfoed', null, 'Johannes Lassen, Kasper Leisner, Flemming Enevold, Kenneth M. Christensen, Alexandre Willaume, Peder Thomas Pedersen, Lise Risom Olsen, Esben Dalgaard Andersen', null, 'An early morning in October, 15 people are taken hostage from a subway train. This puts a huge hostage crisis in motion, and it changes Denmark forever.', 'An early morning in October, 15 people are taken hostage from a subway train. This puts a huge hostage crisis in motion, and it changes Denmark forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iiyaaXZpe52Q6WnwzNtpYiBymbH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:71302'),
  ('605382293698468821', 'Belphegor, or The Phantom of the Louvre', 1965, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Claude Barma', 'Jacques Armand, Claude Barma', 'Juliette Gréco, Isaac Alvarez, Christine Delaroche, René Dary, Yves Rénier, Georges Staquet', 'NR', 'Four episodes chronicle a mysterious phantom who appears in the Musée du Louvre in Paris at night. Neither guards nor police are able to make an arrest. But a curious young man tries to break the ice and discover what drives the creature and its activities.', 'Four episodes chronicle a mysterious phantom who appears in the Musée du Louvre in Paris at night. Neither guards nor police are able to make an arrest. But a curious young man tries to break the ice and discover what drives the creature and its activities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JMgv6MvyOKWSnEivw62gn9vK5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64817'),
  ('85788686123844109', 'Belve', 2018, 'Talk', 'Francesca Fagnani, Irene Ghergo', null, 'Francesca Fagnani', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kN8qnoDKEwEYLQ7ooiMRB84H3r.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:220969'),
  ('237149173903396547', 'BEM', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Atsuhiro Tomioka', 'Mao Ichimichi, Katsuyuki Konishi, Kensho Ono, Maaya Uchida, Maaya Sakamoto, Daisuke Ono, Junichi Suwabe, Soma Saito', null, 'Libra City is a sprawling metropolis whose districts split the rich and the poor. Hiding among the populace are three humanoid monsters—Bem, Bela, and Belo—who protect humanity and hope to one day become humans themselves. However, when a Mysterious Lady threatens their way of life, Bem, Bela, and Belo are pulled into a plot unlike anything they’ve ever known.', 'Libra City is a sprawling metropolis whose districts split the rich and the poor. Hiding among the populace are three humanoid monsters—Bem, Bela, and Belo—who protect humanity and hope to one day become humans themselves. However, when a Mysterious Lady threatens their way of life, Bem, Bela, and Belo are pulled into a plot unlike anything they’ve ever known.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fUd4ejJ1LkqaSaHItHwXE4HVrGy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88063'),
  ('370268723989166148', 'Ben & Holly''s Little Kingdom', 2009, 'Kids, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Neville Astley', null, 'Sian Taylor, Preston Nyman, David Graham, Sarah Ann Kennedy, Ian Puleston-Davies, Sara Crowe, Jonny Butler, Judy Flynn', 'TV-Y', 'The friendship between fairy princess Holly and Ben Elf in an enchanted magical kingdom of elves and fairies.', 'The friendship between fairy princess Holly and Ben Elf in an enchanted magical kingdom of elves and fairies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJfBAzPNojxE3LTcUhrev7TR0eH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:32388'),
  ('341122295545996182', 'Ben 10', 2005, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Kids', 'Duncan Rouleau, Joe Kelly, Joe Casey', null, 'Tara Strong, Meagan Moore, Paul Eiding, Dee Bradley Baker, Steve Blum, Richard McGonagle, Richard Steven Horvitz, Jim Ward', 'TV-Y7', 'When 10-year-old Ben Tennyson discovers a mysterious device, he gains the power to change into ten different alien heroes, each with uniquely awesome powers. With such abilities at his disposal, Ben realizes a greater responsibility to help others and stop evildoers, but that doesn''t mean he''s above a little superpowered mischief now and then.', 'When 10-year-old Ben Tennyson discovers a mysterious device, he gains the power to change into ten different alien heroes, each with uniquely awesome powers. With such abilities at his disposal, Ben realizes a greater responsibility to help others and stop evildoers, but that doesn''t mean he''s above a little superpowered mischief now and then.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eogRp6oAPK0SEvQmCrQ78LTlSdp.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4686'),
  ('302907142014691017', 'Ben 10', 2016, 'Kids, Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Duncan Rouleau', null, 'Tara Strong, Montse Hernandez, David Kaye, Roger Craig Smith, Josh Keaton, John DiMaggio, Daryl Sabara, Travis Willingham', 'TV-Y7', 'With the fifth offshoot of the "Ben 10" franchise, the animated series returns to its roots and its original name, bringing 10-year-old Benjamin "Ben" Tennyson, his cousin Gwen, and Grandpa Max back to life on a new summer vacation journey. As in the original, the stories in the remake of the series also spin around an alien wristwatch called "the Omnitrix," with the help of Ben can turn into ten different aliens, which come up with different supernatural powers. He fights enemy aliens and experiences with his grandfather and cousin the most exciting vacation imaginable.', 'With the fifth offshoot of the "Ben 10" franchise, the animated series returns to its roots and its original name, bringing 10-year-old Benjamin "Ben" Tennyson, his cousin Gwen, and Grandpa Max back to life on a new summer vacation journey. As in the original, the stories in the remake of the series also spin around an alien wristwatch called "the Omnitrix," with the help of Ben can turn into ten different aliens, which come up with different supernatural powers. He fights enemy aliens and experiences with his grandfather and cousin the most exciting vacation imaginable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4H0UR7aUkGZlT6Q9r9grBrjJWR.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:68295'),
  ('13189705166375365', 'Ben 10: Alien Force', 2008, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Duncan Rouleau, Steven T. Seagle, Joe Casey', null, 'Yuri Lowenthal, Ashley Johnson, Greg Cipes', 'TV-Y7', 'Five years later, 15-year-old Ben Tennyson chooses to once again put on the Omnitrix and discovers that it has recalibrated and can now transform him into 10 brand new aliens. Joined by his super-powered cousin Gwen Tennyson and his equally powerful former enemy Kevin Levin, Ben is on a mission to find his missing Grandpa Max. In order to save his Grandpa, Ben must defeat the evil DNAliens, a powerful alien race intent on destroying the galaxy, starting with planet Earth.', 'Five years later, 15-year-old Ben Tennyson chooses to once again put on the Omnitrix and discovers that it has recalibrated and can now transform him into 10 brand new aliens. Joined by his super-powered cousin Gwen Tennyson and his equally powerful former enemy Kevin Levin, Ben is on a mission to find his missing Grandpa Max. In order to save his Grandpa, Ben must defeat the evil DNAliens, a powerful alien race intent on destroying the galaxy, starting with planet Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGhCUqPaXZ0Xp4dUCT7Q6hjJArf.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:6040'),
  ('425513761959958176', 'Ben 10: Omniverse', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Joe Kelly, Joe Casey, Steven T. Seagle', null, 'Yuri Lowenthal, Tara Strong, Bumper Robinson, Paul Eiding, Ashley Johnson, Greg Cipes, David Kaye, John DiMaggio', 'TV-Y7', 'A year after the events that took place during the "Final Battle" and equipped with an all-new completed Omnitrix, 16-year-old Ben Tennyson has to face new enemies.', 'A year after the events that took place during the "Final Battle" and equipped with an all-new completed Omnitrix, 16-year-old Ben Tennyson has to face new enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Re9I5tauOspaJxYCIqRqavKT4F.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:46922'),
  ('353246247121794369', 'Ben 10: Ultimate Alien', 2010, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Joe Casey, Duncan Rouleau, Joe Kelly', null, 'Yuri Lowenthal, Ashley Johnson, Greg Cipes, Dee Bradley Baker', 'TV-Y7', 'With his secret identity now revealed to the world, Ben Tennyson continues to fight evil as a superhero with the help of the newly acquired Ultimatrix.', 'With his secret identity now revealed to the world, Ben Tennyson continues to fight evil as a superhero with the help of the newly acquired Ultimatrix.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4KwrlUKO9S4GvOdZzmnz4zOxx7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:31109'),
  ('670400811474074450', 'Ben and Kate', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Dana Fox', null, 'Nat Faxon, Dakota Johnson, Maggie Elizabeth Jones, Lucy Punch, Echo Kellum', 'TV-14', 'Ben and Kate are a pair of odd-couple siblings - one, a responsible single mom; the other, an exuberant dreamer - who reunite to help raise Kate''s daughter.', 'Ben and Kate are a pair of odd-couple siblings - one, a responsible single mom; the other, an exuberant dreamer - who reunite to help raise Kate''s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhzXOjujMk1c0Olp3Cha9lpNB4v.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43275'),
