  ('791045690529456258', 'Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild', 2013, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Ben Fogle', 'TV-14', 'Ben Fogle follows in the footsteps of various individuals, who against all odds, have willingly forsaken the luxuries and lifestyle of the modern world, for a less-than-ordinary life in the wilderness.', 'Ben Fogle follows in the footsteps of various individuals, who against all odds, have willingly forsaken the luxuries and lifestyle of the modern world, for a less-than-ordinary life in the wilderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JykacgyRt4Ign81ls4G0roB9ne.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:55878'),
  ('371379566805678188', 'Ben Hur', 2010, 'Drama', 'Lew Wallace', null, 'Joseph Morgan, Stephen Campbell Moore, Kristin Kreuk, Emily VanCamp, Alex Kingston, Art Malik, Hugh Bonneville, Lucía Jiménez', null, 'The struggle between the Roman Empire and its rebellious conquest Judaea, and two best friends caught in a terrible moment in history.', 'The struggle between the Roman Empire and its rebellious conquest Judaea, and two best friends caught in a terrible moment in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejsJlDNpZDAKJN1ERa0zrz6MRHA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40360'),
  ('514279232663733138', 'Ben-To', 2011, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Hiro Shimono, Mariya Ise, Emiri Kato, Aoi Yuuki, Ai Kayano, Mamoru Miyano, Ayana Taketatsu, Kazuyuki Okitsu', 'TV-14', 'Every day an epic struggle rages in grocery stores across Japan - the battle for half-priced bento boxes! Once the discount stickers go on, ravenous brawlers start throwing punches in a knockdown, drag-out war over who gets to take home the cheap eats. When a young, broke high school student named Sato joins the Half-Priced Food Lovers Club, he proves to be a rising talent in the world of insane food fights. But does he have what it takes to become the king of clearance cuisine?', 'Every day an epic struggle rages in grocery stores across Japan - the battle for half-priced bento boxes! Once the discount stickers go on, ravenous brawlers start throwing punches in a knockdown, drag-out war over who gets to take home the cheap eats. When a young, broke high school student named Sato joins the Half-Priced Food Lovers Club, he proves to be a rising talent in the world of insane food fights. But does he have what it takes to become the king of clearance cuisine?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKg5GQu5YKJsaN0QJEm5kS16OKx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61970'),
  ('412510807614002055', 'Benched', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Damon Jones, Michaela Watkins', null, 'Eliza Coupe, Jay Harrington, Carter MacIntyre, Oscar Nuñez, Jolene Purdy', 'TV-14', 'Nina is a dedicated, career driven corporate attorney who has a very public nervous breakdown after getting passed up for an expected promotion and now finds herself working as a public defender. Her personal and professional worlds are turned upside down when she joins the ranks of the legal world’s underdogs and very quickly realizes that the law isn''t quite as fair as she once thought.', 'Nina is a dedicated, career driven corporate attorney who has a very public nervous breakdown after getting passed up for an expected promotion and now finds herself working as a public defender. Her personal and professional worlds are turned upside down when she joins the ranks of the legal world’s underdogs and very quickly realizes that the law isn''t quite as fair as she once thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wP2VhLfR196Qg49nVEj3yAOkbX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61508'),
  ('782914136801692595', 'Benefits with Friends', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Matheus Souza', 'Matheus Souza, Juliana Araripe, Nátaly Neri', 'Bruna Marquezine, Sergio Malheiros, Danilo Mesquita, Malu Rodrigues, Rayssa Bratillieri, Sophia Abrahão, João Guilherme Ávila, Ana Hikari', null, 'In a life full of surprises, Bia and Victor''s friendship is a safe place.', 'In a life full of surprises, Bia and Victor''s friendship is a safe place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZcIT8YCPoXOIGHPgCx6TxDuPpJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:224505'),
