  ('104500606424681014', 'Besos al aire', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Darío Madrona', null, 'Paco León, Leonor Watling, Nuria Herrero, Mariam Hernández, Gracia Olayo, Nancho Novo, María León, David Castillo', null, 'Eight interlinked stories of lockdown love sparked during Spain’s first national lockdown during the pandemic.', 'Eight interlinked stories of lockdown love sparked during Spain’s first national lockdown during the pandemic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSKiR4rLl7tNNDKQOS6d1QgPXRh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114841'),
  ('815063981443475740', 'Best Friends', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Soap', 'Anya Koek', null, 'Steef Hupkes, Sydney Tros, Noël van Kleef, Thorn Roos de Vries, Lieke Hammink, Marissa Britney, Amon Aljo, Maurits van Brakel', null, 'Best Friends follows the life of a group of friends at their high school ‘Spangalis College’. Inside and outside of school exciting and challenging experiences take place. Growing up is never easy; every character has its own, unique story of love, friendship, loneliness, sorrow, discovery. There is drama and joy in school, family, teachers, parents, divorce, bullying, and always dreams for the future.', 'Best Friends follows the life of a group of friends at their high school ‘Spangalis College’. Inside and outside of school exciting and challenging experiences take place. Growing up is never easy; every character has its own, unique story of love, friendship, loneliness, sorrow, discovery. There is drama and joy in school, family, teachers, parents, divorce, bullying, and always dreams for the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2bH7QQ7WQfnbt1CWiX8BE5E2V4t.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:36062'),
  ('366712927442389995', 'Best Friends Whenever', 2015, 'Comedy, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jed Elinoff, Scott Thomas', null, 'Lauren Taylor, Landry Bender, August Kamp, Ricky Garcia, Benjamin Royer, Matthew Royer', 'TV-G', 'When their aspiring scientist friend Barry''s invention goes awry, best friends Shelby and Cyd gain the power to leap forward and backward in time whenever they want – and sometimes when they don''t. Now, they experience the twists and turns of friendship and must decide between fixing mistakes in the past or catching a glimpse of the future. While Barry and his assistant, Naldo, try to figure out how to replicate time travel for themselves, Cyd and Shelby use their newfound power to navigate high school life and Shelby''s mischievous twin brothers, Bret and Chet.', 'When their aspiring scientist friend Barry''s invention goes awry, best friends Shelby and Cyd gain the power to leap forward and backward in time whenever they want – and sometimes when they don''t. Now, they experience the twists and turns of friendship and must decide between fixing mistakes in the past or catching a glimpse of the future. While Barry and his assistant, Naldo, try to figure out how to replicate time travel for themselves, Cyd and Shelby use their newfound power to navigate high school life and Shelby''s mischievous twin brothers, Bret and Chet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euWwJsDLPzfPny96UrbD13XOFSz.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:62783'),
  ('1058601481297161067', 'Best Interest', 2019, 'Drama', null, null, 'Tien Hsin, James Wen, Annie Chen, Johnny Yang, Benjamin Tsang', null, 'Rookie lawyer Chen Boyun made a promise at an early age that she will work hard in achieving social justice, and not to drop any opportunities to advocate for justice. Experienced lawyer Fang Chang is the exact opposite; he now only pursues cases that require quick fixes and has long stopped investing personal feelings into cases. When Chen Boyun becomes the intern and personal assistant of Fang Cheng, conflicts ensue as they argue for different "best interests".', 'Rookie lawyer Chen Boyun made a promise at an early age that she will work hard in achieving social justice, and not to drop any opportunities to advocate for justice. Experienced lawyer Fang Chang is the exact opposite; he now only pursues cases that require quick fixes and has long stopped investing personal feelings into cases. When Chen Boyun becomes the intern and personal assistant of Fang Cheng, conflicts ensue as they argue for different "best interests".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31zaeSTGA64ETMV2A5eZBciVC0d.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:89061'),
  ('106547761098322476', 'Best Interests', 2023, 'Drama', 'Jack Thorne', 'Jack Thorne', 'Sharon Horgan, Michael Sheen, Alison Oliver, Niamh Moriarty, Noma Dumezweni, Chizzy Akudolu, Des McAleer, Gary Beadle', null, 'Marnie has a life-threatening condition. The doctors believe it is in her best interests to be allowed to die, but her loving family disagree. And so begins a fight that will take them through every stage of a legal process, as they struggle to contemplate this huge decision. Who decides? And in whose best interests will it be?', 'Marnie has a life-threatening condition. The doctors believe it is in her best interests to be allowed to die, but her loving family disagree. And so begins a fight that will take them through every stage of a legal process, as they struggle to contemplate this huge decision. Who decides? And in whose best interests will it be?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfnqo6uEMAS5Keimidq1VZ5i5be.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217700'),
  ('485704473015119651', 'Best Lover', 2016, 'Drama', null, null, 'Lee Da-hae, Zhou Mi, Park Kwang-hyun, Wang Qiu Zi', 'TV-14', 'In the glitzy world of Korean entertainment, two top stars enter a fake marriage for personal gain—he''s a self-made actor with a painful past, she''s a chaebol heiress hiding her emotional scars. As they struggle to keep up appearances, they discover each other’s vulnerabilities and unexpectedly fall in love.', 'In the glitzy world of Korean entertainment, two top stars enter a fake marriage for personal gain—he''s a self-made actor with a painful past, she''s a chaebol heiress hiding her emotional scars. As they struggle to keep up appearances, they discover each other’s vulnerabilities and unexpectedly fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yn0MIfncUAtJoOOFpgmLKTJxNWC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69051'),
  ('990866350734520260', 'Best Medicine', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Liz Tuccillo', null, 'Josh Charles, Abigail Spencer, Josh Segarra, Cree Cicchino, Annie Potts', null, 'Martin Best is a brilliant surgeon who abruptly leaves his illustrious career in Boston to become the general practitioner in a quaint East Coast fishing village where he spent summers as a child. Unfortunately, Martin''s blunt and borderline rude bedside manner rubs the quirky, needy locals the wrong way, and he quickly alienates the town, even though he''s all they’ve got.', 'Martin Best is a brilliant surgeon who abruptly leaves his illustrious career in Boston to become the general practitioner in a quaint East Coast fishing village where he spent summers as a child. Unfortunately, Martin''s blunt and borderline rude bedside manner rubs the quirky, needy locals the wrong way, and he quickly alienates the town, even though he''s all they’ve got.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7SCSZfDaNDRPL3Xt4TiGSZQQht.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:291084'),
  ('639490092490590625', 'Best Mistake', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Yoon Shi So, Yeo Song-eun', 'Lee Eun-jae, Kang Yul, Yoon Jun-won, Park E-hyun, Lee Jung-jun, Choe Chan-yi, Joo Hyun-young, Yoon Hyun-suk', null, 'The story focuses on Yun Doo, a studious, normal girl. An old partner won''t stop bothering her through messages, so she makes up that she has a boyfriend and posts a random photo of a guy. That picture turns out to be from Hyun Ho, one of the most popular and rebellious of the school. It''s a school drama, with several romances in sight.', 'The story focuses on Yun Doo, a studious, normal girl. An old partner won''t stop bothering her through messages, so she makes up that she has a boyfriend and posts a random photo of a guy. That picture turns out to be from Hyun Ho, one of the most popular and rebellious of the school. It''s a school drama, with several romances in sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vp5DxbL6lqSuo9lqzNPWe71rm4.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:95392'),
  ('137039311281598897', 'Best Selling Secrets', 2007, 'Comedy', null, 'Lai Chun Tsang, Shum Lap-Keung', 'Esther Kwan Wing-Ho, Vin Choi, Stephen Au Kam-Tong, Alvina Kong Yan-Yin, Yoyo Chen Chi-Yiu, Shek Sau, Wong Cho-Lam, Elaine Jin Yan-Ling', null, 'Wong Ka-Nam disappeared to the United States, leaving behind her son and husband in Hong Kong. When her husband dies in an airplane accident looking for her, Wong Ka-Nam''s son, Luk Chit is taken into the custody of her mother-in-law, Ng Hang. After eighteen long years, Wong Ka-Nam wishes to see her son again and returns to Hong Kong. However, she is met with adamant resistance from her mother-in-law, who views Ka-Nam as bad luck, blaming her for the death of her son. Highly protective of her grandson and fearing that Wong Ka-Nam will attempt to take him away, Ka Nam''s mother-in-law does everything in her power to keep mother and son apart. However, Wong Ka-Nam is ironically assisted by her own son, who befriends her and secures her office job in his advertising agency.', 'Wong Ka-Nam disappeared to the United States, leaving behind her son and husband in Hong Kong. When her husband dies in an airplane accident looking for her, Wong Ka-Nam''s son, Luk Chit is taken into the custody of her mother-in-law, Ng Hang. After eighteen long years, Wong Ka-Nam wishes to see her son again and returns to Hong Kong. However, she is met with adamant resistance from her mother-in-law, who views Ka-Nam as bad luck, blaming her for the death of her son. Highly protective of her grandson and fearing that Wong Ka-Nam will attempt to take him away, Ka Nam''s mother-in-law does everything in her power to keep mother and son apart. However, Wong Ka-Nam is ironically assisted by her own son, who befriends her and secures her office job in his advertising agency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDhUREsTCsYzAxykh2CxpJVFzQf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15903'),
  ('984171605112705193', 'Best Time Ever with Neil Patrick Harris', 2015, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Neil Patrick Harris, Nathaniel Motulsky, Nicole Scherzinger', null, 'Five-time Emmy Award winner Neil Patrick Harris is coming to NBC on a new primetime variety series based on the U.K.''s hugely popular "Ant and Dec''s Saturday Night Takeaway." The show will feature comedy sketches, musical numbers, mini game shows, hidden camera pranks on celebrities and appearances by A-list stars. Harris, who has served as an Emmy and Tony Award host and was recently announced as host of the 2015 Academy Awards, will bring his multi-dimensional skills to the forefront of this new hour-long series. Harris recently co-starred in David Fincher’s "Gone Girl," and finished a run on Broadway as the lead in "Hedwig and the Angry Inch," for which he won a Tony Award for Best Performance by a Leading Actor in a Musical. For nine seasons he played the role of Barney Stinson on "How I Met Your Mother," for which he received four Emmy and two Golden Globe nominations.', 'Five-time Emmy Award winner Neil Patrick Harris is coming to NBC on a new primetime variety series based on the U.K.''s hugely popular "Ant and Dec''s Saturday Night Takeaway." The show will feature comedy sketches, musical numbers, mini game shows, hidden camera pranks on celebrities and appearances by A-list stars. Harris, who has served as an Emmy and Tony Award host and was recently announced as host of the 2015 Academy Awards, will bring his multi-dimensional skills to the forefront of this new hour-long series. Harris recently co-starred in David Fincher’s "Gone Girl," and finished a run on Broadway as the lead in "Hedwig and the Angry Inch," for which he won a Tony Award for Best Performance by a Leading Actor in a Musical. For nine seasons he played the role of Barney Stinson on "How I Met Your Mother," for which he received four Emmy and two Golden Globe nominations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6h8WUEgnBHAfn724PLMalON7mK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63933'),
  ('379428830794443152', 'Best.Worst.Weekend.Ever.', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Robin J. Stein, Daniel Bryan Franklin, Jeremy Garelick', null, 'Sam Ashe Arnold, Cole Sand, Brianna Reed, Tiffany Espensen, Eddie Leavy', 'TV-PG', 'Teenage friends plan an epic trip to Comic-Con to meet their idol, only to get caught in one hilariously awkward predicament after another.', 'Teenage friends plan an epic trip to Comic-Con to meet their idol, only to get caught in one hilariously awkward predicament after another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnLPmAawX5YVu30tYPbIiHGTkv8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82656'),
