  ('939856006766681061', 'Betrayed', 2016, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Documentary, Family, Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Revisits heart-pounding cases of deception that ended in murder at the hands of a trusted family member, co-worker, lover, or friend. Told through the lens of the fictionalized, first-person perspectives of the victims, the viewer is treated like the only confidant they have left.', 'Revisits heart-pounding cases of deception that ended in murder at the hands of a trusted family member, co-worker, lover, or friend. Told through the lens of the fictionalized, first-person perspectives of the victims, the viewer is treated like the only confidant they have left.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ljycPK8LFfiviJ1b0yBOQeebrg.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:67633'),
